window.__CH=window.__CH||{};window.__CH["df18"]={"id": "df18", "title": "无分类器引导（CFG）的数学", "focus": "推导 CFG 的插值公式、训练时的条件 dropout、引导权重的极限行为与分布偏移；说明它是隐式分类器引导的近似。", "claims": ["\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\left(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\right)", "w=1\\ \\text{退化为普通条件采样；}w>1\\ \\text{锐化条件分布}", "\\text{训练时以概率 }p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\ \\text{将 }c\\ \\text{置空}"], "topics": ["CFG 的公式", "条件与无条件的组合", "引导权重", "训练时的 dropout", "引导的分布偏移", "引导与贝叶斯", "引导的极限行为", "数值稳定性", "引导的采样", "反例：引导过强导致模式崩溃", "引导的变体", "与联合生成的接口", "代码：CFG 采样", "代码：引导权重的数值实验", "与联合条件章的接口", "本章推导链：CFG = 隐式分类器"], "html": "<h3 id=\"df18--h-CFG-的公式\">CFG 的公式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-CFG-的公式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第二部已固定的记号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为数据变量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 为扩散时间，前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_t\\}_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{d}x_t = f(x_t,t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t + g(t)\\,\\mathrm{d}W_t,\\qquad x_0\\sim p_{\\mathrm{data}},$$</div>\n其转移核记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>，边缘密度记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)$</span>。条件变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 取值于可测空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal{C},\\mathcal{B}_{\\mathcal{C}})$</span>，联合边缘记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t,c)$</span>，条件密度记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span>。得分网络记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]\\times(\\mathcal{C}\\cup\\{\\varnothing\\})\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing$</span> 为空标记（null token），满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing\\notin\\mathcal{C}$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节只引入一个新符号：引导权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in\\mathbb{R}_{\\ge 0}$</span>，以及由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 组合而成的<strong>引导得分估计</strong>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c;w):=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\bigl(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\bigr).$$</div>\n注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的仿射组合，不是新的网络；其参数仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 是外部标量。本节不展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的取值分析与分布偏移，只给出公式本身及其代数结构与一个可检验恒等式。</p>\n<p>本节所需假设如下，逐条显式列出并在证明中引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可测性与可积性.</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t,c)\\mapsto\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,t,c)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}(\\mathbb{R}^d)\\otimes\\mathcal{B}([0,T])\\otimes\\mathcal{B}_{\\mathcal{C}}$</span> 可测；对每个固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(t,c)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,t,c)\\in L^2(\\mathbb{R}^d;p_t)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,t,\\varnothing)\\in L^2(\\mathbb{R}^d;p_t)$</span>。此假设保证下文的期望与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 投影均有定义。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 得分匹配的总体最优性（理想化）.</strong> 存在得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x,c):=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x\\mid c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x):=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,t,c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,t,\\varnothing)$</span> 分别是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot,c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 中的版本（即训练已收敛到总体最优）。此假设仅用于陈述主定理的“理想 CFG”版本；实际网络只近似成立，本节不对此作定量估计。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 正则性（用于恒等式与极限交换）.</strong> 对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x\\mid c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上处处为正、连续可微，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x\\mid c)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)$</span> 连续且有界；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x\\mid c)/p_t(x)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 连续可微。此假设保证 Bayes 恒等式逐点成立且可在积分号下求导。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 条件 dropout 的概率模型.</strong> 训练时以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\in[0,1]$</span> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing$</span>，以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 保留 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing$</span> 上的“边缘化”分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x\\mid\\varnothing):=p_t(x)$</span>。此假设只用于第 4 节；本节仅引用其结论形式，不展开训练动力学。</p>\n<p><strong>(A5) 引导权重的定义域.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in[0,\\infty)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta=\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta=\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)$</span>。本节不讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&lt;0$</span> 的情形。</p>\n<p>下面给出本节的核心定义、主定理、恒等式与具体例子。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-定义-引导得分估计\">定义：引导得分估计<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-定义-引导得分估计\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 18.1（引导得分估计）.</strong> 给定得分网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>、条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathcal{C}$</span>、权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span>，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c;w):=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\bigl(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\bigr).$$</div>\n称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 为<strong>无分类器引导（CFG）得分估计</strong>，称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 为<strong>引导权重</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别.</strong> 需强调三点区别，避免与后续节混淆：</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 不是条件得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 的无偏估计；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ne 1$</span> 时它甚至不是任何概率密度函数的得分（见第 5 节分布偏移）。它只是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 的仿射外推。</p>\n<p>(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 与<strong>隐式分类器引导</strong>不同：后者写作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x)+w\\,\\nabla_x\\log p_t(c\\mid x)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(c\\mid x)$</span> 由一个显式分类器给出；CFG 用得分之差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 替代该分类器梯度。第 16 节将证明二者在理想化假设下相等。</p>\n<p>(iii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 是<strong>得分</strong>层面的组合，不是概率密度层面的组合；不能把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 直接当作某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x\\mid c)$</span> 的得分再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 做代数运算，除非先验证可积性（第 5 节）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-主定理-CFG-的-Bayes-分解\">主定理：CFG 的 Bayes 分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-主定理-CFG-的-Bayes-分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 18.2（CFG 的隐式分类器形式）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathcal{C}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span>，逐点有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c;w)=s_t(x_t)+w\\,\\nabla_x\\log\\frac{p_t(x_t\\mid c)}{p_t(x_t)}.$$</div>\n特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c;1)=s_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=s_t(x_t\\mid c)=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)=s_t(x_t)=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)$</span>。代入定义 18.1：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c;w)=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)+w\\bigl(\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)-\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)\\bigr).$$</div>\n由 (A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid c),p_t(x_t)&gt;0$</span> 且连续可微，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 的差可合并：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)-\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)=\\nabla_x\\log\\frac{p_t(x_t\\mid c)}{p_t(x_t)}.$$</div>\n这里用到恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log a-\\nabla\\log b=\\nabla\\log(a/b)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a,b&gt;0$</span> 时逐点成立；求导与减法均为逐点运算，无需交换积分。合并即得第一式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时第二项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta=s_t+w(\\cdot)=s_t+\\nabla\\log(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)/p_t)=s_t+\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)-\\nabla\\log p_t=\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)=s_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>关键步骤说明.</strong> 定理 18.2 的全部内容是两个恒等式的复合：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)=s_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>（由 A2）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log a-\\nabla\\log b=\\nabla\\log(a/b)$</span>（由 A3 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a,b&gt;0$</span>）。没有用到任何积分交换，因此不需要 Dominated Convergence；这是本节唯一一个“无积分”的主定理，其严格性完全落在逐点正则性 (A3) 上。若 (A3) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)$</span> 在某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 处为零，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_t$</span> 无定义，定理失效；第 10 节将给出该边界情形的反例构造。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 18.3（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 退化）.</strong> 在定理 18.2 的条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c;1)=s_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>，即 CFG 退化为普通条件采样；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c;0)=s_t(\\cdot)$</span>，即退化为无条件采样。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 已由定理 18.2 给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 时定义 18.1 中第二项系数为零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta=\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)=s_t(\\cdot)$</span>（由 A2）。证毕。</p>\n<p>推论 18.3 是本章 canonical claim 的第一条“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 退化为普通条件采样”的精确版本：退化发生在<strong>得分层面</strong>，而得分唯一决定反向 SDE 与概率流 ODE 的漂移（在相同初值与相同噪声实现下），故采样分布退化。注意这里说的是得分相等，不是目标值相等；不得把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 的相等误读为某个损失函数的梯度相等。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-恒等式-引导的线性叠加结构\">恒等式：引导的线性叠加结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-恒等式-引导的线性叠加结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 18.4（引导的仿射分解）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1,w_2\\ge 0$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\in[0,1]$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c;\\lambda w_1+(1-\\lambda)w_2)=\\lambda\\,\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c;w_1)+(1-\\lambda)\\,\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c;w_2).$$</div>\n即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 是仿射的，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c;w)=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\,D_\\theta(x_t,c),\\qquad D_\\theta(x_t,c):=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由定义 18.1 直接展开：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot;w)=\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)+wD_\\theta(\\cdot,c).$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=\\lambda w_1+(1-\\lambda)w_2$</span> 代入：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)+(\\lambda w_1+(1-\\lambda)w_2)D_\\theta\n=\\lambda\\bigl(\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)+w_1D_\\theta\\bigr)+(1-\\lambda)\\bigl(\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)+w_2D_\\theta\\bigr),$$</div>\n右端即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot;w_1)+(1-\\lambda)\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot;w_2)$</span>。这里只用了实数乘法的分配律与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda+(1-\\lambda)=1$</span>，逐点成立，无需 (A1) 之外的正则性；(A1) 仅保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\theta\\in L^2(p_t)$</span> 使该分解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 意义下也有定义。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 18.4 的用途：它把“调 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span>”化为沿固定方向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\theta$</span> 的一维外推。第 3 节将利用此结构分析 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的几何意义；第 7 节将利用它在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 时取极限。本节只记录该代数事实，不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-具体例子-一维高斯条件下的精确计算\">具体例子：一维高斯条件下的精确计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-具体例子-一维高斯条件下的精确计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 18.5.</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 固定，设\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(x\\mid c)=\\mathcal{N}(x;\\mu_c,\\sigma^2),\\qquad p_t(x)=\\mathcal{N}(x;0,\\sigma^2),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_c\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_t(x\\mid c)=-\\frac{x-\\mu_c}{\\sigma^2},\\qquad s_t(x)=-\\frac{x}{\\sigma^2},$$</div>\n故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_\\theta(x,c)=s_t(x\\mid c)-s_t(x)=\\frac{\\mu_c}{\\sigma^2},$$</div>\n与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 无关。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,c;w)=-\\frac{x}{\\sigma^2}+w\\frac{\\mu_c}{\\sigma^2}.$$</div>\n验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta=-(x-\\mu_c)/\\sigma^2=s_t(x\\mid c)$</span>，与推论 18.3 一致；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta=-x/\\sigma^2=s_t(x)$</span>。进一步，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 视为某个高斯密度的得分：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_w(x\\mid c)=\\mathcal{N}(x;w\\mu_c,\\sigma^2)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log q_w(x\\mid c)=-(x-w\\mu_c)/\\sigma^2=\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,c;w)$</span>。故在本例中，CFG 精确地把条件均值从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_c$</span> 平移到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\mu_c$</span>，方差不变。这解释了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时“锐化”的几何来源：均值被外推，而方差未被压缩；真正的“锐化”需要方差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 减小，本例不呈现该效应，故不能把本例当作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 锐化条件分布的普遍证明。第 3 节将给出锐化的精确定义与反例边界。</p>\n<p>本例同时验证了命题 18.4：<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\theta=\\mu_c/\\sigma^2$</span> 为常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 确实是仿射的。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-训练时的条件-dropout-公式层面\">训练时的条件 dropout（公式层面）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-训练时的条件-dropout-公式层面\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节只给出 dropout 在公式层面的接口，训练动力学留到第 4 节。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 18.6（dropout 后的有效得分）.</strong> 在 (A4) 下，训练时以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 置空。记随机掩码 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\in\\{0,1\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}(M=0)=p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}(M=1)=1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=0$</span> 表示置空。则送入网络的條件为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_M:=M\\cdot c+(1-M)\\cdot\\varnothing$</span>（形式记号，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing$</span> 为吸收元）。训练目标为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{CFG}}(\\theta)=\\mathbb{E}_{x_0,c,t,M}\\Bigl[\\bigl\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c_M)-\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c_M)\\bigr\\|^2\\Bigr],$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\sim p_t(\\cdot\\mid x_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}[0,T]$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.7（dropout 的总体最优解）.</strong> 在 (A1)、(A4) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{CFG}}$</span> 的总体最优解存在且唯一（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 意义下），则它满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_\\theta^\\star(x_t,c)=\\begin{cases}s_t(x_t\\mid c), &amp; c\\in\\mathcal{C},\\\\ s_t(x_t), &amp; c=\\varnothing,\\end{cases}$$</div>\n且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathcal{C}$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_\\theta^\\star(x_t,c)=s_t(x_t)+\\nabla_x\\log\\frac{p_t(x_t\\mid c)}{p_t(x_t)}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤.</strong> 对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,t)$</span>，损失关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\cdot)$</span> 是逐点的二次型；由 (A1) 可积，期望与逐点最小化可交换（此处用 Fubini 于计数测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\times$</span> 连续测度，条件为 (A1) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 可积性）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathcal{C}$</span>，以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 出现，逐点最优值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing$</span>，以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 出现，逐点最优值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x_t)$</span>。第二式由定理 18.2 的 Bayes 恒等式直接得到。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 18.7 说明：dropout 不是正则化技巧，而是<strong>在总体层面强制网络同时拟合条件得分与边缘得分</strong>，从而使得定义 18.1 中的两个端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 都有明确语义。若不做 dropout，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 无训练信号，定义 18.1 的第二项无意义；这是本章 canonical claim 第三条“训练时以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 置空”的数学理由。<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 的具体取值不影响总体最优解的形式（只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;p_{\\mathrm{drop}}&lt;1$</span>），只影响有限样本下的方差；该点在第 4 节展开。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>CFG 的公式是得分层面上的仿射组合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c;w)=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing))$</span>；在理想化得分匹配假设 (A2) 与逐点正则性 (A3) 下，它精确等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x_t)+w\\nabla_x\\log(p_t(x_t\\mid c)/p_t(x_t))$</span>，即隐式分类器引导的得分形式（定理 18.2）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta=s_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>，退化为普通条件采样；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 时退化为无条件采样；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 仿射，可沿固定方向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\theta=\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 做一维外推（推论 18.3、命题 18.4）。一维高斯例给出精确验证：CFG 平移条件均值而不改变方差，故“锐化”不能由该例普遍推出。</li>\n<li>训练时以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 置空，使总体最优解同时等于条件得分与边缘得分（命题 18.7）；这是定义 18.1 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 具有明确语义的必要条件。<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 的分布偏移、极限行为与数值稳定性不在本节展开，分别由第 5、7、8 节处理。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-引导得分的算子表述与坐标无关性\">引导得分的算子表述与坐标无关性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-引导得分的算子表述与坐标无关性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定义 18.1 是逐点写出的，但后续节（第 3、5、7 节）需要在流形与算子层面讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的作用。为使接口自洽，本节把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 提升为一个作用在得分场上的算子，并证明它与坐标选取无关。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 18.8（引导算子）.</strong> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathcal{C}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span>。定义映射\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G_{w,c,t}:\\ \\Gamma(T\\mathbb{R}^d)\\times\\Gamma(T\\mathbb{R}^d)\\to\\Gamma(T\\mathbb{R}^d),\\qquad\nG_{w,c,t}(u,v):=v+w(u-v),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Gamma(T\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上光滑向量场的集合。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c;w)=G_{w,c,t}\\bigl(\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c),\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)\\bigr)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.9（引导算子的代数性质）.</strong> 在定义 18.8 的记号下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w,w'\\ge 0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\in[0,1]$</span>：</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_{1,c,t}(u,v)=u$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_{0,c,t}(u,v)=v$</span>；</p>\n<p>(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_{w,c,t}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(u,v)$</span> 是线性的，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_{w,c,t}(\\lambda u_1+(1-\\lambda)u_2,\\lambda v_1+(1-\\lambda)v_2)=\\lambda G_{w,c,t}(u_1,v_1)+(1-\\lambda)G_{w,c,t}(u_2,v_2)$</span>；</p>\n<p>(iii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_{w,c,t}\\circ G_{w',c,t}=G_{ww',c,t}$</span>，其中复合按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_{w,c,t}(G_{w',c,t}(u,v),v)$</span> 理解（即第二次引导以第一次的输出作为“条件端点”、以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 作为“无条件端点”）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> (i) 直接代入：<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_{1}(u,v)=v+1\\cdot(u-v)=u$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_{0}(u,v)=v+0\\cdot(u-v)=v$</span>。(ii) 逐点展开：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G_{w}(\\lambda u_1+(1-\\lambda)u_2,\\lambda v_1+(1-\\lambda)v_2)\n=\\lambda v_1+(1-\\lambda)v_2+w\\bigl(\\lambda(u_1-v_1)+(1-\\lambda)(u_2-v_2)\\bigr),$$</div>\n右端按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 归并即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda G_w(u_1,v_1)+(1-\\lambda)G_w(u_2,v_2)$</span>。(iii) 计算\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G_{w}\\bigl(G_{w'}(u,v),v\\bigr)=v+w\\bigl(v+w'(u-v)-v\\bigr)=v+ww'(u-v)=G_{ww'}(u,v).$$</div>\n三步均为逐点代数运算，不涉及积分或极限，故无需 (A1)–(A3) 之外的正则性；线性性只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u,v$</span> 属于同一向量空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Gamma(T\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 18.9(iii) 给出一个可检验的恒等式：<strong>两次引导权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w'$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的串联等价于一次权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ww'$</span> 的引导</strong>，前提是第二次引导的无条件端点仍取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>。这解释了为什么在实现中重复施加 CFG 与一次性施加乘积权重等价；也说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 在乘法群 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathbb{R}_{&gt;0},\\times)$</span> 下构成一个单参数群作用。第 7 节将利用此群结构讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 的极限。</p>\n<p><strong>坐标无关性.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为微分同胚，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y=\\varphi(x)$</span>。得分场在坐标变换下按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^y(y)=\\bigl(D\\varphi(x)\\bigr)^{-\\top}s^x(x)$</span> 变换（这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_y\\log p^y(y)=\\nabla_y\\log\\bigl(p^x(\\varphi^{-1}(y))|\\det D\\varphi^{-1}(y)|\\bigr)$</span> 的链式法则结果，其中 Jacobian 项对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 的梯度为零）。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_{w,c,t}$</span> 只对同一坐标系下的两个向量场做逐点线性组合，且线性组合与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D\\varphi^{-\\top}$</span> 可交换，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G_{w,c,t}\\bigl(\\varepsilon_\\theta^y(\\cdot,c),\\varepsilon_\\theta^y(\\cdot,\\varnothing)\\bigr)=\\bigl(D\\varphi\\bigr)^{-\\top}G_{w,c,t}\\bigl(\\varepsilon_\\theta^x(\\cdot,c),\\varepsilon_\\theta^x(\\cdot,\\varnothing)\\bigr).$$</div>\n即引导算子与坐标变换交换。该性质保证定义 18.1 不依赖于参数化；在流形上，只需把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_{w,c,t}$</span> 定义为逐纤维的线性组合即可，无需额外结构。此处用到的链式法则要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 微分同胚且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^x$</span> 在支撑上为正，属 (A3) 的坐标版本。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-得分差-D_-theta-的-Bayes-解释与一个可检验恒等式\">得分差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\theta$</span> 的 Bayes 解释与一个可检验恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-得分差-D_-theta-的-Bayes-解释与一个可检验恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 18.4 把 CFG 写成沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\theta=\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 的外推。本节进一步给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\theta$</span> 的精确 Bayes 语义，并由此得到一个不依赖网络参数的恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.10（得分差的 Bayes 恒等式）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(c\\mid x_t),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(c\\mid x_t)=p_t(x_t,c)/p_t(x_t)$</span> 为后验条件概率（对离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 为概率质量，对一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 为 Radon–Nikodym 导数）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 Bayes 公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid c)=p_t(c\\mid x_t)p_t(x_t)/p_t(c)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 无关。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 求梯度：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(c\\mid x_t)+\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t).$$</div>\n移项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x_t\\mid c)-s_t(x_t)=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(c\\mid x_t)$</span>。由 (A2) 左端等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\theta$</span>。这里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_t(c)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的梯度为零，故可略去；求导为逐点运算，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)&gt;0$</span> 由 (A3) 保证。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 18.10 是本节的核心恒等式：它把“两个得分网络输出之差”精确识别为“隐式分类器的对数似然梯度”。结合定理 18.2，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c;w)=s_t(x_t)+w\\,\\nabla_x\\log p_t(c\\mid x_t),$$</div>\n这正是隐式分类器引导的标准形式。<strong>注意这不是把目标值相等当成梯度相等</strong>：命题 18.10 断言的是两个梯度场逐点相等，其证明是 Bayes 公式取对数后逐点求导，不涉及任何期望或极限交换。第 16 节将由此把 CFG 与隐式分类器引导的等价性写成一条推导链。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 18.11（得分差的可积性）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\theta(\\cdot,c)\\in L^2(\\mathbb{R}^d;p_t)$</span>，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}D_\\theta(x,c)\\,p_t(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\nabla_x p_t(c\\mid x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(c\\mid\\cdot)$</span> 具有紧支撑或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x p_t(c\\mid x)$</span> 在无穷远处可积，则右端等于零。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\theta=\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span>，两者均属 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span>（由 A1），故其差属 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span>。第二式由命题 18.10 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)\\nabla_x\\log p_t(c\\mid x)=\\nabla_x p_t(c\\mid x)$</span> 逐点成立，两边乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 后积分即得；积分号内为可积函数（由 A1 与 A3 的有界性），无需交换。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(c\\mid\\cdot)$</span> 紧支撑，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x p_t(c\\mid x)$</span> 在支撑外为零，由散度定理（边界通量消失）积分为零。证毕。</p>\n<p>推论 18.11 给出一个<strong>可检验的数值恒等式</strong>：在理想化网络下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\theta$</span> 在边缘分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 下的期望为零（当后验梯度有紧支撑时）。这可用于诊断训练是否收敛到总体最优：若在大量样本上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{x_t\\sim p_t}[D_\\theta(x_t,c)]$</span> 显著非零，则 (A2) 不成立。注意该恒等式是<strong>期望</strong>层面的，不是逐点层面的；逐点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\theta(x,c)$</span> 一般不为零（例 18.5 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\theta=\\mu_c/\\sigma^2$</span> 为常数，其在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma^2)$</span> 下的期望恰为零，与推论一致）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-一个非高斯例子-离散条件与精确的锐化\">一个非高斯例子：离散条件与精确的锐化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-一个非高斯例子-离散条件与精确的锐化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>例 18.5 中方差不变，无法展示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 的锐化。本节补一个离散条件、非高斯的例子，精确算出 CFG 得分对应的密度，从而在公式层面验证“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 锐化条件分布”这一 canonical claim 的确切含义。</p>\n<p><strong>例 18.12.</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\{-1,+1\\}$</span>，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(x\\mid c=+1)=\\tfrac12\\delta_{a}+\\tfrac12\\delta_{-a},\\qquad p_t(x\\mid c=-1)=\\tfrac12\\delta_{b}+\\tfrac12\\delta_{-b},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;a&lt;b$</span>。为在得分层面运算，需把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 替换为方差趋于零的高斯混合；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t^\\sigma(x\\mid c=+1)=\\tfrac12\\mathcal{N}(x;a,\\sigma^2)+\\tfrac12\\mathcal{N}(x;-a,\\sigma^2),$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^\\sigma(x\\mid c=-1)$</span> 同理以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span>。设先验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c=\\pm1)=\\tfrac12$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t^\\sigma(x)=\\tfrac14\\bigl[\\mathcal{N}(x;a,\\sigma^2)+\\mathcal{N}(x;-a,\\sigma^2)+\\mathcal{N}(x;b,\\sigma^2)+\\mathcal{N}(x;-b,\\sigma^2)\\bigr].$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 充分小时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^\\sigma(x\\mid c=+1)\\approx\\mathcal{N}(x;a,\\sigma^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^\\sigma(x)\\approx\\tfrac14\\mathcal{N}(x;a,\\sigma^2)+\\tfrac14\\mathcal{N}(x;b,\\sigma^2)$</span>。计算得分差：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_\\theta(x,+1)=\\nabla_x\\log\\frac{p_t^\\sigma(x\\mid +1)}{p_t^\\sigma(x)}\\approx\\nabla_x\\log\\frac{\\mathcal{N}(x;a,\\sigma^2)}{\\tfrac14\\mathcal{N}(x;a,\\sigma^2)+\\tfrac14\\mathcal{N}(x;b,\\sigma^2)}.$$</div>\n记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=\\exp\\bigl(-((x-a)^2-(x-b)^2)/(2\\sigma^2)\\bigr)$</span>，则上式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx\\nabla_x\\log\\frac{1}{1+r}=\\frac{-\\nabla_x r}{1+r}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 靠近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\approx 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\theta\\approx 0$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 靠近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 急剧增大，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\theta$</span> 指向把样本推离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 的方向。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,+1;w)=s_t(x)+wD_\\theta(x,+1)$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时把“远离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span>”的推力放大了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 倍，使反向扩散更强烈地把质量集中到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 附近。这就是“锐化条件分布”的精确机制：<strong>不是方差被压缩，而是后验对数似然梯度被放大，从而在采样动力学中压低了竞争模式的权重</strong>。本例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta=s_t(\\cdot\\mid +1)$</span>，采样精确恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\delta_a+\\tfrac12\\delta_{-a}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时极限分布（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\to0$</span> 后）为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_a$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{-a}$</span> 的某个重新加权，权重比随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 单调变化。第 5 节将把该重新加权写成显式的指数倾斜公式；第 10 节将说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 过大时权重比趋于退化，导致模式崩溃。</p>\n<p>本例同时验证了命题 18.10：<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\theta$</span> 恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(c\\mid x)$</span> 的高斯混合近似，且其符号在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 靠近竞争模式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 时指向远离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span>，与 Bayes 后验一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-公式的适用边界-三个显式条件\">公式的适用边界：三个显式条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-公式的适用边界-三个显式条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节的所有命题都建立在 (A1)–(A3) 上。为避免后续节误用，本节把这三条假设在 CFG 情境下的具体含义逐条落实，并指出各自失效时的后果（完整反例见第 10 节）。</p>\n<p><strong>(B1) 正性.</strong> (A3) 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)&gt;0$</span> 处处成立。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在某区域为零（例如数据支撑为低维流形，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上不绝对连续），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_t$</span> 无定义，定理 18.2 与命题 18.10 均失效。此时 CFG 公式仍可逐点写出（定义 18.1 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>），但其 Bayes 解释不存在；第 5 节将在测度层面重新表述。</p>\n<p><strong>(B2) 可积性.</strong> (A1) 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c),\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)\\in L^2(p_t)$</span>。若网络输出在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 下有重尾（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 支撑外增长过快），则推论 18.11 的积分可能发散，数值诊断失效。实现中常见的梯度裁剪正是对 (B1) 的工程替代，但它不恢复数学上的可积性。</p>\n<p><strong>(B3) 总体最优.</strong> (A2) 是理想化假设，实际网络只近似满足。定理 18.2 的等式在有限训练下变为近似等式，误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)-s_t(\\cdot\\mid c)\\|_{L^2(p_t)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)-s_t(\\cdot)\\|_{L^2(p_t)}$</span> 的线性组合，权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 越大，无条件端的拟合误差被放大得越少（因为系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-w$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时为负，误差以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|1-w|$</span> 放大），而条件端的误差以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 放大。这解释了为什么大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 对条件端的网络误差更敏感；第 8 节将把该误差传播写成显式不等式。</p>\n<p>三条边界共同刻画了本节公式的适用范围：<strong>CFG 是一个逐点代数公式，其 Bayes 语义需要正性与可积性，其数值可靠性需要总体最优性</strong>。三者缺一，公式仍可写出，但定理 18.2、命题 18.10、推论 18.11 中相应的等式不再成立。后续第 5、7、8、10 节分别处理这三条边界失效时的定量后果。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df18--h-条件与无条件的组合\">条件与无条件的组合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-条件与无条件的组合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 18 章第 1 节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为前向扩散过程在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 的状态，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathcal{C}$</span> 为条件变量（离散类别或连续嵌入），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing$</span> 为无条件占位符，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times(\\mathcal{C}\\cup\\{\\varnothing\\})\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为噪声预测网络，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span> 为引导权重。本节新引入的符号如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span> 上配有一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-有限测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>，条件分布记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span>，无条件边缘记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)=p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)$</span>，均相对于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上 Lebesgue 测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}x$</span> 绝对连续，密度分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot)$</span>。</li>\n<li>得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x,c):=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x\\mid c)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x,\\varnothing):=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)$</span>。</li>\n<li>组合得分算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathcal{C}\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 定义为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(x,c):=s_t(x,\\varnothing)+w\\bigl(s_t(x,c)-s_t(x,\\varnothing)\\bigr).$$</div></li>\n<li>组合噪声预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span> 由本章 canonical claim 给出，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}$</span> 的关系为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(x,c)=-\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)/\\sigma_t$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 为前向过程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 时刻的噪声尺度，第 1 节已定义）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（正则性）</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathcal{C}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)\\in C^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 且存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x\\mid c)\\|\\le L_t(1+\\|x\\|)$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot)$</span> 满足同样条件。此假设保证得分函数良定义、局部 Lipschitz，从而使反向 SDE 与概率流 ODE 的解存在唯一（第 1 节已引用）。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A2（可积性）</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\|s_t(x,c)\\|^2 p_t(x\\mid c)\\,\\mathrm{d}x&lt;\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\|s_t(x,\\varnothing)\\|^2 p_t(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x&lt;\\infty$</span>。此假设保证 KL 散度与 Fisher 散度在后续命题中有定义。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A3（条件测度的绝对连续性）</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot)$</span> 相互绝对连续，Radon–Nikodym 导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_t(x,c):=\\mathrm{d}p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)/\\mathrm{d}p_t(\\cdot)(x)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_t(\\cdot,c)\\in C^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log r_t(x,c)$</span> 局部有界。此假设是本节组合公式与贝叶斯解释的枢纽。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A4（网络一致性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t(\\cdot))$</span> 下分别逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t s_t(\\cdot,c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t s_t(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span>，逼近误差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|_{L^2}$</span> 意义下趋于零。此假设把总体层面的组合公式与经验网络的可计算量连接起来。</p>\n<p>下面先给出组合算子的定义并澄清它与“条件得分”和“无条件得分”的区别，再证明组合公式的得分表述与贝叶斯分解等价，最后给出一个可检验的恒等式与一个具体例子。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-组合算子的定义与相邻概念的区别\">组合算子的定义与相邻概念的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-组合算子的定义与相邻概念的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1（条件—无条件组合）</strong>。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span>，组合得分算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}$</span> 由上式定义。与之相邻的三个概念必须区分：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>条件得分</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x,c)$</span>：仅使用条件信息，对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 的组合得分（见命题 1）。</li>\n<li><strong>无条件得分</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x,\\varnothing)$</span>：仅使用边缘信息，对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 的组合得分。</li>\n<li><strong>隐式分类器引导得分</strong>：若存在分类器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(c\\mid x)$</span>，其得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(c\\mid x)$</span> 通过贝叶斯公式与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x,c)-s_t(x,\\varnothing)$</span> 联系（命题 2），则组合得分可视为“边缘得分 + <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\cdot$</span> 分类器得分”。这一区别是本节后续“CFG = 隐式分类器”推导链的起点。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>组合算子不是条件得分与无条件得分的凸组合（除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in[0,1]$</span>）；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时它是外推，这正是 canonical claim 中“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 锐化条件分布”的数学来源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-1-组合公式的得分表述与-w-1-退化\">命题 1（组合公式的得分表述与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 退化）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-1-组合公式的得分表述与-w-1-退化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1</strong>。在假设 A1–A3 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，组合噪声预测满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\bigl(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\bigr),$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(1)}(x,c)=s_t(x,c)$</span>，即退化为普通条件采样。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由第 1 节定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=-\\sigma_t s_t(x,c)$</span> 在总体层面成立（假设 A4 保证网络逼近该量）。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}$</span> 的定义两边乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\sigma_t\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(x,c)=-\\sigma_t s_t(x,\\varnothing)-w\\sigma_t\\bigl(s_t(x,c)-s_t(x,\\varnothing)\\bigr)\n=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\bigl(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\bigr).$$</div>\n<p>左端即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span> 的定义（第 1 节），故第一式成立。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde s_t^{(1)}(x,c)=s_t(x,\\varnothing)+1\\cdot\\bigl(s_t(x,c)-s_t(x,\\varnothing)\\bigr)=s_t(x,c).$$</div>\n<p>这正是普通条件采样的得分，故退化成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1 的证明只用了代数恒等式与第 1 节的符号定义，未交换任何积分与极限，因此无需 Dominated Convergence。它的作用是锁定 canonical claim 的符号一致性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-2-贝叶斯分解-组合得分-边缘得分-w-cdot-隐式分类器得分\">命题 2（贝叶斯分解：组合得分 = 边缘得分 + <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\cdot$</span> 隐式分类器得分）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-2-贝叶斯分解-组合得分-边缘得分-w-cdot-隐式分类器得分\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2</strong>。在假设 A1–A3 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，存在隐式分类器密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(c\\mid x)$</span> 使</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_t(x,c)-s_t(x,\\varnothing)=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(c\\mid x),$$</div>\n<p>从而</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(x,c)=s_t(x,\\varnothing)+w\\,\\nabla_x\\log p_t(c\\mid x).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由贝叶斯公式，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(x\\mid c)=\\frac{p_t(c\\mid x)\\,p_t(x)}{p_t(c)},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(c):=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}p_t(c\\mid x)p_t(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>。两边取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x\\mid c)=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(c\\mid x)+\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)-\\nabla_x\\log p_t(c).$$</div>\n<p>末项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(c)=0$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 无关。移项得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(c\\mid x)=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x\\mid c)-\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)=s_t(x,c)-s_t(x,\\varnothing).$$</div>\n<p>这里求导与积分未交换：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(c)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的边缘化，其梯度为零是逐点恒等式，不涉及交换。将上式代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}$</span> 的定义即得第二式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 是本节的核心恒等式：它把“条件减无条件”精确识别为隐式分类器的得分。注意此处只断言目标值（得分）相等，未断言反向 SDE 漂移与概率流 ODE 速度相等；后者属于第 1 节与后续节的接口，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-推论-1-可检验的恒等式-w-的线性叠加\">推论 1（可检验的恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的线性叠加）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-推论-1-可检验的恒等式-w-的线性叠加\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 1</strong>。在假设 A1–A3 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1,w_2\\ge 0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde s_t^{(w_1+w_2)}(x,c)=\\tilde s_t^{(w_1)}(x,c)+\\tilde s_t^{(w_2)}(x,c)-s_t(x,\\varnothing).$$</div>\n<p>特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(x,c)=s_t(x,\\varnothing)+w\\,g_t(x,c)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t(x,c):=s_t(x,c)-s_t(x,\\varnothing)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。直接计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde s_t^{(w_1+w_2)}=s_t(x,\\varnothing)+(w_1+w_2)g_t\n=\\bigl[s_t(x,\\varnothing)+w_1 g_t\\bigr]+\\bigl[s_t(x,\\varnothing)+w_2 g_t\\bigr]-s_t(x,\\varnothing)\n=\\tilde s_t^{(w_1)}+\\tilde s_t^{(w_2)}-s_t(x,\\varnothing).$$</div>\n<p>第二式由定义直接读出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 1 给出一个可在数值上检验的线性结构：固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,c$</span>，组合得分关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 是仿射的。第 14 节的数值实验将据此检查实现是否自洽。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-例-1-一维高斯混合的具体验证\">例 1（一维高斯混合的具体验证）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-例-1-一维高斯混合的具体验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 固定，设无条件密度为两个等权高斯的混合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(x)=\\tfrac12\\mathcal{N}(x;-\\mu,\\sigma^2)+\\tfrac12\\mathcal{N}(x;+\\mu,\\sigma^2),$$</div>\n<p>条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\{+,-\\}$</span> 指定其中一个分量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x\\mid +)=\\mathcal{N}(x;+\\mu,\\sigma^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x\\mid -)=\\mathcal{N}(x;-\\mu,\\sigma^2)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=+$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_t(x,+)=-\\frac{x-\\mu}{\\sigma^2},\\qquad\ns_t(x,\\varnothing)=\\frac{\\tfrac12\\mathcal{N}(x;-\\mu,\\sigma^2)\\cdot(-\\tfrac{x+\\mu}{\\sigma^2})+\\tfrac12\\mathcal{N}(x;+\\mu,\\sigma^2)\\cdot(-\\tfrac{x-\\mu}{\\sigma^2})}{p_t(x)}.$$</div>\n<p>组合得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(x,+)=s_t(x,\\varnothing)+w\\bigl(s_t(x,+)-s_t(x,\\varnothing)\\bigr)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时它等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x,+)$</span>，与命题 1 一致；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mu$</span>（错误分量中心）处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x,+)-s_t(x,\\varnothing)$</span> 指向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\mu$</span> 方向，外推使漂移更强地把样本推离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mu$</span>，这正是“锐化条件分布”的一维显式表现。此例同时验证命题 2：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x,+)-s_t(x,\\varnothing)=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(+\\mid x)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(+\\mid x)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x&gt;0$</span> 时大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x&lt;0$</span> 时小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，其对数梯度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span> 附近为正，与上式符号一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-3-组合算子的-L-2-稳定性\">命题 3（组合算子的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 稳定性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-3-组合算子的-L-2-稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3</strong>。在假设 A1–A4 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，组合噪声预测的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))$</span> 误差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bigl\\|\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)-\\bigl(-\\sigma_t\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(\\cdot,c)\\bigr)\\bigr\\|_{L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))}\n\\le (1+|w-1|)\\,\\delta_t(c)+(|w|+1)\\,\\delta_t(\\varnothing),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t(c):=\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)+\\sigma_t s_t(\\cdot,c)\\|_{L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t(\\varnothing)$</span> 类似定义于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_c:=\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)+\\sigma_t s_t(\\cdot,c)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_\\varnothing:=\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)+\\sigma_t s_t(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span>。由命题 1 的代数式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)+\\sigma_t\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(\\cdot,c)\n=e_\\varnothing+w(e_c-e_\\varnothing)=(1-w)e_\\varnothing+w e_c.$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))$</span> 范数并用三角不等式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|(1-w)e_\\varnothing+w e_c\\|_{L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))}\n\\le |1-w|\\,\\|e_\\varnothing\\|_{L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))}+|w|\\,\\|e_c\\|_{L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))}.$$</div>\n<p>由假设 A3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot)$</span> 相互绝对连续，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|e_\\varnothing\\|_{L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))}\\le M_c\\,\\|e_\\varnothing\\|_{L^2(p_t(\\cdot))}$</span> 对某常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_c$</span> 成立（Radon–Nikodym 导数的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^\\infty$</span> 界）；将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_c$</span> 吸收进 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t(\\varnothing)$</span> 的定义即得所述界。此处未交换极限与积分，仅用三角不等式与绝对连续性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 说明：组合算子对网络逼近误差的放大是线性的，放大因子随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|w|$</span> 增长。这为后续“数值稳定性”节提供了定量接口，但本节不展开稳定性分析。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-4-组合得分的梯度结构-与得分匹配目标的相容性\">命题 4（组合得分的梯度结构：与得分匹配目标的相容性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-4-组合得分的梯度结构-与得分匹配目标的相容性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4</strong>。在假设 A1–A4 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span>，定义组合得分匹配损失</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}_t^{(w)}(c):=\\mathbb{E}_{x\\sim p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)}\\Bigl\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,c)+\\sigma_t\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(x,c)\\Bigr\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^{(w)}(c)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)$</span> 上的唯一极小元（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))$</span> 中）为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_\\theta^\\star(x,c)=-\\sigma_t s_t(x,\\varnothing)-w\\sigma_t\\bigl(s_t(x,c)-s_t(x,\\varnothing)\\bigr)=-\\sigma_t\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(x,c),$$</div>\n<p>且极小值为零。特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时极小元退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t s_t(x,c)$</span>，与普通条件得分匹配目标一致。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。将损失写为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}_t^{(w)}(c)=\\mathbb{E}_{x\\sim p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)}\\Bigl\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,c)-\\bigl(-\\sigma_t\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(x,c)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))$</span> 中到目标函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(\\cdot,c)$</span> 的平方距离。由假设 A2，该目标函数平方可积，故投影定理给出唯一极小元即目标函数本身，极小值为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时由命题 1 的退化式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(1)}=s_t(\\cdot,c)$</span> 直接得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 的意义在于：它把 CFG 的组合公式从“采样时的插值技巧”提升为“一个良定义的得分匹配目标”。这解释了为何训练时无需显式构造组合目标——只要网络分别逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot,c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span>，组合算子就在采样时精确复现该目标的极小元。此处极小元的唯一性依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 空间的严格凸性，未涉及任何积分与极限的交换。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-5-条件与无条件的正交分解\">命题 5（条件与无条件的正交分解）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-5-条件与无条件的正交分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5</strong>。在假设 A1–A3 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t(x,c):=s_t(x,c)-s_t(x,\\varnothing)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t(\\cdot,c)$</span> 关于测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot)$</span> 满足如下矩条件：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{x\\sim p_t(\\cdot)}\\bigl[g_t(x,c)\\bigr]=\\mathbb{E}_{x\\sim p_t(\\cdot)}\\bigl[\\nabla_x\\log p_t(c\\mid x)\\bigr]=0,$$</div>\n<p>其中期望为向量值 Bochner 积分，在假设 A2 下良定义。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t(x,c)=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(c\\mid x)$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{x\\sim p_t(\\cdot)}\\bigl[\\nabla_x\\log p_t(c\\mid x)\\bigr]\n=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\frac{\\nabla_x p_t(c\\mid x)}{p_t(c\\mid x)}\\,p_t(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n<p>由贝叶斯公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(c\\mid x)p_t(x)=p_t(x\\mid c)p_t(c)$</span>，被积函数化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x p_t(c\\mid x)\\cdot p_t(c)/p_t(c\\mid x)$</span> 的形式不便直接积分；改用另一路径：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(c\\mid x)$</span> 视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的函数并注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t(c\\mid x)p_t(x)\\mathrm{d}x=p_t(c)$</span> 为常数，对等式两边取梯度得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}p_t(c\\mid x)p_t(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=0.$$</div>\n<p>在假设 A1（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(c\\mid x)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 且梯度有线性增长界）与假设 A2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 平方可积）下，Leibniz 积分法则适用：被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x p_t(c\\mid x)\\,p_t(x)$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t(1+\\|x\\|)p_t(x)$</span> 控制，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 具有有限一阶矩（由 A2 的平方可积性蕴含），故可用 Dominated Convergence 将梯度移入积分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$0=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\nabla_x p_t(c\\mid x)\\,p_t(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\frac{\\nabla_x p_t(c\\mid x)}{p_t(c\\mid x)}\\,p_t(c\\mid x)\\,p_t(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n<p>右端即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{x\\sim p_t(\\cdot)}[g_t(x,c)]$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(c\\mid x)&gt;0$</span> 的支撑上；零测集上不影响积分）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 给出一个可检验的恒等式：隐式分类器得分在边缘分布下的均值为零。这与“分类器得分应无系统性漂移”的直觉一致，并为第 14 节的数值实验提供一个廉价的断言：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，用大量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\sim p_t(\\cdot)$</span> 样本估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[g_t(x,c)]$</span>，其范数应随样本量增大趋于零。证明中唯一使用 Dominated Convergence 的地方是梯度与积分的交换，其控制函数由 A1 的线性增长界与 A2 的有限矩共同保证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-6-w-的极限行为-w-to-0-与-w-to-infty-的得分极限\">命题 6（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的极限行为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to 0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 的得分极限）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-6-w-的极限行为-w-to-0-与-w-to-infty-的得分极限\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6</strong>。在假设 A1–A3 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>：</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\displaystyle\\lim_{w\\to 0^+}\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(x,c)=s_t(x,\\varnothing)$</span>，且收敛在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))$</span> 下成立，误差界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\,\\|g_t(\\cdot,c)\\|_{L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))}$</span>；</p>\n<p>(ii) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t(x,c)\\neq 0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(x,c)\\|\\to\\infty$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span>），即组合得分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 增大时无界外推。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。(i) 由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(x,c)-s_t(x,\\varnothing)=w\\,g_t(x,c)$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))$</span> 范数即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde s_t^{(w)}-s_t(\\cdot,\\varnothing)\\|_{L^2}=w\\|g_t\\|_{L^2}$</span>，由假设 A2 该范数有限，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to 0^+$</span> 时趋于零，逐点收敛由同一恒等式直接读出。(ii) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}=s_t(\\cdot,\\varnothing)+w g_t$</span> 与三角不等式反向估计：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(x,c)\\|\\ge w\\|g_t(x,c)\\|-\\|s_t(x,\\varnothing)\\|,$$</div>\n<p>右端当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t(x,c)\\neq 0$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 精确刻画了 canonical claim 中“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 锐化条件分布”的机制：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to 0$</span> 抹去条件信息回到边缘采样；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 增大则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t\\neq 0$</span> 处无界放大条件与边缘的差。这为后续“引导权重”节与“引导的极限行为”节提供代数接口，但本节只断言得分层面的极限，不对应分布层面的极限——后者需要额外假设，属于第 7 节的范围。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-例-2-离散条件的一维验证-组合得分的仿射性与矩条件\">例 2（离散条件的一维验证：组合得分的仿射性与矩条件）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-例-2-离散条件的一维验证-组合得分的仿射性与矩条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}=\\{+1,-1\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span> 上的均匀计数测度。设无条件密度为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(x)=\\tfrac12\\mathcal{N}(x;-1,1)+\\tfrac12\\mathcal{N}(x;+1,1),$$</div>\n<p>条件密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x\\mid c)=\\mathcal{N}(x;c,1)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=+1$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_t(x,+1)=-(x-1),\\qquad\ns_t(x,\\varnothing)=\\frac{\\tfrac12\\varphi(x+1)(-(x+1))+\\tfrac12\\varphi(x-1)(-(x-1))}{p_t(x)},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 为标准正态密度。组合得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(x,+1)=s_t(x,\\varnothing)+w\\bigl(s_t(x,+1)-s_t(x,\\varnothing)\\bigr)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>验证推论 1</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_2=1.5$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(2)}(x,+1)$</span> 应等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(0.5)}(x,+1)+\\tilde s_t^{(1.5)}(x,+1)-s_t(x,\\varnothing)$</span>。逐点代入定义即得，无需数值计算；这是纯代数恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>验证命题 5</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t(x,+1)=s_t(x,+1)-s_t(x,\\varnothing)=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(+1\\mid x)$</span>。由贝叶斯公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(+1\\mid x)=\\tfrac12\\varphi(x-1)/p_t(x)$</span>，其对数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\tfrac12+\\log\\varphi(x-1)-\\log p_t(x)$</span>，梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-(x-1)-\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)=s_t(x,+1)-s_t(x,\\varnothing)$</span>，与定义一致。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\sim p_t(\\cdot)$</span> 取期望，由命题 5 该期望为零；这一恒等式可用蒙特卡洛估计检验（第 14 节代码将给出断言）。</p>\n<p><strong>验证命题 6</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to 0^+$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(x,+1)\\to s_t(x,\\varnothing)$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 增大，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1$</span>（错误分量中心）处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t(x,+1)$</span> 显著非零，组合得分沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+1$</span> 方向外推，把样本推离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1$</span>，这正是“锐化”的一维显式图像。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-7-组合算子与条件期望算子的交换性\">命题 7（组合算子与条件期望算子的交换性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-7-组合算子与条件期望算子的交换性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 7</strong>。在假设 A1–A4 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_c$</span> 为由条件变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 生成的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数。则对任意有界可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\bigl[\\phi(x_t)\\mid c\\bigr]\\ \\text{在}\\ p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)\\ \\text{下的得分表示与}\\ \\tilde s_t^{(w)}\\ \\text{的组合结构相容}：$$</div>\n<p>更精确地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 表示以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(\\cdot,c)$</span> 为得分、以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot)$</span> 为边缘的密度（在后续“引导的分布偏移”节中构造），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(w)}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 的条件化与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的边缘化在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时重合于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong>。此命题的作用是把组合算子嵌入条件期望的框架，为后续“引导的分布偏移”节提供接口。关键步骤是：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时由命题 1 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(1)}=s_t(\\cdot,c)$</span>，而得分唯一确定密度（在假设 A1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 与 A2 的平方可积下，Poincaré 不等式保证得分到密度的映射在相差常数因子意义下唯一），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(1)}(\\cdot\\mid c)=p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>。对一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(w)}$</span> 的存在性与显式构造属于第 5 节，本节只断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 的重合性与组合结构对条件期望的相容性；完整构造见第 5 节。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 刻意只给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 的完整论证与一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的接口陈述，避免与后续“引导的分布偏移”节重复展开。它的价值在于明确本节论证链的边界：本节完成的是得分层面的组合代数（命题 1–6），分布层面的组合留给第 5 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-8-组合公式的坐标无关表述\">命题 8（组合公式的坐标无关表述）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-8-组合公式的坐标无关表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 8</strong>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{M}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维光滑流形，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{M}$</span> 上相对于体积测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{vol}$</span> 绝对连续的正密度。则组合得分算子</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}=s_t(\\cdot,\\varnothing)+w\\bigl(s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t(\\cdot,\\varnothing)\\bigr)$$</div>\n<p>是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{M}$</span> 上的光滑向量场，且在任意局部坐标卡 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(U,\\psi)$</span> 下，其分量表示为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde s_t^{(w),i}(x)=g^{ij}(x)\\,\\partial_j\\log p_t(x)+w\\,g^{ij}(x)\\,\\partial_j\\log\\frac{p_t(x\\mid c)}{p_t(x)},\\qquad i=1,\\dots,d,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{ij}$</span> 为逆度量分量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_j$</span> 为坐标偏导，指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1,\\dots,d$</span> 并按 Einstein 求和约定。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。得分函数在流形上的坐标无关定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>，即密度的梯度向量场；在局部坐标下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t=g^{ij}\\partial_j\\log p_t$</span>。组合算子是三个向量场的线性组合，系数为常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$-w$</span>，故仍为光滑向量场。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot)$</span> 分别用坐标表示并代入组合定义，合并同类项即得所述分量式。此处未涉及积分与极限，仅用向量场的线性结构与度量张量的坐标表示。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8 的作用是确保组合公式不依赖于欧氏坐标的选择：在流形上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t(\\cdot,\\varnothing)=\\nabla\\log(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)/p_t(\\cdot))$</span> 是坐标无关的向量场，这正是命题 2 贝叶斯分解的几何版本。它同时提醒：组合算子的线性叠加（推论 1）在流形上依然成立，因为向量场的线性组合与度量无关。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>组合得分算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(x,c)=s_t(x,\\varnothing)+w(s_t(x,c)-s_t(x,\\varnothing))$</span> 与 canonical claim 的噪声预测式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing))$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t$</span> 缩放下逐点等价；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 精确退化为条件得分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 退化为无条件得分。</li>\n<li>在条件测度绝对连续（假设 A3）下，条件减无条件精确等于隐式分类器的对数密度梯度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x,c)-s_t(x,\\varnothing)=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(c\\mid x)$</span>，从而 CFG 的组合得分是“边缘得分 + <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\cdot$</span> 隐式分类器得分”，这是本章“CFG = 隐式分类器”推导链的代数起点。</li>\n<li>组合得分关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 仿射（推论 1），网络逼近误差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))$</span> 下被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|w|$</span> 线性放大（命题 3）；这两个可检验结论分别对接第 14 节的数值实验与第 8 节的数值稳定性分析。</li>\n<li>组合得分算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(x,c)=s_t(x,\\varnothing)+w(s_t(x,c)-s_t(x,\\varnothing))$</span> 与 canonical claim 的噪声预测式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing))$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t$</span> 缩放下逐点等价；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 精确退化为条件得分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 退化为无条件得分，且组合得分是得分匹配损失的唯一极小元（命题 1、4）。</li>\n<li>在条件测度绝对连续（假设 A3）下，条件减无条件精确等于隐式分类器的对数密度梯度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x,c)-s_t(x,\\varnothing)=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(c\\mid x)$</span>，该差在边缘分布下均值为零（命题 2、5），从而 CFG 的组合得分是“边缘得分 + <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\cdot$</span> 隐式分类器得分”，这是本章“CFG = 隐式分类器”推导链的代数起点。</li>\n<li>组合得分关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 仿射（推论 1），<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to 0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛到边缘得分、<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 时在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t\\neq 0$</span> 处无界外推（命题 6），网络逼近误差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))$</span> 下被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|w|$</span> 线性放大（命题 3）；这些可检验结论分别对接第 14 节的数值实验与第 8 节的数值稳定性分析，分布层面的组合则留给第 5 节。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df18--h-引导权重\">引导权重<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-引导权重\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前两节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为扩散过程在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的状态，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 为条件变量（取值于可测空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing$</span> 为“空条件”记号，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 参数化的噪声预测网络，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)$</span> 为其在空条件下的输出。前节已确立 CFG 插值公式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\left(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\right),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span> 为标量。本节只讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的取值如何改变由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 诱导的分布，不重复推导插值公式本身。</p>\n<p>本节引入的新符号如下，均在此处定义，后续不再另设：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span>：给定条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 时时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的边缘密度（相对于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 的 Lebesgue 测度），假设存在且为正。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)$</span>：空条件（即无条件）边缘密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)=p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x_t,c)=\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span>：条件得分函数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x_t)=\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t(x_t)$</span>：无条件得分函数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(x_t,c)$</span>：由插值噪声预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 经 Tweedie 公式诱导的得分估计，定义为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(x_t,c):=-\\frac{\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)}{\\sigma_t^2},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 为前节已定义的扩散方差调度在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的取值，假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span> 成立。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(w)}(x_t\\mid c)$</span>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}$</span> 在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 处作为得分场诱导的“引导分布”，其定义通过下式隐式给出：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log \\tilde p_t^{(w)}(x_t\\mid c)=\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(x_t,c).$$</div>\n该定义只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(\\cdot,c)$</span> 为某密度梯度的意义下成立；本节命题 1 给出其存在条件。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设统一列出，后续命题逐条引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1)（可测性与可积性）</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,c)\\mapsto \\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}(\\mathbb{R}^d)\\otimes\\mathcal{B}(\\mathcal{C})$</span> 可测，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)\\in L^2(\\mathbb{R}^d;p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2)（得分场正则性）</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathcal{C}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot,c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上局部 Lipschitz 连续，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_t}\\cdot s_t(\\cdot,c)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_t}\\cdot s_t(\\cdot)$</span> 局部有界。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3)（边界通量消失）</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_t\\|\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid c)\\,s_t(x_t,c)\\to 0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)\\,s_t(x_t)\\to 0$</span> 在分布意义下成立（即边界项在分部积分中消失）。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4)（Tweedie 一致性）</strong> 假设网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 在条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 下精确逼近条件得分：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=-\\sigma_t^2 s_t(x_t,c)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,t$</span> 成立；同理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)=-\\sigma_t^2 s_t(x_t)$</span>。本节先在此理想化假设下推导 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的语义，第 5 节再放松该假设讨论估计误差。</p>\n<p><strong>(A5)（归一化可行性）</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span>，函数\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F^{(w)}(x_t;c):=\\log p_t(x_t)+w\\left(\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)-\\log p_t(x_t)\\right)$$</div>\n满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\exp(F^{(w)}(x_t;c))\\,\\mathrm{d}x_t&lt;\\infty$</span>，从而可定义归一化密度\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde p_t^{(w)}(x_t\\mid c)=\\frac{\\exp(F^{(w)}(x_t;c))}{Z^{(w)}(c)},\\qquad Z^{(w)}(c)=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\exp(F^{(w)}(x_t;c))\\,\\mathrm{d}x_t.$$</div></p>\n<p>在 (A4) 下，(A5) 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{(w)}$</span> 之梯度恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(w)}$</span> 与隐式定义自洽。以下命题均在此框架内陈述。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-1-引导权重的插值语义与-w-1-退化\">命题 1（引导权重的插值语义与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 退化）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-1-引导权重的插值语义与-w-1-退化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> (A1)–(A5) 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述：</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathcal{C}$</span>，引导分布满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde p_t^{(w)}(x_t\\mid c)=\\frac{p_t(x_t)^{1-w}\\,p_t(x_t\\mid c)^{w}}{Z^{(w)}(c)}.$$</div>\n<p>特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(1)}(x_t\\mid c)=p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span>，即退化为普通条件采样；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(0)}(x_t\\mid c)=p_t(x_t)$</span>，即退化为无条件采样。</p>\n<p><strong>证明：</strong> 由 (A5)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\tilde p_t^{(w)}(x_t\\mid c)=F^{(w)}(x_t;c)-\\log Z^{(w)}(c)$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{(w)}$</span> 的定义展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F^{(w)}(x_t;c)=\\log p_t(x_t)+w\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)-w\\log p_t(x_t)=(1-w)\\log p_t(x_t)+w\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c).$$</div>\n<p>取指数即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(F^{(w)})=p_t^{1-w}p_t^w$</span>，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^{(w)}(c)$</span> 得所述表达式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^{(1)}(c)=\\int p_t(x_t\\mid c)\\mathrm{d}x_t=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(1)}=p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 时分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^{(0)}(c)=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(0)}=p_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别：</strong> 命题 1 的插值是在<strong>密度层面</strong>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 做几何插值（指数族意义下的 log-linear 插值），而非在得分层面做线性插值。二者在 (A4) 下等价，因为得分是密度的对数梯度，线性插值得分恰给出 log-linear 插值密度的梯度。若 (A4) 失效（网络未精确逼近得分），得分插值与密度插值不再等价，这是第 5 节分布偏移分析的起点。此外，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 不是温度参数：温度缩放作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 的整体系数，而这里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 同时缩放条件与无条件两部分，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 对应原分布而非“更锐化”的分布。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-2-w-gt-1-锐化条件分布-KL-散度的单调性\">命题 2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 锐化条件分布：KL 散度的单调性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-2-w-gt-1-锐化条件分布-KL-散度的单调性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> (A1)–(A5) 成立，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot)$</span> 的支撑集相同（避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\neq 1$</span> 时出现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\cdot\\infty$</span> 型未定义）。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述：</strong> 定义引导分布与条件分布之间的 KL 散度\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D^{(w)}(c):=\\mathrm{KL}\\!\\left(\\tilde p_t^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)\\,\\|\\,p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)\\right)=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\tilde p_t^{(w)}(x_t\\mid c)\\log\\frac{\\tilde p_t^{(w)}(x_t\\mid c)}{p_t(x_t\\mid c)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x_t.$$</div>\n则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D^{(w)}(c)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 单调不减；且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)\\neq p_t(\\cdot)$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D^{(w)}(c)&gt;0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明：</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_w=\\tilde p_t^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1=p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0=p_t(\\cdot)$</span>。由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q_w=(1-w)\\log q_0+w\\log q_1-\\log Z^{(w)}$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D^{(w)}=\\int q_w\\left[(1-w)\\log q_0+w\\log q_1-\\log Z^{(w)}-\\log q_1\\right]\\mathrm{d}x_t\n=\\int q_w\\left[(1-w)\\log q_0+(w-1)\\log q_1-\\log Z^{(w)}\\right]\\mathrm{d}x_t.$$</div>\n<p>提取公因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(w-1)$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D^{(w)}=(w-1)\\int q_w\\log\\frac{q_1}{q_0}\\,\\mathrm{d}x_t-\\log Z^{(w)}.$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^{(w)}=\\int q_0^{1-w}q_1^w\\,\\mathrm{d}x_t=\\int q_1\\exp\\!\\left((w-1)\\log\\frac{q_0}{q_1}\\right)\\mathrm{d}x_t$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(w):=\\log Z^{(w)}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的凸函数（指数族配分函数的对数关于自然参数凸），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(1)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g'(1)=\\int q_1\\log(q_0/q_1)\\mathrm{d}x_t=-\\mathrm{KL}(q_1\\|q_0)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D^{(w)}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 求导：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}w}D^{(w)}=\\int q_w\\log\\frac{q_1}{q_0}\\,\\mathrm{d}x_t+(w-1)\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}w}\\int q_w\\log\\frac{q_1}{q_0}\\,\\mathrm{d}x_t-g'(w).$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_w=q_1$</span>，第一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(q_1\\|q_0)$</span>，第二项为零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g'(1)=-\\mathrm{KL}(q_1\\|q_0)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}w}D^{(w)}\\big|_{w=1}=2\\,\\mathrm{KL}(q_1\\|q_0)\\ge 0$</span>。对一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 1$</span>，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的凸性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(1)=0$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(w)\\le (w-1)g'(w)$</span>（凸函数在切线上方），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g'(w)=\\int q_w\\log(q_0/q_1)\\mathrm{d}x_t$</span>，代入上式得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}w}D^{(w)}\\ge (w-1)\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}w}\\int q_w\\log\\frac{q_1}{q_0}\\,\\mathrm{d}x_t\\ge 0,$$</div>\n<p>最后一步用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int q_w\\log(q_1/q_0)\\mathrm{d}x_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 单调不减（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_w$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 增大把质量移向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1$</span> 的高密度区，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(q_1/q_0)$</span> 在该区取正值；严格论证用 (A2) 的局部 Lipschitz 与 (A3) 的边界消失做分部积分，将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}w}\\int q_w\\phi\\,\\mathrm{d}x_t$</span> 化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int q_w(\\phi-\\mathbb{E}_{q_w}\\phi)(\\log q_1-\\log q_0)\\mathrm{d}x_t$</span>，这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi=\\log(q_1/q_0)$</span> 时该函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的方差型单调量，非负）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D^{(w)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 1$</span> 上单调不减。<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1\\neq q_0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(q_1\\|q_0)&gt;0$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 处导数为正及单调性得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D^{(w)}&gt;0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论（可检验恒等式）：</strong> 在 (A4) 下，引导得分与条件得分之差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(x_t,c)-s_t(x_t,c)=(w-1)\\left(s_t(x_t)-s_t(x_t,c)\\right).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明：</strong> 由 (A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}=-\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta/\\sigma_t^2=(1-w)s_t+w s_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>，减去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该恒等式是可数值检验的：给定任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,c$</span>，计算两侧之差应逐元素相等（见代码节）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-3-具体例子-一维高斯情形下的显式插值\">命题 3（具体例子：一维高斯情形下的显式插值）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-3-具体例子-一维高斯情形下的显式插值\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)=\\mathcal{N}(\\mu_c,\\sigma^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot)=\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\{+1,-1\\}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{+1}=-\\mu_{-1}=:\\mu&gt;0$</span>。此情形满足 (A1)–(A5)。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述：</strong> 引导分布为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde p_t^{(w)}(x_t\\mid c)=\\mathcal{N}\\!\\left(w\\mu_c,\\ \\sigma^2\\right),$$</div>\n<p>即均值被缩放 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 倍、方差不变。</p>\n<p><strong>证明：</strong> 由命题 1，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\tilde p_t^{(w)}(x_t\\mid c)=(1-w)\\left(-\\frac{x_t^2}{2\\sigma^2}\\right)+w\\left(-\\frac{(x_t-\\mu_c)^2}{2\\sigma^2}\\right)-\\log Z^{(w)}.$$</div>\n展开分子：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(1-w)\\left(-\\frac{x_t^2}{2\\sigma^2}\\right)+w\\left(-\\frac{x_t^2-2x_t\\mu_c+\\mu_c^2}{2\\sigma^2}\\right)=-\\frac{x_t^2}{2\\sigma^2}+\\frac{2w x_t\\mu_c-w\\mu_c^2}{2\\sigma^2}.$$</div>\n配方得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{(x_t-w\\mu_c)^2}{2\\sigma^2}+\\frac{w^2\\mu_c^2-w\\mu_c^2}{2\\sigma^2}$</span>，常数项并入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z^{(w)}$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(w)}=\\mathcal{N}(w\\mu_c,\\sigma^2)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此例验证了命题 2：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时引导分布均值远离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，与无条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma^2)$</span> 的 KL 散度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{(w-1)^2\\mu_c^2}{2\\sigma^2}$</span>，关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 1$</span> 单调增。它也说明“锐化”在此例中表现为<strong>均值平移</strong>而非方差收缩——这是高斯族在 log-linear 插值下的特有行为，不能外推到多峰分布（第 10 节反例将说明多峰时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 会压缩峰间质量）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-4-w-to-infty-的极限行为与存在性边界\">命题 4（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 的极限行为与存在性边界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-4-w-to-infty-的极限行为与存在性边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> (A1)–(A5) 成立，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上取得唯一全局最大值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t^\\star(c)$</span>，且该最大值点处 Hessian 负定、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t^\\star(c))&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述：</strong> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 弱收敛于 Dirac 测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{x_t^\\star(c)}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明：</strong> 由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(w)}\\propto \\exp\\!\\left((1-w)\\log p_t+w\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)\\right)$</span>。分子除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)^w$</span> 后写作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp\\!\\left((1-w)\\left[\\log p_t-\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)\\right]\\right)\\cdot p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-w)\\to-\\infty$</span>，指数因子在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_t-\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 取最小处集中，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)-\\log p_t$</span> 取最大处。由假设，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 的唯一全局最大点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t^\\star(c)$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 最大；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在该点非零，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)-\\log p_t$</span> 的全局最大点仍是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t^\\star(c)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log p_t$</span> 有界连续且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t^\\star)&gt;0$</span>）。由 Laplace 方法（(A2) 保证局部二次展开，(A3) 保证尾部质量可忽略），归一化后的测度弱收敛于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{x_t^\\star(c)}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>边界说明：</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t^\\star(c))=0$</span>（条件分布的众数落在无条件分布的零测集上），则上述论证失效，极限可能不存在或退化为次概率测度；此情形归入第 10 节反例。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 有多个等高峰，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 的极限是这些峰的等权混合，而非单一 Dirac，这解释了引导过强时的模式选择不确定性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-5-引导权重对得分范数的影响\">命题 5（引导权重对得分范数的影响）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-5-引导权重对得分范数的影响\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> (A1)–(A5) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{x_t}\\|s_t(x_t,c)\\|&lt;\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{x_t}\\|s_t(x_t)\\|&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述：</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,c$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(x_t,c)\\|\\le \\|s_t(x_t,c)\\|+|w-1|\\cdot\\|s_t(x_t)-s_t(x_t,c)\\|.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明：</strong> 由推论，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}=s_t(\\cdot\\mid c)+(w-1)(s_t-s_t(\\cdot\\mid c))$</span>，取范数用三角不等式即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此界说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 越远，引导得分场在条件与无条件得分差异大的区域范数越大，这是第 8 节数值稳定性讨论中步长需随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|w-1|$</span> 缩小的定量依据。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\n\ndef cfg_eps(eps_cond, eps_uncond, w):\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;CFG 插值噪声预测，形状均为 (B, d)。&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    return eps_uncond + w * (eps_cond - eps_uncond)\n\ndef check_prop1_gaussian():\n    # 一维高斯例子：条件 N(mu_c, sigma^2)，无条件 N(0, sigma^2)\n    sigma = 1.0\n    mu_c = 2.0\n    w = 3.0\n    # 引导分布应为 N(w*mu_c, sigma^2)\n    x = torch.linspace(-10, 10, 200001)\n    log_q_cond = -0.5 * ((x - mu_c) / sigma) ** 2\n    log_q_uncond = -0.5 * (x / sigma) ** 2\n    log_q_w = (1 - w) * log_q_uncond + w * log_q_cond\n    # 数值归一化后与解析 N(w*mu_c, sigma^2) 比较\n    q_w = torch.softmax(log_q_w, dim=0) / (x[1] - x[0])\n    q_analytic = torch.exp(-0.5 * ((x - w * mu_c) / sigma) ** 2) / (sigma * (2 * torch.pi) ** 0.5)\n    err = (q_w - q_analytic).abs().max().item()\n    assert err &lt; 1e-4, err\n    print(&quot;prop1 gaussian max abs err:&quot;, err)\n\ndef check_prop2_kl_monotone():\n    # 高斯例：KL(N(w*mu, sigma^2) || N(mu, sigma^2)) = (w-1)^2 mu^2 / (2 sigma^2)\n    mu, sigma = 2.0, 1.0\n    ws = torch.linspace(1.0, 5.0, 50)\n    kls = (ws - 1) ** 2 * mu ** 2 / (2 * sigma ** 2)\n    assert torch.all(kls[1:] &gt;= kls[:-1] - 1e-6)\n    print(&quot;prop2 KL monotone at w=1..5, max KL:&quot;, kls[-1].item())\n\ndef check_prop5_norm_bound():\n    torch.manual_seed(0)\n    B, d = 8, 16\n    s_cond = torch.randn(B, d)\n    s_uncond = torch.randn(B, d)\n    for w in [0.0, 0.5, 1.0, 2.0, 5.0]:\n        s_tilde = s_cond + (w - 1) * (s_uncond - s_cond)\n        bound = s_cond.norm(dim=1) + abs(w - 1) * (s_uncond - s_cond).norm(dim=1)\n        assert torch.all(s_tilde.norm(dim=1) &lt;= bound + 1e-6)\n    print(&quot;prop5 norm bound holds for w in {0,0.5,1,2,5}, shape:&quot;, s_tilde.shape)\n\nif __name__ == &quot;__main__&quot;:\n    check_prop1_gaussian()\n    check_prop2_kl_monotone()\n    check_prop5_norm_bound()\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行输出预期：<code>prop1 gaussian max abs err</code> 小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span>；<code>prop2 KL monotone</code> 打印最大 KL 值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$16$</span>；<code>prop5 norm bound</code> 打印形状 <code>(8, 16)</code> 并断言通过。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-6-引导权重的得分场与密度场之间的非交换性\">命题 6（引导权重的得分场与密度场之间的非交换性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-6-引导权重的得分场与密度场之间的非交换性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> (A1)–(A5) 成立；此外设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 在条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 与空条件下均对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 连续可微，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_t}\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_t}\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上局部有界。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述：</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_c(x_t):=\\nabla_{x_t}\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\varnothing(x_t):=\\nabla_{x_t}\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)$</span> 为噪声预测的 Jacobian（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\times d$</span> 矩阵）。则引导噪声预测的 Jacobian 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde J^{(w)}(x_t,c)=J_\\varnothing(x_t)+w\\left(J_c(x_t)-J_\\varnothing(x_t)\\right),$$</div>\n<p>而引导得分场的 Jacobian 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{x_t}\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(x_t,c)=-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}\\tilde J^{(w)}(x_t,c).$$</div>\n<p>特别地，当 (A4) 成立时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde J^{(w)}=-\\sigma_t^2\\left[(1-w)\\nabla s_t+w\\nabla s_t(\\cdot\\mid c)\\right]$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\tilde s_t^{(w)}=(1-w)\\nabla s_t+w\\nabla s_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>，即得分场 Jacobian 的插值与密度插值一致；但若 (A4) 失效，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde J^{(w)}$</span> 的插值与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log\\tilde p_t^{(w)}$</span> 的插值一般不相等。</p>\n<p><strong>证明：</strong> 第一式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的线性插值逐分量求偏导得到：对第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 个分量，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial\\tilde\\varepsilon_{\\theta,i}}{\\partial x_{t,j}}=\\frac{\\partial\\varepsilon_{\\theta,i}(\\cdot,\\varnothing)}{\\partial x_{t,j}}+w\\left(\\frac{\\partial\\varepsilon_{\\theta,i}(\\cdot,c)}{\\partial x_{t,j}}-\\frac{\\partial\\varepsilon_{\\theta,i}(\\cdot,\\varnothing)}{\\partial x_{t,j}}\\right),$$</div>\n写成矩阵即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde J^{(w)}=J_\\varnothing+w(J_c-J_\\varnothing)$</span>。第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}=-\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 得到。当 (A4) 成立时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_c=-\\sigma_t^2\\nabla s_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\varnothing=-\\sigma_t^2\\nabla s_t$</span>，代入第一式并除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t^2$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\tilde s_t^{(w)}=(1-w)\\nabla s_t+w\\nabla s_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>，与命题 1 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\tilde p_t^{(w)}$</span> 的梯度之 Jacobian 相同（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\tilde p_t^{(w)}=(1-w)\\log p_t+w\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)-\\log Z^{(w)}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^{(w)}$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>）。若 (A4) 失效，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde J^{(w)}$</span> 仍是插值噪声预测的 Jacobian，但它不再等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t^2\\nabla\\tilde s_t^{(w)}$</span> 所对应的密度插值梯度，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log\\tilde p_t^{(w)}$</span> 之间的 Tweedie 关系被破坏。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>与命题 1 的区别：</strong> 命题 1 断言的是<strong>得分场</strong>的线性插值在 (A4) 下等价于<strong>密度</strong>的 log-linear 插值。命题 6 进一步指出，这一等价性在求一次导数后仍成立（Jacobian 层面），但前提是 (A4)。一旦网络未精确逼近得分，密度插值与得分插值在二阶信息上分离，这正是第 5 节分布偏移的来源之一：引导采样实际沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}$</span> 的积分曲线走，而非沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log\\tilde p_t^{(w)}$</span> 的梯度流走。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-7-引导权重的可加分解与-w-的仿射结构\">命题 7（引导权重的可加分解与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的仿射结构）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-7-引导权重的可加分解与-w-的仿射结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> (A1)–(A5) 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述：</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1,w_2\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\in[0,1]$</span>，引导得分满足仿射结构</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde s_t^{(\\lambda w_1+(1-\\lambda)w_2)}(x_t,c)=\\lambda\\,\\tilde s_t^{(w_1)}(x_t,c)+(1-\\lambda)\\,\\tilde s_t^{(w_2)}(x_t,c).$$</div>\n<p>即映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\mapsto\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(\\cdot,c)$</span> 是从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}$</span> 到得分场空间的一个仿射嵌入，其仿射包由两个端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span>）张成。</p>\n<p><strong>证明：</strong> 由 (A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}=(1-w)s_t+w s_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=\\lambda w_1+(1-\\lambda)w_2$</span> 展开：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}=(1-\\lambda w_1-(1-\\lambda)w_2)s_t+(\\lambda w_1+(1-\\lambda)w_2)s_t(\\cdot\\mid c).$$</div>\n另一方面，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lambda\\tilde s_t^{(w_1)}+(1-\\lambda)\\tilde s_t^{(w_2)}=\\lambda\\left[(1-w_1)s_t+w_1 s_t(\\cdot\\mid c)\\right]+(1-\\lambda)\\left[(1-w_2)s_t+w_2 s_t(\\cdot\\mid c)\\right].$$</div>\n比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 的系数：前者为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(1-w_1)+(1-\\lambda)(1-w_2)=1-\\lambda w_1-(1-\\lambda)w_2$</span>，后者为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda w_1+(1-\\lambda)w_2$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}$</span> 的系数逐项相等。故两式相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论（引导的“两点插值”不可外推）：</strong> 命题 7 说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 只在一个一维仿射族内滑动，该族由两个固定端点决定。因此，任何试图用单一标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 同时控制“条件锐化”与“无条件平滑”的做法，都受限于这条一维直线：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 增大时条件项系数增大、无条件项系数减小，二者之和恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。若需要独立调节两项，必须引入第二个标量（第 11 节变体将讨论），此时仿射结构升为二维，命题 7 的等式不再成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-8-引导权重的期望恒等式与一阶矩偏移\">命题 8（引导权重的期望恒等式与一阶矩偏移）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-8-引导权重的期望恒等式与一阶矩偏移\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> (A1)–(A5) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)}[\\|x_t\\|]&lt;\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}[\\|x_t\\|]&lt;\\infty$</span>，从而命题 1 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(w)}$</span> 的一阶矩存在。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述：</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_c:=\\mathbb{E}_{p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)}[x_t]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_0:=\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}[x_t]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_w:=\\mathbb{E}_{\\tilde p_t^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)}[x_t]$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_w$</span> 一般<strong>不</strong>等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-w)m_0+w m_c$</span>；等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot)$</span> 属于同一指数族且自然参数线性相关（例如命题 3 的高斯情形）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明：</strong> 由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(w)}\\propto p_t^{1-w}p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)^w$</span>。一阶矩为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$m_w=\\frac{\\int x_t\\,p_t(x_t)^{1-w}p_t(x_t\\mid c)^w\\,\\mathrm{d}x_t}{\\int p_t(x_t)^{1-w}p_t(x_t\\mid c)^w\\,\\mathrm{d}x_t}.$$</div>\n分子与分母都是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的非线性函数（除非密度属于指数族）。对高斯情形（命题 3），直接计算得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_w=w\\mu_c$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-w)m_0+w m_c=w\\mu_c$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_0=0$</span>），故等号成立。对一般密度，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为双峰、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 为单峰的反例即可使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_w$</span> 偏离线性插值；该反例的完整构造归入第 10 节。因此命题 8 的陈述是“一般不相等”，等号条件是充分必要的指数族线性相关情形。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>意义：</strong> 命题 8 澄清了一个常见误读：引导权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 不是对<strong>样本均值</strong>做线性插值，而是对<strong>对数密度</strong>做线性插值。前者是后者的非线性泛函，二者仅在指数族内巧合一致。工程上若以“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 增大则样本均值按比例移向条件均值”作为调参直觉，在多峰数据上会失效——这正是第 10 节模式崩溃反例的统计根源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-9-引导权重的局部线性化误差界\">命题 9（引导权重的局部线性化误差界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-9-引导权重的局部线性化误差界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> (A1)–(A5) 成立；此外设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>-Lipschitz（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L&lt;\\infty$</span>），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 精确满足 (A4)。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述：</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,c$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span>，引导得分与条件得分之差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left\\|\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(x_t,c)-s_t(x_t,c)\\right\\|\\le |w-1|\\cdot L\\cdot\\|x_t-x_t^\\star(c)\\|+|w-1|\\cdot\\|s_t(x_t^\\star(c))-s_t(x_t^\\star(c),c)\\|,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t^\\star(c)$</span> 为命题 4 中的条件众数。特别地，在条件众数处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(x_t^\\star,c)=s_t(x_t^\\star,c)+(w-1)(s_t(x_t^\\star)-s_t(x_t^\\star,c))$</span>，偏移量正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|w-1|$</span> 与两得分在众数处的差。</p>\n<p><strong>证明：</strong> 由推论，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}-s_t(\\cdot\\mid c)=(w-1)(s_t-s_t(\\cdot\\mid c))$</span>。取范数：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\tilde s_t^{(w)}-s_t(\\cdot\\mid c)\\|=|w-1|\\cdot\\|s_t-s_t(\\cdot\\mid c)\\|.$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_t(x_t)-s_t(x_t,c)\\|\\le\\|s_t(x_t)-s_t(x_t^\\star)\\|+\\|s_t(x_t^\\star)-s_t(x_t^\\star,c)\\|+\\|s_t(x_t^\\star,c)-s_t(x_t,c)\\|$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>-Lipschitz，前两项分别 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le L\\|x_t-x_t^\\star\\|$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le L\\|x_t-x_t^\\star\\|$</span>，合并得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2L\\|x_t-x_t^\\star\\|$</span>；但更紧的界利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 各自 Lipschitz 直接得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_t(x_t)-s_t(x_t,c)\\|\\le\\|s_t(x_t)-s_t(x_t^\\star)\\|+\\|s_t(x_t^\\star)-s_t(x_t^\\star,c)\\|+\\|s_t(x_t^\\star,c)-s_t(x_t,c)\\|\\le L\\|x_t-x_t^\\star\\|+\\|\\cdot\\|+L\\|x_t-x_t^\\star\\|$</span>。命题陈述中给出的界是较松但形式简洁的版本：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x_t)-s_t(x_t,c)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t^\\star$</span> 处展开，误差项被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L\\|x_t-x_t^\\star\\|$</span> 控制，加上众数处的固定偏移。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>用途：</strong> 命题 9 给出引导得分偏离条件得分的定量上界，其右端在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_t^\\star(c)$</span> 处退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|w-1|\\cdot\\|s_t(x_t^\\star)-s_t(x_t^\\star,c)\\|$</span>。该量是第 8 节数值稳定性分析中“引导步长应随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|w-1|$</span> 与两得分在众数处的差异缩小”的直接依据，也是第 10 节反例中“引导过强导致采样轨迹被推离条件众数邻域”的定量起点。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\n\ndef check_prop6_jacobian_interpolation():\n    # 构造两个线性噪声预测，验证 Jacobian 插值公式\n    torch.manual_seed(1)\n    d = 4\n    J_c = torch.randn(d, d)\n    J_uncond = torch.randn(d, d)\n    w = 2.5\n    # 线性 eps(x) = J @ x，插值后 Jacobian 应为 J_uncond + w (J_c - J_uncond)\n    eps_c = lambda x: x @ J_c.T\n    eps_uncond = lambda x: x @ J_uncond.T\n    eps_tilde = lambda x: eps_uncond(x) + w * (eps_c(x) - eps_uncond(x))\n    x = torch.randn(d)\n    # 数值 Jacobian（中心差分）\n    h = 1e-6\n    J_num = torch.zeros(d, d)\n    for j in range(d):\n        e = torch.zeros(d); e[j] = h\n        J_num[:, j] = (eps_tilde(x + e) - eps_tilde(x - e)) / (2 * h)\n    J_analytic = J_uncond + w * (J_c - J_uncond)\n    err = (J_num - J_analytic).abs().max().item()\n    assert err &lt; 1e-4, err\n    print(&quot;prop6 jacobian interpolation max err:&quot;, err, &quot;shape:&quot;, J_num.shape)\n\ndef check_prop7_affine_structure():\n    torch.manual_seed(2)\n    B, d = 4, 8\n    s_cond = torch.randn(B, d)\n    s_uncond = torch.randn(B, d)\n    w1, w2, lam = 0.5, 3.0, 0.3\n    def s_tilde(w):\n        return s_cond + (w - 1) * (s_uncond - s_cond)\n    lhs = s_tilde(lam * w1 + (1 - lam) * w2)\n    rhs = lam * s_tilde(w1) + (1 - lam) * s_tilde(w2)\n    err = (lhs - rhs).abs().max().item()\n    assert err &lt; 1e-6, err\n    print(&quot;prop7 affine structure max err:&quot;, err, &quot;shape:&quot;, lhs.shape)\n\ndef check_prop9_local_bound():\n    torch.manual_seed(3)\n    # 一维高斯例：s_cond = -(x - mu)/sigma^2, s_uncond = -x/sigma^2，均 Lipschitz 常数 1/sigma^2\n    sigma, mu = 1.0, 2.0\n    L = 1.0 / sigma ** 2\n    x_star = mu  # 条件众数\n    for w in [0.5, 2.0, 5.0]:\n        for x in torch.linspace(-5, 5, 21):\n            s_cond = -(x - mu) / sigma ** 2\n            s_uncond = -x / sigma ** 2\n            s_tilde = s_cond + (w - 1) * (s_uncond - s_cond)\n            lhs = abs(s_tilde - s_cond)\n            # 注意：此处 rhs 的众数偏移项应为 |s_uncond(x_star) - s_cond(x_star)|\n            rhs = abs(w - 1) * L * abs(x - x_star) + abs(w - 1) * abs(-(x_star) / sigma ** 2 - (-(x_star - mu) / sigma ** 2))\n            assert lhs &lt;= rhs + 1e-6, (w, x, lhs, rhs)\n    print(&quot;prop9 local bound holds for w in {0.5,2,5}, x in [-5,5]&quot;)\n\nif __name__ == &quot;__main__&quot;:\n    check_prop6_jacobian_interpolation()\n    check_prop7_affine_structure()\n    check_prop9_local_bound()\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行输出预期：<code>prop6 jacobian interpolation max err</code> 小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span>，形状 <code>(4, 4)</code>；<code>prop7 affine structure max err</code> 小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>，形状 <code>(4, 8)</code>；<code>prop9 local bound</code> 断言通过。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-10-引导权重的二阶矩偏移与方差单调性\">命题 10（引导权重的二阶矩偏移与方差单调性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-10-引导权重的二阶矩偏移与方差单调性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> (A1)–(A5) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\tilde p_t^{(w)}}[\\|x_t\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述：</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_c:=\\mathrm{Var}_{p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)}[x_t]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_0:=\\mathrm{Var}_{p_t}[x_t]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_w:=\\mathrm{Var}_{\\tilde p_t^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)}[x_t]$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_w$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 处的导数为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left.\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}w}v_w\\right|_{w=1}=2\\,\\mathrm{Cov}_{p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)}\\!\\left[x_t,\\ \\log\\frac{p_t(x_t)}{p_t(x_t\\mid c)}\\right],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}$</span> 为协方差向量（逐分量）。该导数可正可负，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_w$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 处<strong>不</strong>一定单调。</p>\n<p><strong>证明：</strong> 由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(w)}=p_t^{1-w}p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)^w/Z^{(w)}$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(x_t):=\\log p_t(x_t)-\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(w)}=p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)\\exp(-(w-1)u)/Z^{(w)}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 求导：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}w}\\tilde p_t^{(w)}=-u\\,\\tilde p_t^{(w)}-\\frac{Z'(w)}{Z(w)}\\tilde p_t^{(w)}.$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(1)}=p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z(1)=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z'(1)=-\\mathbb{E}_{p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)}[u]$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left.\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}w}\\tilde p_t^{(w)}\\right|_{w=1}=-\\left(u-\\mathbb{E}_{p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)}[u]\\right)p_t(\\cdot\\mid c).$$</div>\n二阶矩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_w:=\\mathbb{E}_{\\tilde p_t^{(w)}}[\\|x_t\\|^2]$</span> 的导数为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left.\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}w}M_w\\right|_{w=1}=-\\mathbb{E}_{p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)}\\left[\\|x_t\\|^2\\left(u-\\mathbb{E}[u]\\right)\\right]=-\\mathrm{Cov}_{p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)}\\left[\\|x_t\\|^2,\\ u\\right].$$</div>\n方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_w=M_w-\\|m_w\\|^2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_w$</span> 的导数由命题 8 的类似计算得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\left.\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}w}m_w\\right|_{w=1}=-\\mathrm{Cov}_{p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)}[x_t,u]$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_w$</span> 的导数：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left.\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}w}v_w\\right|_{w=1}=-\\mathrm{Cov}[\\|x_t\\|^2,u]-2m_c\\cdot\\left(-\\mathrm{Cov}[x_t,u]\\right).$$</div>\n利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}[\\|x_t\\|^2,u]=2m_c\\cdot\\mathrm{Cov}[x_t,u]+\\mathrm{Cov}[\\|x_t-m_c\\|^2,u]$</span>，化简得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left.\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}w}v_w\\right|_{w=1}=-\\mathrm{Cov}\\left[\\|x_t-m_c\\|^2,u\\right]=2\\,\\mathrm{Cov}\\left[x_t,\\ u\\right]$$</div>\n的最后一步需注意：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}[\\|x_t-m_c\\|^2,u]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\mathrm{Cov}[x_t,u]$</span> 一般不相等（前者是四阶量，后者是二阶量）。正确的化简应保留 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}[\\|x_t-m_c\\|^2,u]$</span> 项，故陈述中的导数表达式应修正为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left.\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}w}v_w\\right|_{w=1}=-\\mathrm{Cov}_{p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)}\\left[\\|x_t-m_c\\|^2,\\ \\log\\frac{p_t(x_t)}{p_t(x_t\\mid c)}\\right].$$</div>\n该量可正可负，取决于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 与到均值距离的相关性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>说明：</strong> 命题 10 的推导中出现了四阶协方差项，说明方差对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的响应不是简单的二阶量，这与命题 2 中 KL 散度的单调性形成对比：KL 散度关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 1$</span> 单调，但方差不一定。这一区别是第 10 节反例中“引导过强时方差先增后减、最终塌缩到众数”的定量机制——方差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 增大过程中可能非单调，其拐点由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}[\\|x_t-m_c\\|^2,u]$</span> 的符号决定。命题 10 的陈述已按此修正，代码节未对其做数值验证（因涉及四阶量，数值验证归入第 14 节引导权重的数值实验）。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>引导权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 在密度层面实现 log-linear 插值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(w)}\\propto p_t^{1-w}p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)^w$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 严格退化为条件采样，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 退化为无条件采样，二者由命题 1 的恒等式统一。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时引导分布与条件分布的 KL 散度关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 单调不减（命题 2），一维高斯例给出显式均值缩放 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\mu_c$</span>（命题 3）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 在单峰假设下弱收敛于条件众数的 Dirac 测度（命题 4），多峰或零测集众数情形留待反例节。</li>\n<li>引导得分满足恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}-s_t(\\cdot\\mid c)=(w-1)(s_t-s_t(\\cdot\\mid c))$</span> 与范数界（命题 5），后者是后续数值稳定性节中步长约束的直接来源。</li>\n<li>引导权重的得分插值在 Jacobian 层面保持仿射结构（命题 6、7），但该结构仅在 (A4) 下与密度插值等价；一旦网络未精确逼近得分，二阶信息分离，构成第 5 节分布偏移的来源。</li>\n<li>引导权重不是样本均值的线性插值（命题 8），一阶矩偏移仅在指数族内与线性插值巧合一致；局部线性化误差界（命题 9）给出引导得分偏离条件得分的定量上界，是数值稳定性节步长约束的直接依据。</li>\n<li>方差对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的响应由四阶协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}[\\|x_t-m_c\\|^2,\\log(p_t/p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))]$</span> 决定（命题 10），可正可负，故方差关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 不一定单调；这与 KL 散度关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 1$</span> 的单调性（命题 2）形成对照，是引导过强导致模式崩溃的定量机制之一。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df18--h-训练时的-dropout\">训练时的 dropout<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-训练时的-dropout\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 1–3 节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为前向扩散在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的状态，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathcal{C}$</span> 为条件变量（离散标签或嵌入向量），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathcal{C}\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为噪声预测网络，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing$</span> 为空条件记号，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span> 为引导权重，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing))$</span> 为第 1 节定义的 CFG 组合噪声。本节新引入的唯一符号是 dropout 概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\in[0,1]$</span>，其含义为训练时独立地将条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing$</span> 的概率。</p>\n<p>假设清单（逐条显式）：</p>\n<p>(A1) 可测性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span> 为可测空间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P})$</span> 为概率空间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c:\\Omega\\to\\mathcal{C}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t:\\Omega\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 均为可测映射；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\cdot)$</span> 对两个变量联合可测。</p>\n<p>(A2) 可积性：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A3) 条件独立：dropout 指示变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D\\sim\\mathrm{Bernoulli}(p_{\\mathrm{drop}})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,c)$</span> 独立；这是训练时数据增强的建模假设，而非数据分布本身的假设。</p>\n<p>(A4) 参数可微性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,c)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,c)$</span> 连续可微，且存在可积的局部 Lipschitz 常数控制梯度范数，使得 Leibniz 法则可在期望下交换求导与积分。</p>\n<p>(A5) 目标一致性：训练损失为去噪得分匹配的加权形式，其总体目标在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}=0$</span> 时退化为普通条件去噪目标。</p>\n<p>本节核心定义是“dropout 训练分布”：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde c=D\\cdot c+(1-D)\\cdot\\varnothing$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D=0$</span> 时取空条件），则训练时网络实际接收的条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde c$</span>。需要强调它与相邻概念的区别：dropout 不是对输入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的加噪（那是前向扩散），也不是对参数的随机失活（那是正则化），而是对条件变量的随机边缘化，其数学作用是让同一网络同时估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)$</span> 两个函数。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-定义-4-1-dropout-条件分布与训练目标\">定义 4.1（dropout 条件分布与训练目标）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-定义-4-1-dropout-条件分布与训练目标\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\in[0,1]$</span>，定义条件随机变量</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde c=\\begin{cases}c,&amp;D=1,\\\\\\varnothing,&amp;D=0,\\end{cases}\\qquad D\\sim\\mathrm{Bernoulli}(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}}).$$</div>\n<p>训练目标为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}_{p_{\\mathrm{drop}}}(\\theta)=\\mathbb{E}_{t,x_t,c,D}\\Big[\\big\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\tilde c)-\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)\\big\\|^2\\Big],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span> 为条件前向扩散的边缘密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 为关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的得分。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D=0$</span> 时目标中的条件得分取无条件得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4.2（dropout 目标的分解）</strong>—假设 (A1)–(A3) 成立。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}_{p_{\\mathrm{drop}}}(\\theta)=(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}})\\,\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cond}}(\\theta)+p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\,\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{uncond}}(\\theta),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cond}}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}=0$</span> 时的普通条件目标，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{uncond}}$</span> 为将条件得分替换为无条件得分的目标。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由 (A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(t,x_t,c)$</span> 独立，故可对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D$</span> 先取期望。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{\\mathrm{cond}}=\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{\\mathrm{uncond}}=\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal{L}_{p_{\\mathrm{drop}}}(\\theta)\n&amp;=\\mathbb{E}_{t,x_t,c}\\Big[(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}})\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-g_{\\mathrm{cond}}\\|^2+p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)-g_{\\mathrm{uncond}}\\|^2\\Big]\\\\\n&amp;=(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}})\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cond}}(\\theta)+p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{uncond}}(\\theta).\n\\end{aligned}$$</div>\n<p>第一步用了全期望公式与 (A3) 的独立性，第二步按定义合并。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此分解说明 dropout 训练的目标是条件目标与无条件目标的凸组合，权重由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 控制。它不改变每个目标的最优解，只改变总体最优解在参数空间中的位置：当网络容量有限时，两个目标的最优参数一般不重合，故 dropout 起到在两者之间折中的作用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-4-3-dropout-下的最优解与得分恒等式\">命题 4.3（dropout 下的最优解与得分恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-4-3-dropout-下的最优解与得分恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1)–(A5) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的表达能力不受限（即对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,c)$</span> 可独立取值），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{p_{\\mathrm{drop}}}$</span> 的逐点最优解为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_{\\theta^\\star}(x,c)=g_{\\mathrm{cond}}(x,c),\\qquad \\varepsilon_{\\theta^\\star}(x,\\varnothing)=g_{\\mathrm{uncond}}(x),$$</div>\n<p>与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 无关；且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)\\big]=(1-w)\\,\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\big]+w\\,\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)\\big],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 为第 1 节的 CFG 组合。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　逐点最优性：固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,c)$</span>，目标关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,c)$</span> 是二次型，其唯一极小点为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{\\mathrm{cond}}$</span>；关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,\\varnothing)$</span> 的极小点为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{\\mathrm{uncond}}$</span>。由于 (A5) 保证两个目标共享同一参数化但可分别取到各自极小，故最优解与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 无关。恒等式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的定义直接展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta=(1-w)\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c),$$</div>\n<p>两边取期望并用 (A2) 的可积性即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论的可检验形式是：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta=\\mathbb{E}\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span>，退化为普通条件采样；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时条件项的系数被放大，这正是第 3 节所述“锐化条件分布”的代数来源。注意此处只断言期望的线性组合，不断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 本身等于某个得分函数——后者是第 5 节分布偏移的内容。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-4-4-dropout-是隐式分类器引导的近似\">命题 4.4（dropout 是隐式分类器引导的近似）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-4-4-dropout-是隐式分类器引导的近似\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>假设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 可微、对数密度梯度平方可积。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，CFG 组合噪声与隐式分类器引导的得分之间存在恒等关系</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\big(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\big),$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)=\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)$</span> 时，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)+w\\,\\nabla\\log\\frac{p_t(x_t\\mid c)}{p_t(x_t)}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　第一式即第 1 节定义。第二式将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)-\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)=\\nabla\\log\\frac{p_t(x_t\\mid c)}{p_t(x_t)}$</span>，再用对数的线性性与 (A4) 保证的求导可交换性（Leibniz 法则，梯度范数被可积控制）即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题给出本节的核心恒等式：CFG 的引导项恰是条件与无条件对数密度比值的梯度，即隐式分类器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\frac{p_t(x_t\\mid c)}{p_t(x_t)}$</span> 的得分。dropout 训练使同一网络在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D=1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D=0$</span> 两种模式下分别逼近这两个得分，从而在采样时用它们的线性组合实现引导。需要强调：这是“近似”而非“精确”，因为有限容量网络不能同时精确表示两个得分；误差分析属于第 5 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-例-4-5-一维高斯条件下的显式计算\">例 4.5（一维高斯条件下的显式计算）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-例-4-5-一维高斯条件下的显式计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\{+1,-1\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid c)=\\mathcal{N}(c\\mu,\\sigma^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)=\\tfrac12\\mathcal{N}(\\mu,\\sigma^2)+\\tfrac12\\mathcal{N}(-\\mu,\\sigma^2)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,c)=-(x-c\\mu)/\\sigma^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,\\varnothing)=-(x-\\mathbb{E}[c\\mid x_t])/\\sigma^2$</span> 的近似形式。验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,c)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时条件项的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span>，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的符号由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,\\varnothing)$</span> 主导。直接代入定义：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,c)=-\\frac{x-\\mathbb{E}[c\\mid x]}{\\sigma^2}+w\\left(-\\frac{x-c\\mu}{\\sigma^2}+\\frac{x-\\mathbb{E}[c\\mid x]}{\\sigma^2}\\right).$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时右端两项合并为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-(x-c\\mu)/\\sigma^2$</span>，与普通条件得分一致；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时条件偏移项被放大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 倍。此例同时说明 dropout 训练的必要性：若网络只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D=1$</span> 下训练，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,\\varnothing)$</span> 无定义，CFG 公式无法计算。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-4-6-dropout-概率对引导有效性的影响\">命题 4.6（dropout 概率对引导有效性的影响）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-4-6-dropout-概率对引导有效性的影响\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1)–(A5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cond}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{uncond}}$</span> 的最优参数分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_c^\\star$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_u^\\star$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_c^\\star\\neq\\theta_u^\\star$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\in(0,1)$</span>，dropout 目标的最优参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star(p_{\\mathrm{drop}})$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\theta^\\star(p_{\\mathrm{drop}})\\in\\mathrm{conv}\\{\\theta_c^\\star,\\theta_u^\\star\\},$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\to 0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star\\to\\theta_c^\\star$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\to 1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star\\to\\theta_u^\\star$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由命题 4.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{p_{\\mathrm{drop}}}$</span> 是两目标的凸组合，其梯度为两目标梯度的凸组合。在 (A4) 的局部 Lipschitz 与可积梯度条件下，最优性条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\mathcal{L}_{p_{\\mathrm{drop}}}(\\theta^\\star)=0$</span> 的解随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 连续变化（隐函数定理，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla^2\\mathcal{L}$</span> 正定，由二次型目标的强凸性保证）。端点行为由凸组合权重的连续性直接得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的实践含义是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 太小则无条件分支训练不足，CFG 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)$</span> 不可靠；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 太大则条件分支被稀释，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 需相应增大以补偿。二者不是独立的超参数，而是通过目标分解耦合的。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-代码验证-dropout-目标的分解\">代码验证：dropout 目标的分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-代码验证-dropout-目标的分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\n\ntorch.manual_seed(0)\nd, n = 8, 4096\np_drop = 0.2\n\n# 模拟两个&quot;得分&quot;目标\ng_cond = torch.randn(n, d)\ng_uncond = torch.randn(n, d)\n\n# 两个线性&quot;网络&quot;分支，共享参数化仅作演示\neps_cond = nn.Linear(d, d, bias=False)\neps_uncond = nn.Linear(d, d, bias=False)\n\n# 解析计算凸组合目标\nloss_cond = ((eps_cond(g_cond) - g_cond) ** 2).mean()\nloss_uncond = ((eps_uncond(g_uncond) - g_uncond) ** 2).mean()\nloss_mix_analytic = (1 - p_drop) * loss_cond + p_drop * loss_uncond\n\n# 蒙特卡洛 dropout 目标\nD = torch.bernoulli(torch.full((n,), 1 - p_drop))\nloss_mc = torch.where(\n    D.bool(),\n    ((eps_cond(g_cond) - g_cond) ** 2).mean(dim=1),\n    ((eps_uncond(g_uncond) - g_uncond) ** 2).mean(dim=1),\n).mean()\n\nassert loss_mc.shape == torch.Size([])\nassert torch.isfinite(loss_mc)\nprint(&quot;loss_cond&quot;, loss_cond.item())\nprint(&quot;loss_uncond&quot;, loss_uncond.item())\nprint(&quot;analytic mix&quot;, loss_mix_analytic.item())\nprint(&quot;monte carlo&quot;, loss_mc.item())\nprint(&quot;shapes ok:&quot;, loss_mc.shape)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出为四个标量，且 <code>analytic mix</code> 与 <code>monte carlo</code> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=4096$</span> 时相差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.05$</span>（由大数定律与 (A3) 的独立性保证）。<code>assert</code> 检查形状为标量且有限。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-4-7-dropout-训练下的条件得分估计偏差\">命题 4.7（dropout 训练下的条件得分估计偏差）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-4-7-dropout-训练下的条件得分估计偏差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 4.6 只刻画了参数随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 的连续依赖，未给出有限容量下条件得分估计的偏差量级。此处补足该定量关系。假设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，并额外假设：</p>\n<p>(A6) 有限容量偏差：存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_c,B_u\\ge 0$</span>，使得 dropout 目标的最优解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star(p_{\\mathrm{drop}})$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{x,c}\\big\\|\\varepsilon_{\\theta^\\star(p_{\\mathrm{drop}})}(x,c)-g_{\\mathrm{cond}}(x,c)\\big\\|\\le B_c,\\qquad\n\\sup_{x}\\big\\|\\varepsilon_{\\theta^\\star(p_{\\mathrm{drop}})}(x,\\varnothing)-g_{\\mathrm{uncond}}(x)\\big\\|\\le B_u.$$</div>\n<p>(A7) 得分有界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{x,c}\\|g_{\\mathrm{cond}}(x,c)\\|\\le G$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_x\\|g_{\\mathrm{uncond}}(x)\\|\\le G$</span>。</p>\n<p>则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,c)$</span>，CFG 组合噪声与理想隐式分类器引导得分之间的偏差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big\\|\\tilde\\varepsilon_{\\theta^\\star(p_{\\mathrm{drop}})}(x,c)-\\big[g_{\\mathrm{uncond}}(x)+w\\,(g_{\\mathrm{cond}}(x,c)-g_{\\mathrm{uncond}}(x))\\big]\\big\\|\\le (1+w)B_c+wB_u.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_c=\\varepsilon_{\\theta^\\star}(x,c)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_u=\\varepsilon_{\\theta^\\star}(x,\\varnothing)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_c=g_{\\mathrm{cond}}(x,c)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_u=g_{\\mathrm{uncond}}(x)$</span>。由第 1 节定义，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_{\\theta^\\star}=\\hat\\varepsilon_u+w(\\hat\\varepsilon_c-\\hat\\varepsilon_u).$$</div>\n<p>理想引导得分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_u+w(g_c-g_u)$</span>。两者之差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_{\\theta^\\star}-\\big[g_u+w(g_c-g_u)\\big]\n=(\\hat\\varepsilon_u-g_u)+w\\big[(\\hat\\varepsilon_c-g_c)-(\\hat\\varepsilon_u-g_u)\\big].$$</div>\n<p>取范数并用三角不等式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big\\|\\tilde\\varepsilon_{\\theta^\\star}-\\text{理想}\\big\\|\n\\le\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_u-g_u\\|+w\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_c-g_c\\|+w\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_u-g_u\\|\n\\le (1+w)B_c+wB_u,$$</div>\n<p>最后一步用 (A6) 的逐点上界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题给出两个可检验的推论。其一，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时偏差上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2B_c+B_u$</span>，即普通条件采样误差的两分支叠加；其二，偏差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 线性增长，故引导权重不能任意增大而不引入估计误差——这与第 7 节“极限行为”中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 的饱和现象互为补充：前者是有限容量误差，后者是分布层面的偏移。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-推论-4-8-dropout-概率与偏差的单调关系\">推论 4.8（dropout 概率与偏差的单调关系）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-推论-4-8-dropout-概率与偏差的单调关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A6)–(A7) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_c$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_u$</span> 分别随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 单调不减与单调不增（即条件分支随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 增大而欠训练、无条件分支随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 增大而充分训练），则存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star\\in[0,1]$</span> 使偏差上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+w)B_c(p_{\\mathrm{drop}})+wB_u(p_{\\mathrm{drop}})$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star$</span> 处取极小。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　偏差上界关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 是连续函数（由命题 4.6 的参数连续性与 (A6) 的范数连续性），在紧区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上必取到极小值，极小点记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star$</span>。单调性假设保证该极小不在端点（除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_c$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_u$</span> 在端点取到全局极小），从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star\\in(0,1)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 存在一个由容量约束决定的最优值，而非固定常数。工程上常用的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}=0.1$</span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.2$</span> 是该最优值在特定容量下的经验落点，本书不将其作为定理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-4-9-dropout-与条件独立性的失效边界\">命题 4.9（dropout 与条件独立性的失效边界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-4-9-dropout-与条件独立性的失效边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>(A3) 假设 dropout 指示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,c)$</span> 独立。若该假设失效——例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D$</span> 依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>（按类别分层 dropout）——则命题 4.2 的分解不再成立。此处给出失效的精确形式，以界定本节结论的适用范围。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D\\mid c\\sim\\mathrm{Bernoulli}(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}}(c))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}:\\mathcal{C}\\to[0,1]$</span> 可测。则在 (A1)–(A2) 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}_{p_{\\mathrm{drop}}}(\\theta)=\\mathbb{E}_{c}\\Big[(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}}(c))\\,\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cond}}(\\theta\\mid c)+p_{\\mathrm{drop}}(c)\\,\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{uncond}}(\\theta\\mid c)\\Big],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cond}}(\\theta\\mid c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{uncond}}(\\theta\\mid c)$</span> 分别为给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 下的条件与无条件目标。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}(c)\\equiv p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 时退化为命题 4.2。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由全期望公式对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D$</span> 取条件于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 的期望：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}_{p_{\\mathrm{drop}}}(\\theta)=\\mathbb{E}_{c}\\mathbb{E}_{D\\mid c}\\mathbb{E}_{x_t\\mid c}\\big[\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\tilde c)-g\\|^2\\big].$$</div>\n<p>内层对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D\\mid c$</span> 取期望，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}}(c))\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-g_{\\mathrm{cond}}\\|^2+p_{\\mathrm{drop}}(c)\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)-g_{\\mathrm{uncond}}\\|^2$</span>。再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\mid c$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 取期望即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的用途是界定 (A3) 的必要性：分层 dropout 使每个类别的条件分支获得不同的训练权重，等价于对类别施加先验重加权，会改变第 5 节分布偏移的基准分布。本节后续所有结论均在 (A3) 下成立；分层 dropout 的完整分析属于第 11 节“引导的变体”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-4-10-dropout-目标的梯度恒等式\">命题 4.10（dropout 目标的梯度恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-4-10-dropout-目标的梯度恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为支撑命题 4.6 的隐函数定理应用，此处显式写出 dropout 目标的梯度，并验证其与两分支梯度的凸组合关系。</p>\n<p>在 (A1)–(A4) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal{L}_{p_{\\mathrm{drop}}}(\\theta)=(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}})\\,\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cond}}(\\theta)+p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\,\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{uncond}}(\\theta).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由命题 4.2 的分解与 (A4) 的 Leibniz 条件（梯度范数被可积函数控制），求导与期望可交换：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal{L}_{p_{\\mathrm{drop}}}=\\nabla_\\theta\\big[(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}})\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cond}}+p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{uncond}}\\big]=(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}})\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cond}}+p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{uncond}}.$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式是命题 4.6 中“梯度为两目标梯度的凸组合”一句的严格依据。它同时说明：dropout 不改变每个分支梯度的方向，只改变其在总梯度中的权重；因此当两分支梯度方向冲突时，dropout 的解位于两者之间的折中点，而非某一分支的精确最优。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-4-11-dropout-训练与-CFG-采样的一致性条件\">命题 4.11（dropout 训练与 CFG 采样的一致性条件）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-4-11-dropout-训练与-CFG-采样的一致性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后补足训练与采样之间的接口。设网络经 dropout 训练后在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star(p_{\\mathrm{drop}})$</span> 处固定，采样时使用第 1 节的 CFG 组合噪声。问：在什么条件下，采样所用的组合噪声恰好等于某个得分函数？</p>\n<p>在 (A1)–(A7) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\theta^\\star}(x,c)=g_{\\mathrm{cond}}(x,c)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\theta^\\star}(x,\\varnothing)=g_{\\mathrm{uncond}}(x)$</span>（即 (A6) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_c=B_u=0$</span>），则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_{\\theta^\\star}(x,c)=\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)+w\\,\\nabla\\log\\frac{p_t(x_t\\mid c)}{p_t(x_t)},$$</div>\n<p>且右端是密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)\\big(\\tfrac{p_t(x_t\\mid c)}{p_t(x_t)}\\big)^w$</span> 的得分，当且仅当该密度可积且归一化常数为有限。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　第一式即命题 4.4 在零偏差下的特例。第二式：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_w(x)=p_t(x)\\big(\\tfrac{p_t(x\\mid c)}{p_t(x)}\\big)^w$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log q_w=\\nabla\\log p_t+w\\nabla\\log\\frac{p_t(x\\mid c)}{p_t(x)},$$</div>\n<p>与第一式右端一致。可积性与归一化条件保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_w$</span> 是概率密度，从而其得分有定义。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题标明本节结论的边界：dropout 训练只保证两分支得分可被同一网络近似，不保证 CFG 组合噪声本身是某个归一化密度的得分。后者需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_w$</span> 可积，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_w$</span> 可能不可积（重尾），这正是第 5 节分布偏移与第 10 节模式崩溃的数学根源。本节不展开该分析，仅指出一致性条件的精确形式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\n\ntorch.manual_seed(1)\nd, n = 4, 2048\n\n# 验证命题 4.10：dropout 梯度是两分支梯度的凸组合\np_drop = 0.3\neps = nn.Linear(d, d, bias=False)\ng_c = torch.randn(n, d)\ng_u = torch.randn(n, d)\n\nloss_c = ((eps(g_c) - g_c) ** 2).mean()\nloss_u = ((eps(g_u) - g_u) ** 2).mean()\ngrad_c = torch.autograd.grad(loss_c, eps.weight, retain_graph=True)[0]\ngrad_u = torch.autograd.grad(loss_u, eps.weight, retain_graph=True)[0]\n\n# 蒙特卡洛 dropout 梯度\nD = torch.bernoulli(torch.full((n,), 1 - p_drop))\nloss_mc = torch.where(\n    D.bool(),\n    ((eps(g_c) - g_c) ** 2).mean(dim=1),\n    ((eps(g_u) - g_u) ** 2).mean(dim=1),\n).mean()\ngrad_mc = torch.autograd.grad(loss_mc, eps.weight)[0]\n\ngrad_mix = (1 - p_drop) * grad_c + p_drop * grad_u\nassert grad_mc.shape == eps.weight.shape\nassert torch.allclose(grad_mc, grad_mix, atol=0.05), (grad_mc - grad_mix).abs().max()\nprint(&quot;grad shapes:&quot;, grad_mc.shape, grad_mix.shape)\nprint(&quot;max grad diff:&quot;, (grad_mc - grad_mix).abs().max().item())\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出为两个形状为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(4,4)$</span> 的张量，且 <code>max grad diff</code> 不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.05$</span>（蒙特卡洛误差，随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 增大而减小）。<code>assert</code> 检查梯度形状一致且凸组合恒等式在容差内成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-4-12-dropout-概率的极小极大刻画\">命题 4.12（dropout 概率的极小极大刻画）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-4-12-dropout-概率的极小极大刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合命题 4.7 与推论 4.8，可给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 的一个极小极大刻画，作为本节对训练超参数选择的数学结论。</p>\n<p>在 (A1)–(A7) 下，定义最坏情形偏差</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$R(p_{\\mathrm{drop}},w)=\\sup_{x,c}\\big\\|\\tilde\\varepsilon_{\\theta^\\star(p_{\\mathrm{drop}})}(x,c)-\\text{理想引导得分}\\big\\|.$$</div>\n<p>则由命题 4.7，<span class=\"math-inline\">$R(p_{\\mathrm{drop}},w)\\le(1+w)B_c(p_{\\mathrm{drop}})+wB_u(p_{\\mathrm{drop}})$</span>。若进一步假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_c,B_u$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 连续，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\inf_{p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\in[0,1]}\\sup_{w\\ge 0}\\frac{R(p_{\\mathrm{drop}},w)}{1+w}\\le\\inf_{p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\in[0,1]}\\big(B_c(p_{\\mathrm{drop}})+B_u(p_{\\mathrm{drop}})\\big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span>，由命题 4.7，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{R(p_{\\mathrm{drop}},w)}{1+w}\\le B_c(p_{\\mathrm{drop}})+\\frac{w}{1+w}B_u(p_{\\mathrm{drop}})\\le B_c(p_{\\mathrm{drop}})+B_u(p_{\\mathrm{drop}}),$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span> 取上确界得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_w R/(1+w)\\le B_c+B_u$</span>。再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 取下确界即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此刻画的意义在于：归一化偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R/(1+w)$</span> 消去了引导权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的线性放大，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 的选择只依赖于两分支的容量偏差之和。它把“dropout 概率应与引导权重联合调节”这一实践直觉转化为一个不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的极小化问题，其解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star$</span> 由网络容量而非采样超参数决定。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>dropout 训练的目标是条件目标与无条件目标的凸组合，权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span>；它使同一网络同时逼近两个得分，是 CFG 公式中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)$</span> 可计算的前提。</li>\n<li>CFG 组合噪声的期望是两分支期望的线性组合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 退化为普通条件采样，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 放大条件与无条件对数密度比的梯度项，即隐式分类器引导。</li>\n<li>有限容量下 dropout 概率与引导权重通过目标分解耦合：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 过小使无条件分支欠训练，过大则稀释条件分支；该耦合的定量分析属于第 5 节分布偏移与第 7 节极限行为的内容。</li>\n<li>CFG 组合噪声的期望是两分支期望的线性组合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 退化为普通条件采样，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 放大条件与无条件对数密度比的梯度项，即隐式分类器引导；有限容量下偏差上界随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 线性增长，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 存在由容量决定的最优值。</li>\n<li>训练与采样的一致性要求两分支得分精确且组合密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)\\big(p_t(x_t\\mid c)/p_t(x_t)\\big)^w$</span> 可积；该条件在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时可能失效，其分布层面的后果属于第 5 节分布偏移与第 10 节模式崩溃的内容。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df18--h-引导的分布偏移\">引导的分布偏移<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-引导的分布偏移\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为扩散过程在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 的状态，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 为条件变量（取值于可测空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing$</span> 为条件 dropout 所用的空条件记号，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span> 为噪声预测网络，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span> 为 CFG 组合噪声预测，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span> 为引导权重，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\in[0,1)$</span> 为训练时条件置空概率。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span> 为给定条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 时时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的边缘密度（相对于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 的 Lebesgue 测度），<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 为无条件边缘密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)$</span> 为数据分布在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的加噪边缘。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x_t,c)=\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span> 为条件得分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x_t,\\varnothing)=\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 为无条件得分。本节新引入的符号仅有：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 表示由 CFG 组合噪声所诱导的时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的隐式分布（定义见下文），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t(x_t,c):=s_t(x_t,c)-s_t(x_t,\\varnothing)$</span> 为条件得分与无条件得分之差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)$</span> 为扩散过程的噪声调度系数（在 VE 参数化下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta=-\\sigma_t s_t$</span>，在 VP 参数化下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,s_t$</span>，本节只用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 的线性比例关系，故记比例常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=-\\kappa_t s_t(x_t,c)$</span>）。</p>\n<p>本节的正则性假设如下，逐条显式列出并在证明中引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可测性与可积性.</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,c)\\mapsto p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}(\\mathbb{R}^d)\\otimes\\mathcal{B}(\\mathcal{C})$</span> 可测，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)\\cap L^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)\\in W^{1,1}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 得分正则性.</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot,c)\\in C^1(\\mathbb{R}^d;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，且存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_t(x,c)-s_t(y,c)\\|\\le L_t\\|x-y\\|$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,y$</span> 成立；同时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{x}\\|s_t(x,c)\\|&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 边界通量消失.</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{\\|x\\|\\to\\infty}p_t(x\\mid c)\\|s_t(x,c)\\|=0$</span>，从而分部积分无边界项。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 归一化与严格正性.</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t(x\\mid c)\\,dx=1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x\\mid c)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立（保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_t$</span> 全局定义）。</p>\n<p><strong>(A5) 引导权重的可容许范围.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in[0,\\infty)$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\neq 1$</span> 时，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 可归一化，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t^{(w)}(c):=\\int p_t(x\\mid\\varnothing)\\exp\\!\\big((w-1)\\log\\frac{p_t(x\\mid c)}{p_t(x\\mid\\varnothing)}\\big)\\,dx&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>这些假设在本章情境下为何成立：扩散模型在有限时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span> 的边缘密度是数据分布与高斯核的卷积，故 (A1)(A4) 由高斯核的解析性与正性直接得到；(A2) 由卷积后密度的光滑性与数据分布紧支撑（或有限二阶矩）得到；(A3) 由高斯尾衰减得到；(A5) 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 不太大且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 似然比有界时成立，其失效情形正是第 10 节反例节的主题。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-1-CFG-组合噪声诱导的隐式分布\">1. CFG 组合噪声诱导的隐式分布<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-1-CFG-组合噪声诱导的隐式分布\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已给出 CFG 组合公式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\big(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\big).$$</div>\n<p>利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta=-\\kappa_t s_t$</span>，将其翻译为得分语言：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\kappa_t\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(x_t,c)=-\\kappa_t s_t(x_t,\\varnothing)-w\\kappa_t\\big(s_t(x_t,c)-s_t(x_t,\\varnothing)\\big),$$</div>\n<p>即</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(x_t,c)=s_t(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\,\\Delta_t(x_t,c).$$</div>\n<p><strong>定义（CFG 隐式分布）.</strong> 设 (A1)–(A5) 成立。定义时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的 CFG 隐式密度</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\pi_t^{(w)}(x_t\\mid c):=\\frac{1}{Z_t^{(w)}(c)}\\,p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)\\exp\\!\\big(w\\log\\tfrac{p_t(x_t\\mid c)}{p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)}\\big),$$</div>\n<p>其中归一化常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t^{(w)}(c)$</span> 如 (A5) 所定义。等价地，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\pi_t^{(w)}(x_t\\mid c)=\\frac{1}{Z_t^{(w)}(c)}\\,\\frac{p_t(x_t\\mid c)^{w}}{p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)^{w-1}}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 1（得分匹配）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A5) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 的对数得分恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(\\cdot,c)$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log\\pi_t^{(w)}(x_t\\mid c)=s_t(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\big(s_t(x_t,c)-s_t(x_t,\\varnothing)\\big)=\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(x_t,c).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 对定义式取对数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\pi_t^{(w)}(x_t\\mid c)=-\\log Z_t^{(w)}(c)+\\log p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)+w\\big(\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)-\\log p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)\\big).$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t^{(w)}(c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 无关，故其梯度为零。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 求梯度，由 (A2) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 性与 (A4) 的正性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_t$</span> 可微且梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log\\pi_t^{(w)}(x_t\\mid c)=s_t(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\big(s_t(x_t,c)-s_t(x_t,\\varnothing)\\big)=s_t(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\Delta_t(x_t,c).$$</div>\n<p>证毕。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：CFG 并非在采样阶段“事后修改”分布，而是定义了一个新的隐式分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span>，其得分恰为组合噪声所对应的得分。这是本节后续一切分布偏移论断的出发点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-2-分布偏移的精确刻画\">2. 分布偏移的精确刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-2-分布偏移的精确刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 2（分布偏移的指数族表示）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A5) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 之间的 Radon–Nikodym 导数几乎处处为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d\\pi_t^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)}{dp_t(\\cdot\\mid c)}(x_t)=\\frac{1}{Z_t^{(w)}(c)}\\,\\frac{p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)^{1-w}}{p_t(x_t\\mid c)^{1-w}}\\cdot\\frac{p_t(x_t\\mid c)}{p_t(x_t\\mid c)}=\\frac{1}{Z_t^{(w)}(c)}\\Big(\\frac{p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)}{p_t(x_t\\mid c)}\\Big)^{1-w}.$$</div>\n<p>特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 在指数族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)\\exp(\\theta\\,g(x_t)-\\psi(\\theta))\\}$</span> 中的成员，其中充分统计量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x_t)=-\\log\\frac{p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)}{p_t(x_t\\mid c)}=\\log\\frac{p_t(x_t\\mid c)}{p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)}$</span>，自然参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=w-1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由定义，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\pi_t^{(w)}(x_t\\mid c)=\\frac{1}{Z_t^{(w)}(c)}p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)\\exp\\!\\big((w-1)\\log\\tfrac{p_t(x_t\\mid c)}{p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)}\\big).$$</div>\n<p>将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)=p_t(x_t\\mid c)\\cdot\\frac{p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)}{p_t(x_t\\mid c)}$</span> 代入，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\pi_t^{(w)}(x_t\\mid c)=\\frac{1}{Z_t^{(w)}(c)}p_t(x_t\\mid c)\\Big(\\frac{p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)}{p_t(x_t\\mid c)}\\Big)^{1-w}\\exp\\!\\big((w-1)\\log\\tfrac{p_t(x_t\\mid c)}{p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)}\\big).$$</div>\n<p>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp((w-1)\\log\\frac{p_t(x_t\\mid c)}{p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)})=\\big(\\frac{p_t(x_t\\mid c)}{p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)}\\big)^{w-1}$</span>，与前面的因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(\\frac{p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)}{p_t(x_t\\mid c)}\\big)^{1-w}$</span> 相乘恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\pi_t^{(w)}(x_t\\mid c)=\\frac{1}{Z_t^{(w)}(c)}p_t(x_t\\mid c)\\Big(\\frac{p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)}{p_t(x_t\\mid c)}\\Big)^{1-w}.$$</div>\n<p>指数族形式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=\\log(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)/p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing))$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=w-1$</span> 直接读出。证毕。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 退化）.</strong> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t^{(1)}(c)=1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(1)}(\\cdot\\mid c)=p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 几乎处处。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 在定理 2 的 Radon–Nikodym 导数中令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\pi_t^{(1)}/dp_t=1/Z_t^{(1)}(c)$</span>。由 (A4) 两边积分：<span class=\"math-inline\">$1=\\int d\\pi_t^{(1)}=\\int (1/Z_t^{(1)})dp_t=1/Z_t^{(1)}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t^{(1)}=1$</span>，导数恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。证毕。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论与本章 canonical claim“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 退化为普通条件采样”一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-3-锐化效应的定量表述\">3. 锐化效应的定量表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-3-锐化效应的定量表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 的锐化）.</strong> 设 (A1)–(A5) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t(\\cdot,c)$</span> 不几乎处处为零。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 的高密度区域相对增大、在低密度区域相对减小，具体地，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,y$</span> 有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\pi_t^{(w)}(x\\mid c)/\\pi_t^{(w)}(y\\mid c)}{p_t(x\\mid c)/p_t(y\\mid c)}=\\Big(\\frac{p_t(x\\mid c)/p_t(x\\mid\\varnothing)}{p_t(y\\mid c)/p_t(y\\mid\\varnothing)}\\Big)^{w-1}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由定理 2 的 Radon–Nikodym 导数，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,y$</span> 取比值，归一化常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t^{(w)}(c)$</span> 相消：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\pi_t^{(w)}(x\\mid c)}{\\pi_t^{(w)}(y\\mid c)}=\\frac{p_t(x\\mid c)}{p_t(y\\mid c)}\\cdot\\frac{\\big(p_t(x\\mid\\varnothing)/p_t(x\\mid c)\\big)^{1-w}}{\\big(p_t(y\\mid\\varnothing)/p_t(y\\mid c)\\big)^{1-w}}.$$</div>\n<p>将右端第二个因子改写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(\\frac{p_t(y\\mid c)/p_t(y\\mid\\varnothing)}{p_t(x\\mid c)/p_t(x\\mid\\varnothing)}\\big)^{1-w}=\\big(\\frac{p_t(x\\mid c)/p_t(x\\mid\\varnothing)}{p_t(y\\mid c)/p_t(y\\mid\\varnothing)}\\big)^{w-1}$</span>，即得所述恒等式。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 处的条件似然比高于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 处，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span> 的相对质量向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 偏移，此即“锐化条件分布”。证毕。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与“目标值相等不等于梯度相等”的区分）.</strong> 命题 1 断言的是得分（梯度）层面的匹配，命题 4 断言的是密度比值（目标值）层面的偏移。二者不可互换：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot,c)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\neq 1$</span> 时不相等，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}\\neq p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>；但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时二者同时相等。本节所有结论均在得分与密度两个层面分别陈述，不混用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-4-具体例子-高斯情形下的精确偏移\">4. 具体例子：高斯情形下的精确偏移<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-4-具体例子-高斯情形下的精确偏移\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 5.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x\\mid c)=\\mathcal{N}(x;\\mu_c,\\sigma^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x\\mid\\varnothing)=\\mathcal{N}(x;0,\\sigma^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_c\\neq0$</span>。验证 (A1)–(A5) 成立（高斯密度的解析性、正性、对数梯度的 Lipschitz 性与边界通量消失均为标准事实）。</p>\n<p>似然比的对数为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\frac{p_t(x\\mid c)}{p_t(x\\mid\\varnothing)}=\\frac{x^2-(x-\\mu_c)^2}{2\\sigma^2}=\\frac{2\\mu_c x-\\mu_c^2}{2\\sigma^2}.$$</div>\n由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}\\propto p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)\\exp\\big(w\\log(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)/p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing))\\big)$</span>，其对数（忽略常数）为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\frac{x^2}{2\\sigma^2}+w\\frac{2\\mu_c x-\\mu_c^2}{2\\sigma^2}\n=-\\frac{1}{2\\sigma^2}\\big(x-w\\mu_c\\big)^2+\\text{常数}.$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)=\\mathcal{N}(w\\mu_c,\\sigma^2)$</span>。其得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log\\pi_t^{(w)}=-(x-w\\mu_c)/\\sigma^2$</span>；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot,\\varnothing)=-x/\\sigma^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t=\\mu_c/\\sigma^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}=-x/\\sigma^2+w\\mu_c/\\sigma^2=-(x-w\\mu_c)/\\sigma^2$</span>，与命题 1 一致。</p>\n<p>高斯情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span> 的均值随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 线性平移、方差不变。这说明 CFG 在高斯族内只平移条件均值而不收缩方差；“锐化”体现为均值被放大，方差收缩需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 或得分非线性，此点留待第 7 节极限行为讨论。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（得分匹配）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A5) 下（其中 (A5) 的归一化常数改为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde Z_t^{(w)}(c)$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 的对数得分恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(\\cdot,c)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 取对数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\pi_t^{(w)}=-\\log\\tilde Z_t^{(w)}+w\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)-(w-1)\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)$</span>。求梯度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w s_t(\\cdot,c)-(w-1)s_t(\\cdot,\\varnothing)=s_t(\\cdot,\\varnothing)+w(s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t(\\cdot,\\varnothing))=\\tilde s_t^{(w)}$</span>。证毕。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>定理 2.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A5) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\pi_t^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)/dp_t(\\cdot\\mid c)(x)=\\frac{1}{\\tilde Z_t^{(w)}(c)}\\big(p_t(x\\mid c)/p_t(x\\mid\\varnothing)\\big)^{w-1}$</span> 几乎处处。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}=\\frac{1}{\\tilde Z_t^{(w)}}p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)^w/p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)^{w-1}=\\frac{1}{\\tilde Z_t^{(w)}}p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)\\big(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)/p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)\\big)^{w-1}$</span>，两边除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 即得。证毕。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3</strong> 不变（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde Z_t^{(1)}=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(1)}=p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4</strong> 的比值恒等式形式不变，证明中用精确形式定理 2 即可。</p>\n<p><strong>例 5.</strong> 高斯情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}=\\mathcal{N}(w\\mu_c,\\sigma^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}=-(x-w\\mu_c)/\\sigma^2=\\nabla\\log\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span>，命题 1 成立。命题 4 的比值：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}(x)/\\pi_t^{(w)}(y)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x\\mid c)/p_t(y\\mid c)$</span> 之比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp\\big(-\\frac{(x-w\\mu_c)^2-(y-w\\mu_c)^2}{2\\sigma^2}+\\frac{(x-\\mu_c)^2-(y-\\mu_c)^2}{2\\sigma^2}\\big)$</span>，展开线性项得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp\\big(\\frac{(w-1)\\mu_c(x-y)}{\\sigma^2}\\big)=\\big(\\frac{p_t(x\\mid c)/p_t(x\\mid\\varnothing)}{p_t(y\\mid c)/p_t(y\\mid\\varnothing)}\\big)^{w-1}$</span>（因似然比的对数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_c x/\\sigma^2+$</span> 常数，差值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_c(x-y)/\\sigma^2$</span>）。验证通过。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-5-与训练时-dropout-的关系\">5. 与训练时 dropout 的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-5-与训练时-dropout-的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已建立：训练时以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 置空，故网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 同时被训练来近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span>。本节只需指出：上述隐式分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span> 的得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}$</span> 完全由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span> 的线性组合给出，不引入任何额外网络；因此 CFG 的分布偏移是<strong>训练后</strong>由权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 参数化的一族分布，其成员资格由 (A5) 的可归一化条件保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 的作用仅是保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 是一个被一致训练的无条件预测器，从而使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 时退化为无条件得分、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时退化为条件得分。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 无训练信号，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 端点无定义；此失效情形归入第 10 节反例节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-6-可运行的数值验证\">6. 可运行的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-6-可运行的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码验证命题 1、推论 3 与例 5 的解析结论，并打印形状与断言结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef gaussian_logpdf(x, mu, sigma):\n    return -0.5 * ((x - mu) / sigma) ** 2 - 0.5 * np.log(2 * np.pi * sigma ** 2)\n\ndef score_gaussian(x, mu, sigma):\n    return -(x - mu) / sigma ** 2\n\n# 例 5 参数\nmu_c, sigma = 1.3, 0.7\nw = 2.5\nxs = np.linspace(-5, 8, 200001)\ndx = xs[1] - xs[0]\n\n# 条件与无条件密度\nlog_pc = gaussian_logpdf(xs, mu_c, sigma)\nlog_p0 = gaussian_logpdf(xs, 0.0, sigma)\n\n# CFG 隐式密度（精确形式定义）：pi ∝ p_c^w / p_0^{w-1}\nlog_pi_unnorm = w * log_pc - (w - 1) * log_p0\nlog_Z = np.log(np.sum(np.exp(log_pi_unnorm - log_pi_unnorm.max())) * dx) + log_pi_unnorm.max()\nlog_pi = log_pi_unnorm - log_Z\npi = np.exp(log_pi)\n\n# 断言 1：归一化\nassert abs(np.sum(pi) * dx - 1.0) &lt; 1e-6, &quot;pi not normalized&quot;\n\n# 断言 2：解析均值为 w*mu_c，方差为 sigma^2\nmean_num = np.sum(xs * pi) * dx\nvar_num = np.sum((xs - mean_num) ** 2 * pi) * dx\nassert abs(mean_num - w * mu_c) &lt; 1e-4, f&quot;mean mismatch: {mean_num} vs {w*mu_c}&quot;\nassert abs(var_num - sigma ** 2) &lt; 1e-4, f&quot;var mismatch: {var_num} vs {sigma**2}&quot;\n\n# 断言 3：命题 1，数值梯度与组合得分一致（中心差分）\nx_test = np.array([-0.4, 0.0, 0.9, 2.1])\neps = 1e-6\ndef log_pi_at(x):\n    lp = w * gaussian_logpdf(x, mu_c, sigma) - (w - 1) * gaussian_logpdf(x, 0.0, sigma)\n    return lp - log_Z\ngrad_num = (log_pi_at(x_test + eps) - log_pi_at(x_test - eps)) / (2 * eps)\ns0 = score_gaussian(x_test, 0.0, sigma)\nsc = score_gaussian(x_test, mu_c, sigma)\ns_cfg = s0 + w * (sc - s0)\nassert np.allclose(grad_num, s_cfg, atol=1e-5), &quot;score mismatch&quot;\n\n# 断言 4：推论 3，w=1 时 pi 等于条件密度\nw1 = 1.0\nlog_pi1_unnorm = w1 * log_pc - (w1 - 1) * log_p0\nlog_Z1 = np.log(np.sum(np.exp(log_pi1_unnorm - log_pi1_unnorm.max())) * dx) + log_pi1_unnorm.max()\npi1 = np.exp(log_pi1_unnorm - log_Z1)\nassert np.allclose(pi1, np.exp(log_pc), atol=1e-6), &quot;w=1 degeneracy failed&quot;\n\n# 断言 5：命题 4 的比值恒等式，取两点 x=1.0, y=-0.5\nx1, y1 = 1.0, -0.5\nlhs = np.exp(log_pi_at(x1) - log_pi_at(y1)) / np.exp(gaussian_logpdf(x1, mu_c, sigma) - gaussian_logpdf(y1, mu_c, sigma))\nratio_lik = np.exp((gaussian_logpdf(x1, mu_c, sigma) - gaussian_logpdf(x1, 0.0, sigma))\n                   - (gaussian_logpdf(y1, mu_c, sigma) - gaussian_logpdf(y1, 0.0, sigma)))\nrhs = ratio_lik ** (w - 1)\nassert abs(lhs - rhs) &lt; 1e-6, f&quot;ratio identity failed: {lhs} vs {rhs}&quot;\n\nprint(&quot;pi shape:&quot;, pi.shape, &quot;mean:&quot;, mean_num, &quot;var:&quot;, var_num)\nprint(&quot;grad check:&quot;, grad_num, &quot;vs&quot;, s_cfg)\nprint(&quot;w=1 degeneracy: max abs diff =&quot;, np.max(np.abs(pi1 - np.exp(log_pc))))\nprint(&quot;ratio identity: lhs =&quot;, lhs, &quot;rhs =&quot;, rhs)\nprint(&quot;all assertions passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行结果预期：<code>pi shape: (200001,)</code>，<code>mean</code> 约等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2.5\\times 1.3=3.25$</span>，<code>var</code> 约等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.49$</span>，梯度检查两组数值接近，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 退化最大绝对差小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>，比值恒等式两端相等，最后打印 <code>all assertions passed</code>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-7-分布偏移的-KL-与-Fisher-度量\">7. 分布偏移的 KL 与 Fisher 度量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-7-分布偏移的-KL-与-Fisher-度量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前文已把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 的指数族倾斜。本节补充两个可检验的恒等式，用于定量刻画偏移幅度：一是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 之间的 KL 散度对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的导数，二是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span> 的得分场在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 处的 Fisher 信息展开。这两条恒等式把“锐化”从比值陈述提升为可微分的量。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（KL 对权重的导数）.</strong> 设 (A1)–(A5) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_t^{(w)}}\\big[|\\log(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)/p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing))|\\big]&lt;\\infty$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dw}\\mathrm{KL}\\big(\\pi_t^{(w)}\\,\\|\\,p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)\\big)=\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_t^{(w)}}\\Big[\\log\\frac{p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)}{p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)}\\Big]-\\mathbb{E}_{p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)}\\Big[\\log\\frac{p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)}{p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)}\\Big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x)=\\log\\frac{p_t(x\\mid c)}{p_t(x\\mid\\varnothing)}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde Z(w)=\\int p_t(x\\mid c)^w p_t(x\\mid\\varnothing)^{1-w}dx$</span>。由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}=p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)^w p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)^{1-w}/\\tilde Z(w)$</span>。KL 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(w)=\\int\\pi_t^{(w)}(x)\\log\\frac{\\pi_t^{(w)}(x)}{p_t(x\\mid c)}dx=\\int\\pi_t^{(w)}(x)\\big((w-1)g(x)-\\log\\tilde Z(w)\\big)dx.$$</div>\n<p>由 (A5) 的归一化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\pi_t^{(w)}dx=1$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(w)=(w-1)\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_t^{(w)}}[g]-\\log\\tilde Z(w).$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 求导，需要交换求导与积分。验证 Leibniz 条件：被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}(x)\\big((w-1)g(x)-\\log\\tilde Z(w)\\big)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 在任意紧区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[w_0,w_1]\\subset(0,\\infty)$</span> 上被可积控制函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w_0)}(x)\\big((w_1-1)|g(x)|+|\\log\\tilde Z(w_1)|+|\\log\\tilde Z(w_0)|\\big)$</span> 控制（利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的单调似然比性质与 (A5) 的可积性），故由 Dominated Convergence 可交换。求导得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dw}\\mathrm{KL}(w)=\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_t^{(w)}}[g]+(w-1)\\frac{d}{dw}\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_t^{(w)}}[g]-\\frac{\\tilde Z'(w)}{\\tilde Z(w)}.$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dw}\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_t^{(w)}}[g]=\\int g(x)\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial w}\\pi_t^{(w)}(x)dx$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial w}\\pi_t^{(w)}=\\pi_t^{(w)}\\big(g-\\frac{\\tilde Z'(w)}{\\tilde Z(w)}\\big)$</span>。代入得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dw}\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_t^{(w)}}[g]=\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_t^{(w)}}\\big[g^2\\big]-\\frac{\\tilde Z'(w)}{\\tilde Z(w)}\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_t^{(w)}}[g].$$</div>\n<p>又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\tilde Z'(w)}{\\tilde Z(w)}=\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_t^{(w)}}[g]$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dw}\\mathrm{KL}(w)=\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_t^{(w)}}[g]+(w-1)\\big(\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_t^{(w)}}[g^2]-\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_t^{(w)}}[g]^2\\big)-\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_t^{(w)}}[g]=(w-1)\\mathrm{Var}_{\\pi_t^{(w)}}(g).$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)}[g]=\\mathrm{KL}(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)\\|p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing))$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_t^{(w)}}[g]$</span> 之差即命题所述。证毕。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题给出一个直接推论：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dw}\\mathrm{KL}\\big(\\pi_t^{(w)}\\|p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)\\big)\\big|_{w=1}=0$</span>，且二阶导为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_{p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)}(g)\\ge 0$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 是 KL 的驻点且为局部极小——这与推论 3 的退化一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的任何方向都增大与条件分布的 KL。注意该结论只说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 附近与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 最接近，并不说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span> 更接近数据真实条件分布；后者是第 6 节贝叶斯接口的问题。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（得分场的 Fisher 展开）.</strong> 设 (A1)–(A5) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))$</span>。则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 附近，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(x,c)=s_t(x,c)+(w-1)\\Delta_t(x,c),$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span> 的得分场与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 的得分场之差的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))$</span> 范数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|w-1|\\,\\|\\Delta_t(\\cdot,c)\\|_{L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 第一式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}=s_t(\\cdot,\\varnothing)+w\\Delta_t=s_t(\\cdot,c)+(w-1)\\Delta_t$</span> 直接得到（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot,\\varnothing)=s_t(\\cdot,c)-\\Delta_t$</span>）。第二式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde s_t^{(w)}-s_t(\\cdot,c)\\|_{L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))}^2=(w-1)^2\\int\\Delta_t(x,c)^2p_t(x\\mid c)dx$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))$</span> 知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t=\\nabla g$</span> 的平方可积性需 (A2) 的 Lipschitz 与 (A4) 的正性保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla g$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 下平方可积；开方即得。证毕。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：CFG 的得分偏移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 附近是<strong>线性</strong>的，偏移方向恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t$</span>，偏移幅度正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|w-1|$</span>。这与命题 4 的比值陈述互补：比值陈述是全局的、非线性的，Fisher 展开是局部的、线性的。二者不冲突，因为比值恒等式对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 成立，而 Fisher 展开只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to 1$</span> 时给出可加的线性化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-8-偏移的不可逆性与-w-lt-0-的边界\">8. 偏移的不可逆性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&lt;0$</span> 的边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-8-偏移的不可逆性与-w-lt-0-的边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前文只讨论了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span>。本节补充 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&lt;0$</span> 时的代数结构与失效边界，因为 CFG 实现中偶有负权重用于“反向引导”，其数学后果必须显式给出，不能留作工程口传。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（负权重的密度反演）.</strong> 设 (A1)–(A5) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&lt;0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde Z_t^{(w)}(c)&lt;\\infty$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\pi_t^{(w)}(x\\mid c)=\\frac{1}{\\tilde Z_t^{(w)}(c)}\\,p_t(x\\mid\\varnothing)^{1-w}p_t(x\\mid c)^{w},$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 的低密度区域相对增大、高密度区域相对减小；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to-\\infty$</span> 时，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 的支撑外有正质量，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span> 的质量向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 的“反条件”区域集中。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 第一式即定义式的代数改写。第二式由命题 4 的比值恒等式取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&lt;0$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(p_t(x\\mid c)/p_t(x\\mid\\varnothing))^{w-1}$</span> 的指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w-1&lt;-1$</span>，故条件似然比越高，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span> 的相对质量越小，即反向锐化。第三式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to-\\infty$</span> 的极限陈述，其严格证明需 (A5) 在负权重下的可归一化条件；该条件在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 支撑外有正质量时失效，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde Z_t^{(w)}$</span> 发散，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span> 无定义——这正是第 10 节反例节要处理的边界。证毕。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的要点是：负权重不是“减弱引导”，而是把条件分布<strong>反演</strong>为反条件分布；它在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to-\\infty$</span> 时不可归一化，故负权重的可容许范围受 (A5) 严格限制。工程上常见的“负权重微调”只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in(-1,0)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 支撑重合时才有数学意义。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-9-偏移在时间轴上的传播\">9. 偏移在时间轴上的传播<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-9-偏移在时间轴上的传播\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前文所有陈述都是逐时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的。本节补充一个跨时刻的恒等式，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span> 族在时间轴上是否构成一个合法的扩散过程——即是否存在前向 SDE 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span> 为其边缘。这是“分布偏移”能否被采样器一致实现的前提。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（CFG 隐式分布的时间一致性）.</strong> 设 (A1)–(A5) 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span> 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(\\cdot,c)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 满足 (A2) 的一致 Lipschitz 界。则存在前向 SDE</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dX_t=\\big[-\\kappa_t\\tilde s_t^{(w)}(X_t,c)\\big]dt+\\sqrt{2\\kappa_t}\\,dW_t$$</div>\n<p>（在 VE 参数化下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的时间导数的一半，具体系数由噪声调度决定），使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 为其边缘密度。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span> 的对数得分。Fokker–Planck 方程的解在得分场满足 (A2) 的 Lipschitz 与 (A3) 的边界通量消失时存在且唯一（标准的存在唯一性定理，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> Lipschitz）。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}$</span> 代入前向 SDE 的漂移，其 Fokker–Planck 方程的平稳解即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span>。证毕。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的意义是：CFG 不是“在采样最后一步改分”，而是定义了一族随时间演化的合法边缘分布；只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}$</span> 满足正则性，采样器（反向 SDE 或概率流 ODE）就能一致地产生 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0^{(w)}$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}$</span> 在某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 处不满足 Lipschitz（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 在该时刻有近零密度导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t$</span> 爆炸），则时间一致性失效，采样器可能产生非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span> 的样本——此失效归入第 8 节数值稳定性与第 10 节反例节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-10-与相邻概念的区分\">10. 与相邻概念的区分<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-10-与相邻概念的区分\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后补一条概念区分，防止把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span> 与另外两个常见对象混淆。</p>\n<p>其一，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span> 不是“条件分布的 tempered posterior”。Tempered posterior 形如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)^\\beta p_t(\\cdot)^{1-\\beta}$</span>，其指数和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span> 的指数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-w$</span>，和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 但基准分布是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 而非先验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)=p_t(\\cdot)$</span>（即空条件恰为先验）时二者重合；否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span> 的基准是无条件边缘，它已经包含了数据分布的信息，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span> 的“锐化”是相对于无条件边缘的，而非相对于先验的。</p>\n<p>其二，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span> 不是“条件分布的几何插值”。几何插值形如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)^w p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)^{1-w}/\\tilde Z$</span> 与本节定义在代数上相同，但几何插值的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in[0,1]$</span> 是插值参数，而 CFG 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 是外推参数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span> 已不在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 的凸包内，而是指数族的外推点。这一区别在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 的极限行为中尤为明显（第 7 节极限行为节展开）。</p>\n<p>其三，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span> 不是“隐式分类器引导的精确形式”。隐式分类器引导用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(c\\mid x_t)$</span> 修正得分，其精确形式要求分类器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(c\\mid x_t)$</span> 可微且归一化；CFG 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t$</span> 近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(c\\mid x_t)$</span>，近似误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(c\\mid x_t)-\\Delta_t$</span>。由贝叶斯公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(c\\mid x_t)=p_t(x_t\\mid c)p(c)/p_t(x_t)$</span>，取对数梯度得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(c\\mid x_t)=s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t(\\cdot,\\varnothing)=\\Delta_t$</span>——在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)=p_t(\\cdot)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 无关时二者精确相等；否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t$</span> 只是隐式分类器得分的一个近似，其误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot)$</span> 的差异决定。此近似关系是第 6 节贝叶斯接口与第 16 节推导链的主题，本节只登记其代数形式，不展开。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>CFG 组合噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^{(w)}=s_t(\\cdot,\\varnothing)+w\\Delta_t$</span> 精确对应隐式密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}\\propto p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)^w/p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)^{w-1}$</span>，其得分匹配由命题 1 给出；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时退化为条件密度（推论 3），<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时按似然比的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w-1$</span> 次幂锐化条件分布（命题 4）。</li>\n<li>分布偏移的精确形式是 Radon–Nikodym 导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)/p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)\\big)^{w-1}/\\tilde Z_t^{(w)}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span> 属于以对数似然比为充分统计量、自然参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w-1$</span> 的指数族；高斯例子给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(w\\mu_c,\\sigma^2)$</span> 的闭式验证。</li>\n<li>训练时 dropout 只保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 被一致训练，从而使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 两个端点分别对应无条件与条件得分；CFG 本身不引入新网络，其全部效应由权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 在固定得分场上参数化，可归一化条件 (A5) 是分布偏移良定义的前提，其失效情形归入反例节。</li>\n<li>分布偏移的精确形式是 Radon–Nikodym 导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)/p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)\\big)^{w-1}/\\tilde Z_t^{(w)}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t^{(w)}$</span> 属于以对数似然比为充分统计量、自然参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w-1$</span> 的指数族；高斯例子给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(w\\mu_c,\\sigma^2)$</span> 的闭式验证，KL 对权重的导数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 处为零且二阶导为似然比方差（命题 6），得分偏移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 附近线性可加（命题 7）。</li>\n<li>训练时 dropout 只保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 被一致训练，从而使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 两个端点分别对应无条件与条件得分；CFG 本身不引入新网络，其全部效应由权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 在固定得分场上参数化，可归一化条件 (A5) 是分布偏移良定义的前提，负权重（命题 8）与时间一致性（命题 9）分别给出反演结构与采样可实现性的边界，其失效情形归入反例节。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df18--h-引导与贝叶斯\">引导与贝叶斯<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-引导与贝叶斯\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span> 为噪声预测网络，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha_t x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 为前向扩散在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的边缘样本，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing$</span> 为空条件（null token），<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span> 为引导权重，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\in[0,1)$</span> 为训练时条件置空概率。记条件数据分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0(x_0\\mid c)$</span>，无条件边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0(x_0)$</span>，对应的得分函数分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 为前向过程在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的条件边缘密度。</p>\n<p>本节引入如下新符号并固定其含义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t(c\\mid x_t):=\\log\\dfrac{p_t(x_t\\mid c)}{p_t(x_t)}$</span>，称为<strong>时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的条件对数似然比</strong>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)&gt;0$</span> 处定义）；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(c\\mid x_t):=\\dfrac{p_t(x_t\\mid c)\\,p(c)}{p_t(x_t)}$</span>，为贝叶斯后验（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c)$</span> 为条件先验，本节取离散条件空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal{C}|&lt;\\infty$</span>，并假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathcal{C}$</span>）；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t:=\\sigma_t^2 I_d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 为数据维度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I_d$</span> 为单位阵。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的正则性假设统一列于此，后续命题逐条引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(H1)</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathcal{C}\\cup\\{\\varnothing\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 连续可微且处处为正；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 局部 Lipschitz。</p>\n<p><strong>(H2)</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_t(x_t\\mid c)}[\\|\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_t(x_t)}[\\|\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(H3)</strong> 网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 连续可微且局部 Lipschitz，并对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t,c$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=-\\sigma_t\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span> 的近似关系（即网络是条件得分的参数化，误差项在后续命题中显式出现）。</p>\n<p><strong>(H4)</strong> 条件先验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span> 上严格正。</p>\n<p>在 (H1)–(H4) 下，本节所有求导与积分交换均由 Leibniz 法则（被积函数关于参数连续可微且局部 Lipschitz，积分区域固定）或 Dominated Convergence（(H2) 提供可积控制函数）保证，下文逐处标注。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-贝叶斯分解与得分恒等式\">贝叶斯分解与得分恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-贝叶斯分解与得分恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节的核心恒等式是：条件得分与无条件得分之差等于条件对数似然比的梯度。这一恒等式把 CFG 的线性插值解释为对隐式分类器得分的缩放。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.6.1（得分–似然比恒等式）</strong> 在 (H1)、(H2) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathcal{C}$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)&gt;0$</span> 处有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)-\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)=\\nabla_x\\,\\ell_t(c\\mid x_t).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t(c\\mid x_t)=\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)-\\log p_t(x_t)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 求梯度，两项分别求导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)$</span> 均在 (H1) 下存在且连续。线性性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\ell_t=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)-\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 18.6.2（贝叶斯后验的得分表示）</strong> 在 (H1)、(H2)、(H4) 下，后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(c\\mid x_t)$</span> 的对数梯度满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x\\log q_t(c\\mid x_t)=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)-\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)=\\nabla_x\\ell_t(c\\mid x_t).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由贝叶斯公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(c\\mid x_t)=p_t(x_t\\mid c)p(c)/p_t(x_t)$</span>。取对数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q_t=\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)+\\log p(c)-\\log p_t(x_t)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 求梯度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 无关，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log q_t=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)-\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)$</span>。再由命题 18.6.1 得第二等号。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 18.6.2 表明：条件得分减去无条件得分，恰是后验对数密度的梯度。换言之，网络输出的差值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)$</span> 在理想情形下编码了“给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 时条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 的后验如何随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 变化”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-CFG-作为隐式分类器引导的近似\">CFG 作为隐式分类器引导的近似<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-CFG-作为隐式分类器引导的近似\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>隐式分类器引导的标准形式是：在无条件得分上加上后验对数密度的梯度，再乘以引导强度。CFG 用网络差值替代该梯度，并用权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 缩放。下面把这一替代写成精确的误差分解。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 18.6.3（隐式分类器引导得分）</strong> 给定权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span>，定义理想引导得分</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_w^{\\mathrm{ICG}}(x_t,c):=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)+w\\,\\nabla_x\\ell_t(c\\mid x_t),$$</div>\n<p>以及 CFG 引导得分</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_w^{\\mathrm{CFG}}(x_t,c):=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)+w\\left(\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)-\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)\\right).$$</div>\n<p>两者在 (H1) 下均有定义。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.6.4（CFG 与 ICG 的误差分解）</strong> 在 (H1)、(H2)、(H3) 下，设网络误差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta_t(x_t,c):=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)+\\sigma_t\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c),\\qquad\n\\delta_t(x_t,\\varnothing):=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+\\sigma_t\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t),$$</div>\n<p>则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)+\\sigma_t s_w^{\\mathrm{ICG}}(x_t,c)\n=w\\left(\\delta_t(x_t,c)-\\delta_t(x_t,\\varnothing)\\right),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\left(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\right)$</span> 为本章 canonical 的 CFG 插值。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=-\\sigma_t\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)-\\delta_t(x_t,c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)=-\\sigma_t\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)-\\delta_t(x_t,\\varnothing)$</span>，代入插值公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=-\\sigma_t\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)-\\delta_t(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\left[-\\sigma_t\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)+\\sigma_t\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)-\\delta_t(x_t,c)+\\delta_t(x_t,\\varnothing)\\right].$$</div>\n<p>整理得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=-\\sigma_t\\left[\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)+w\\left(\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)-\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)\\right)\\right]-w\\left(\\delta_t(x_t,c)-\\delta_t(x_t,\\varnothing)\\right).$$</div>\n<p>右端方括号即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_w^{\\mathrm{ICG}}$</span>，移项即得所述恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 18.6.4 的要点：CFG 与理想 ICG 的偏差恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 乘以两个网络误差之差。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时，若两个误差相等（例如网络对条件与无条件的近似精度一致），偏差消失，CFG 退化为普通条件采样；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时，误差差被放大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 倍。这解释了为什么大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 下采样质量对网络误差敏感。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 18.6.5（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 的退化）</strong> 在命题 18.6.4 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t(x_t,c)=\\delta_t(x_t,\\varnothing)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span>，即 CFG 采样与普通条件采样在得分层面完全一致。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span>，插值公式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing))=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-引导权重的贝叶斯解释-温度缩放\">引导权重的贝叶斯解释：温度缩放<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-引导权重的贝叶斯解释-温度缩放\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 的效应可以用后验的幂变换精确刻画。下面的命题说明：CFG 得分对应的“有效后验”是原后验的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 次幂归一化，即温度缩放的倒数。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.6.6（引导得分的有效后验）</strong> 在 (H1)、(H2)、(H4) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_t^{(w)}(c\\mid x_t):=\\frac{p_t(x_t\\mid c)^w\\,p(c)}{\\sum_{c'\\in\\mathcal{C}}p_t(x_t\\mid c')^w\\,p(c')},$$</div>\n<p>则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathcal{C}$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)&gt;0$</span> 处有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x\\log q_t^{(w)}(c\\mid x_t)=w\\,\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)-\\nabla_x\\log\\!\\left(\\sum_{c'\\in\\mathcal{C}}p_t(x_t\\mid c')^w p(c')\\right).$$</div>\n<p>特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t^{(1)}=q_t$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t^{(w)}$</span> 对似然更高的条件赋予更大质量。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t^{(w)}$</span> 取对数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log q_t^{(w)}(c\\mid x_t)=w\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)+\\log p(c)-\\log Z_w(x_t),\\quad Z_w(x_t):=\\sum_{c'\\in\\mathcal{C}}p_t(x_t\\mid c')^w p(c').$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 求梯度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 无关，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_w$</span> 仅通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid c')$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>。由 (H1) 每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid c')$</span> 连续可微且正，(H4) 保证求和项严格正，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_w&gt;0$</span> 且可微；求导与有限求和交换无需额外条件。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x\\log q_t^{(w)}=w\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)-\\nabla_x\\log Z_w(x_t).$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_1=p_t(x_t)$</span>（由全概率公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)=\\sum_{c'}p_t(x_t\\mid c')p(c')$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log q_t^{(1)}=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)-\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)=\\nabla_x\\ell_t$</span>，与推论 18.6.2 一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_w$</span> 是似然的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 次幂的加权和，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t^{(w)}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid x_t)$</span> 的幂变换归一化，即温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/w$</span> 的锐化。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 18.6.6 与命题 18.6.4 合起来给出本节的主结论：CFG 的插值公式在得分层面等价于在无条件得分上叠加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 倍的后验对数梯度；当网络误差可忽略时，它采样自温度缩放后的后验。注意，这里的“等价”是得分层面的，不是分布层面的：得分匹配只保证在理想条件下生成分布与目标分布一致，有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 与网络误差会引入分布偏移（第 5 节已讨论，本节不再展开）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-具体例子-二类条件的高斯情形\">具体例子：二类条件的高斯情形<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-具体例子-二类条件的高斯情形\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}=\\{+1,-1\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c)=1/2$</span>。设前向边缘为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(x_t\\mid c)=\\mathcal{N}(x_t;\\,c\\,\\mu_t,\\,\\sigma_t^2),\\qquad p_t(x_t)=\\tfrac12\\mathcal{N}(x_t;\\,\\mu_t,\\sigma_t^2)+\\tfrac12\\mathcal{N}(x_t;\\,-\\mu_t,\\sigma_t^2),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t&gt;0$</span>。验证命题 18.6.1 与命题 18.6.6。</p>\n<p>条件得分：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)=-(x_t-c\\mu_t)/\\sigma_t^2$</span>。无条件得分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)=\\frac{\\tfrac12\\mathcal{N}(x_t;\\mu_t,\\sigma_t^2)\\cdot(-(x_t-\\mu_t)/\\sigma_t^2)+\\tfrac12\\mathcal{N}(x_t;-\\mu_t,\\sigma_t^2)\\cdot(-(x_t+\\mu_t)/\\sigma_t^2)}{p_t(x_t)}.$$</div>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(x_t):=\\dfrac{\\mathcal{N}(x_t;\\mu_t,\\sigma_t^2)}{\\mathcal{N}(x_t;-\\mu_t,\\sigma_t^2)}=\\exp\\!\\left(\\dfrac{2\\mu_t x_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\right)$</span>（两高斯方差相同，指数中二次项抵消）。则后验</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_t(+1\\mid x_t)=\\frac{r(x_t)}{1+r(x_t)},\\qquad \\nabla_x\\log q_t(+1\\mid x_t)=\\frac{2\\mu_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{1+r(x_t)}.$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，由命题 18.6.1，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid +1)-\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)=\\frac{-(x_t-\\mu_t)+(x_t-\\mu_t)q_t(+1\\mid x_t)+(x_t+\\mu_t)q_t(-1\\mid x_t)}{\\sigma_t^2}.$$</div>\n<p>利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(-1\\mid x_t)=1-q_t(+1\\mid x_t)$</span>，分子化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{2\\mu_t(1-q_t(+1\\mid x_t))}{\\sigma_t^2}=\\dfrac{2\\mu_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{1+r(x_t)}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log q_t$</span> 一致。命题 18.6.1 得验。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t^{(w)}(+1\\mid x_t)=\\dfrac{r(x_t)^w}{1+r(x_t)^w}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t&gt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r&gt;1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r^w/(1+r^w)\\to 1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span>），即后验锐化至确定性；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t^{(w)}=1/2$</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 不变。这给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的几何意义：它放大后验的 log-odds，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 倍 log-odds 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r^w$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-引导与贝叶斯的关系小结\">引导与贝叶斯的关系小结<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-引导与贝叶斯的关系小结\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合命题 18.6.1、18.6.4、18.6.6，本节建立了如下链条：贝叶斯后验的对数梯度等于条件得分减无条件得分（命题 18.6.1、推论 18.6.2）；隐式分类器引导在该梯度上乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span>；CFG 用网络差值近似该梯度，误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(\\delta_c-\\delta_\\varnothing)$</span>（命题 18.6.4）；理想情形下 CFG 对应后验的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 次幂归一化，即温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/w$</span> 的锐化（命题 18.6.6）。这条链条把 CFG 的插值公式、引导权重的语义与贝叶斯推断精确地联系起来，为后续节的极限行为（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 时后验趋于 one-hot，对应模式选择）与分布偏移分析提供了代数基础。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-引导得分与贝叶斯后验的梯度对齐-一个恒等式\">引导得分与贝叶斯后验的梯度对齐：一个恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-引导得分与贝叶斯后验的梯度对齐-一个恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 18.6.6 给出的是后验幂变换的得分表达式，但它并未直接说明 CFG 引导得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_w^{\\mathrm{CFG}}$</span> 与后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t^{(w)}$</span> 的得分之间差了什么。下面的恒等式把这一差值精确写出，从而把“CFG 近似 ICG”进一步细化为“CFG 近似温度缩放后验的得分，误差由归一化项与网络误差共同构成”。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.6.7（引导得分与锐化后验得分的分解）</strong> 在 (H1)、(H2)、(H4) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathcal{C}$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)&gt;0$</span> 处有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_w^{\\mathrm{CFG}}(x_t,c)=\\nabla_x\\log q_t^{(w)}(c\\mid x_t)+\\nabla_x\\log Z_w(x_t)+w\\left(\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)-\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)\\right)\\Big|_{\\text{网络误差项}},$$</div>\n<p>更精确地，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t(x_t,c)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t(x_t,\\varnothing)$</span> 如命题 18.6.4 所定义，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_w^{\\mathrm{CFG}}(x_t,c)=\\nabla_x\\log q_t^{(w)}(c\\mid x_t)+\\nabla_x\\log Z_w(x_t)-\\frac{w}{\\sigma_t}\\left(\\delta_t(x_t,c)-\\delta_t(x_t,\\varnothing)\\right).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 18.6.4 的证明过程，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=-\\sigma_t s_w^{\\mathrm{ICG}}(x_t,c)-w(\\delta_t(x_t,c)-\\delta_t(x_t,\\varnothing))$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_w^{\\mathrm{CFG}}$</span> 按定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta/\\sigma_t$</span>（在得分参数化下），故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_w^{\\mathrm{CFG}}(x_t,c)=s_w^{\\mathrm{ICG}}(x_t,c)+\\frac{w}{\\sigma_t}\\left(\\delta_t(x_t,c)-\\delta_t(x_t,\\varnothing)\\right).$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，由命题 18.6.6 的证明，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log q_t^{(w)}(c\\mid x_t)=w\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)-\\nabla_x\\log Z_w(x_t)$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_w^{\\mathrm{ICG}}=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)+w\\nabla_x\\ell_t$</span>，代入命题 18.6.1 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_w^{\\mathrm{ICG}}=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)+w(\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)-\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t))=(1-w)\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)+w\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span>。与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log q_t^{(w)}$</span> 相减：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_w^{\\mathrm{ICG}}-\\nabla_x\\log q_t^{(w)}=(1-w)\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)+\\nabla_x\\log Z_w(x_t).$$</div>\n<p>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log Z_w$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_w=\\sum_{c'}p_t(x_t\\mid c')^w p(c')$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_1=p_t(x_t)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log Z_1=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)$</span>，上式右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-1)\\nabla_x\\log p_t+\\nabla_x\\log p_t=\\nabla_x\\log p_t$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_1^{\\mathrm{ICG}}=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log q_t^{(1)}=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)-\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)$</span>，差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)$</span>，一致。对一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span>，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_w^{\\mathrm{CFG}}=s_w^{\\mathrm{ICG}}+\\frac{w}{\\sigma_t}(\\delta_c-\\delta_\\varnothing)$</span> 代入即得所述分解。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 18.6.7 的结构值得注意：右端第一项是锐化后验的得分，第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log Z_w$</span> 是归一化因子的梯度，第三项是网络误差的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w/\\sigma_t$</span> 倍放大。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 且误差为零时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_1^{\\mathrm{CFG}}=\\nabla_x\\log q_t^{(1)}+\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span>，正是普通条件得分，与推论 18.6.5 吻合。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log Z_w$</span> 一般不为零，它刻画了“锐化后验”与“无条件边缘”之间的漂移修正；这正是 CFG 在得分层面偏离纯后验梯度的来源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-引导权重的可加性失效与路径依赖\">引导权重的可加性失效与路径依赖<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-引导权重的可加性失效与路径依赖\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>一个自然的问题是：连续应用两次引导是否等价于一次以乘积权重引导？在得分层面，答案是否定的，因为归一化因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_w$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 而非线性。下面的命题给出精确的复合规则。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.6.8（引导的复合不满足权重相乘）</strong> 在 (H1)、(H2)、(H4) 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_w$</span> 为“以权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 做一次 CFG 得分替换”的算子，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_w s(x_t,c):=s(x_t,\\varnothing)+w(s(x_t,c)-s(x_t,\\varnothing))$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x_t,c)=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x_t,\\varnothing)=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)$</span>。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1,w_2\\ge 0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$T_{w_2}T_{w_1}s(x_t,c)=s(x_t,\\varnothing)+w_1w_2\\left(s(x_t,c)-s(x_t,\\varnothing)\\right),$$</div>\n<p>即在得分层面复合等于权重相乘。然而，若把每次引导视为对后验做一次幂变换，则复合后的有效后验为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t^{(w_1w_2)}$</span>，而两次幂变换的中间归一化因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{w_1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{w_2}$</span> 并不满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{w_1w_2}=Z_{w_1}Z_{w_2}$</span>，故分布层面的复合与得分层面的复合不一致。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 得分层面的复合是线性算子的复合：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{w_2}T_{w_1}s=s_\\varnothing+w_2(s_\\varnothing+w_1(s_c-s_\\varnothing)-s_\\varnothing)=s_\\varnothing+w_1w_2(s_c-s_\\varnothing)$</span>，直接计算得第一结论。分布层面，由命题 18.6.6，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t^{(w_1w_2)}(c\\mid x_t)\\propto p_t(x_t\\mid c)^{w_1w_2}p(c)$</span>，而先做 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1$</span> 再做 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_2$</span> 的复合后验为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\propto (p_t(x_t\\mid c)^{w_1}p(c)/Z_{w_1})^{w_2}p(c)=\\propto p_t(x_t\\mid c)^{w_1w_2}p(c)^{w_2}/Z_{w_1}^{w_2}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c)^{w_2}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{w_1}^{w_2}$</span> 均依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_2$</span>，一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c)$</span> 与常数。故两次幂变换的复合不等于一次幂变换，除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c)$</span> 为均匀且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{w_1}=1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 18.6.8 澄清了一个常见混淆：CFG 的插值公式在得分空间是线性的，因此权重可乘；但它在分布空间对应的是幂变换，幂变换的复合不保持“单一温度”的形式。这解释了为什么在采样中把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 从 1 逐步增大到目标值，与直接以目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 采样，在有限步离散化下会产生不同的轨迹——前者每一步都重新归一化，后者只归一化一次。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-条件先验非均匀时的修正\">条件先验非均匀时的修正<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-条件先验非均匀时的修正\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节与命题 18.6.6 均假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c)$</span> 进入后验，但在 CFG 的 canonical 公式中，网络差值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)$</span> 并不显式包含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c)$</span>。下面的命题说明：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c)$</span> 非均匀时，CFG 的插值实际上隐含了一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c)$</span> 有关的偏移，该偏移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时恰好被抵消，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\neq 1$</span> 时残留。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.6.9（先验偏移）</strong> 在 (H1)、(H2)、(H3)、(H4) 下，设网络精确（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t\\equiv 0$</span>），则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_w^{\\mathrm{CFG}}(x_t,c)=\\nabla_x\\log q_t^{(w)}(c\\mid x_t)+\\nabla_x\\log Z_w(x_t)+(w-1)\\nabla_x\\log p(c).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 18.6.7 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t\\equiv 0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_w^{\\mathrm{CFG}}=s_w^{\\mathrm{ICG}}=\\nabla_x\\log q_t^{(w)}+\\nabla_x\\log Z_w+(1-w)\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)$</span>。而由命题 18.6.6 的证明，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log q_t^{(w)}=w\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)-\\nabla_x\\log Z_w$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_w=\\sum_{c'}p_t(x_t\\mid c')^w p(c')$</span>。把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log Z_w$</span> 展开：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log Z_w=\\frac{\\sum_{c'}p_t(x_t\\mid c')^{w-1}\\nabla_x p_t(x_t\\mid c')p(c')}{Z_w}$</span>，它依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c')$</span> 的加权。直接比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_w^{\\mathrm{ICG}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log q_t^{(w)}$</span> 的表达式：前者为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-w)\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)+w\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span>，后者为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)-\\nabla_x\\log Z_w$</span>，故差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-w)\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)+\\nabla_x\\log Z_w$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c)$</span> 均匀时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_w\\propto\\sum_{c'}p_t(x_t\\mid c')^w$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)$</span> 的关系由全概率公式给出；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c)$</span> 非均匀时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_w$</span> 的梯度中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c')$</span> 的权重不能约去，差值中出现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(w-1)\\nabla_x\\log p(c)$</span> 的残余项（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时为零）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 18.6.9 的实用含义：若训练时条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c)$</span> 非均匀而采样时按 canonical CFG 公式操作，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\neq 1$</span> 会引入一个与先验梯度成正比的漂移；该漂移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时消失，故普通条件采样不受影响。这为后续“引导的变体”节中讨论先验校正项提供了动机。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-一个可检验的恒等式-引导得分的散度\">一个可检验的恒等式：引导得分的散度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-一个可检验的恒等式-引导得分的散度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出一个在工程上可检验的恒等式：CFG 引导得分的散度等于条件得分散度与无条件得分散度的线性组合。这一恒等式在计算概率流 ODE 的瞬时变化率时直接可用，且不涉及后验归一化。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.6.10（散度的线性性）</strong> 在 (H1)、(H2)、(H3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 连续可微且其 Jacobian 的迹可积，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x\\cdot\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\nabla_x\\cdot\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\left(\\nabla_x\\cdot\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\nabla_x\\cdot\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\right),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\cdot$</span> 表示对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的散度（迹 of Jacobian）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 散度是线性算子：对向量场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u,v$</span> 与标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha,\\beta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(\\alpha u+\\beta v)=\\alpha\\nabla\\cdot u+\\beta\\nabla\\cdot v$</span>（在可微性下由乘积法则逐分量求和得）。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=w$</span>，即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 18.6.10 看似平凡，但它排除了一个常见误用：把“目标值相等”当成“梯度相等”。CFG 插值在得分层面是线性的，因此散度也线性；但若有人误以为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)$</span> 的散度相等而无需条件，则命题 18.6.5 的误差项会破坏这一结论——散度线性成立的前提是插值公式本身，而非两个网络输出的近似相等。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>条件得分与无条件得分之差等于条件对数似然比的梯度（命题 18.6.1），亦即贝叶斯后验对数密度的梯度（推论 18.6.2），这是 CFG 与贝叶斯推断之间的恒等桥梁。</li>\n<li>CFG 插值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta=\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)+w(\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing))$</span> 与理想隐式分类器引导得分的偏差恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(\\delta_c-\\delta_\\varnothing)$</span>（命题 18.6.4）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 且两误差相等时退化为普通条件采样（推论 18.6.5）。</li>\n<li>理想情形下，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的引导得分对应后验的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 次幂归一化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t^{(w)}\\propto p_t(x_t\\mid c)^w p(c)$</span>，即温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/w$</span> 的锐化（命题 18.6.6）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 放大后验 log-odds，为后续极限行为与模式崩溃分析提供代数依据。</li>\n<li>引导得分与锐化后验得分之间的差值可精确分解为归一化因子梯度与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w/\\sigma_t$</span> 倍网络误差（命题 18.6.7），这把“CFG 近似 ICG”细化为“CFG 近似温度缩放后验的得分，误差含归一化与网络两部分”。</li>\n<li>得分层面的引导复合满足权重相乘，但分布层面的幂变换复合不满足单一温度形式（命题 18.6.8）；条件先验非均匀时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\neq 1$</span> 引入与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p(c)$</span> 成正比的残余漂移（命题 18.6.9）。</li>\n<li>CFG 插值的散度是条件与无条件散度的线性组合（命题 18.6.10），该恒等式在概率流 ODE 的瞬时变化率计算中直接可用，并警示不得把目标值相等误当作梯度相等。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df18--h-引导的极限行为\">引导的极限行为<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-引导的极限行为\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span> 为以条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 为输入、在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 预测噪声的网络；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing$</span> 为空条件（无条件嵌入）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span> 为引导权重；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\in[0,1)$</span> 为训练时条件置空概率；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span> 为 CFG 组合噪声预测，满足 canonical 公式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=(1-w)\\,\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\,\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c).$$</div>\n<p>本节新引入的符号仅两个，先定义如下。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 18.7.1（引导族）</strong> 对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon^{(w)}$</span> 为上式给出的关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的一族噪声预测。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span>，与之对应的反向 SDE 漂移与概率流 ODE 速度按第 18.1 节的标准构造给出；本节只研究 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon^{(w)}$</span> 本身作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的函数及其诱导的得分场极限，不重复构造 SDE。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 18.7.2（引导得分场）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)$</span> 分别为条件与无条件边缘密度，且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span> 均为正且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>。定义条件得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x_t,c)=\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span>、无条件得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x_t)=\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t(x_t)$</span>，以及引导得分场</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde s^{(w)}_t(x_t,c):=s_t(x_t)+w\\left(s_t(x_t,c)-s_t(x_t)\\right).$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（得分正则性）</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot,c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上局部 Lipschitz 且平方可积于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot)$</span> 之下。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>–<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 一致性）</strong> 存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 无关的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=-\\sigma_t\\,s_t(x_t,c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)=-\\sigma_t\\,s_t(x_t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 几乎处处成立（即网络精确参数化得分，无逼近误差）。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A3（对数密度可微性）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)-\\log p_t(x_t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 连续可微，且其梯度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 下可积。</p>\n<p>这三条假设在本节情境下的成立性说明：A1 是反向 SDE 存在强解的标准要求（第 18.1 节已默认）；A2 是“得分匹配”的理想化表述，用于把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 层面的极限翻译为得分层面的极限，若网络有逼近误差，则本节结论需加误差项，这属于第 18.8 节数值稳定性讨论的范围；A3 保证下面引理 18.7.3 中 Bayes 恒等式逐点成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-一-引导得分场的代数结构\">一、引导得分场的代数结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-一-引导得分场的代数结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>引理 18.7.3（引导得分场是条件与无条件得分的仿射组合）</strong> 在 A1–A3 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde s^{(w)}_t(x_t,c)=(1-w)\\,s_t(x_t)+w\\,s_t(x_t,c).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义 18.7.2 直接展开：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t+w(s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t)=s_t-ws_t+ws_t(\\cdot,c)=(1-w)s_t+ws_t(\\cdot,c)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此引理说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 不是“放大条件得分”，而是把条件得分与无条件得分作凸/仿射插值；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 退化为纯无条件，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 退化为纯条件。这与 canonical 公式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 层面的线性组合完全同构（在 A2 下两边同乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t$</span> 即得）。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 18.7.4（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 的退化恒等式）</strong> 在 A1–A3 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s^{(1)}_t(x_t,c)=s_t(x_t,c)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 成立；相应地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon^{(1)}_\\theta=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span>。这正是 canonical 断言“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 退化为普通条件采样”的得分层表述。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 在引理 18.7.3 中令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-1)s_t+1\\cdot s_t(\\cdot,c)=s_t(\\cdot,c)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-二-w-to-infty-的极限-条件得分的支配与集中\">二、<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 的极限：条件得分的支配与集中<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-二-w-to-infty-的极限-条件得分的支配与集中\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节的核心问题是：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 增大，引导分布向何处集中？下面给出一个可证明的极限陈述，它把“锐化条件分布”精确化为得分场的逐点极限与测度层面的集中。</p>\n<p><strong>定理 18.7.5（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 的得分极限与集中）</strong> 设 A1–A3 成立，且存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m&gt;0$</span> 使对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left\\|s_t(x_t,c)-s_t(x_t)\\right\\|_2\\ge m.$$</div>\n<p>则：</p>\n<p>(i) 对每个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{w\\to\\infty}\\dfrac{\\tilde s^{(w)}_t(x_t,c)}{w}=s_t(x_t,c)-s_t(x_t)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s^{(w)}_t$</span> 的方向当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 充分大时由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t(\\cdot)$</span> 主导；</p>\n<p>(ii) 若进一步假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t(\\cdot)$</span> 的零点集在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 下为零测集，则对任意紧集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\subset\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span>，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W(K,\\delta)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;W$</span> 时</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t\\!\\left(\\left\\{x_t\\in K:\\ \\big\\|\\tilde s^{(w)}_t(x_t,c)\\big\\|\\le \\delta\\right\\}\\mid c\\right)=0.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> (i) 由引理 18.7.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s^{(w)}_t/w=(1/w-1)s_t+s_t(\\cdot,c)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/w\\to0$</span>，故极限为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-s_t+s_t(\\cdot,c)=s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t(\\cdot)$</span>。方向主导性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s^{(w)}_t=w\\left[(s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t(\\cdot))+\\frac{1-w}{w}s_t\\right]=w\\left[(s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t(\\cdot))-\\frac{w-1}{w}s_t\\right]$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 充分大，括号内第二项的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{w-1}{w}\\to1$</span> 有界，而第一项按假设范数下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m&gt;0$</span>，故括号内向量与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t(\\cdot)$</span> 的夹角余弦当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<p>(ii) 由 (i)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde s^{(w)}_t\\|=w\\|(s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t(\\cdot))-\\frac{w-1}{w}s_t\\|$</span>。在紧集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 局部 Lipschitz 故有界，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_t\\|\\le M_K$</span>；又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t(\\cdot)\\|\\ge m$</span>，于是由三角不等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left\\|(s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t(\\cdot))-\\frac{w-1}{w}s_t\\right\\|\\ge m-\\frac{w-1}{w}M_K.$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{w-1}{w}M_K\\le m/2$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge \\frac{2M_K}{2M_K-m}$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2M_K&gt;m$</span>；否则任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge1$</span> 即可），则括号内范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge m/2$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde s^{(w)}_t\\|\\ge wm/2$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W=\\max\\{1,\\,2\\delta/m,\\,\\frac{2M_K}{2M_K-m}\\}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;W$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde s^{(w)}_t\\|&gt;\\delta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 上处处成立，故所论集合为空集，其概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>定理 18.7.5 的假设“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t(\\cdot)\\|\\ge m$</span>”是一个<strong>显式的、可检验的</strong>非退化条件：它排除了条件与无条件得分在支撑上处处相等的退化情形（此时引导无信息可放大）。该条件在条件信息确实改变分布时成立；若它失效，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 的极限可能不集中，这属于第 18.10 节反例节处理的边界情形。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 18.7.6（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 的锐化方向）</strong> 在定理 18.7.5 的假设下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s^{(w)}_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot,c)$</span> 的内积满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left\\langle \\tilde s^{(w)}_t,\\ s_t(\\cdot,c)\\right\\rangle=\\|s_t(\\cdot,c)\\|^2+(w-1)\\left\\langle s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t,\\ s_t(\\cdot,c)\\right\\rangle.$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t,\\,s_t(\\cdot,c)\\rangle&gt;0$</span>（即条件得分相对无条件得分在条件得分方向上有正投影）时，该内积随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 线性增大，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 沿条件得分方向锐化；当该内积为负时锐化方向反转。这给出“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 锐化条件分布”的一个可计算判据，而非笼统断言。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由引理 18.7.3 展开内积：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle (1-w)s_t+ws_t(\\cdot,c),\\,s_t(\\cdot,c)\\rangle=(1-w)\\langle s_t,s_t(\\cdot,c)\\rangle+w\\|s_t(\\cdot,c)\\|^2$</span>。整理得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_t(\\cdot,c)\\|^2+(w-1)(\\|s_t(\\cdot,c)\\|^2-\\langle s_t,s_t(\\cdot,c)\\rangle)=\\|s_t(\\cdot,c)\\|^2+(w-1)\\langle s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t,\\,s_t(\\cdot,c)\\rangle$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-三-w-to--infty-与-w-lt-0-的边界\">三、<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to-\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&lt;0$</span> 的边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-三-w-to--infty-与-w-lt-0-的边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>对称地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to-\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s^{(w)}_t/w\\to -(s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t(\\cdot))$</span>，即引导方向反转，把样本推离条件分布。<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&lt;0$</span> 在数学上良定义（引理 18.7.3 对任意实数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 成立），但其诱导的得分场不再对应任何非负密度的得分（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&lt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-w)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 异号，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s^{(w)}$</span> 一般不是某个概率密度对数的梯度）。这一点必须在采样节（第 18.9 节）作为“引导得分场不总是可积得分场”的警示，本节只记录代数事实：</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.7.7（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&lt;0$</span> 的非可积性判据）</strong> 若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\times\\tilde s^{(w)}_t(x_t,c)\\neq0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge2$</span> 时的旋度判据），则不存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span> 函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s^{(w)}_t=\\nabla F$</span> 在该点邻域成立，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s^{(w)}_t$</span> 不是任何正密度的得分场。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s^{(w)}_t=\\nabla F$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F\\in C^2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\times\\nabla F=0$</span>（混合偏导对称），与假设矛盾。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的作用是把“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&lt;0$</span> 是否合法”从直觉判断变为可计算的旋度检验；具体例子留待第 18.10 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-四-具体例子-一维高斯下的显式极限\">四、具体例子：一维高斯下的显式极限<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-四-具体例子-一维高斯下的显式极限\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 18.7.8</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)=\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid c)=\\mathcal{N}(\\mu,\\sigma^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu\\neq0$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x_t)=-x_t/\\sigma^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x_t\\mid c)=-(x_t-\\mu)/\\sigma^2$</span>。由引理 18.7.3，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde s^{(w)}_t(x_t,c)=-\\frac{x_t}{\\sigma^2}+w\\left(-\\frac{x_t-\\mu}{\\sigma^2}+\\frac{x_t}{\\sigma^2}\\right)=-\\frac{x_t}{\\sigma^2}+\\frac{w\\mu}{\\sigma^2}.$$</div>\n<p>于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s^{(w)}_t$</span> 恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(w\\mu,\\sigma^2)$</span> 的得分。这验证了：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 给出条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(\\mu,\\sigma^2)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 把均值平移至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\mu$</span>（沿条件方向锐化/放大）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 给出无条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma^2)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 时均值发散，与定理 18.7.5 的“得分范数随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 增长”一致（此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t(\\cdot)\\|=\\|\\mu\\|/\\sigma^2=m&gt;0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu\\neq0$</span>）。该例同时说明：在一维高斯族内，CFG 精确等价于均值平移，不存在“分布偏移”以外的非线性效应；非线性效应只在非高斯、多峰情形出现（第 18.5 节已述，本节不重复）。</p>\n<p><strong>数值校验（可运行）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef gaussian_cfg_scores(x, mu, sigma2, w):\n    s_uncond = -x / sigma2\n    s_cond   = -(x - mu) / sigma2\n    s_cfg    = s_uncond + w * (s_cond - s_uncond)\n    return s_uncond, s_cond, s_cfg\n\nx = np.array([0.3, -1.2, 2.0])\nmu, sigma2 = 1.5, 0.7\nfor w in [0.0, 1.0, 2.5]:\n    su, sc, sg = gaussian_cfg_scores(x, mu, sigma2, w)\n    # 解析预期：s_cfg = -(x - w*mu)/sigma2\n    expected = -(x - w * mu) / sigma2\n    assert np.allclose(sg, expected), (w, sg, expected)\n    print(f&quot;w={w}: s_cfg={sg}, expected={expected}, shape={sg.shape}&quot;)\n\n# 极限行为：w 增大时 |s_cfg| 增长，且方向由 mu/sigma2 主导\nw_large = 50.0\n_, _, sg_large = gaussian_cfg_scores(x, mu, sigma2, w_large)\nassert np.all(np.abs(sg_large) &gt; np.abs(gaussian_cfg_scores(x, mu, sigma2, 1.0)[2]))\nprint(&quot;limit check passed: |s_cfg(w=50)| &gt; |s_cfg(w=1)| for all entries&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：三行分别打印 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0,1,2.5$</span> 的得分向量与解析值，形状均为 <code>(3,)</code>；末行打印极限校验通过。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-五-与本章推导链的接口\">五、与本章推导链的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-五-与本章推导链的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 18.7.5 的 (i) 是“CFG = 隐式分类器”推导链（第 18.16 节）的极限环节：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span>，引导得分场的方向由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)-\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)=\\nabla\\log p_t(c\\mid x_t)$</span> 主导（在 A3 下由 Bayes 恒等式逐点成立），即引导在极限中把采样推向“条件似然最大”的区域。本节只证明该方向主导性与集中性，不展开隐式分类器的完整推导——那属于第 18.16 节。同时，定理 18.7.5 的假设“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t(\\cdot)\\|\\ge m$</span>”正是第 18.10 节反例节中“引导过强导致模式崩溃”的失效边界：当该下界在支撑上趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（条件信息在部分区域退化），<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 不再保证集中，反而可能把样本推入得分差近零的鞍区。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-六-w-的连续依赖与得分场族的稳定性\">六、<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的连续依赖与得分场族的稳定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-六-w-的连续依赖与得分场族的稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 的极限刻画为方向主导与范数增长。但采样实际使用的是有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span>，因此必须回答：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 在有限区间内变动时，引导得分场是否连续依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span>？若连续，则有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的采样结果可视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=\\infty$</span> 极限的“软化”，且误差可控。下面给出一个定量稳定性陈述。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.7.9（引导得分场对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的 Lipschitz 依赖）</strong> 设 A1–A3 成立，且对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot,c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上全局有界，界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t&lt;\\infty$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w,w'\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left\\|\\tilde s^{(w)}_t(x_t,c)-\\tilde s^{(w')}_t(x_t,c)\\right\\|_2\\le |w-w'|\\cdot 2M_t.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由引理 18.7.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s^{(w)}_t-\\tilde s^{(w')}_t=(w-w')\\left(s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t(\\cdot)\\right)$</span>。取范数并用三角不等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t(\\cdot)\\|\\le\\|s_t(\\cdot,c)\\|+\\|s_t(\\cdot)\\|\\le 2M_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明：引导得分场作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的函数是全局 Lipschitz 的，Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2M_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 无关。因此有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 与极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=\\infty$</span> 之间的“软化误差”在得分层面正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/w$</span>（因为主导项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t(\\cdot))$</span> 的系数是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span>，而修正项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-w)s_t$</span> 的相对大小是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/w)$</span>）。这为第 18.9 节采样节中“有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 近似极限行为”的误差分析提供了得分层的输入，本节不展开采样误差的完整传播。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 18.7.10（有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的方向偏差界）</strong> 在命题 18.7.9 的假设下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t(\\cdot)\\|\\ge m&gt;0$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_w$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s^{(w)}_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t(\\cdot)$</span> 的夹角。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sin\\theta_w\\le \\frac{2M_t}{|w|\\,m}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定理 18.7.5 证明中的分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s^{(w)}_t=w\\left[(s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t(\\cdot))-\\frac{w-1}{w}s_t\\right]$</span>，括号内第二项范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\frac{|w-1|}{|w|}M_t\\le 2M_t/|w|$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|w|\\ge1$</span>）。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s^{(w)}_t/w$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t(\\cdot)$</span> 的偏差范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 2M_t/|w|$</span>，而后者范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge m$</span>，故夹角正弦 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le (2M_t/|w|)/m$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 18.7.10 给出一个<strong>可检验的定量判据</strong>：要让引导方向与极限方向夹角小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>，只需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|w|\\ge 2M_t/(m\\epsilon)$</span>。这比“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 足够大”的定性说法强，且常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t,m$</span> 都是本节假设中显式出现的量。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\to0$</span>（条件信息退化），所需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 发散，正是第 18.10 节模式崩溃反例的定量根源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-七-极限分布的存在性与集中测度\">七、极限分布的存在性与集中测度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-七-极限分布的存在性与集中测度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前文只在得分层面讨论极限。一个自然的问题是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 时是否存在一个极限<strong>分布</strong>，使得引导采样收敛到它？本节给出一个在紧化意义下的存在性陈述，并明确它与“点质量”的区别。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 18.7.11（引导分布族）</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p^{(w)}_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s^{(w)}_t(\\cdot,c)$</span> 为得分场的概率密度（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge0$</span> 时由引理 18.7.3 的凸组合保证存在性；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&lt;0$</span> 时按命题 18.7.7 未必存在）。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p^{(w)}_T$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 时刻的边缘。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.7.12（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 的紧化极限）</strong> 设 A1–A3 与定理 18.7.5 的假设成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 具有紧支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_c$</span>。则对任意有界连续函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{w\\to\\infty}\\int f(x)\\,\\tilde p^{(w)}_T(x\\mid c)\\,dx=\\int f(x)\\,\\delta_{x^\\star(c)}(dx),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\star(c)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_T(\\cdot,c)-s_T(\\cdot)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_c$</span> 上的唯一零点（若存在）。若该零点不唯一，则极限为这些零点上的等权混合（在对称情形下）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong> 由定理 18.7.5(ii)，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 充分大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p^{(w)}_T(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 在集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x:\\|\\tilde s^{(w)}_T(x,c)\\|\\le\\delta\\}$</span> 上的质量为零。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s^{(w)}_T=0$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-w)s_T+ws_T(\\cdot,c)=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_T(\\cdot,c)-s_T(\\cdot)=\\frac{w-1}{w}s_T$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span>，右端趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_T$</span>，故零点集收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_T(\\cdot,c)-s_T(\\cdot)$</span> 的零点集。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_c$</span> 紧且零点唯一的假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p^{(w)}_T$</span> 的质量集中在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\star(c)$</span> 的任意小邻域内（否则与定理 18.7.5(ii) 矛盾），故弱收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{x^\\star(c)}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的假设“<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 紧支撑”在本节情境下是标准的（数据分布紧支撑，第 18.1 节已默认）；“零点唯一”是一个额外假设，它在多峰条件分布下失效，此时极限是零点集上的混合，而非单点。这精确化了“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 锐化为点质量”的直觉，同时给出失效边界：多峰时极限是混合，不是单峰。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 18.7.13（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 与条件众数的关系）</strong> 在命题 18.7.12 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\star(c)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 的众数（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_T(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 的零点），则引导极限分布集中在条件众数上。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_T(\\cdot,c)-s_T(\\cdot)=\\nabla\\log p_T(\\cdot\\mid c)-\\nabla\\log p_T(\\cdot)=\\nabla\\log p_T(c\\mid\\cdot)$</span>（Bayes）。其零点即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_T(\\cdot\\mid c)=\\nabla\\log p_T(\\cdot)$</span> 的点。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\star$</span> 同时是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 的众数，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_T(x^\\star\\mid c)=0$</span>；又若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\star$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_T(x^\\star)=0$</span>（无条件众数），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_T(\\cdot,c)-s_T(\\cdot)$</span> 在该点为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意推论 18.7.13 的条件是“<span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\star$</span> 同时是条件与无条件众数”，这是一个<strong>强条件</strong>，一般不成立；它只说明在特殊情形下极限与条件众数重合，不能反过来断言“引导极限总是条件众数”。这一区分是第 18.16 节隐式分类器推导链必须小心的点：隐式分类器引导的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_T(c\\mid x)$</span> 的梯度，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_T(x\\mid c)$</span> 的众数。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-八-p_-mathrm-drop-对极限行为的调制\">八、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 对极限行为的调制<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-八-p_-mathrm-drop-对极限行为的调制\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>训练时以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 置空（canonical 断言）。这使网络在无条件输入上也被训练，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 下的期望意义下的无条件得分估计。本节需说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 如何进入极限行为的分析。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.7.14（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 与有效引导权重）</strong> 设训练分布中条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 保留、以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 置空。则在得分匹配的理想化下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)$</span> 估计的是混合得分</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s^{\\mathrm{mix}}_t(x_t)=(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}})\\,s_t(x_t\\mid c)+p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\,s_t(x_t),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x_t)$</span> 为真无条件得分。于是 CFG 的有效引导权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_{\\mathrm{eff}}=w/(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}})$</span>，即</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde s^{(w)}_t=s^{\\mathrm{mix}}_t+w\\left(s_t(\\cdot,c)-s^{\\mathrm{mix}}_t\\right)=(1-w_{\\mathrm{eff}})\\,s_t+w_{\\mathrm{eff}}\\,s_t(\\cdot,c).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 dropout 的期望：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)$</span> 在训练中见到的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}})$</span> 比例的条件样本与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 比例的无条件样本的混合，故其得分估计为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^{\\mathrm{mix}}_t$</span>。代入 CFG 公式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s^{(w)}_t=s^{\\mathrm{mix}}_t+w(s_t(\\cdot,c)-s^{\\mathrm{mix}}_t)$</span>。展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^{\\mathrm{mix}}_t=(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}})s_t(\\cdot,c)+p_{\\mathrm{drop}}s_t$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s^{(w)}_t=(1-w)[(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}})s_t(\\cdot,c)+p_{\\mathrm{drop}}s_t]+w\\,s_t(\\cdot,c)$</span>。整理系数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot,c)$</span> 的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-w)(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}})+w=1-wp_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-w)p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_{\\mathrm{eff}}=w/(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}})$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-w_{\\mathrm{eff}}=1-w/(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}})=(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}}-w)/(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}})$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_{\\mathrm{eff}}=w/(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}})$</span>，两者之和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot,c)$</span> 系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_{\\mathrm{eff}}=w/(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}})$</span> 与上式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-wp_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}=0$</span> 时一致；一般情形下需按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 重新标定，故有效权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_{\\mathrm{eff}}=w/(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的意义：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}&gt;0$</span> 使网络的无条件得分估计偏向条件得分，从而<strong>放大</strong>了有效引导权重。这解释了为何训练时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 的选择会改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的语义；在极限分析中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 的行为由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_{\\mathrm{eff}}$</span> 主导，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 只改变达到极限所需的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 阈值，不改变极限本身（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_{\\mathrm{eff}}\\to\\infty$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}&lt;1$</span>）。这一结论与定理 18.7.5 一致：极限由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t(\\cdot)$</span> 主导，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 无关。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-九-极限行为的坐标无关表述\">九、极限行为的坐标无关表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-九-极限行为的坐标无关表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节所有命题均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 的标准坐标下写出。为与第 18.16 节联合生成接口的流形表述衔接，需说明这些结论在坐标变换下的不变性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.7.15（引导得分场的坐标协变性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span> 微分同胚，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y=\\phi(x)$</span>。则引导得分场在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 坐标下为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde s^{(w)}_t(y,c)=\\left(D\\phi(x)\\right)^{-\\top}\\tilde s^{(w)}_t(x,c),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D\\phi$</span> 为 Jacobian，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\cdot)^{-\\top}$</span> 为逆转置。特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 的方向主导性与范数增长在坐标变换下保持（范数按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D\\phi^{-\\top}$</span> 的算子范数缩放）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 得分场在坐标变换下按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(y)=D\\phi(x)^{-\\top}s_t(x)$</span> 变换（链式法则作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_t(\\phi^{-1}(y))$</span>）。由引理 18.7.3 的线性组合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s^{(w)}_t(y)=(1-w)s_t(y)+ws_t(y\\mid c)=D\\phi(x)^{-\\top}[(1-w)s_t(x)+ws_t(x\\mid c)]=D\\phi(x)^{-\\top}\\tilde s^{(w)}_t(x)$</span>。方向主导性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s^{(w)}_t(x)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x,c)-s_t(x)$</span> 夹角小，则经可逆线性映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D\\phi(x)^{-\\top}$</span> 后夹角仍小（因为可逆线性映射不改变“零与非零”的区分，且夹角上界按条件数缩放）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的作用：本节的一维高斯例（例 18.7.8）在坐标变换下给出非高斯、非各向同性的显式极限，从而说明“均值平移”结论不是高斯特有，而是坐标协变性的特例。这为第 18.16 节在流形上的联合生成接口提供了得分层的坐标无关语言。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>引导得分场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s^{(w)}_t=(1-w)s_t+ws_t(\\cdot,c)$</span> 是条件与无条件得分的仿射插值；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 精确退化为条件得分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 退化为无条件得分（引理 18.7.3、推论 18.7.4）。</li>\n<li>在显式非退化假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t(\\cdot)\\|\\ge m&gt;0$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 时引导得分的方向由条件–无条件得分差主导，且其范数随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 线性增长，从而在紧集上把得分范数推到任意大（定理 18.7.5）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 的锐化方向由内积判据 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle s_t(\\cdot,c)-s_t,s_t(\\cdot,c)\\rangle$</span> 的符号决定（推论 18.7.6）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$w&lt;0$</span> 在代数上良定义，但一般不是可积得分场（旋度判据，命题 18.7.7）；一维高斯例给出精确的均值平移极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(w\\mu,\\sigma^2)$</span>，验证了上述全部代数与极限结论（例 18.7.8）。</li>\n<li>引导得分场对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 是全局 Lipschitz 的（命题 18.7.9），有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 与极限方向夹角的正弦有显式上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2M_t/(|w|m)$</span>（推论 18.7.10），给出“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 多大才够”的定量判据。</li>\n<li>在紧支撑与零点唯一假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 的引导分布弱收敛到条件–无条件得分差零点的点质量（命题 18.7.12）；多峰时极限为零点集上的混合，且仅当零点同时是条件与无条件众数时才与条件众数重合（推论 18.7.13）。</li>\n<li>训练 dropout 通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_{\\mathrm{eff}}=w/(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}})$</span> 调制有效引导权重（命题 18.7.14），但不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 的极限；引导得分场在微分同胚下按逆转置 Jacobian 协变（命题 18.7.15），使本节结论可移植到流形接口。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df18--h-数值稳定性\">数值稳定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-数值稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span> 为噪声预测网络，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing$</span> 为空条件，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 为引导权重，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 为训练时条件置空概率，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span> 为 CFG 组合噪声预测。前序节已确立\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\left(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\right).$$</div>\n本节引入如下记号并写入符号表：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_\\theta(x_t,c):=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)$</span>，称为<strong>引导残差</strong>（guidance residual），取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 为数据维度。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,c):=\\nabla_{x_t}\\Delta_\\theta(x_t,c)\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times d}$</span>，称为<strong>残差雅可比</strong>，其第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(i,j)$</span> 元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{x_t^{(j)}}\\Delta_\\theta^{(i)}(x_t,c)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1\\le i,j\\le d$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\theta(x_t,c):=\\nabla_{x_t}\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times d}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing):=\\nabla_{x_t}\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)$</span>，分别为条件与无条件噪声预测的雅可比。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span> 为扩散过程在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的噪声尺度（前序节已定义），<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span> 为终端时刻。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需假设如下，逐条显式列出并在证明中引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可微性与 Lipschitz 性.</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathcal{C}\\cup\\{\\varnothing\\}$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\mapsto\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上连续可微，且存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Lambda_\\theta(x_t,c)\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}\\le L_\\varepsilon$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}$</span> 为谱范数）。由此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,c)\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}\\le 2L_\\varepsilon$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 有界性.</strong> 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{x_t,c}\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)\\|_2\\le B_\\varepsilon$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{x_t,c}\\|\\Delta_\\theta(x_t,c)\\|_2\\le 2B_\\varepsilon$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 采样离散化.</strong> 反向过程采用步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 的显式 Euler–Maruyama 离散，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 步更新为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_{k-1}}=x_{t_k}-\\eta\\, f_\\theta(x_{t_k},t_k)+\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,\\sigma_{t_k}\\,\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_{t_k},c)+\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,\\sigma_{t_k}\\,z_k,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span> 为反向 SDE 漂移（前序节已定义），<span class=\"math-inline\">$z_k\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span> 独立。本节只关心 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 项的数值行为，故将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span> 项视为已给定。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 引导权重范围.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in[0,W_{\\max}]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_{\\max}&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节的核心问题是：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 增大或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0$</span> 时退化时，CFG 组合项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的<strong>单步放大因子</strong>与<strong>累积误差</strong>如何随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 变化。前序节已给出极限行为（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 的分布锐化），本节处理的是有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 下的离散数值稳定性，两者不重复。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-单步放大因子的精确表达\">单步放大因子的精确表达<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-单步放大因子的精确表达\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1（单步引导增益）.</strong> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,c$</span>，定义标量\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G(x_t,c):=\\frac{\\|\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)\\|_2}{\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\|_2},$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\neq 0$</span> 时取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,\\infty)$</span>；当分母为零时约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G=+\\infty$</span>（若分子非零）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G=0$</span>（若分子亦为零）。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 为<strong>单步引导增益</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（增益的三角不等式上界）.</strong> 在 (A2) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,c$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G(x_t,c)\\le 1+w\\cdot\\frac{\\|\\Delta_\\theta(x_t,c)\\|_2}{\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\|_2}.$$</div>\n特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\|_2\\ge \\delta&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Delta_\\theta(x_t,c)\\|_2\\le 2B_\\varepsilon$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G\\le 1+2wB_\\varepsilon/\\delta$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由 CFG 公式，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\Delta_\\theta.$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_2$</span> 范数并用三角不等式：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|_2\\le\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\|_2+w\\|\\Delta_\\theta\\|_2.$$</div>\n两边除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\|_2$</span> 即得第一式；第二式由 (A2) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Delta_\\theta\\|_2\\le 2B_\\varepsilon$</span> 代入。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1 说明：增益关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 是<strong>仿射</strong>的，斜率由残差与无条件预测的范数比决定。当无条件预测在某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 处接近零（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近终端、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 很大时噪声预测趋于零均值），斜率爆炸，这正是数值不稳定的来源之一。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（增益的梯度放大）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的雅可比为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\Lambda_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\Lambda_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\,\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,c),$$</div>\n且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\tilde\\Lambda_\\theta(x_t,c)\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}\\le L_\\varepsilon(1+2w).$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 对 CFG 公式逐分量求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{x_t^{(j)}}$</span>，由 (A1) 中连续可微性，求导与线性组合可交换：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_{x_t^{(j)}}\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta^{(i)}=\\partial_{x_t^{(j)}}\\varepsilon_\\theta^{(i)}(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\left(\\partial_{x_t^{(j)}}\\varepsilon_\\theta^{(i)}(x_t,c)-\\partial_{x_t^{(j)}}\\varepsilon_\\theta^{(i)}(x_t,\\varnothing)\\right),$$</div>\n即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\Lambda_\\theta=\\Lambda_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)+w\\Sigma_\\theta$</span>。取谱范数，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\tilde\\Lambda_\\theta\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}\\le\\|\\Lambda_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}+w\\|\\Sigma_\\theta\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}\\le L_\\varepsilon+w\\cdot 2L_\\varepsilon.$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 1 是本节主定理的基础：它把 CFG 的<strong>空间局部 Lipschitz 常数</strong>从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\varepsilon$</span> 放大到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\varepsilon(1+2w)$</span>。在显式 Euler 离散中，这个常数直接进入单步误差传播。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-主定理-离散更新的单步误差界\">主定理：离散更新的单步误差界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-主定理-离散更新的单步误差界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 1（CFG 显式 Euler 的单步误差界）.</strong> 设 (A1)–(A4) 成立。记精确反向 SDE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_{k-1},t_k]$</span> 上的解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_{k-1}}$</span>，Euler 近似为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{t_{k-1}}$</span>，二者从同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}$</span> 出发。则存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1,C_2&gt;0$</span>（只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\varepsilon,B_\\varepsilon,\\sigma_{t_k},d$</span>）使得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\left[\\|X_{t_{k-1}}-\\hat x_{t_{k-1}}\\|_2^2\\right]\\le C_1\\eta^2\\left(1+w\\right)^2+C_2\\eta^2 w^2.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta X:=X_{t_{k-1}}-\\hat x_{t_{k-1}}$</span>。精确解满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_{t_{k-1}}=x_{t_k}-\\int_{t_{k-1}}^{t_k}f_\\theta(X_s,s)\\,ds+\\int_{t_{k-1}}^{t_k}\\sigma_s\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(X_s,c)\\,ds+\\int_{t_{k-1}}^{t_k}\\sigma_s\\,dW_s,$$</div>\nEuler 近似满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_{t_{k-1}}=x_{t_k}-\\eta f_\\theta(x_{t_k},t_k)+\\eta\\sigma_{t_k}\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_{t_k},c)+\\sigma_{t_k}(W_{t_{k-1}}-W_{t_k}).$$</div>\n两式相减，布朗项相消：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta X=-\\int_{t_{k-1}}^{t_k}\\left[f_\\theta(X_s,s)-f_\\theta(x_{t_k},t_k)\\right]ds+\\int_{t_{k-1}}^{t_k}\\left[\\sigma_s\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(X_s,c)-\\sigma_{t_k}\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_{t_k},c)\\right]ds.$$</div>\n对第二项用三角不等式拆为两项：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left\\|\\sigma_s\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(X_s,c)-\\sigma_{t_k}\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_{t_k},c)\\right\\|_2\\le \\sigma_{t_k}\\left\\|\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(X_s,c)-\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_{t_k},c)\\right\\|_2+|\\sigma_s-\\sigma_{t_k}|\\,\\|\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(X_s,c)\\|_2.$$</div>\n由推论 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\varepsilon(1+2w)$</span>，故第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le \\sigma_{t_k}L_\\varepsilon(1+2w)\\|X_s-x_{t_k}\\|_2$</span>。由 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|_2\\le B_\\varepsilon(1+2w)$</span>，故第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le |\\sigma_s-\\sigma_{t_k}|B_\\varepsilon(1+2w)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span> 项用其 Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_f$</span>（前序节已假设反向漂移 Lipschitz），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f_\\theta(X_s,s)-f_\\theta(x_{t_k},t_k)\\|_2\\le L_f(\\|X_s-x_{t_k}\\|_2+|s-t_k|)$</span>。</p>\n<p>将上述界代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta X$</span> 的表达式，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_2$</span> 范数并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a+b)^2\\le 2a^2+2b^2$</span>，再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in[t_{k-1},t_k]$</span> 积分。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|X_s-x_{t_k}\\|_2\\le \\|X_s-X_{t_k}\\|_2+\\|\\Delta X\\|_2$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|X_s-X_{t_k}\\|_2^2\\le C\\sigma_{t_k}^2|s-t_k|$</span>（反向 SDE 的局部方差界，由 (A2) 与有界扩散系数得），对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\Delta X\\|_2^2$</span> 用 Gronwall 不等式（离散形式，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>）吸收 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|X_s-x_{t_k}\\|_2$</span> 项，得到\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\Delta X\\|_2^2\\le C_1\\eta^2\\left(L_f+\\sigma_{t_k}L_\\varepsilon(1+2w)\\right)^2+C_2\\eta^2\\left(B_\\varepsilon(1+2w)\\right)^2.$$</div>\n将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+2w)^2\\le 2(1+w)^2$</span> 代入并合并常数，即得所述形式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>定理 1 的关键结构是：误差界中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+w)^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w^2$</span> 两种方式出现，前者来自 Lipschitz 放大（推论 1），后者来自幅值放大（命题 1）。这说明<strong>增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 同时放大局部斜率与局部幅值</strong>，二者不可分离。在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 下，误差关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 是二次增长的；若要保持误差有界，必须令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 反比缩小，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=O(1/w)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（稳定步长尺度）.</strong> 在定理 1 的条件下，若要求单步均方误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon^2$</span>，则需\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\eta\\le \\frac{\\epsilon}{\\sqrt{C_1}(1+w)+\\sqrt{C_2}\\,w}.$$</div>\n特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\gg 1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=O(\\epsilon/w)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 将定理 1 的界设为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\epsilon^2$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 解二次不等式，取正根并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}\\le a+b$</span> 放缩。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 2 给出可操作的工程判据：引导权重加倍，步长须减半以上。这与前序节“引导权重”中讨论的分布锐化形成对照——锐化是<strong>分布层面</strong>的效应，而这里是<strong>离散层面</strong>的误差累积，两者独立发生。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-终端噪声尺度退化与增益爆炸\">终端噪声尺度退化与增益爆炸<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-终端噪声尺度退化与增益爆炸\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已指出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0$</span> 时趋于零。在反向采样中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 递减到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 递减。命题 1 的分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\|_2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0$</span> 时是否退化，取决于网络在低噪声端的输出。若网络满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\to 0$</span>（例如参数化使得噪声预测在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处为零），则增益 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 在终端附近无界。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（终端增益爆炸的必要条件）.</strong> 设 (A2) 成立，且存在序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_n}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_{t_n},\\varnothing)\\|_2\\to 0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Delta_\\theta(x_{t_n},c_n)\\|_2\\ge\\delta&gt;0$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G(x_{t_n},c_n)\\to\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由命题 1 第一式，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G\\ge \\frac{\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)+w\\Delta_\\theta\\|_2}{\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)\\|_2}\\ge \\frac{w\\|\\Delta_\\theta\\|_2-\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)\\|_2}{\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)\\|_2}=\\frac{w\\|\\Delta_\\theta\\|_2}{\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)\\|_2}-1,$$</div>\n其中第二个不等号用了反向三角不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|a+b\\|_2\\ge\\|b\\|_2-\\|a\\|_2$</span>。当分母趋于零而分子下界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\delta&gt;0$</span> 时，右端趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 说明：终端增益爆炸不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的函数性质，而是<strong>网络在低噪声端的行为</strong>与<strong>残差非零</strong>的联合后果。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_\\theta$</span> 在终端也趋于零（即条件与无条件预测在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0$</span> 时一致），则爆炸不发生。这给出一个可检验的设计准则：条件 dropout 训练应使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 在低噪声端共享终端行为。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-具体例子-一维线性网络\">具体例子：一维线性网络<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-具体例子-一维线性网络\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 1.</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，设\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=a(c)\\,x_t,\\qquad \\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)=a(\\varnothing)\\,x_t,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(c),a(\\varnothing)\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span> 为常数。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_\\theta(x_t,c)=(a(c)-a(\\varnothing))x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=a(c)-a(\\varnothing)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)=a(\\varnothing)$</span>。CFG 组合为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\left[a(\\varnothing)+w(a(c)-a(\\varnothing))\\right]x_t=:\\tilde a(w)\\,x_t.$$</div>\n单步增益 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G=|\\tilde a(w)|/|a(\\varnothing)|$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(\\varnothing)\\neq 0$</span>）。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(\\varnothing)=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a(c)=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=3$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde a=0.1+3\\cdot 0.4=1.3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G=13$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=10$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde a=4.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G=41$</span>。验证命题 1：<span class=\"math-inline\">$1+w|\\Delta|/|\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)|=1+3\\cdot 0.4/0.1=13$</span>，取等号（一维情形三角不等式为等式）。验证推论 1：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\Lambda\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}=|\\tilde a|=1.3\\le L_\\varepsilon(1+2w)$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\varepsilon=0.5$</span>，右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=0.5\\cdot 7=3.5$</span>，成立。</p>\n<p>此例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde a(w)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 线性增长，故若反向 SDE 的漂移含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 项且步长固定，离散更新 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{k-1}}=(1-\\eta\\tilde a(w))x_{t_k}+\\cdots$</span> 的乘子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|1-\\eta\\tilde a(w)|$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\tilde a(w)&gt;2$</span> 时超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，显式 Euler 发散。这直接验证推论 2：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=3$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\tilde a=0.13&lt;2$</span> 稳定；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=10$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\tilde a=0.41&lt;2$</span> 仍稳定；但若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=10$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\tilde a=2.05&gt;2$</span>，发散。数值实验可在代码节复现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-数值稳定的三条操作准则\">数值稳定的三条操作准则<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-数值稳定的三条操作准则\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>由命题 1、定理 1、推论 2 与命题 2，可提炼三条彼此独立、各有数学依据的准则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>步长–权重耦合</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\le \\epsilon/\\left(\\sqrt{C_1}(1+w)+\\sqrt{C_2}w\\right)$</span>（推论 2）。这是误差界层面的硬约束，与网络具体参数无关，只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\varepsilon,B_\\varepsilon$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>终端残差收缩</strong>：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0$</span> 处令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Delta_\\theta(x_t,c)\\|_2\\to 0$</span>，即条件与无条件预测在低噪声端重合（命题 2）。这消除了增益爆炸的必要条件，但不改变中高噪声端的锐化效应。</li>\n<li><strong>幅值截断</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|_2$</span> 超过阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>，按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta\\leftarrow M\\,\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta/\\|\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|_2$</span> 截断。截断后 (A2) 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_\\varepsilon$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 替代，定理 1 的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2$</span> 相应缩小，但截断引入的偏差需单独分析（属后续“引导的变体”节范围，本节不展开）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>三条准则互不替代：准则 1 控制离散误差，准则 2 控制增益分母，准则 3 控制幅值上界。同时违反两条以上时，定理 1 的界不再适用，需回到命题 1 与命题 2 逐点判断。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>CFG 组合噪声预测的单步增益 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 仿射增长（命题 1），其雅可比的谱范数上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\varepsilon(1+2w)$</span>（推论 1），二者共同构成显式 Euler 单步均方误差界中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+w)^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w^2$</span> 两个放大项（定理 1）。</li>\n<li>稳定步长与引导权重成反比：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\gg 1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=O(\\epsilon/w)$</span>（推论 2）；终端噪声尺度退化时若残差非零则增益无界（命题 2），消除该爆炸需令条件与无条件预测在低噪声端重合。</li>\n<li>一维线性网络例给出增益与乘子的精确闭式，验证了命题 1 取等、推论 1 成立，并给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\tilde a(w)&gt;2$</span> 时显式 Euler 发散的判据，与推论 2 的步长约束一致。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\n# 例 1：一维线性网络，验证命题 1、推论 1、推论 2 的数值行为\na_uncond = 0.1\na_cond = 0.5\nL_eps = 0.5  # 谱范数上界，一维即 |a|\n\nfor w in [1.0, 3.0, 10.0]:\n    delta = a_cond - a_uncond\n    a_tilde = a_uncond + w * delta\n    G = abs(a_tilde) / abs(a_uncond)\n    # 命题 1 上界\n    bound = 1 + w * abs(delta) / abs(a_uncond)\n    assert G &lt;= bound + 1e-12, (w, G, bound)\n    # 推论 1 上界\n    assert abs(a_tilde) &lt;= L_eps * (1 + 2 * w) + 1e-12\n    print(f&quot;w={w:5.1f}  a_tilde={a_tilde:6.2f}  G={G:6.2f}  bound={bound:6.2f}&quot;)\n\n# 显式 Euler 乘子稳定性：|1 - eta * a_tilde| &lt;= 1\neta = 0.1\nfor w in [1.0, 3.0, 10.0]:\n    a_tilde = a_uncond + w * (a_cond - a_uncond)\n    mult = abs(1 - eta * a_tilde)\n    print(f&quot;eta={eta}  w={w:5.1f}  multiplier={mult:6.3f}  stable={mult &lt;= 1}&quot;)\n\n# 验证 eta=0.5, w=10 时发散\neta_bad = 0.5\nw_bad = 10.0\na_tilde_bad = a_uncond + w_bad * (a_cond - a_uncond)\nmult_bad = abs(1 - eta_bad * a_tilde_bad)\nassert mult_bad &gt; 1, mult_bad\nprint(f&quot;eta={eta_bad}  w={w_bad}  multiplier={mult_bad:6.3f}  -&gt; 发散&quot;)\n\n# 推论 2 步长上界（取 C1=C2=1, epsilon=0.1 的示意常数）\neps = 0.1\nC1, C2 = 1.0, 1.0\nfor w in [1.0, 3.0, 10.0]:\n    eta_max = eps / (np.sqrt(C1) * (1 + w) + np.sqrt(C2) * w)\n    print(f&quot;w={w:5.1f}  eta_max={eta_max:.4f}&quot;)\n\n# 终端增益爆炸：a_uncond -&gt; 0, delta 固定\nfor a_u in [0.1, 0.01, 0.001]:\n    delta = 0.4\n    w = 3.0\n    a_tilde = a_u + w * delta\n    G = abs(a_tilde) / abs(a_u)\n    print(f&quot;a_uncond={a_u:.3f}  G={G:.1f}&quot;)\n\nprint(&quot;all asserts passed&quot;)\n\n</code></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-多步累积误差与-w-的二次增长\">多步累积误差与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的二次增长<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-多步累积误差与-w-的二次增长\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 1 只给出单步界。采样需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=T/\\eta$</span> 步，误差沿步数累积。若每步误差界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\eta^2(1+w)^2$</span> 且无误差放大，则总误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N\\eta^2(1+w)^2)=O(T\\eta(1+w)^2)$</span>，随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\to 0$</span> 收敛。但推论 1 表明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数被放大到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\varepsilon(1+2w)$</span>，这使误差在步间<strong>传播</strong>而非简单相加。下面把这一传播写成显式递推。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（误差传播递推）.</strong> 设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{t_k}$</span> 为 Euler 近似，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_k}$</span> 为精确解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k:=\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat x_{t_k}-X_{t_k}\\|_2^2$</span>。则存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_1,K_2&gt;0$</span>（依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_f,L_\\varepsilon,B_\\varepsilon,\\sigma_{t_k},d$</span>）使得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta_{k-1}\\le (1+\\eta K_1(1+w)^2)\\,\\delta_k+\\eta^2 K_2(1+w)^2+\\eta^2 K_2 w^2.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_k:=\\hat x_{t_k}-X_{t_k}$</span>。Euler 更新与精确解的差可写为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e_{k-1}=e_k-\\eta\\left[f_\\theta(\\hat x_{t_k},t_k)-f_\\theta(X_{t_k},t_k)\\right]-\\eta\\sigma_{t_k}\\left[\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\hat x_{t_k},c)-\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(X_{t_k},c)\\right]+R_k,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_k$</span> 为定理 1 中已界定的单步截断项，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|R_k\\|_2^2\\le C_1\\eta^2(1+w)^2+C_2\\eta^2w^2$</span>。对前两项用 Lipschitz 性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span> 的常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_f$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\varepsilon(1+2w)$</span>（推论 1）。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|e_{k-1}\\|_2\\le\\|e_k\\|_2+\\eta L_f\\|e_k\\|_2+\\eta\\sigma_{t_k}L_\\varepsilon(1+2w)\\|e_k\\|_2+\\|R_k\\|_2.$$</div>\n令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho:=1+\\eta\\left(L_f+\\sigma_{t_k}L_\\varepsilon(1+2w)\\right)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|e_{k-1}\\|_2\\le\\rho\\|e_k\\|_2+\\|R_k\\|_2$</span>。两边平方并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a+b)^2\\le(1+\\eta K_1)a^2+(1+1/(\\eta K_1))b^2$</span>（对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_1&gt;0$</span>），取期望：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta_{k-1}\\le(1+\\eta K_1)\\rho^2\\delta_k+\\left(1+\\frac{1}{\\eta K_1}\\right)\\mathbb{E}\\|R_k\\|_2^2.$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_1$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+\\eta K_1)\\rho^2\\le 1+\\eta K_1(1+w)^2$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^2=1+2\\eta(\\cdots)+\\eta^2(\\cdots)^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+2w)^2\\le 4(1+w)^2$</span> 可做到，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K_1$</span> 吸收 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_f,L_\\varepsilon,\\sigma_{t_k}$</span> 的常数），第二项用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|R_k\\|_2^2$</span> 的界并取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_2$</span> 足够大吸收 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(\\eta K_1)$</span> 因子，即得所述递推。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>递推的解为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta_0\\le \\rho_{\\mathrm{total}}^N\\delta_N+\\sum_{j=0}^{N-1}\\rho_{\\mathrm{total}}^j\\,\\eta^2\\left[K_2(1+w)^2+K_2w^2\\right],$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_{\\mathrm{total}}:=1+\\eta K_1(1+w)^2$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\eta=T$</span> 固定、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\to 0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_{\\mathrm{total}}^N\\to e^{K_1T(1+w)^2}$</span>，求和项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to \\eta K_2T[(1+w)^2+w^2]/\\eta\\cdot\\eta$</span> 的极限为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\eta)$</span>。故总误差\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta_0=O\\!\\left(\\eta\\,T\\,K_2\\left[(1+w)^2+w^2\\right]e^{K_1T(1+w)^2}\\right).$$</div>\n这里出现了<strong>指数因子</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{K_1T(1+w)^2}$</span>，它是命题 3 与前序单步界的关键区别：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 不仅以多项式方式放大局部误差，还以指数方式放大误差的<strong>累积传播</strong>。这与常微分方程数值分析中刚性问题的稳定性分析同构：Lipschitz 常数越大，稳定域越小，累积误差的指数放大越显著。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（临界权重）.</strong> 在命题 3 的设定下，若要求总误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_0\\le\\epsilon^2$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 固定，则存在临界权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_c$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;w_c$</span> 时误差界超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon^2$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_c$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$K_1T(1+w_c)^2=\\log\\frac{\\epsilon^2}{\\eta T K_2[(1+w_c)^2+w_c^2]}.$$</div>\n当右端对数项随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_c$</span> 缓变时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_c=O(\\sqrt{\\log(1/\\eta)}/\\sqrt{T})$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 将总误差界设为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon^2$</span> 并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 解方程；对数项对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的依赖为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\log w)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\gg1$</span> 时被左侧二次项主导，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_c$</span> 的量级由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_1T w_c^2\\approx\\log(\\epsilon^2/(\\eta T K_2 w_c^2))$</span> 给出，取对数主项得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_c=O(\\sqrt{\\log(1/\\eta)}/\\sqrt{T})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 3 的实践含义：在固定步长与固定采样时长下，引导权重存在一个由<strong>误差传播指数</strong>决定的上限，超过它则离散解偏离精确反向 SDE。这与前序节“引导的极限行为”中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 的<strong>分布层面</strong>锐化不矛盾：分布锐化是精确 SDE 的性质，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_c$</span> 是离散近似保持该性质有效的<strong>数值门槛</strong>。两者是不同层次的对象，不可混为一谈。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-条件-dropout-对数值稳定性的作用\">条件 dropout 对数值稳定性的作用<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-条件-dropout-对数值稳定性的作用\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已确立训练时以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 置空。这一操作在数值稳定性上有独立于分布偏移的效应：它使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 成为条件预测的<strong>凸组合锚点</strong>，从而约束残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_\\theta$</span> 的幅值。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（dropout 下的残差期望界）.</strong> 设训练分布中条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 被替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing$</span>，且网络在训练中最小化噪声预测的均方误差。则在 (A2) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,c$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{c\\sim p_{\\mathrm{data}}}\\left[\\|\\Delta_\\theta(x_t,c)\\|_2^2\\right]\\le \\frac{2B_\\varepsilon^2}{1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}}}.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(x_t,c;\\theta):=\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{target}}(x_t,c)\\|_2^2$</span> 为条件分支损失，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L(x_t,\\varnothing;\\theta)$</span> 为无条件分支损失。dropout 训练的总损失为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}=(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}})\\mathbb{E}_{c}\\left[L(x_t,c;\\theta)\\right]+p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\mathbb{E}_{c}\\left[L(x_t,\\varnothing;\\theta)\\right].$$</div>\n在最优解处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 最小化第二项，故它是条件目标在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 上的某种平均（具体形式依赖目标分布，此处只用其有界性）。由 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)\\|_2\\le B_\\varepsilon$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)\\|_2\\le B_\\varepsilon$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Delta_\\theta\\|_2^2\\le\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)\\|_2^2+\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)\\|_2^2+2\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)\\|_2\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)\\|_2\\le 4B_\\varepsilon^2$</span>。取期望并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}})\\ge 1$</span> 放缩即得所述界（常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 为保守估计）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 的意义在于：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 越大，残差期望界越松（分母越小），但这只是<strong>上界</strong>的放缩，不代表实际残差增大。真正的稳定性效应来自另一侧：dropout 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 必须同时拟合所有条件的平均目标，故它在低噪声端的幅值不会因单一条件而退化到零——这恰好是命题 2 中增益爆炸的反条件。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 在数值稳定性上扮演<strong>双刃</strong>角色：过大则无条件分支欠拟合（残差界松），过小则无条件分支在终端退化（增益爆炸）。二者之间存在由 (A2) 与命题 2 共同确定的工作区间，其精确边界依赖具体网络，本节不给出闭式，只指出该区间由两个独立约束夹逼。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-与反向-SDE-漂移项的耦合\">与反向 SDE 漂移项的耦合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-与反向-SDE-漂移项的耦合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已定义反向 SDE 漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span>。CFG 只修改扩散项系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>，不修改 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span>。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span> 通常显式含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>，故 CFG 是否应同时修改 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span> 是一个必须澄清的数值问题。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（漂移项不修改的误差代价）.</strong> 设反向 SDE 漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\alpha_t x_t+\\beta_t\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t,\\beta_t$</span> 为给定标量函数），而扩散项用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>。则精确 CFG 反向 SDE 与“仅改扩散项”的近似 SDE 之间的漂移差为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta f=\\beta_t\\left[\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)-\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)\\right]=-\\beta_t w\\Delta_\\theta(x_t,c).$$</div>\n其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_2$</span> 范数上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\beta_t|w\\cdot 2B_\\varepsilon$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 直接代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span> 的表达式与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的定义，相减即得。取范数用 (A2)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 说明：若漂移项保留无条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 而扩散项用 CFG 组合，则两条 SDE 的漂移差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 线性增长。这一差在数值上表现为<strong>漂移–扩散不匹配</strong>：Euler 更新的确定性部分与随机部分来自不同的噪声预测。定理 1 的误差界只覆盖扩散项，未覆盖此项；若把漂移也改为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>，则漂移的 Lipschitz 常数同样被放大到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\varepsilon(1+2w)$</span>，定理 1 的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1$</span> 相应增大，但漂移–扩散匹配消除。两种选择各有代价：保留无条件漂移则引入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(w)$</span> 的模型偏差，改为组合漂移则引入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(w)$</span> 的 Lipschitz 放大。数值稳定性分析必须明确所选约定，不能默认其一。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-数值稳定的判据汇总\">数值稳定的判据汇总<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-数值稳定的判据汇总\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>把本节各命题的条件整理为可检验的判据表（不引入新符号，只引用已定义量）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>数学依据</th>\n<th>检验对象</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\tilde a(w)\\le 2$</span>（一维线性）</td>\n<td>例 1 乘子分析</td>\n<td>显式 Euler 乘子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\le\\epsilon/[\\sqrt{C_1}(1+w)+\\sqrt{C_2}w]$</span></td>\n<td>推论 2</td>\n<td>单步均方误差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\le w_c$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_c=O(\\sqrt{\\log(1/\\eta)}/\\sqrt{T})$</span></td>\n<td>推论 3</td>\n<td>多步累积误差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Delta_\\theta(x_t,c)\\|_2\\to 0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0$</span></td>\n<td>命题 2</td>\n<td>终端增益分母</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 处于双刃区间</td>\n<td>命题 4 与命题 2</td>\n<td>残差界与终端退化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漂移项约定显式声明</td>\n<td>命题 5</td>\n<td>漂移–扩散匹配</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>这张表把本节从“单步增益”到“多步累积”再到“训练侧 dropout”的论证串成一条链：命题 1 给出增益的代数结构，推论 1 给出雅可比放大，定理 1 给出单步界，命题 3 把单步界提升为多步递推，推论 3 从中读出临界权重，命题 2 与命题 4 处理终端与训练侧的边界，命题 5 澄清漂移项的约定。每一环都有显式假设与逐步证明，缺任一环则数值稳定性论断不完整。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\n# 命题 3：多步误差递推的数值验证（一维线性网络，显式 Euler）\na_uncond, a_cond = 0.1, 0.5\nL_eps = 0.5\nL_f = 1.0\nsigma_t = 1.0\nT = 1.0\neta = 0.01\nN = int(T / eta)\n\ndef simulate(w, eta, N, x0=1.0, seed=0):\n    rng = np.random.default_rng(seed)\n    a_tilde = a_uncond + w * (a_cond - a_uncond)\n    x = x0\n    for _ in range(N):\n        # 简化反向更新：漂移用无条件，扩散用 CFG 组合\n        drift = a_uncond * x\n        diff = a_tilde * x\n        x = x - eta * drift + np.sqrt(eta) * sigma_t * diff * rng.standard_normal()\n    return x\n\n# 同一随机种子下不同 w 的终端值离散度\nfor w in [1.0, 3.0, 10.0]:\n    vals = [simulate(w, eta, N, seed=s) for s in range(200)]\n    print(f&quot;w={w:5.1f}  mean={np.mean(vals):8.3f}  std={np.std(vals):8.3f}&quot;)\n\n# 推论 3 临界权重的量级检查：固定 eta, T，看误差随 w 的增长\nK1, K2 = 1.0, 1.0\neps = 0.5\nfor w in [1.0, 3.0, 10.0]:\n    bound = eta * T * K2 * ((1 + w)**2 + w**2) * np.exp(K1 * T * (1 + w)**2)\n    print(f&quot;w={w:5.1f}  error_bound={bound:.3e}  exceeds_eps={bound &gt; eps**2}&quot;)\n\n# 命题 4：dropout 概率对残差界的影响（示意常数 B_eps=1）\nB_eps = 1.0\nfor p_drop in [0.0, 0.1, 0.5, 0.9]:\n    if p_drop &lt; 1.0:\n        bound = 2 * B_eps**2 / (1 - p_drop)\n        print(f&quot;p_drop={p_drop:.1f}  residual_bound={bound:.2f}&quot;)\n\n# 命题 5：漂移-扩散不匹配的范数上界\nbeta_t = 0.5\nfor w in [1.0, 3.0, 10.0]:\n    mismatch = abs(beta_t) * w * 2 * B_eps\n    print(f&quot;w={w:5.1f}  drift_mismatch_bound={mismatch:.2f}&quot;)\n\nprint(&quot;all checks done&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>代码中 <code>simulate</code> 用简化的一维反向更新演示了同一随机种子下终端值的离散度随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 增长，与命题 3 的指数放大定性一致；<code>error_bound</code> 一列展示推论 3 的界随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 二次–指数增长并在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=10$</span> 时超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon^2$</span>；<code>residual_bound</code> 与 <code>drift_mismatch_bound</code> 分别验证命题 4 与命题 5 的代数界。所有断言均为代数不等式，不依赖随机数，可复现。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df18--h-引导的采样\">引导的采样<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-引导的采样\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为扩散过程在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 的状态，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathcal{C}$</span> 为条件变量（离散或连续），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing$</span> 为无条件占位符，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span> 为噪声预测网络，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span> 为 CFG 组合噪声预测，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span> 为引导权重，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\in[0,1)$</span> 为训练时条件 dropout 概率。记前向过程为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha_t x_0+\\sigma_t \\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span>，信噪比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\alpha_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调递减。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span> 为条件边缘分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 为无条件边缘分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_t\\mid c)$</span> 为网络诱导的参数化分布。</p>\n<p>本节引入的新符号仅一个：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_w$</span> 表示由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 诱导的采样算子（定义见下文定义 9.1）。采样算子作用于初始噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span> 与条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，输出样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0^{\\mathrm{cfg}}$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设如下，逐条列出并在命题中引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可测性与可积性.</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,c)\\mapsto\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}(\\mathbb{R}^d)\\otimes\\mathcal{B}(\\mathcal{C})$</span> 可测，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{q_t(\\cdot\\mid c)}[\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{q_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)}[\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) Lipschitz 与线性增长.</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 全局 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span>-Lipschitz，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)\\|\\le K_t(1+\\|x_t\\|)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t,K_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 局部有界。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 得分匹配误差.</strong> 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t\\ge 0$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\sigma_t s_t(x_t\\mid c)\\|_{L^2(q_t(\\cdot\\mid c))}\\le\\delta_t$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)-\\sigma_t s_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)\\|_{L^2(q_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing))}\\le\\delta_t$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x_t\\mid c)=\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 反向 SDE 的适定性.</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，反向漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t(x_t,c)=-\\tfrac{1}{2}\\beta_t x_t-\\beta_t\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 为前向方差速率）满足 (A2)，从而反向 SDE 有唯一强解。</p>\n<p><strong>(A5) 边界通量消失.</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_t\\mid c)\\|\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q_t(x_t\\mid c)\\|\\to 0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_t\\|\\to\\infty$</span>，保证分部积分合法。</p>\n<p>以下命题均在 (A1)–(A5) 中所需子集下陈述。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-9-1-采样算子与插值公式的相容性\">9.1 采样算子与插值公式的相容性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-9-1-采样算子与插值公式的相容性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 9.1（CFG 采样算子）.</strong> 给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>、条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>、权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span>，CFG 采样算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_w$</span> 定义为反向 SDE</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{d}x_t=\\left[-\\tfrac{1}{2}\\beta_t x_t-\\beta_t\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)\\right]\\mathrm{d}t+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bar W_t,\\qquad x_T=\\alpha_T^{-1}\\big(x_T^{\\mathrm{fwd}}-\\sigma_T\\epsilon\\big),$$</div>\n<p>的强解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 的取值，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar W_t$</span> 为反向时间 Wiener 过程。等价地，用概率流 ODE 表述时</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}x_t}{\\mathrm{d}t}=-\\tfrac{1}{2}\\beta_t x_t-\\beta_t\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c),$$</div>\n<p>其解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 的取值记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_w^{\\mathrm{ODE}}(\\epsilon,c)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.1（采样算子对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的连续性）.</strong> 在 (A1)、(A2)、(A4) 下，对每个固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\epsilon,c)$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\mapsto\\mathcal{S}_w(\\epsilon,c)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,\\infty)$</span> 上连续；进一步，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_w$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)\\otimes\\mu_c)$</span> 中连续，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_c$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 的分布。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_w(x_t,c)=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing))$</span>。由 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_w$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t(1+w)$</span>-Lipschitz，关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 是仿射的。反向 SDE 的解对漂移参数的连续依赖性由 Picard 迭代的标准估计给出：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_n\\to w$</span>，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\big\\|x_t^{(w_n)}-x_t^{(w)}\\big\\|^2\\le C_t\\int_t^T\\mathbb{E}\\big\\|g_{w_n}(x_s^{(w_n)},c)-g_w(x_s^{(w)},c)\\big\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}s,$$</div>\n<p>右端被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{const}\\cdot|w_n-w|^2\\cdot\\sup_s\\mathbb{E}\\|x_s^{(w_n)}\\|^2$</span> 控制（利用 (A2) 的线性增长与 Gronwall），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_n\\sup_s\\mathbb{E}\\|x_s^{(w_n)}\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 由 (A4) 的一致矩界给出。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_n\\to w$</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛，连续性得证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.1（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 的退化）.</strong> 在命题 9.1 的条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_1(\\epsilon,c)$</span> 与普通条件采样算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}^{\\mathrm{cond}}(\\epsilon,c)$</span>（即用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span> 替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的反向 SDE 解）几乎必然相等。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+1\\cdot(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing))=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span>，逐点恒等，故两 SDE 漂移逐点相同，强解唯一性 (A4) 给出几乎必然相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 不是近似而是精确退化，这是插值公式的结构性事实，与得分匹配误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span> 无关。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-9-2-采样分布与引导后验的恒等式\">9.2 采样分布与引导后验的恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-9-2-采样分布与引导后验的恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节的核心可检验恒等式是：CFG 采样分布在得分匹配误差为零时，等于一个显式的“引导后验”分布。为此先给出该后验的定义。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 9.2（引导后验）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度有正密度。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span>，定义引导后验密度</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_t^{(w)}(x_t\\mid c)=\\frac{q_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)^{1-w}\\,q_t(x_t\\mid c)^{w}}{Z_t^{(w)}(c)},\\qquad Z_t^{(w)}(c)=\\int q_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)^{1-w}q_t(x_t\\mid c)^{w}\\,\\mathrm{d}x_t,$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t^{(w)}(c)\\in(0,\\infty)$</span> 时良定义。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.2（引导得分恒等式）.</strong> 在 (A5) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t^{(w)}(c)\\in(0,\\infty)$</span> 下，对几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q_t^{(w)}(x_t\\mid c)=(1-w)\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)+w\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q_t(x_t\\mid c).$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 对定义 9.2 取对数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q_t^{(w)}=(1-w)\\log q_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)+w\\log q_t(\\cdot\\mid c)-\\log Z_t^{(w)}(c)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t^{(w)}(c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 无关，故其梯度为零。逐项求梯度即得。求导合法性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t^{(w)}$</span> 的可微性由 (A5) 保证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int q_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)^{1-w}q_t(\\cdot\\mid c)^w\\,\\mathrm{d}x_t$</span> 关于参数的可微性由 Leibniz 法则给出，被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的梯度被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)^{1-w}q_t(\\cdot\\mid c)^w\\|\\nabla\\log q_t\\|$</span> 控制，而后者可积由 (A5) 与 Hölder 不等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>定理 9.1（CFG 采样分布 = 引导后验，零误差情形）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t=0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\sigma_t s_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span>-几乎处处成立，无条件同理），且 (A1)–(A5) 成立。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t^{(w)}(c)\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>，CFG 反向 SDE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 的边缘分布等于由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 诱导的分布，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_w$</span> 的样本分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 反向 SDE 的漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac{1}{2}\\beta_t x_t-\\beta_t\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t=0$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\sigma_t\\big[(1-w)s_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)+w s_t(x_t\\mid c)\\big]=\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t^{(w)}(x_t\\mid c)$</span>（命题 9.2）。于是反向 SDE 恰为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 为边缘的扩散过程的反向 SDE：其前向对应过程满足 Fokker–Planck 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t q_t^{(w)}=\\nabla\\cdot(\\tfrac{1}{2}\\beta_t x_t q_t^{(w)}+\\beta_t q_t^{(w)}\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t^{(w)})$</span>，而该方程的解正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t^{(w)}$</span>（由定义 9.2 的归一化与命题 9.2 的得分恒等式直接验证）。反向 SDE 的边缘分布因此从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_T^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 演化到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 的端点）.</strong> 在定理 9.1 的条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_1$</span> 的分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_0$</span> 的分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t^{(1)}=q_t(\\cdot\\mid c)/Z_t^{(1)}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t^{(1)}=\\int q_t(\\cdot\\mid c)\\mathrm{d}x_t=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t^{(1)}=q_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 时同理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t^{(0)}=q_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论与推论 9.1 一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 退化为普通条件采样，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 退化为无条件采样，两端点均由同一插值公式统一。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-9-3-引导权重的锐化效应-一个可检验的例子\">9.3 引导权重的锐化效应：一个可检验的例子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-9-3-引导权重的锐化效应-一个可检验的例子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 9.1（高斯混合的锐化）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\{0,1\\}$</span>，先验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi(c)=1/2$</span>。条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0(x_0\\mid c)=\\mathcal{N}(\\mu_c,\\sigma^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=-1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=+1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=1$</span>。取前向过程为方差保持型，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_t\\mid c)=\\mathcal{N}(\\alpha_t\\mu_c,\\alpha_t^2\\sigma^2+\\sigma_t^2)$</span>。无条件边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)=\\tfrac{1}{2}q_t(x_t\\mid 0)+\\tfrac{1}{2}q_t(x_t\\mid 1)$</span>。</p>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_0=1,\\sigma_0=0$</span>）处，引导后验密度为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_0^{(w)}(x_0\\mid c=1)=\\frac{q_0(x_0\\mid\\varnothing)^{1-w}q_0(x_0\\mid 1)^{w}}{Z_0^{(w)}(1)}.$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=2$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0(x_0\\mid\\varnothing)=\\tfrac{1}{2}\\mathcal{N}(-1,1)+\\tfrac{1}{2}\\mathcal{N}(1,1)$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span> 附近，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0(x_0\\mid\\varnothing)\\approx\\tfrac{1}{2}\\mathcal{N}(1,1)$</span>（另一分量在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(-1,1)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span> 的密度，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}}e^{-2}\\approx 0.054$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(1,1)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}}\\approx 0.399$</span>）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0^{(2)}(x_0\\mid 1)\\propto q_0(x_0\\mid\\varnothing)^{-1}q_0(x_0\\mid 1)^{2}$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span> 处，该值与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=-1$</span> 处的比值约为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{q_0(1\\mid\\varnothing)^{-1}q_0(1\\mid 1)^2}{q_0(-1\\mid\\varnothing)^{-1}q_0(-1\\mid 1)^2}\\approx\\frac{(0.453)^{-1}(0.399)^2}{(0.453)^{-1}(0.054)^2}\\approx\\left(\\frac{0.399}{0.054}\\right)^2\\approx 54.6,$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=2$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span> 相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=-1$</span> 的密度比从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx 54.6$</span>（此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时比值即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0(1\\mid 1)/q_0(-1\\mid 1)=0.399/0.054\\approx 7.4$</span> 的平方，注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=2$</span> 时多了一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)^{-1}$</span> 因子，其比值约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.453/0.453=1$</span>）锐化到约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$54.6$</span>。更精确地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=q_0(1\\mid 1)/q_0(-1\\mid 1)\\approx 7.4$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=2$</span> 时比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx 54.6\\approx 7.4^2$</span>。这验证了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 锐化条件分布的定性结论：密度比按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的幂次放大。</p>\n<p><em>验证.</em> 上述数值仅用于核对幂次关系，公式本身由定义 9.2 与命题 9.2 严格给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此例同时说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 的锐化不是把分布“推向某个模式”的启发式，而是密度比的幂次放大，其精确形式由定义 9.2 给出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-9-4-采样误差的分解\">9.4 采样误差的分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-9-4-采样误差的分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>实际采样中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t&gt;0$</span>，且反向 SDE 用离散时间积分。本节给出一个误差分解恒等式，把采样分布与引导后验的偏差拆成三项，供后续数值稳定性节与代码节使用。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.3（采样误差分解）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_w$</span> 的样本分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat q_0^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>，定理 9.1 的理想分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\big(\\hat q_0^{(w)}\\,\\|\\,q_0^{(w)}\\big)\\le \\underbrace{C_1\\sum_{t}\\delta_t^2}_{\\text{得分误差}}+\\underbrace{C_2\\,\\Delta t}_{\\text{离散化}}+\\underbrace{C_3\\,|w-1|^2\\delta_t^2}_{\\text{插值放大}},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1,C_2,C_3$</span> 只依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$K_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 为最大步长。</p>\n<p><em>证明思路.</em> 用 Girsanov 定理比较两个反向 SDE 的漂移：真实漂移与理想漂移之差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\sigma_t\\big[(1-w)(\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)/\\sigma_t-s_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing))+w(\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)/\\sigma_t-s_t(\\cdot\\mid c))\\big]$</span>，其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-w)\\delta_t+w\\delta_t=\\delta_t$</span> 控制（由 (A3) 与三角不等式）。Girsanov 给出 KL 上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac{1}{2}\\int\\beta_t^2\\sigma_t^2\\mathbb{E}\\|\\text{漂移差}\\|^2\\mathrm{d}t\\le C_1\\sum_t\\delta_t^2$</span>。离散化项由 Euler–Maruyama 的强收敛阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt{\\Delta t})$</span> 与 KL 的凸性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span>。插值放大项来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 因子的平方：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\sigma_t s_t^{(w)}\\|^2\\le (1-w)^2\\delta_t^2+w^2\\delta_t^2$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 时该项不被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t^2$</span> 单独控制，需显式写出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|w-1|^2\\delta_t^2$</span> 的系数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此分解的关键在于：得分误差项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 无关（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span> 一致控制），而插值放大项显式依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|w-1|$</span>，这解释了为何大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t&gt;0$</span> 时会放大误差——这是后续反例节“引导过强导致模式崩溃”的定量入口。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-9-5-采样算子的可交换性与条件组合\">9.5 采样算子的可交换性与条件组合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-9-5-采样算子的可交换性与条件组合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9.4（采样算子与条件组合的交换性）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1,c_2\\in\\mathcal{C}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1,w_2\\ge 0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta^{(w_1,w_2)}(x_t,c_1,c_2)=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w_1(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c_1)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing))+w_2(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c_2)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing))$</span>。则在 (A1)–(A4) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_{w_1,w_2}(\\epsilon,c_1,c_2)$</span> 的分布等于以得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-w_1-w_2)s_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)+w_1 s_t(\\cdot\\mid c_1)+w_2 s_t(\\cdot\\mid c_2)$</span> 为漂移的反向 SDE 的解的分布。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 直接代入组合公式，逐点恒等，强解唯一性给出分布相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明多条件 CFG 的采样是单条件 CFG 采样在得分层面的线性组合，其权重不必归一化；归一化会改变插值结构，不属于本节定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_w$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-9-6-采样算子的时间反演相容性\">9.6 采样算子的时间反演相容性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-9-6-采样算子的时间反演相容性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已给出 CFG 的插值公式与得分恒等式，但采样算子的定义（定义 9.1）只写了反向 SDE 与概率流 ODE 两种表述。本节补足第三种表述——得分 ODE 的时间反演形式——并证明三者给出的样本分布在零误差下一致。这一相容性是后续代码节实现 CFG 采样器的数学依据：无论用哪种积分器，只要漂移项按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 组装，得到的分布相同。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 9.3（得分 ODE 采样算子）.</strong> 给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>、条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>、权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span>，得分 ODE 采样算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_w^{\\mathrm{score}}$</span> 定义为常微分方程</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}x_t}{\\mathrm{d}t}=-\\tfrac{1}{2}\\beta_t x_t-\\beta_t\\sigma_t\\Big[(1-w)s_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)+w s_t(x_t\\mid c)\\Big],\\qquad x_T=\\alpha_T^{-1}\\big(x_T^{\\mathrm{fwd}}-\\sigma_T\\epsilon\\big),$$</div>\n<p>的解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 的取值，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot\\mid c)=\\nabla\\log q_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 为真实得分（非网络预测）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.5（三种采样算子的分布相容性）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A5) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t=0$</span> 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t^{(w)}(c)\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>，反向 SDE 算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_w$</span>、概率流 ODE 算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_w^{\\mathrm{ODE}}$</span>、得分 ODE 算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_w^{\\mathrm{score}}$</span> 三者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 的边缘分布均等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 概率流 ODE 与得分 ODE 的漂移逐点相同：概率流 ODE 的漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac{1}{2}\\beta_t x_t-\\beta_t\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t=0$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t^{(w)}(x_t\\mid c)$</span>（命题 9.2），而得分 ODE 的漂移正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac{1}{2}\\beta_t x_t-\\beta_t\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t^{(w)}$</span>。故两 ODE 的解逐点相同，分布相同。反向 SDE 与概率流 ODE 的分布相等是标准事实：反向 SDE 的边缘分布满足 Fokker–Planck 方程，而概率流 ODE 的传输方程给出同一族边缘分布（两者共享同一得分场，Fokker–Planck 方程中的扩散项与漂移项的组合恰使边缘沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t^{(w)}$</span> 演化）。具体地，反向 SDE 的 Fokker–Planck 方程为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t q_t^{(w)}=\\nabla\\cdot\\big(\\tfrac{1}{2}\\beta_t x_t q_t^{(w)}+\\beta_t q_t^{(w)}\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t^{(w)}\\big)+\\tfrac{1}{2}\\beta_t\\Delta q_t^{(w)}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t^{(w)}$</span> 满足该方程（由定义 9.2 与前向过程的 Fokker–Planck 方程逐项验证）；概率流 ODE 的连续性方程为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t q_t^{(w)}=\\nabla\\cdot\\big(\\tfrac{1}{2}\\beta_t x_t q_t^{(w)}+\\beta_t q_t^{(w)}\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t^{(w)}\\big)$</span>，同样被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t^{(w)}$</span> 满足。两方程的解在相同初值下唯一，故边缘分布相同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的关键在于：三种算子的漂移在零误差下都化为同一个得分场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t^{(w)}$</span> 的函数，差别仅在随机项的有无，而随机项不改变边缘分布（只改变样本路径）。这解释了为何实践中可以用确定性 ODE 采样器替代 SDE 采样器而不改变分布——前提是得分场精确。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-9-7-引导权重的极限行为-采样层面的补充\">9.7 引导权重的极限行为：采样层面的补充<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-9-7-引导权重的极限行为-采样层面的补充\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已讨论引导权重的极限行为（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 的锐化极限），但那里的讨论停留在分布层面。本节补足采样算子层面的极限行为，给出一个可检验的收敛速率。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.6（大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 下采样算子的条件模式集中）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上有唯一全局众数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_c$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_c$</span> 互不相同。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{m_c\\}$</span> 上取正值。在 (A1)–(A5) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t=0$</span> 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_w(\\epsilon,c)$</span> 的分布弱收敛于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{m_c}$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由定理 9.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_w$</span> 的分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)\\propto q_0(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)^{1-w}q_0(\\cdot\\mid c)^w$</span>。取对数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q_0^{(w)}=(1-w)\\log q_0(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)+w\\log q_0(\\cdot\\mid c)-\\log Z_0^{(w)}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w^{-1}\\log q_0^{(w)}\\to\\log q_0(\\cdot\\mid c)-\\log q_0(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 的常数部分被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_0^{(w)}$</span> 吸收，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0^{(w)}$</span> 的 Laplace 型集中在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q_0(\\cdot\\mid c)-\\log q_0(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 的全局最大点。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 的唯一众数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_c$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)(m_c)&gt;0$</span>，该最大点即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_c$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 的对数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_c$</span> 处的贡献是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的低阶项，不改变最大点位置，只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_c$</span> 附近有界且正）。Laplace 方法给出弱收敛。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.3（模式集中的速率）.</strong> 在命题 9.6 的条件下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_c$</span> 附近满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q_0(x\\mid c)-\\log q_0(m_c\\mid c)\\le -\\tfrac{1}{2}(x-m_c)^\\top H_c(x-m_c)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_c$</span> 为负定 Hessian），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_w(\\epsilon,c)$</span> 的分布与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{m_c}$</span> 的 2-Wasserstein 距离满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{W}_2\\le C\\,w^{-1/2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_c$</span> 的最小特征值与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_c$</span> 处的局部界。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由命题 9.6 的 Laplace 展开，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0^{(w)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_c$</span> 附近的密度近似为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(m_c,w^{-1}H_c^{-1})$</span>（高斯近似），其方差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w^{-1}$</span> 缩放，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{W}_2$</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w^{-1/2}$</span> 缩放。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出一个可检验的定量结论：大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 下样本向条件众数集中，集中速率是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w^{-1/2}$</span>。这与前序节“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 锐化条件分布”的定性结论一致，但给出了速率。注意此速率仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t=0$</span> 下成立；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t&gt;0$</span> 时，命题 9.3 的插值放大项会破坏该速率，这正是后续反例节的入口。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-9-8-采样算子对初始噪声的敏感性\">9.8 采样算子对初始噪声的敏感性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-9-8-采样算子对初始噪声的敏感性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后一个补充是采样算子对初始噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 的敏感性。这决定了 CFG 采样能否用固定种子复现，以及多个样本之间的独立性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.7（采样算子对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性）.</strong> 在 (A1)、(A2)、(A4) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_w$</span> 使得对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon,\\epsilon'\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\mathcal{S}_w(\\epsilon,c)-\\mathcal{S}_w(\\epsilon',c)\\|\\le L_w\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon'\\|,$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_w\\le \\exp\\big(\\int_0^T L_t(1+w)\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\big)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 反向 SDE 的漂移关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t(1+w)$</span>-Lipschitz（由 (A2) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的线性组合结构）。两解之差满足 Gronwall 不等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_t^{(w)}(\\epsilon)-x_t^{(w)}(\\epsilon')\\|^2\\le \\|x_T(\\epsilon)-x_T(\\epsilon')\\|^2\\exp\\big(2\\int_t^T L_s(1+w)\\,\\mathrm{d}s\\big)$</span>。初始条件之差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_T(\\epsilon)-x_T(\\epsilon')\\|=\\sigma_T\\alpha_T^{-1}\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon'\\|$</span>，代入即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：CFG 采样对初始噪声的敏感度随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 指数增长。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 很大时，微小的初始噪声差异会被放大，导致采样轨迹剧烈分离——这是大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 下样本多样性下降的另一个定量解释，与命题 9.3 的插值放大项互为补充。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.4（固定种子的可复现性）.</strong> 在命题 9.7 的条件下，若积分器确定（概率流 ODE 或得分 ODE），则给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_w^{\\mathrm{ODE}}(\\epsilon,c)$</span> 是确定性的；若积分器随机（反向 SDE），则给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 与随机种子，样本路径几乎必然唯一。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 确定性 ODE 的解由初值与漂移唯一确定；反向 SDE 的强解由初值与 Wiener 路径唯一确定（(A4)）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是代码节“固定种子复现”的数学依据：只要积分器与初始噪声固定，CFG 采样就是确定性的（ODE）或路径唯一的（SDE），与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>CFG 采样算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_w$</span> 由插值噪声预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 驱动反向 SDE 或概率流 ODE 定义；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 精确退化为普通条件采样，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 退化为无条件采样，两端点由同一插值公式统一，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_w$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中连续。</li>\n<li>在得分匹配零误差下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_w$</span> 的样本分布精确等于引导后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t^{(w)}\\propto q_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)^{1-w}q_t(\\cdot\\mid c)^w$</span>，其得分恒等式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-w)\\nabla\\log q_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)+w\\nabla\\log q_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 的锐化是密度比的幂次放大，可由高斯混合例子定量验证。</li>\n<li>实际采样误差可分解为得分误差、离散化误差与插值放大项三部分，其中插值放大项显式依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|w-1|$</span>，为大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 下的分布偏移与模式崩溃提供了定量入口，供后续反例节与数值稳定性节使用。</li>\n<li>CFG 采样算子的三种表述——反向 SDE、概率流 ODE、得分 ODE——在零得分误差下给出相同的边缘分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>，差别仅在样本路径的随机性；这为实践中用确定性 ODE 采样器替代 SDE 采样器提供了数学依据。</li>\n<li>大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 极限下，采样分布弱收敛于条件众数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{m_c}$</span>，集中速率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{W}_2\\le C w^{-1/2}$</span>（在局部二次型条件下）；该速率仅在零得分误差下成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t&gt;0$</span> 时被插值放大项破坏。</li>\n<li>采样算子对初始噪声的 Lipschitz 常数随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 指数增长（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_w\\le\\exp(\\int L_t(1+w)\\mathrm{d}t)$</span>），这解释了大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 下样本多样性下降与轨迹分离，同时给出固定种子可复现性的充分条件。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df18--h-反例-引导过强导致模式崩溃\">反例：引导过强导致模式崩溃<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-反例-引导过强导致模式崩溃\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：数据分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}(x)$</span>，条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathcal{C}$</span>，噪声水平 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span>，前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha_t x_0+\\sigma_t \\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，得分网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span> 与无条件网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)$</span>，引导权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 1$</span>，引导后的噪声预测</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\,\\Delta\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c),\\qquad \\Delta\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c):=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing).$$</div>\n<p>本节新引入的符号如下，均在本节内首次出现处给出定义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span>：条件边缘分布，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim p_{\\mathrm{data}}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的律；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_t)$</span>：无条件边缘分布，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的律；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t)$</span>：对应的得分函数（Stein 得分，关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的梯度）；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,c):=-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)/\\sigma_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing):=-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)/\\sigma_t$</span>：网络给出的得分估计；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_w(x_t,c):=s_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\left(s_\\theta(x_t,c)-s_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\right)$</span>：引导后的得分，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的关系为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_w=-\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta/\\sigma_t$</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_w(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>：以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_w$</span> 为得分、从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_T$</span> 出发经反向 SDE 或概率流 ODE 生成的样本律在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处的边缘（即引导采样分布）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需的假设逐条列出，并在每个命题中显式引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 正则性。</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T]\\times\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 连续可微且处处为正；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 局部 Lipschitz、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续。此假设保证反向 SDE 与概率流 ODE 的强解存在唯一（前序节已证）。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 得分匹配误差。</strong> 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 使得对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathcal{C}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t\\mid c)\\right\\|\\le\\eta,\\qquad\n\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)-\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t)\\right\\|\\le\\eta.$$</div>\n<p>此假设把“网络已训练好”形式化为一致误差界；本节的反例将说明当 (A2) 失效（尤其在条件稀疏区域）时结论如何改变。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 条件支撑的稀疏性（反例构造用）。</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}=\\{c_1,c_2\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}(c_1)=p_{\\mathrm{data}}(c_2)=1/2$</span>，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_{\\mathrm{data}}(x\\mid c_1)=\\mathcal{N}(-\\mu,I_d),\\qquad p_{\\mathrm{data}}(x\\mid c_2)=\\mathcal{N}(+\\mu,I_d),\\qquad \\mu\\in\\mathbb{R}^d,\\ \\|\\mu\\|&gt;0.$$</div>\n<p>即两个条件模式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 中相距 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\|\\mu\\|$</span>，各自为各向同性高斯。此假设使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_t\\mid c_i)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_t)$</span> 均有闭式表达，从而所有量可精确计算，反例不依赖数值近似。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 引导采样的良定义。</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_w$</span> 满足 (A1) 中关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 的正则性要求（由 (A1)、(A2) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 为常数直接得到），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_w(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 良定义。</p>\n<p>下面四个小节依次给出：精确的得分分解（命题 18.10.1）、引导过强的定量模式崩溃（命题 18.10.2）、拆掉 (A2) 后结论失效的构造（命题 18.10.3）、以及正确表述所需补充的条件（命题 18.10.4）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-1-精确得分分解与引导的贝叶斯解释\">1. 精确得分分解与引导的贝叶斯解释<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-1-精确得分分解与引导的贝叶斯解释\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 18.10.1（引导得分 = 无条件得分 + <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 倍隐式分类器得分）</strong></p>\n<p>假设 (A1)、(A2)、(A4) 成立。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathcal{C}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t\\mid c)=\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t)+\\nabla\\log q_t(c\\mid x_t),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(c\\mid x_t)$</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_t)$</span> 为边缘、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span> 为条件的贝叶斯后验。从而引导得分可写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde s_w(x_t,c)=s_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\left(s_\\theta(x_t,c)-s_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\right)\n=\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t)+w\\,\\nabla\\log q_t(c\\mid x_t)+O(\\eta(1+w)).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由贝叶斯公式，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_t(x_t\\mid c)=\\frac{q_t(c\\mid x_t)\\,q_t(x_t)}{q(c)},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(c)=p_{\\mathrm{data}}(c)$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>。两边取关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的对数梯度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(c)$</span> 为常数故消失，得第一式。第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_w$</span> 的定义展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde s_w=s_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)+w(s_\\theta(\\cdot,c)-s_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing))\n=(1-w)s_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)+w\\,s_\\theta(\\cdot,c).$$</div>\n<p>代入 (A2) 的两条误差界，并用三角不等式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left\\|\\tilde s_w-\\left[\\nabla\\log q_t+w\\nabla\\log q_t(c\\mid x_t)\\right]\\right\\|\n\\le (w-1)\\eta+w\\eta=O(\\eta(1+w)).$$</div>\n<p>最后一步用了第一式把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t(c\\mid x_t)$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t\\mid c)-\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t)$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 18.10.1 说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时引导得分等价于在无条件得分上叠加一个被放大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 倍的隐式分类器得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t(c\\mid x_t)$</span>。这正是“CFG = 隐式分类器引导”的精确含义（本章推导链的目标）。但放大分类器得分并不等于“更准确地采样条件分布”，下一小节给出定量反例。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-2-引导过强导致模式崩溃-定量反例\">2. 引导过强导致模式崩溃：定量反例<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-2-引导过强导致模式崩溃-定量反例\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 18.10.2（高斯混合下的精确模式权重与崩溃阈值）</strong></p>\n<p>假设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，且 (A3) 中的两模式高斯混合成立。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=c_1$</span>，记引导采样分布在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处对两模式的分配权重为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\pi_w(c_2\\mid c_1):=\\int_{\\|x-\\mu\\|&lt;\\|x+\\mu\\|}\\pi_w(x\\mid c_1)\\,dx,$$</div>\n<p>即生成样本落入“错误模式”（<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2$</span> 的中心 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\mu$</span> 一侧）的概率。则存在仅依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu\\|,\\sigma_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的显式函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R(t)&gt;0$</span>，使得当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w&gt;w_{\\mathrm{crit}}(t):=1+\\frac{2\\|\\mu\\|}{\\sigma_t^2\\,R(t)}$$</div>\n<p>时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_w(c_2\\mid c_1)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 单调递减并在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>；且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_{\\mathrm{collapse}}&gt;w_{\\mathrm{crit}}(t)$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge w_{\\mathrm{collapse}}$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_w(\\cdot\\mid c_1)$</span> 的支撑被压缩到以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mu$</span> 为中心的半径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sigma_t/\\sqrt{w})$</span> 的球内，即模式崩溃。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由 (A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_t\\mid c_i)=\\mathcal{N}(\\alpha_t(\\pm\\mu),\\sigma_t^2 I_d)$</span>（符号对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-$</span>），且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_t(x_t)=\\tfrac12\\mathcal{N}(\\alpha_t\\mu,\\sigma_t^2 I_d)+\\tfrac12\\mathcal{N}(-\\alpha_t\\mu,\\sigma_t^2 I_d).$$</div>\n<p>由命题 18.10.1，在 (A2) 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>（精确得分，反例只需上界故可令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 取最有利情形）时，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde s_w(x_t,c_1)=\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t)+w\\nabla\\log q_t(c_1\\mid x_t).$$</div>\n<p>直接计算后验对数梯度。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i(x_t):=\\langle x_t-\\alpha_t(\\pm\\mu),\\alpha_t\\mu\\rangle/\\sigma_t^2$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-$</span>），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_t(c_1\\mid x_t)=\\frac{\\exp(z_1(x_t))}{\\exp(z_1(x_t))+\\exp(z_2(x_t))}=\\sigma\\!\\left(z_1(x_t)-z_2(x_t)\\right),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(\\cdot)$</span> 为 logistic 函数。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log q_t(c_1\\mid x_t)=\\sigma\\!\\left(-(z_1-z_2)\\right)\\nabla(z_1-z_2)(x_t),$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_1-z_2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 是仿射的：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(z_1-z_2)(x_t)=\\frac{\\langle x_t,\\alpha_t\\mu\\rangle}{\\sigma_t^2}\\cdot(-2)+\\text{常数},\n\\qquad\n\\nabla(z_1-z_2)(x_t)=-\\frac{2\\alpha_t\\mu}{\\sigma_t^2}.$$</div>\n<p>因此在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 处，引导得分相对无条件得分的修正项为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w\\nabla\\log q_t(c_1\\mid x_t)=-w\\,\\frac{2\\alpha_t\\mu}{\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\sigma\\!\\left(\\frac{2\\langle x_t,\\alpha_t\\mu\\rangle}{\\sigma_t^2}+\\text{常数}\\right).$$</div>\n<p>关键观察：该修正项沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mu$</span> 方向，其大小被 logistic 因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(\\cdot)\\in(0,1)$</span> 截断，故对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span>，修正项的模不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2w\\alpha_t\\|\\mu\\|/\\sigma_t^2$</span>。但反向 SDE 的漂移中，无条件得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 靠近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\alpha_t\\mu$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2$</span> 模式中心）时指向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\mu$</span> 一侧，量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\alpha_t\\mu\\|/\\sigma_t^2$</span>；引导修正项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 靠近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\alpha_t\\mu$</span> 时 logistic 因子接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（因为此时后验偏向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2$</span>），修正项几乎为零。于是存在阈值：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 超过</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_{\\mathrm{crit}}(t)=1+\\frac{2\\|\\mu\\|}{\\sigma_t^2\\,R(t)},\\qquad R(t):=\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\sigma_t}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\|\\mu\\|}\\cdot\\sup_{x_t\\in\\mathbb{R}^d}\\left\\|\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t)\\right\\|^{-1}\\cdot\\text{（显式常数）},$$</div>\n<p>引导漂移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\alpha_t\\mu$</span> 邻域内把样本推离该模式的速度超过无条件漂移把样本拉向该模式的速度，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_w(c_2\\mid c_1)$</span> 单调下降。<span class=\"math-inline\">$R(t)$</span> 的显式形式可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t$</span> 在两模式中心处的取值直接算出：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha_t\\mu$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t)=\\alpha_t\\mu/\\sigma_t^2\\cdot\\sigma(-2\\alpha_t\\|\\mu\\|^2/\\sigma_t^2)$</span> 量级，代入即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R(t)$</span> 的显式下界。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 时，修正项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle x_t,\\alpha_t\\mu\\rangle&lt;0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1$</span> 一侧）时 logistic 因子趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，修正项趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2w\\alpha_t\\mu/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，其模随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 线性增长，把样本强推向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mu$</span>；而在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\mu$</span> 一侧 logistic 因子趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，修正项不增长，但无条件漂移也不足以对抗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 增大后在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mu$</span> 一侧形成的强吸引。定量地，反向 SDE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处的样本律的均值满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_w}[x_0\\mid c_1]=-\\mu+O(\\sigma_t/\\sqrt{w}),$$</div>\n<p>方差满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_{\\pi_w}[x_0\\mid c_1]=O(\\sigma_t^2/w)$</span>。这是因为在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mu$</span> 邻域内，引导得分近似为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log\\mathcal{N}(-\\mu,\\sigma_t^2/w\\,I_d)$</span> 的得分（修正项把有效方差缩小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 倍），而在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\mu$</span> 邻域内修正项被 logistic 因子截断、无法形成第二个吸引子。于是当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge w_{\\mathrm{collapse}}:=C\\|\\mu\\|^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 为显式常数）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_w(\\cdot\\mid c_1)$</span> 的质量集中在半径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sigma_t/\\sqrt{w})$</span> 的球内，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_w(c_2\\mid c_1)\\to0$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 18.10.2 的要点是：模式崩溃不是“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 太大时数值溢出”的工程现象，而是引导得分在错误模式一侧被 logistic 因子截断、在正确模式一侧被线性放大所造成的<strong>分布层面</strong>的必然结果。<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_{\\mathrm{crit}}(t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_{\\mathrm{collapse}}$</span> 都是显式可计算的，且随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu\\|/\\sigma_t$</span> 增大而增大——模式间距越大、噪声越小，越容易在较小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 处崩溃。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-3-拆掉-A2-得分误差使崩溃阈值下移\">3. 拆掉 (A2)：得分误差使崩溃阈值下移<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-3-拆掉-A2-得分误差使崩溃阈值下移\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 18.10.3（(A2) 失效时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_{\\mathrm{crit}}$</span> 的下移）</strong></p>\n<p>假设 (A1)、(A3)、(A4) 成立，但 (A2) 不成立：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_0\\in(0,T]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t^\\ast$</span> 使</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t^\\ast,c_1)-\\nabla\\log q_{t_0}(x_t^\\ast\\mid c_1)\\right\\|=\\eta_0&gt;0,\n\\qquad\n\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t^\\ast,\\varnothing)-\\nabla\\log q_{t_0}(x_t^\\ast)\\right\\|=0.$$</div>\n<p>则命题 18.10.2 中的崩溃阈值满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_{\\mathrm{crit}}^{\\mathrm{err}}(t_0)\\le w_{\\mathrm{crit}}(t_0)-\\frac{\\eta_0\\,\\sigma_{t_0}^2}{2\\|\\mu\\|}.$$</div>\n<p>即得分误差使崩溃在更小的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 处发生。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 引导得分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t^\\ast$</span> 处的误差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde s_w(x_t^\\ast,c_1)-\\left[\\nabla\\log q_{t_0}(x_t^\\ast)+w\\nabla\\log q_{t_0}(c_1\\mid x_t^\\ast)\\right]\n=w\\left(s_\\theta(x_t^\\ast,c_1)-\\nabla\\log q_{t_0}(x_t^\\ast\\mid c_1)\\right),$$</div>\n<p>其模为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\eta_0$</span>。若该误差方向与引导修正项方向相反（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2$</span> 模式一侧，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t^\\ast$</span> 靠近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\alpha_t\\mu$</span>），则它抵消了本应把样本推离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2$</span> 模式的修正项。抵消量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\eta_0$</span>，而命题 18.10.2 中修正项的有效量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2w\\alpha_t\\|\\mu\\|/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 乘以 logistic 因子。令二者相等，得崩溃阈值下移量</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta w=\\frac{\\eta_0\\,\\sigma_t^2}{2\\alpha_t\\|\\mu\\|}\\cdot\\text{（logistic 因子在 }x_t^\\ast\\text{ 处的值）}^{-1}.$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t^\\ast$</span> 处 logistic 因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(\\cdot)\\le1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta w\\ge\\eta_0\\sigma_t^2/(2\\|\\mu\\|)$</span>（取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\le1$</span>）。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 18.10.3 说明：(A2) 不是技术性假设，而是反例结论成立的必要条件。当网络在条件稀疏区域（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2$</span> 模式一侧）有系统偏差时，引导放大该偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 倍，崩溃阈值下移。这解释了为什么实际训练中 dropout 概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 与引导权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 必须联合调节：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 增大使无条件网络更准（(A2) 更易满足），从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 可取得更大而不崩溃。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-4-正确表述所需补充的条件\">4. 正确表述所需补充的条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-4-正确表述所需补充的条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 18.10.4（避免模式崩溃的充分条件）</strong></p>\n<p>假设 (A1)、(A3)、(A4) 成立，且 (A2) 以误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 成立。若引导权重满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w\\le 1+\\frac{2\\|\\mu\\|}{\\sigma_t^2\\,R(t)}-\\frac{\\eta\\,\\sigma_t^2}{2\\|\\mu\\|},$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_w(c_2\\mid c_1)\\ge\\pi_1(c_2\\mid c_1)-O(\\eta(w-1))$</span>，即引导不引入新的模式崩溃（相对于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 的普通条件采样）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由命题 18.10.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_w$</span> 与“精确引导得分”之差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\eta(1+w))$</span>。由命题 18.10.2 的单调性，精确引导得分下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_w(c_2\\mid c_1)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 单调递减；误差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\eta(w-1))$</span> 使该单调性在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 超过命题 18.10.2 阈值减去命题 18.10.3 下移量时失效。将两阈值相减即得所述上界。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 18.10.4 的正确表述需要补充三个条件，缺一不可：(i) (A2) 的一致得分误差界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>；(ii) 模式间距 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu\\|$</span> 与噪声水平 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的显式关系（决定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R(t)$</span>）；(iii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的上界与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的联合约束。若去掉 (i)，命题 18.10.3 给出反例；若去掉 (ii)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$R(t)$</span> 无法显式计算，阈值退化为存在性陈述；若去掉 (iii)，命题 18.10.2 给出崩溃构造。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-6-崩溃的几何刻画-引导得分场的吸引子结构\">6. 崩溃的几何刻画：引导得分场的吸引子结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-6-崩溃的几何刻画-引导得分场的吸引子结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 18.10.2 从概率质量的角度刻画了崩溃，但“模式崩溃”在样本路径层面还有一个更精细的几何表述：引导得分场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_w(\\cdot,c_1)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0$</span> 时把整个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 的流吸引到单一不动点。本小节给出这一表述，并说明它与命题 18.10.2 的阈值一致。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.10.5（引导得分场的吸引子收缩）</strong></p>\n<p>假设 (A1)、(A3)、(A4) 成立，(A2) 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_w(x_t):=-\\tilde s_w(x_t,c_1)$</span> 为概率流 ODE 的速度场。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_w$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上存在唯一全局吸引的不动点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_w^\\ast$</span>，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_w^\\ast=-\\alpha_t\\mu+O\\!\\left(\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{w\\|\\mu\\|}\\right),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Jac}\\,v_w(x_w^\\ast)=-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}\\left(I_d+\\frac{w-1}{1+e^{-2\\alpha_t\\|\\mu\\|^2/\\sigma_t^2}}\\,\\Pi_{\\mu}\\right),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_\\mu=\\mu\\mu^\\top/\\|\\mu\\|^2$</span> 为沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 方向的投影。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Jac}\\,v_w(x_w^\\ast)$</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 方向的最小特征值趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>，即吸引子沿模式间距方向无限收缩。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由命题 18.10.1 与 (A3)，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde s_w(x_t,c_1)=\\frac{x_t-\\alpha_t\\mu}{\\sigma_t^2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{1+e^{-2\\langle x_t,\\alpha_t\\mu\\rangle/\\sigma_t^2}}\\cdot(-1)\\cdot\\text{（符号整理）}+w\\cdot\\text{（分类器项）}.$$</div>\n<p>更直接地，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_w$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\nabla\\log q_t(c_1\\mid x_t)$</span> 之和。前者是两高斯混合的得分，其在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=-\\alpha_t\\mu$</span> 处为零（该点为无条件混合的一个局部极大，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu\\|$</span> 足够大时）；后者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=-\\alpha_t\\mu$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{2\\alpha_t\\mu}{\\sigma_t^2}\\sigma(2\\alpha_t\\|\\mu\\|^2/\\sigma_t^2)$</span>，方向沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mu$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_w$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\alpha_t\\mu$</span> 附近的零点满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$0=v_w(x_w^\\ast)=-\\frac{x_w^\\ast+\\alpha_t\\mu}{\\sigma_t^2}+w\\,\\frac{2\\alpha_t\\mu}{\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\sigma\\!\\left(\\frac{2\\langle x_w^\\ast,\\alpha_t\\mu\\rangle}{\\sigma_t^2}\\right)+O\\!\\left(\\|x_w^\\ast+\\alpha_t\\mu\\|^2\\right),$$</div>\n<p>解得一阶修正 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_w^\\ast+\\alpha_t\\mu=O(\\sigma_t^2/(w\\|\\mu\\|))$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_w$</span> 求 Jacobi 矩阵：无条件部分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\alpha_t\\mu$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-I_d/\\sigma_t^2$</span>（高斯得分在均值处的 Jacobi 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-I/\\sigma_t^2$</span>）；分类器项的 Jacobi 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-w\\,\\frac{2\\alpha_t\\mu}{\\sigma_t^2}\\cdot\\sigma'(\\cdot)\\cdot\\frac{2\\alpha_t\\mu^\\top}{\\sigma_t^2}\n=-w\\,\\frac{4\\alpha_t^2}{\\sigma_t^4}\\,\\sigma'(\\cdot)\\,\\Pi_\\mu,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma'(\\cdot)=\\sigma(\\cdot)(1-\\sigma(\\cdot))$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=-\\alpha_t\\mu$</span> 处，logistic 自变量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\alpha_t\\|\\mu\\|^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma'(\\cdot)=e^{-2\\alpha_t\\|\\mu\\|^2/\\sigma_t^2}/(1+e^{-2\\alpha_t\\|\\mu\\|^2/\\sigma_t^2})^2$</span>。合并得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Jac}\\,v_w=-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}I_d-w\\,\\frac{4\\alpha_t^2}{\\sigma_t^4}\\,\\sigma'(\\cdot)\\,\\Pi_\\mu.$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu\\|$</span> 较大、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 较小时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma'(\\cdot)\\approx e^{-2\\alpha_t\\|\\mu\\|^2/\\sigma_t^2}$</span> 指数小，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 线性增长；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{2\\alpha_t\\|\\mu\\|^2/\\sigma_t^2}$</span> 量级时，沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 方向的特征值变为大负数，吸引子沿该方向无限收缩。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma'(\\cdot)$</span> 的显式值代入并整理系数，即得命题所述的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{w-1}{1+e^{-2\\alpha_t\\|\\mu\\|^2/\\sigma_t^2}}$</span> 形式（相差一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t$</span> 有关的正常数因子，已并入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O$</span> 记号）。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 18.10.5 与命题 18.10.2 的关系是：前者给出样本路径层面的吸引子收缩率，后者给出概率质量层面的权重衰减。二者阈值一致，因为概率质量的衰减正是由吸引子沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 方向的收缩率决定的——当收缩率超过无条件漂移在错误模式一侧的恢复率时，错误模式不再有吸引域。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-7-拆掉-A3-非高斯条件下崩溃阈值不存在统一形式\">7. 拆掉 (A3)：非高斯条件下崩溃阈值不存在统一形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-7-拆掉-A3-非高斯条件下崩溃阈值不存在统一形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 18.10.2 的显式阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_{\\mathrm{collapse}}=C\\|\\mu\\|^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 依赖于 (A3) 中两模式为等权各向同性高斯这一结构。若去掉 (A3)，只保留 (A1)、(A2)、(A4)，则崩溃现象仍然存在，但阈值不再有统一显式形式；本小节给出一个反例说明“阈值”本身可能不存在。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.10.6（非等权混合下崩溃阈值的非存在性）</strong></p>\n<p>假设 (A1)、(A2)、(A4) 成立，但 (A3) 改为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}(c_1)=\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}(c_2)=1-\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\in(0,1/2)$</span>，两条件分布仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(\\mp\\mu,\\sigma_t^2 I_d)$</span>。则对任意固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge1$</span>，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_0(w)&gt;0$</span>，使得当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&lt;\\epsilon_0(w)$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_w(c_2\\mid c_1)&gt;\\pi_1(c_2\\mid c_1)$</span>，即引导<strong>增加</strong>了错误模式的权重；且不存在仅依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu\\|,\\sigma_t$</span> 的崩溃阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_{\\mathrm{collapse}}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由命题 18.10.1，引导得分中的分类器项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\nabla\\log q_t(c_1\\mid x_t)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 很小时，先验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(c_1)=\\epsilon$</span> 使后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(c_1\\mid x_t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 靠近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\alpha_t\\mu$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2$</span> 模式中心）时也接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t(c_1\\mid x_t)$</span> 在该处几乎为零；而在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 靠近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\alpha_t\\mu$</span> 时后验接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t(c_1\\mid x_t)$</span> 的模被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 放大（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q_t(c_1\\mid x_t)=\\log\\epsilon+\\log q_t(x_t\\mid c_1)-\\log q_t(x_t)$</span>，其梯度中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\epsilon$</span> 消失，但后验的 logistic 自变量含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\epsilon$</span> 项，使过渡区变宽）。定量地，后验的 logistic 自变量为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\frac{q_t(x_t\\mid c_1)}{q_t(x_t\\mid c_2)}+\\log\\frac{\\epsilon}{1-\\epsilon},$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\to0$</span> 时该自变量整体左移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(\\epsilon/(1-\\epsilon))\\to-\\infty$</span>，使后验在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\alpha_t\\mu$</span> 附近仍接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\epsilon$</span> 项被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_t\\mid c_1)/q_t(x_t\\mid c_2)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\alpha_t\\mu$</span> 处的大负值抵消）。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t(c_1\\mid x_t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\alpha_t\\mu$</span> 处的模不再被 logistic 因子截断到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，而是保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 量级。引导修正项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\nabla\\log q_t(c_1\\mid x_t)$</span> 因此在错误模式一侧也有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(w)$</span> 量级的推动，方向指向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mu$</span>，但该推动在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\alpha_t\\mu$</span> 处与无条件得分方向相反、量级相当，导致样本被从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\alpha_t\\mu$</span> 推向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\alpha_t\\mu$</span> 的速度超过无条件漂移的恢复速度。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_0(w)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(\\epsilon/(1-\\epsilon))$</span> 足够负，即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_w(c_2\\mid c_1)&gt;\\pi_1(c_2\\mid c_1)$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_0(w)$</span> 依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 且随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 增大而减小，不存在仅依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu\\|,\\sigma_t$</span> 的统一下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_{\\mathrm{collapse}}$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 18.10.6 说明：(A3) 的等权假设不是技术便利，而是崩溃阈值存在性的必要条件。去掉等权后，“引导过强导致崩溃”仍然成立，但“崩溃在哪个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 处发生”依赖于先验权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>，无法写成仅含几何量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu\\|,\\sigma_t$</span> 的显式阈值。这正是本节标题“反例”的第二层含义：不仅给出崩溃的构造，还给出“崩溃阈值”这一概念本身在一般条件下的失效边界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-8-与数值稳定性的边界-崩溃不是数值溢出\">8. 与数值稳定性的边界：崩溃不是数值溢出<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-8-与数值稳定性的边界-崩溃不是数值溢出\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已讨论引导的数值稳定性（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 过大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的模线性增长导致浮点溢出）。本小节必须区分两种“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 过大”的失效模式，否则会把命题 18.10.2 的分布层面崩溃误读为数值层面溢出。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.10.7（分布崩溃先于数值溢出）</strong></p>\n<p>假设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)\\|$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\|$</span> 在紧集上一致有界，界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span>。则引导噪声预测的模满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)\\|\\le B(1+2w),$$</div>\n<p>故浮点溢出（模超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{\\mathrm{float}}$</span>）发生在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge M_{\\mathrm{float}}/(2B)$</span> 量级；而命题 18.10.2 的崩溃阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_{\\mathrm{collapse}}=C\\|\\mu\\|^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 可以任意小（取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu\\|$</span> 小、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 大）。因此存在参数区域使崩溃在数值溢出之前发生。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的定义与三角不等式直接得模界。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu\\|=\\sigma_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$C=1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_{\\mathrm{collapse}}=1$</span>；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{\\mathrm{float}}/(2B)$</span> 在双精度下为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{308}$</span> 量级（<span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 时），远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。故崩溃先于溢出。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 18.10.7 的结论是：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 调小以避免溢出，并不能避免崩溃；崩溃是分布层面的，溢出是表示层面的，二者阈值可以相差任意多个数量级。正确的工程表述应是“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的上界由得分误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 与模式几何决定”，而非“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的上界由浮点范围决定”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-9-崩溃的不可逆性-引导采样不能通过后续无条件采样修复\">9. 崩溃的不可逆性：引导采样不能通过后续无条件采样修复<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-9-崩溃的不可逆性-引导采样不能通过后续无条件采样修复\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后一个边界情形：一旦引导采样在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处崩溃到单一模式，能否通过在中间时刻切换回 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 来恢复另一模式？本小节说明不能，因为反向过程一旦进入单一模式的吸引域，无条件漂移不足以在剩余时间内把样本送回另一模式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.10.8（切换引导权重的不可逆性）</strong></p>\n<p>假设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，且引导权重在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,t^\\ast]$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;w_{\\mathrm{collapse}}$</span>、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(t^\\ast,0]$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span>。则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t^\\ast$</span> 足够小（即切换发生在反向过程晚期）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{w\\to1}(\\cdot\\mid c_1)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_w(\\cdot\\mid c_1)$</span> 在错误模式一侧的质量之差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\exp(-2\\|\\mu\\|^2/(\\sigma_t^2(t^\\ast))))$</span>，即切换几乎不恢复错误模式的质量。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,t^\\ast]$</span> 内，样本已被吸引到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\alpha_t\\mu$</span> 的半径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sigma_t/\\sqrt{w})$</span> 球内（命题 18.10.5）。切换后，反向过程从该球内出发，无条件漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\nabla\\log q_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\alpha_t\\mu$</span> 附近指向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\alpha_t\\mu$</span>（局部极大），把样本继续拉向该点；要从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\alpha_t\\mu$</span> 到达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\alpha_t\\mu$</span> 需跨越势垒 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu\\|^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 量级，所需时间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(2\\|\\mu\\|^2/\\sigma_t^2)$</span> 量级（Kramers 型估计），远大于剩余时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t^\\ast$</span>。故切换后样本仍停留在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\alpha_t\\mu$</span> 附近，错误模式质量不恢复。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 18.10.8 说明：引导过强造成的崩溃在采样轨迹上是不可逆的；不能在晚期通过降低 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 来“补救”。这与前序节“引导的采样”中“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 应在整个反向过程保持恒定”的实践建议一致，但此处给出了数学理由而非经验规则。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>引导得分精确分解为无条件得分加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 倍隐式分类器得分（命题 18.10.1），<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 放大的是分类器得分而非条件得分本身，这是模式崩溃的数学根源。</li>\n<li>在两模式高斯混合下，引导采样对错误模式的权重随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 单调递减，存在显式崩溃阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_{\\mathrm{collapse}}=C\\|\\mu\\|^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span>（命题 18.10.2）；得分误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 使该阈值下移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\sigma_t^2/(2\\|\\mu\\|)$</span>（命题 18.10.3），故 (A2) 是反例结论成立的必要条件。</li>\n<li>避免崩溃的正确表述需补充一致得分误差界、模式间距与噪声水平的显式关系、以及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的联合上界（命题 18.10.4）；三者缺一，反例即成立。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df18--h-引导的变体\">引导的变体<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-引导的变体\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号，不引入新的概率空间或测度记号。记数据维度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb{N}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为前向扩散过程在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 的状态，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 为条件变量（离散类别标签或连续嵌入），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing$</span> 为“空条件”占位符。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c;\\theta)$</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 参数化的噪声预测网络，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)$</span> 为其在空条件下的输出。引导权重记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span>，训练 dropout 概率记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\in[0,1)$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span> 为条件边缘分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 为无条件边缘分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span> 为条件得分。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span> 为引导后的噪声预测，其定义由本章第 1 节给出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\left(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\right).$$</div>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设如下，逐条显式列出并在命题中引用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(A1) 可测性与可积性</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,c)\\mapsto\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(x_t)\\otimes\\sigma(c)$</span> 可测；对每个固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)\\in L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)\\in L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing))$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>(A2) Lipschitz 正则性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 局部 Lipschitz，Lipschitz 常数记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_c,L_\\varnothing&lt;\\infty$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>(A3) 得分存在性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续且密度为正，得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 存在且平方可积。</li>\n<li><strong>(A4) 边界通量消失</strong>：在无穷远处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid c)\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)\\to 0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)\\to 0$</span>，以保证分部积分无边界项。</li>\n<li><strong>(A5) 期望与梯度可交换</strong>：对变体构造中出现的参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\mapsto \\mathbb{E}_{p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)}[\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)]$</span> 在紧区间上连续可微，且被一个可积控制函数支配，从而可引用 Dominated Convergence。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：在保持 canonical 插值公式不变的前提下，刻画三类变体——<strong>条件插值变体</strong>、<strong>得分缩放变体</strong>、<strong>多条件组合变体</strong>——并证明它们与基准 CFG 的等价性或差异恒等式。所有变体均以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的代数重写或对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的重新参数化为载体，不改变本章第 1 节的定义符号。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-变体一-条件插值的一般仿射族\">变体一：条件插值的一般仿射族<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-变体一-条件插值的一般仿射族\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>基准 CFG 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span> 的仿射组合，系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-w,w)$</span>。更一般地，取仿射族</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon^{(a,b)}_\\theta(x_t,c)=a\\,\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+b\\,\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c),\\qquad a,b\\in\\mathbb{R}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 18.11.1（仿射族的得分解释）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)=-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span> 为噪声调度系数），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon^{(a,b)}_\\theta$</span> 对应的隐式得分为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t}\\tilde\\varepsilon^{(a,b)}_\\theta(x_t,c)=a\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)+b\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由假设直接代入：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)=-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon^{(a,b)}_\\theta=a(-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing))+b(-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))=-\\sigma_t\\big(a\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)+b\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)\\big).$$</div>\n<p>两边除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>基准 CFG 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=1-w$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=w$</span>。命题 18.11.1 说明：任何仿射变体都等价于对两个得分场做线性组合，其组合系数不必满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a+b=1$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a+b\\neq 1$</span> 时，组合后的向量场不再是某个归一化分布的得分（因为得分场在无穷远处的通量条件 (A4) 被破坏），这解释了为何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a+b=1$</span> 是保持“得分场”语义的必要条件。由此得到可检验推论。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 18.11.2（归一化条件）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon^{(a,b)}_\\theta$</span> 是某个概率密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 的得分（乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t$</span>）当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a+b=1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 必要性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon^{(a,b)}=-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t$</span>，则由 (A4) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\nabla\\cdot(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)\\nabla\\log q_t)\\,dx_t=0$</span>，展开得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)(a\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)+b\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))\\cdot\\nabla\\log q_t$</span> 的积分恒等式；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t=p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 代入并用 (A4) 分部积分，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\cdot 0+b\\cdot\\int p_t|\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)|^2=0$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b=0$</span> 时平凡，故一般情形要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a+b=1$</span> 才能与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t=p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 自洽。充分性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$a+b=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon^{(a,b)}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)^{a}p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)^{b}$</span> 的得分（乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t$</span>），该乘积在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a,b\\geq 0$</span> 时为正密度。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论给出一个具体数值检验：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)=\\mathcal{N}(\\mu,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=1$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)=-x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)=-(x_t-\\mu)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=0.5,b=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon^{(a,b)}=-(x_t-\\mu/2)$</span>，对应得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\nabla\\log q_t$</span> 其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t=\\mathcal{N}(\\mu/2,1)$</span>，验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a+b=1$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=0.5,b=1.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon^{(a,b)}=-(x_t-1.5\\mu)$</span>，对应“得分” <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\nabla\\log q_t$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 不是归一化密度（其积分发散），验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a+b=2\\neq 1$</span> 时语义失效。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-变体二-得分缩放与温度重参数化\">变体二：得分缩放与温度重参数化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-变体二-得分缩放与温度重参数化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第二类变体保持插值结构但将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 替换为依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 的函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t,c)$</span>，称为<strong>时变引导权重</strong>。定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon^{(t)}_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w(t,c)\\left(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\right).$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 18.11.3（时变权重的得分恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A5) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w:[0,T]\\times\\mathcal{C}\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span> 连续且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(t,c)$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t,c)\\geq 0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon^{(t)}_\\theta$</span> 对应的隐式条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t\\mid c)=(1-w(t,c))\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)+w(t,c)\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c),$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t,c)\\equiv w$</span> 为常数时退化为基准 CFG。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 18.11.1 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=1-w(t,c)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=w(t,c)$</span>，逐点成立。常数情形显然。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>时变权重的一个自然选择是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t,c)=\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\sigma_t^2+\\tau^2}$</span>（温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>），它在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to 0$</span>）时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，实现“早期弱引导、晚期强引导”。该选择的合法性由 (A5) 保证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\mapsto w(t,c)$</span> 连续可微且被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 支配，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}[\\tilde\\varepsilon^{(t)}]$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 可微，可引用 Dominated Convergence 交换期望与梯度。需注意：时变权重不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 退化为普通条件采样这一 canonical 事实，因为对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 逐点有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t,c)=1\\Rightarrow\\tilde\\varepsilon^{(t)}=\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-变体三-多条件组合与嵌入算术\">变体三：多条件组合与嵌入算术<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-变体三-多条件组合与嵌入算术\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第三类变体处理多个条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1,\\dots,c_m$</span> 的同时引导。设每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_i$</span> 对应噪声预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c_i)$</span>，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon^{(m)}_\\theta(x_t,\\{c_i\\})=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+\\sum_{i=1}^{m}w_i\\left(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c_i)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\right),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=1$</span> 时退化为基准 CFG。<strong>命题 18.11.4（多条件组合的得分表示）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，若各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c_i)$</span> 均为得分（乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t$</span>），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t}\\tilde\\varepsilon^{(m)}_\\theta=\\Big(1-\\sum_{i=1}^{m}w_i\\Big)\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)+\\sum_{i=1}^{m}w_i\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c_i).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 逐项代入并合并同类项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon^{(m)}=-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)+\\sum_i w_i\\big(-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c_i)+\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)\\big)\n=-\\sigma_t\\Big[\\big(1-\\sum_i w_i\\big)\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)+\\sum_i w_i\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c_i)\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>由推论 18.11.2，多条件组合保持得分语义的充要条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(1-\\sum_i w_i\\big)+\\sum_i w_i=1$</span>，该式恒成立，故多条件组合<strong>总是</strong>得分场，这与单条件仿射族不同——原因是空条件项的系数被吸收进总和。这一恒等式是可检验的：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1=w_2=0.5$</span>，则组合得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=0\\cdot\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)+0.5\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c_1)+0.5\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c_2)$</span>，对应几何平均密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c_1)^{1/2}p_t(\\cdot\\mid c_2)^{1/2}$</span> 的得分，归一化条件自动满足。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-变体四-隐式分类器引导的精确重写\">变体四：隐式分类器引导的精确重写<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-变体四-隐式分类器引导的精确重写\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第四类变体将 CFG 重写为<strong>显式分类器引导</strong>的近似形式，以揭示其与贝叶斯分解的关系（本章第 6 节已建立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 锐化条件分布的结论，本节只做代数重写，不重复该结论的证明）。由贝叶斯公式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)=\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)+\\nabla\\log p_t(c\\mid x_t),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)=p_t(x_t\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 在空条件语义下成立。代入基准 CFG 得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=-\\sigma_t\\big[\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)+w\\nabla\\log p_t(c\\mid x_t)\\big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 18.11.5（分类器引导的等价重写）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，基准 CFG 的隐式得分等于</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t\\mid c)=\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)+w\\nabla\\log p_t(c\\mid x_t),$$</div>\n<p>即 CFG 等价于对隐式分类器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_t(c\\mid x_t)$</span> 的梯度做 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 倍缩放后叠加到无条件得分上。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 18.11.1 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=1-w,b=w$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-w)\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)+w\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>。代入贝叶斯分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)=\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot)+\\nabla\\log p_t(c\\mid\\cdot)$</span> 并利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)=p_t(\\cdot)$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(1-w)\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot)+w\\big(\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot)+\\nabla\\log p_t(c\\mid\\cdot)\\big)=\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot)+w\\nabla\\log p_t(c\\mid\\cdot).$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该重写说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时分类器项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，退化为普通条件采样；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时分类器项被放大，锐化条件分布；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&lt;1$</span> 时分类器项被压缩，条件分布被平坦化。这与本章第 3、7 节的结论一致，但本节只给出代数恒等式，不重复极限行为的证明。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-变体五-dropout-概率对变体的调制\">变体五：dropout 概率对变体的调制<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-变体五-dropout-概率对变体的调制\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>训练时以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 置空（canonical 事实）。在推理阶段，该 dropout 不直接作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>，但通过训练分布影响 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 的估计质量。设训练时条件被置空的指示变量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D\\sim\\mathrm{Bernoulli}(p_{\\mathrm{drop}})$</span>，则训练目标为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}(\\theta)=\\mathbb{E}_{(x_t,c),D}\\Big[\\big\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,(1-D)c+D\\varnothing)-\\varepsilon\\big\\|^2\\Big],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-D)c+D\\varnothing$</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D=1$</span> 时取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D=0$</span> 时取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>。<strong>命题 18.11.6（dropout 下的双目标分解）</strong> 在 (A1)、(A5) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,c)$</span> 独立，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}(\\theta)=(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}})\\,\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon\\|^2\\big]+p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\,\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)-\\varepsilon\\|^2\\big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,c)$</span> 独立及全期望公式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}=\\mathbb{E}_{(x_t,c)}\\Big[(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}})\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon\\|^2+p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)-\\varepsilon\\|^2\\Big],$$</div>\n<p>再交换期望（Fubini，被积函数非负可积，由 (A1) 保证），得两项之和。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该分解说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 越大，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 的训练信号越强，但其条件分支的训练样本越少；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\to 1$</span> 时条件分支完全失训，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)$</span> 退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span>，此时任何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 均给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta=\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span>，CFG 失效。这为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 的取值提供了理论边界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}&lt;1$</span> 是 CFG 有意义的必要条件。需强调该命题只做期望分解，不涉及梯度交换；若需对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度，须额外假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 被可积控制函数支配，方可引用 Leibniz 规则。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-变体间的等价关系与差异\">变体间的等价关系与差异<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-变体间的等价关系与差异\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>将上述变体统一在一个交换图中：基准 CFG（仿射族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a+b=1$</span>）、时变权重（逐点仿射族）、多条件组合（总和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的仿射族）、分类器重写（贝叶斯分解后的仿射族）四者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t,c)\\equiv w$</span> 时两两等价；差异仅出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a+b\\neq 1$</span>（得分语义失效）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>（非自治向量场）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\geq 2$</span>（几何平均密度）三种情形。<strong>推论 18.11.7（变体差异的充要条件）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，两个变体给出相同隐式得分场当且仅当其系数向量在贝叶斯分解后的基 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot),\\nabla\\log p_t(c\\mid\\cdot))$</span> 下相等。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 18.11.5，任意变体的隐式得分均可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot)+\\beta\\nabla\\log p_t(c\\mid\\cdot)$</span> 的形式，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1$</span>（基准、时变、分类器重写）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1-\\sum_i w_i+\\sum_i w_i=1$</span>（多条件），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=w$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=\\sum_i w_i$</span>。两变体得分场相同当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\alpha,\\beta)$</span> 相同，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 相同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论给出一个可运行检验：对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，计算基准 CFG（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=2$</span>）与多条件组合（<span class=\"math-inline\">$m=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1=w_2=1$</span>）的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon$</span>，二者 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>，故得分场相同；而仿射族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=0.5,b=1.5$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1.5$</span>，与基准不同。代码节将验证这一恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>基准 CFG 的仿射族推广为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon^{(a,b)}=a\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)+b\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)$</span>，其保持得分语义的充要条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a+b=1$</span>；时变权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t,c)$</span> 与多条件组合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i w_i$</span> 均自动满足该条件，分别对应非自治向量场与几何平均密度。</li>\n<li>由贝叶斯分解，任意变体的隐式得分可统一写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot)+\\beta\\nabla\\log p_t(c\\mid\\cdot)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 为有效引导强度；两变体等价当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 相等，这为变体的数值比较提供了可检验判据。</li>\n<li>训练 dropout 概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 通过双目标分解调制条件分支与空条件分支的权重，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}&lt;1$</span> 是 CFG 有意义的必要条件；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\to 1$</span> 时条件分支失训，所有变体退化为无条件采样。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\nimport math\n\ntorch.manual_seed(0)\nd = 4\nmu_c = torch.randn(d)          # 条件均值\nsigma_t = 1.0\n\n# 构造得分场：p(.|∅)=N(0,I), p(.|c)=N(mu_c,I)\ndef eps_uncond(x):  return -sigma_t * x\ndef eps_cond(x):    return -sigma_t * (x - mu_c)\n\nx = torch.randn(d)\n\n# 基准 CFG, w=2\nw = 2.0\neps_base = eps_uncond(x) + w * (eps_cond(x) - eps_uncond(x))\n\n# 多条件组合 m=2, w1=w2=1, c1=c2=c -&gt; beta=2\nw1, w2 = 1.0, 1.0\neps_multi = eps_uncond(x) + w1*(eps_cond(x)-eps_uncond(x)) + w2*(eps_cond(x)-eps_uncond(x))\n\n# 仿射族 a=0.5, b=1.5 -&gt; beta=1.5\na, b = 0.5, 1.5\neps_affine = a*eps_uncond(x) + b*eps_cond(x)\n\n# 分类器重写: grad log p(c|x) = -(x-mu_c) + x = mu_c\ngrad_log_pc = mu_c\neps_clf = eps_uncond(x) + w * (-sigma_t * grad_log_pc)\n\nassert torch.allclose(eps_base, eps_multi, atol=1e-6), &quot;基准与多条件组合应相等&quot;\nassert torch.allclose(eps_base, eps_clf, atol=1e-6), &quot;基准与分类器重写应相等&quot;\nassert not torch.allclose(eps_base, eps_affine, atol=1e-6), &quot;仿射族 beta=1.5 应与基准不同&quot;\n\n# 验证 beta 相等判据: 提取 beta = (eps - eps_uncond) / (eps_cond - eps_uncond)\ndenom = eps_cond(x) - eps_uncond(x)\nbeta_base = ((eps_base - eps_uncond(x)) / denom).mean().item()\nbeta_multi = ((eps_multi - eps_uncond(x)) / denom).mean().item()\nbeta_affine = ((eps_affine - eps_uncond(x)) / denom).mean().item()\nprint(&quot;eps_base shape:&quot;, eps_base.shape)\nprint(&quot;beta_base =&quot;, beta_base, &quot; beta_multi =&quot;, beta_multi, &quot; beta_affine =&quot;, beta_affine)\nassert abs(beta_base - 2.0) &lt; 1e-5\nassert abs(beta_multi - 2.0) &lt; 1e-5\nassert abs(beta_affine - 1.5) &lt; 1e-5\nprint(&quot;all assertions passed&quot;)\n\n</code></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-变体六-引导的算子重写与谱解释\">变体六：引导的算子重写与谱解释<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-变体六-引导的算子重写与谱解释\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前述变体均在噪声预测层面对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 做代数重写。本节再给出一个算子层面的变体：将引导视为作用在得分场上的线性算子，并刻画其特征结构。定义算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_w:L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing))\\times L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))\\to L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))$</span> 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(G_w s)(x_t)=(1-w)\\,s_\\varnothing(x_t)+w\\,s_c(x_t),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\varnothing=\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_c=\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span>。基准 CFG 的隐式得分即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_w s$</span> 乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1/\\sigma_t$</span> 后的结果（符号约定见命题 18.11.1）。<strong>命题 18.11.8（算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_w$</span> 的谱结构）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_w$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))$</span> 上的有界线性算子，其算子范数满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|G_w\\|_{L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))\\to L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))}\\leq |1-w|\\,\\|s_\\varnothing\\|_{L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))}/\\|s_c\\|_{L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))}+|w|.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|G_w f\\|_{L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))}\\leq |1-w|\\,\\|s_\\varnothing f\\|_{L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))}+|w|\\,\\|s_c f\\|_{L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))}.$$</div>\n<p>由 (A1) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\varnothing,s_c\\in L^2$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 绝对连续，用 Hölder 不等式（指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2,2$</span>）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\varnothing f\\|_{L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))}\\leq\\|s_\\varnothing\\|_{L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))}\\|f\\|_{L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))}$</span>，同理对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_c$</span>。合并即得所述上界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该谱解释的价值在于：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的符号决定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_w$</span> 是否保持正定性。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in[0,1]$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_w$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\varnothing$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_c$</span> 的凸组合，对应密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)^{1-w}p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)^{w}$</span> 的得分（几何插值），该密度归一化且正；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时，系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-w&lt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_w$</span> 不再是凸组合，对应密度不再是归一化概率密度，而是“带符号测度”的得分——这正是本章第 10 节所述模式崩溃的算子根源：负系数使无条件得分项被反向叠加，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 的低密度区放大梯度，把样本推向条件众数。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&lt;0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_w$</span> 反向锐化无条件分布，对应本章第 5 节分布偏移的反向情形。需强调：谱解释只刻画线性结构，不涉及非线性采样动力学的稳定性，后者须由第 8 节数值稳定性单独处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-变体七-连续时间插值与引导调度的微分同胚\">变体七：连续时间插值与引导调度的微分同胚<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-变体七-连续时间插值与引导调度的微分同胚\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>时变权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t,c)$</span> 的一个自然推广是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 视为沿反向时间的连续调度，定义引导速度场</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_w(x_t,t)=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w(t)\\left(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\right).$$</div>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w:[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span> 连续且分段 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_w$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 局部 Lipschitz（由 (A2) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的连续性），从而概率流 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x_t=v_w(x_t,t)$</span> 在任意紧时间区间上存在唯一解（Picard–Lindelöf）。<strong>命题 18.11.9（调度不变性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若两个调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1,w_2$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1(t)-w_2(t)=k$</span> 为常数且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\neq 0$</span>，则它们诱导的概率流 ODE 的解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 时刻不相等，除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)\\equiv\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 两速度场之差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_{w_1}-v_{w_2}=(w_1-w_2)(\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing))=k\\,(\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)).$$</div>\n<p>若该差恒为零，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)=\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span>，与假设矛盾；故存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 使差非零。由 ODE 解对向量场的连续依赖（Picard–Lindelöf 的 Gronwall 估计），非零扰动在有限时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 内产生非零位移，故两解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 时刻不同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明：引导调度不能通过常数平移相互转化而不改变采样轨迹；换言之，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 的绝对值（而非仅其形状）影响最终分布。这与本章第 3 节“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 退化为普通条件采样”的结论一致——<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\equiv 1$</span> 是唯一使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_w$</span> 与条件速度场重合的调度。一个具体例子：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1(t)=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_2(t)=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{w_1}=\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{w_2}=\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span>，两 ODE 分别采样条件与无条件分布，解显然不同（除非条件与无条件分布重合）。该例子验证了调度不变性命题的边界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1$</span> 时差异最大。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-变体八-引导与条件嵌入的几何变体\">变体八：引导与条件嵌入的几何变体<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-变体八-引导与条件嵌入的几何变体\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>当条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 为连续嵌入（如文本嵌入）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 可微。定义<strong>嵌入方向引导</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon^{\\mathrm{dir}}_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\,\\big(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c_0)\\big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0$</span> 为参考条件（如空文本嵌入），<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 为方向强度。该变体与基准 CFG 的区别在于：基准用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing$</span> 作参考点，方向变体用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0$</span> 作参考点，二者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0=\\varnothing$</span> 时重合。<strong>命题 18.11.10（方向引导的得分分解）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 可微的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0=\\varnothing$</span>，则方向引导与基准 CFG 给出相同隐式得分；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0\\neq\\varnothing$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t}\\tilde\\varepsilon^{\\mathrm{dir}}_\\theta=\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)+w\\big(\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)-\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c_0)\\big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 18.11.1 的代入计算，方向变体的得分即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)+w(\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)-\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c_0))$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0=\\varnothing$</span> 时第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)-\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)$</span>，与基准 CFG 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-w)\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)+w\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 相等当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的系数匹配，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-w+w=1$</span>，恒成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>方向变体的几何意义是：它引导的是条件分布相对于参考条件分布的<strong>相对得分</strong>，而非相对于无条件的绝对得分。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 接近时，相对得分幅度小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 可取得更大而不致模式崩溃；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0=\\varnothing$</span> 时退化为基准 CFG。该变体为本章第 12 节“与联合生成的接口”提供了连续条件的自然接口：联合生成中的条件嵌入可通过方向引导与无条件分支耦合，而无需显式构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing$</span> 嵌入。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-变体间的统一恒等式\">变体间的统一恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-变体间的统一恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>将上述八个变体统一为一个恒等式。对任意变体，其隐式得分可写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t}\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)+\\beta(x_t,c)\\,\\nabla\\log p_t(c\\mid x_t),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(x_t,c)$</span> 为<strong>有效引导强度函数</strong>，对基准 CFG 为常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span>，对时变权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t,c)$</span>，对多条件组合为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i w_i$</span>，对方向引导为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\cdot\\frac{\\nabla\\log p_t(c\\mid x_t)-\\nabla\\log p_t(c_0\\mid x_t)}{\\nabla\\log p_t(c\\mid x_t)}$</span>（在分母非零处）。<strong>推论 18.11.11（有效强度的可检验判据）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，两变体在点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,c)$</span> 处给出相同隐式得分当且仅当其有效强度函数在该点相等。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由贝叶斯分解，任意变体的隐式得分均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(\\cdot)+\\beta\\nabla\\log p_t(c\\mid\\cdot)$</span> 的形式（命题 18.11.5 及命题 18.11.4 的推广）。两式相等当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1(x_t,c)=\\beta_2(x_t,c)$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(c\\mid x_t)$</span> 在 (A3) 下非零（密度为正）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论将变体的比较归结为标量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的比较，避免了逐点比较向量场的繁琐。代码节已用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 提取验证了基准、多条件组合、仿射族的等价与差异；方向引导的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0=\\varnothing$</span> 时退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0\\neq\\varnothing$</span> 时为相对强度，可同样用该判据检验。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-变体的适用边界与失效模式\">变体的适用边界与失效模式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-变体的适用边界与失效模式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上述变体并非在所有参数区间均有效。逐条列出失效边界，均以本节假设为判据：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>仿射族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a+b\\neq 1$</span></strong>：由推论 18.11.2，得分语义失效，对应密度不归一化；在采样中表现为轨迹漂移出数据流形，属本章第 10 节模式崩溃的连续版本。</li>\n<li><strong>时变权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t,c)&lt;0$</span></strong>：由命题 18.11.8 的谱解释，负系数使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_w$</span> 非凸组合，对应密度带符号；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 小）时数值不稳定，属第 8 节数值稳定性的失效情形。</li>\n<li><strong>多条件组合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i w_i&gt;1$</span></strong>：虽保持得分语义（推论 18.11.2 的恒等式），但几何平均密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c_1)^{w_1}\\cdots$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i$</span> 过大时退化为尖峰，采样多样性下降；该失效不破坏数学自洽性，仅破坏采样质量，属第 10 节模式崩溃的温和版本。</li>\n<li><strong>方向引导 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0\\neq\\varnothing$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(c\\mid x_t)=0$</span></strong>：推论 18.11.11 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 定义在分母为零处失效，此时方向引导退化为无条件采样；该退化是良性的，不构成反例，但需在实现中做分母保护（代码节以 <code>atol</code> 处理）。</li>\n<li><strong>dropout <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}=1$</span></strong>：由命题 18.11.6，条件分支失训，所有变体退化为无条件采样；这是 CFG 有意义的严格边界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}&lt;1$</span> 为必要条件。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>以上边界均在本节假设 (A1)–(A5) 下可验证，无需引入新假设。完整反例构造（含数值轨迹）归入本章第 10 节，本节只给出边界判据，不展开半成品论证。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df18--h-与联合生成的接口\">与联合生成的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-与联合生成的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号：数据空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}\\subseteq\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span>，Borel <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}(\\mathcal{X})$</span>），条件空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span> 为可数离散集或紧致度量空间（下文分别处理），空条件记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing\\in\\mathcal{C}$</span>。前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t)_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span> 满足标准 VP-SDE，其边际密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续；条件边际密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x\\mid c)$</span> 与无条件边际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x\\mid\\varnothing)=p_t(x)$</span> 同样绝对连续。得分网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c,t)$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，与得分的关系为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c,t)=-\\sigma_t\\,s_\\theta(x_t,c,t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x\\mid c)$</span>。引导权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span> 为标量常数。训练 dropout 概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\in[0,1)$</span> 已在第 4 节定义。</p>\n<p>本节引入的新符号如下，且仅在本节使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_c$</span>：条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 在联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X,C)\\sim\\pi$</span> 下的条件分布，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_c(\\mathrm{d}x)=\\pi(\\mathrm{d}x\\mid C=c)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\varnothing$</span> 表示把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 置空后的边际分布，按第 4 节约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\varnothing=\\int_{\\mathcal{C}}\\pi_c\\,\\mu(\\mathrm{d}c)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span> 上的先验测度（离散情形为计数测度归一化，连续情形为紧致空间上的概率测度）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{t,c}$</span>：扩散时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 处的前向边际，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{t,c}(\\mathrm{d}x)=p_t(x\\mid c)\\mathrm{d}x$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{t,\\varnothing}=p_t(x)\\mathrm{d}x$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{w}_t$</span>：CFG 在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 诱导的“引导边际”，定义为得分场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_w(x,t)=s_\\theta(x,\\varnothing,t)+w\\,(s_\\theta(x,c,t)-s_\\theta(x,\\varnothing,t))$</span> 所对应的（形式）密度，其存在性由下面的命题 12.1 保证。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{J}_{t,c}$</span>：条件得分与无条件得分之差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{J}_{t,c}(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x\\mid c)-\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)$</span>，称为条件得分残差场（score residual field）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathrm{joint}}$</span>：联合生成的目标分布，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X,C)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}\\times\\mathcal{C}$</span> 上的联合测度；其与 CFG 接口的核心问题是：CFG 采样得到的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 边缘是否等于某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathrm{joint}}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 边缘，以及在何种意义下可以由此恢复条件结构。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>假设清单（本节所有命题共享，逐条在命题处引用）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(A1) 正则性</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathcal{C}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x\\mid c)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 连续可微且严格正，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x\\mid c)$</span> 局部有界；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c,t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 连续可微且局部 Lipschitz。</li>\n<li><strong>(A2) 可积性</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathcal{X}}\\|\\mathcal{J}_{t,c}(x)\\|^2\\,p_t(x\\mid c)\\,\\mathrm{d}x&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathcal{X}}\\|\\mathcal{J}_{t,c}(x)\\|^2\\,p_t(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x&lt;\\infty$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>(A3) 边界通量消失</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{\\|x\\|\\to\\infty}p_t(x\\mid c)\\,\\mathcal{J}_{t,c}(x)=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{\\|x\\|\\to\\infty}p_t(x)\\,\\mathcal{J}_{t,c}(x)=0$</span>，保证分部积分无边界项。</li>\n<li><strong>(A4) 测度绝对连续</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_c\\ll\\pi_\\varnothing$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 成立（即条件分布关于无条件分布绝对连续），Radon–Nikodym 导数记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c(x)=\\mathrm{d}\\pi_c/\\mathrm{d}\\pi_\\varnothing(x)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c\\in L^2(\\pi_\\varnothing)$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>(A5) 先验非退化</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu(\\{c\\})&gt;0$</span> 对离散情形每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 成立；连续情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span> 的 Borel 集绝对连续且密度有正下界。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>(A4) 是本节接口论证的关键：它把“条件分布”与“无条件分布”放在同一测度空间上比较，从而使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{J}_{t,c}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 意义合法。若 (A4) 失效（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_c$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\varnothing$</span> 互相奇异），则下面的命题 12.2 不成立，反例边界见第 10 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-12-1-引导边际的存在性与显式表达\">12.1 引导边际的存在性与显式表达<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-12-1-引导边际的存在性与显式表达\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 12.1（引导边际的存在性）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span>，存在概率密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{w}_t(x\\mid c)$</span> 使得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x\\log p^{w}_t(x\\mid c)=s_\\theta(x,\\varnothing,t)+w\\,(s_\\theta(x,c,t)-s_\\theta(x,\\varnothing,t)),$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 精确等于真实得分时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{w}_t$</span> 具有显式形式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p^{w}_t(x\\mid c)=\\frac{p_t(x\\mid c)^{w}\\,p_t(x)^{1-w}}{Z_{t,c}(w)},\\qquad Z_{t,c}(w)=\\int_{\\mathcal{X}}p_t(x\\mid c)^{w}\\,p_t(x)^{1-w}\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　先验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{t,c}(w)\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>。由 (A1) 严格正性，被积函数处处正；由 (A2) 与 (A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x\\mid c)^{w}p_t(x)^{1-w}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in[0,1]$</span> 时被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max(p_t(x\\mid c),p_t(x))$</span> 控制，而后者可积；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x\\mid c)^{w}$</span> 控制，由 (A2) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{J}_{t,c}$</span> 的平方可积性及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_t(x\\mid c)$</span> 局部有界（(A1)）知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x\\mid c)^{w}$</span> 可积。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{t,c}(w)\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>。</p>\n<p>再验证得分恒等式。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p^{w}_t$</span> 求梯度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x\\log p^{w}_t(x\\mid c)=w\\,\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x\\mid c)+(1-w)\\,\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x).$$</div>\n<p>将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x,c,t)=-\\sigma_t^{-1}\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x\\mid c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x,\\varnothing,t)=-\\sigma_t^{-1}\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)$</span> 代入右端，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t$</span> 即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p^{w}_t=-\\sigma_t^{-1}\\tilde s_w$</span>，与定义一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 12.1 的意义在于：CFG 的插值公式在得分层面是线性的，但在密度层面是<strong>几何插值</strong>（指数族形式的加权几何平均），而非线性插值。这一区别是后续分布偏移分析的根源。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 12.2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 退化）</strong>　在命题 12.1 的假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{1}_t(x\\mid c)=p_t(x\\mid c)$</span>，即 CFG 退化为普通条件采样。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{t,c}(1)=\\int p_t(x\\mid c)\\mathrm{d}x=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{1}_t=p_t(x\\mid c)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-12-2-与联合分布的接口-边缘一致性\">12.2 与联合分布的接口：边缘一致性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-12-2-与联合分布的接口-边缘一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节标题承诺的核心问题是：CFG 采样得到的分布，能否视为某个联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathrm{joint}}$</span> 的边缘？下面的命题给出精确回答。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.3（联合接口的充分条件）</strong>　设 (A1)–(A5) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span>。则存在联合测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathrm{joint}}$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}\\times\\mathcal{C}$</span>，使得其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 边缘等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathcal{C}}\\pi_c\\,\\mu(\\mathrm{d}c)=\\pi_\\varnothing$</span>，且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>-几乎每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，条件边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_c$</span>。此时 CFG（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span>）采样分布与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathrm{joint}}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 边缘一致。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathrm{joint}}(\\mathrm{d}x,\\mathrm{d}c)=\\pi_c(\\mathrm{d}x)\\,\\mu(\\mathrm{d}c)$</span>。由 (A5) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 为概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathrm{joint}}$</span> 为概率测度。其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\pi_c\\,\\mu(\\mathrm{d}c)=\\pi_\\varnothing$</span>（第 4 节定义）。由命题 12.1 与推论 12.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 CFG 采样分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\varnothing$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.4（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\neq 1$</span> 时的接口失效）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A5) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{J}_{0,c}\\not\\equiv 0$</span>（即条件与无条件分布在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处确有差异），则不存在联合测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathrm{joint}}$</span> 使得 CFG 采样分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{w}_0$</span> 等于其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 边缘且条件边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_c$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　反设存在这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathrm{joint}}$</span>。则其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{w}_0$</span> 必须满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{w}_0=\\int\\pi_c\\,\\mu(\\mathrm{d}c)=\\pi_\\varnothing$</span>，因为条件边缘被要求为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_c$</span>。但由命题 12.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{w}_0(\\mathrm{d}x)=p^{w}_0(x\\mid c)\\mathrm{d}x$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{w}_0\\propto p_0(x\\mid c)^{w}p_0(x)^{1-w}$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{J}_{0,c}\\not\\equiv 0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0(x\\mid c)\\neq p_0(x)$</span> 于正测度集，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{w}_0\\neq p_0$</span> 于正测度集（指数插值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\neq 1$</span> 时一般不等于端点），与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{w}_0=\\pi_\\varnothing$</span> 矛盾。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 12.4 说明：<strong>CFG 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 采样不是任何具有指定条件边缘的联合分布的边缘</strong>。它只能被解释为“对条件分布的锐化”，而不能被解释为“从联合分布中条件采样”。这正是本节标题“接口”的精确含义：CFG 与联合生成之间存在一个不可消除的间隙，间隙的大小由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w-1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{J}_{0,c}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\pi_\\varnothing)$</span> 范数控制。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-12-3-接口的定量刻画-L-2-间隙\">12.3 接口的定量刻画：<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 间隙<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-12-3-接口的定量刻画-L-2-间隙\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 12.5（间隙的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 估计）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 1$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_w=\\pi^{w}_0-\\pi_\\varnothing$</span> 为带符号测度。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\delta_w\\|_{TV}\\le \\frac{w-1}{2}\\,\\|\\mathcal{J}_{0,c}\\|_{L^2(\\pi_\\varnothing)}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由命题 12.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{w}_0$</span> 的密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{w}_0=Z^{-1}p_0(x\\mid c)^{w}p_0(x)^{1-w}$</span>。写 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0(x\\mid c)=r_c(x)p_0(x)$</span>（(A4)），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p^{w}_0(x)=\\frac{r_c(x)^{w}p_0(x)}{Z(w)},\\qquad Z(w)=\\int r_c(x)^{w}p_0(x)\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n<p>由 Taylor 展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z(w)=\\log Z(1)+(w-1)\\int\\log r_c\\,\\mathrm{d}\\pi_\\varnothing+O((w-1)^2)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z(1)=1$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{w}_0-p_0=p_0\\,(r_c^{w}/Z(w)-1)$</span>。由 (A4) <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c\\in L^2(\\pi_\\varnothing)$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log r_c$</span> 的可积性（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c&gt;0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c\\in L^2$</span> 保证），一阶项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(w-1)p_0(\\log r_c-\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_\\varnothing}\\log r_c)$</span>。全变差范数满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta_w\\|_{TV}\\le\\frac12\\|p^{w}_0-p_0\\|_{L^1(\\pi_\\varnothing)}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p^{w}_0-p_0\\|_{L^1}\\le\\|p^{w}_0-p_0\\|_{L^2}$</span>（Cauchy–Schwarz，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\varnothing$</span> 为概率测度）。由 (A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\log r_c-\\mathbb{E}\\log r_c\\|_{L^2(\\pi_\\varnothing)}\\le\\|\\mathcal{J}_{0,c}\\|_{L^2(\\pi_\\varnothing)}$</span>（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{J}_{0,c}=\\nabla\\log r_c$</span> 且 Poincaré 型不等式在 (A1) 局部有界下成立），合并即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 12.5 的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12$</span> 不可改进为更小的一般常数，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 之间的 Cauchy–Schwarz 在指示函数上取等。该估计表明：<strong>接口间隙随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w-1$</span> 线性增长，且被条件得分残差的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数控制</strong>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{J}_{0,c}$</span> 很小（条件与无条件分布接近）时，CFG 与联合生成的接口近似成立；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{J}_{0,c}$</span> 很大（条件信息强）时，接口间隙不可忽略。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-12-4-具体例子-一维高斯情形\">12.4 具体例子：一维高斯情形<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-12-4-具体例子-一维高斯情形\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}=\\mathbb{R}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0(x)=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0(x\\mid c)=\\mathcal{N}(\\mu_c,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_c\\neq 0$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c(x)=\\exp(\\mu_c x-\\mu_c^2/2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{J}_{0,c}(x)=\\mu_c$</span> 为常数场。</p>\n<p>由命题 12.1，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p^{w}_0(x\\mid c)=\\frac{\\exp\\!\\left(w\\mu_c x-\\frac{w\\mu_c^2}{2}\\right)\\exp\\!\\left(-\\frac{x^2}{2}\\right)}{Z(w)}=\\mathcal{N}(w\\mu_c,1).$$</div>\n<p>即 CFG 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时把条件均值从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_c$</span> 放大到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\mu_c$</span>，方差不变。这验证了命题 12.1 的显式公式，也验证了命题 12.4：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{w}_0=\\mathcal{N}(w\\mu_c,1)\\neq\\mathcal{N}(0,1)=\\pi_\\varnothing$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_c\\neq 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\neq 1$</span>）。同时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mathcal{J}_{0,c}\\|_{L^2(\\pi_\\varnothing)}=|\\mu_c|$</span>，命题 12.5 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta_w\\|_{TV}\\le\\frac{w-1}{2}|\\mu_c|$</span>，与直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mathcal{N}(w\\mu_c,1)-\\mathcal{N}(0,1)\\|_{TV}\\le\\frac{w-1}{2}|\\mu_c|$</span>（由 Pinsker 不等式）一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-12-5-接口的操作含义-联合生成中的条件注入\">12.5 接口的操作含义：联合生成中的条件注入<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-12-5-接口的操作含义-联合生成中的条件注入\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在联合生成（第 15 节接口）中，目标是从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathrm{joint}}$</span> 采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X,C)$</span>。CFG 提供的是一个<strong>单向接口</strong>：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，它产生一个锐化的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 分布，但不产生 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的分布。若要在联合生成中使用 CFG，必须外挂一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的先验采样器（例如从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，再以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span>），此时得到的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X,C)$</span> 联合分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{w}_c\\otimes\\mu$</span>，其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\pi^{w}_c\\,\\mu(\\mathrm{d}c)$</span>，一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\varnothing$</span>。由命题 12.4，这个联合分布不可能是“以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_c$</span> 为条件边缘”的联合分布；它对应的是一个<strong>被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 扭曲的条件族</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\pi^{w}_c\\}_{c\\in\\mathcal{C}}$</span>。因此，联合生成若要与 CFG 接口，必须显式记录扭曲参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span>，并在下游任务中把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{w}_c$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_c$</span> 作为条件分布使用。这一操作含义是本节标题“接口”的最终落点：<strong>CFG 不是联合生成的一个特例，而是联合生成的一个带扭曲参数的投影</strong>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-12-6-接口间隙的变分刻画-从-L-2-到-KL\">12.6 接口间隙的变分刻画：从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 到 KL<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-12-6-接口间隙的变分刻画-从-L-2-到-KL\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 12.5 给出的是全变差意义下的线性界。联合生成的下游任务（例如条件似然评估、条件采样一致性检验）更常用的是 KL 散度与 Fisher 信息。本节给出接口间隙在这两种度量下的精确恒等式，它们把“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 扭曲”与“条件得分残差”的联系写得比命题 12.5 更紧。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.6（KL 间隙的精确恒等式）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{w}_0$</span> 由命题 12.1 给出。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}^{w}_c=\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi^{w}_0\\,\\|\\,\\pi_\\varnothing)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}^{w}_c=\\log Z(w)-w\\,\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi^{w}_0}\\!\\left[\\log r_c\\right],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z(w)=\\int r_c^{w}\\,\\mathrm{d}\\pi_\\varnothing$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c=\\mathrm{d}\\pi_c/\\mathrm{d}\\pi_\\varnothing$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由命题 12.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{w}_0=r_c^{w}p_0/Z(w)$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}^{w}_c=\\int p^{w}_0\\log\\frac{p^{w}_0}{p_0}\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int p^{w}_0\\left(w\\log r_c-\\log Z(w)\\right)\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n<p>右端第一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\,\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi^{w}_0}[\\log r_c]$</span>，第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log Z(w)$</span>（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{w}_0$</span> 为概率密度，积分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）。整理即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 12.6 的关键在于：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}^{w}_c$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 是<strong>凸函数</strong>（因为它是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\mapsto \\log\\int e^{w\\log r_c}\\,\\mathrm{d}\\pi_\\varnothing$</span> 与线性项之差，前者为对数矩母函数，凸）。因此接口间隙在 KL 意义下关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 没有“平台”，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 即刻产生正的间隙，且间隙随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 单调增（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 1$</span> 一侧）。这与命题 12.5 的线性界互补：全变差界给出一阶增长的上界，KL 恒等式给出精确值。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 12.7（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to 1$</span> 的二阶展开）</strong>　在命题 12.6 的假设下，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to 1$</span> 时，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}^{w}_c=\\frac{(w-1)^2}{2}\\,\\mathrm{Var}_{\\pi_\\varnothing}(\\log r_c)+O((w-1)^3).$$</div>\n<p>特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}^{1}_c=0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\left.\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}w}\\mathrm{KL}^{w}_c\\right|_{w=1}=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(w)=\\log Z(w)=\\log\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_\\varnothing}[e^{w\\log r_c}]$</span> 为对数矩母函数。由命题 12.6，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}^{w}_c=M(w)-wM'(w)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 处 Taylor 展开：<span class=\"math-inline\">$M(w)=M(1)+(w-1)M'(1)+\\frac{(w-1)^2}{2}M''(1)+O((w-1)^3)$</span>。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(1)=\\log\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_\\varnothing}[r_c]=\\log 1=0$</span>（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_c$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\varnothing$</span> 的密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_\\varnothing}[r_c]=1$</span>）。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M'(w)=\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi^{w}_0}[\\log r_c]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M''(w)=\\mathrm{Var}_{\\pi^{w}_0}(\\log r_c)$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M'(1)=\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_\\varnothing}[\\log r_c]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M''(1)=\\mathrm{Var}_{\\pi_\\varnothing}(\\log r_c)$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}^{w}_c=M(w)-wM'(w)=\\left[M(1)-M'(1)\\right]+(w-1)\\left[M'(1)-M'(1)-M''(1)\\right]+\\frac{(w-1)^2}{2}M''(1)+O((w-1)^3).$$</div>\n<p>第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(1)-M'(1)=-\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_\\varnothing}[\\log r_c]$</span>，第二项为零，第三项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{(w-1)^2}{2}\\mathrm{Var}_{\\pi_\\varnothing}(\\log r_c)$</span>。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}^{1}_c=0$</span> 要求常数项为零，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_\\varnothing}[\\log r_c]=0$</span>。这一等式一般不成立；实际上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}^{1}_c=M(1)-1\\cdot M'(1)=-\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_\\varnothing}[\\log r_c]$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi_\\varnothing\\|\\pi_\\varnothing)=0$</span> 只给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(1)=0$</span>，不给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M'(1)=0$</span>。因此上面的展开需要精确表述：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}^{w}_c$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 处的值由命题 12.6 直接计算为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z(1)=1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi^{1}_0}[\\log r_c]=\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_\\varnothing}[\\log r_c]$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}^{1}_c=\\log 1-1\\cdot\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_\\varnothing}[\\log r_c]$</span>；要使之为零必须 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_\\varnothing}[\\log r_c]=0$</span>，这仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c\\equiv 1$</span> 时成立）。故推论 12.7 的展开应理解为<strong>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c\\equiv 1$</span> 的邻域内</strong>（即条件与无条件分布接近时）成立；一般情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}^{w}_c$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 处不取零，这与命题 12.4 一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 CFG 采样分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\varnothing$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi_\\varnothing\\|\\pi_\\varnothing)=0$</span> 是恒等式，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}^{1}_c$</span> 必须为零。矛盾来自命题 12.6 的推导中把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{w}_0$</span> 当作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{w}_0$</span> 的密度时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{1}_0=r_cp_0/Z(1)=r_cp_0=p_0(x\\mid c)$</span>，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span>。因此命题 12.6 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}^{w}_c$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi^{w}_0\\|\\pi_\\varnothing)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi_c\\|\\pi_\\varnothing)$</span>，一般不为零。推论 12.7 的正确表述是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}^{w}_c$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 处取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi_c\\|\\pi_\\varnothing)$</span>，其二阶展开围绕该值进行，二阶系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_{\\pi_c}(\\log r_c)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>上述推导暴露了一个接口层面的重要事实：<strong><span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 CFG 采样分布是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_c$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\varnothing$</span></strong>。命题 12.3 中“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 CFG 采样分布与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathrm{joint}}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 边缘一致”一语，指的是对给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 的条件采样，而非对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 边缘化后的采样。若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 也视为随机（从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 采样），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 的 CFG 联合采样分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_c\\otimes\\mu$</span>，其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\varnothing$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathrm{joint}}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 边缘一致。这一区分是接口论证的精确化，也是命题 12.4 与命题 12.3 不矛盾的原因：命题 12.4 的反设要求“条件边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_c$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{w}_0$</span>”，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{w}_0=\\pi_c$</span> 对给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 成立，边缘化后为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\varnothing$</span>，恰好满足命题 12.3。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-12-7-接口的-Fisher-度量与-w-的可辨识性\">12.7 接口的 Fisher 度量与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的可辨识性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-12-7-接口的-Fisher-度量与-w-的可辨识性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>联合生成的下游任务若需要从 CFG 采样中<strong>反推</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span>，则必须知道 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 在何种意义下可辨识。下面的命题给出 Fisher 信息意义下的可辨识性条件。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.8（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的局部可辨识性）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c\\not\\equiv 1$</span>。则族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p^{w}_0\\}_{w\\ge 0}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 处的 Fisher 信息为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(1)=\\mathrm{Var}_{\\pi_c}(\\log r_c),$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(1)&gt;0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log r_c$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_c$</span> 下非退化。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　Fisher 信息定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(w)=\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi^{w}_0}[(\\partial_w\\log p^{w}_0)^2]$</span>。由命题 12.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p^{w}_0=w\\log r_c-\\log Z(w)+\\log p_0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_w\\log p^{w}_0=\\log r_c-M'(w)$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(w)=\\mathrm{Var}_{\\pi^{w}_0}(\\log r_c)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{1}_0=\\pi_c$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(1)=\\mathrm{Var}_{\\pi_c}(\\log r_c)$</span>。非退化性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log r_c$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_c$</span> 下非常数等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c$</span> 非常数（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 为单射），即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_c\\neq\\pi_\\varnothing$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 12.8 说明：只要条件分布与无条件分布确有差异，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 处就是局部可辨识的，且可辨识度由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log r_c$</span> 在条件分布下的方差量化。这与命题 12.5 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\pi_\\varnothing)$</span> 范数形成对照：前者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_c$</span> 下度量，后者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\varnothing$</span> 下度量，二者通过测度变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c$</span> 联系。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\varnothing$</span> 下方差大而在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_c$</span> 下方差小时（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\varnothing$</span> 的尾部取大值），<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的可辨识性弱于接口间隙的大小，这是联合生成中“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 难以从样本反推”的数学根源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-12-8-接口的复合-多条件与联合条件的注入\">12.8 接口的复合：多条件与联合条件的注入<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-12-8-接口的复合-多条件与联合条件的注入\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>联合生成常涉及多个条件变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=(C_1,\\dots,C_m)$</span>。CFG 的接口在此情形下需要说明：逐条件引导与联合引导是否等价。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}=\\mathcal{C}_1\\times\\cdots\\times\\mathcal{C}_m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=\\mu_1\\otimes\\cdots\\otimes\\mu_m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c=\\mathrm{d}\\pi_c/\\mathrm{d}\\pi_\\varnothing$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.9（逐条件引导的不可交换性）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\ge 2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_j\\ge 0$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 个条件的引导权重。逐条件依次引导得到的密度为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p^{w_1,\\dots,w_m}_0\\propto p_0\\prod_{j=1}^{m}\\left(\\frac{p_0(x\\mid c_j)}{p_0(x)}\\right)^{w_j},$$</div>\n<p>而联合引导（以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=(c_1,\\dots,c_m)$</span> 为单一条件、权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span>）得到的密度为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p^{w}_0\\propto p_0\\left(\\frac{p_0(x\\mid c)}{p_0(x)}\\right)^{w}.$$</div>\n<p>二者一般不等，除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0(x\\mid c)=\\prod_j p_0(x\\mid c_j)/p_0(x)^{m-1}$</span>（即条件独立且边际一致）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　逐条件引导的密度由命题 12.1 逐次应用得到：每次以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_j$</span> 为条件、以当前密度为“无条件”密度做几何插值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 次复合给出上式。联合引导的密度由命题 12.1 一次性应用得到。二者相等当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_j r_{c_j}^{w_j}=r_c^{w}$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\varnothing$</span>-a.e.，取对数得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j w_j\\log r_{c_j}=w\\log r_c$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_j=w$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c=\\prod_j r_{c_j}$</span>（条件独立）时成立；一般情形不成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 12.9 的接口含义是：<strong>联合生成若要把多个条件注入 CFG，必须选择“逐条件复合”或“联合条件”之一，二者给出不同的扭曲族</strong>。逐条件复合的扭曲是乘性的（在对数得分层面为加性），联合条件的扭曲是整体的；前者对应“每个条件独立锐化”，后者对应“联合条件整体锐化”。在联合生成的下游任务中，若条件之间统计相关，则逐条件复合会引入额外的交互项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j w_j\\log r_{c_j}-w\\log r_c$</span>，该交互项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_j=1$</span> 时退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\prod_j r_{c_j}-\\log r_c$</span>，即条件独立性的对数偏差。这一偏差是联合生成接口在多条件下的精确刻画。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-12-9-接口的时间一致性-从-t-T-到-t-0\">12.9 接口的时间一致性：从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-12-9-接口的时间一致性-从-t-T-到-t-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序各节的接口讨论均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处进行。联合生成的实际采样从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 出发，经反向 SDE 或概率流 ODE 到达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span>。下面的命题说明：接口间隙在时间演化下如何传播。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.10（接口间隙的时间传播）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta^{w}_t=\\pi^{w}_{t}-\\pi_{t,\\varnothing}$</span> 为时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的带符号测度。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;s&lt;t\\le T$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\delta^{w}_t\\|_{TV}\\le \\|\\delta^{w}_s\\|_{TV}+\\int_{s}^{t}\\left\\|\\nabla\\cdot\\left(\\tilde s_w-s_\\varnothing\\right)\\right\\|_{L^1(\\pi^{w}_\\tau)}\\,\\mathrm{d}\\tau,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_w$</span> 为 CFG 得分场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\varnothing$</span> 为无条件得分场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot$</span> 为散度算子（关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的 Euclid 度量）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{w}_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{t,\\varnothing}$</span> 分别满足以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_w$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\varnothing$</span> 为漂移的反向 Fokker–Planck 方程。两者之差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta^{w}_t$</span> 满足线性方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\delta^{w}_t=-\\nabla\\cdot(\\tilde s_w\\delta^{w}_t)-\\nabla\\cdot((\\tilde s_w-s_\\varnothing)\\pi_{t,\\varnothing})$</span>。对全变差范数取时间导数，由 (A1) 局部 Lipschitz 与 (A3) 边界通量消失，分部积分给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\|\\delta^{w}_t\\|_{TV}\\le\\|\\nabla\\cdot(\\tilde s_w-s_\\varnothing)\\|_{L^1(\\pi^{w}_t)}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[s,t]$</span> 积分即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 12.10 的接口含义是：<strong>接口间隙不是静态的，它沿反向时间被散度项累积放大</strong>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处（先验附近），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{w}_T$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{T,\\varnothing}$</span> 都近似为标准高斯，间隙小；随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 减小，条件信息逐渐注入，散度项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(\\tilde s_w-s_\\varnothing)$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 范数增大，间隙累积。这解释了为何 CFG 的分布偏移在采样末期（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小）最显著，而在采样初期（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 大）几乎不可见。联合生成若要在中间时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 注入条件，必须意识到此时的接口间隙已被前序时间累积，不能简单以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 的间隙估计代替。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-12-10-接口的极限-w-to-infty-与联合生成的退化\">12.10 接口的极限：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 与联合生成的退化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-12-10-接口的极限-w-to-infty-与联合生成的退化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 7 节已讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 时 CFG 退化为条件分布的众数附近。本节从联合接口角度补充：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 时接口间隙如何发散，以及联合生成在此极限下退化为何种对象。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.11（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 的接口发散）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_c\\neq\\pi_\\varnothing$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{ess\\,sup}_{\\pi_\\varnothing}\\log r_c&lt;\\infty$</span>。则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{w}_0$</span> 弱收敛于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_c$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log r_c$</span> 取最大值处的条件化测度（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_c$</span> 的“最可几”子集上的归一化限制），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}^{w}_c\\to\\infty$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log r_c$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\varnothing$</span> 下无界。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由命题 12.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{w}_0\\propto r_c^{w}p_0$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c^{w}$</span> 的质量集中在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log r_c$</span> 的最大值集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_c=\\{x:\\log r_c(x)=\\mathrm{ess\\,sup}\\}$</span> 上（Laplace 方法，由 (A1) 连续性与 (A3) 边界条件保证）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{w}_0$</span> 弱收敛于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\varnothing$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_c$</span> 上的条件化测度，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\varnothing$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_c$</span> 上的条件化等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_c$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_c$</span> 上的条件化（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_c$</span> 上为常数）。KL 发散性由命题 12.6：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}^{w}_c=M(w)-wM'(w)$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log r_c$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\varnothing$</span> 下无界时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(w)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 超线性增长，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}^{w}_c\\to\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 12.11 的接口含义是：<strong><span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 时 CFG 采样退化为条件分布的“最可几子集”上的均匀化，而非条件分布本身</strong>。联合生成若在此极限下使用 CFG，得到的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X,C)$</span> 联合分布为“每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 对应其最可几子集上的均匀分布”与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 的乘积，其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 边缘高度集中，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathrm{joint}}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 边缘相差甚远。这正是第 10 节“引导过强导致模式崩溃”的接口层面表述：模式崩溃不是采样误差，而是接口间隙在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 时的必然发散。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-12-11-接口的可逆性-从-CFG-采样恢复联合分布\">12.11 接口的可逆性：从 CFG 采样恢复联合分布<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-12-11-接口的可逆性-从-CFG-采样恢复联合分布\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出接口的逆向问题：给定 CFG 在若干 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 下的采样，能否恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathrm{joint}}$</span>？下面的命题给出可逆性的充分条件。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.12（接口的可逆性）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\varnothing$</span> 下取值于紧集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[a,b]\\subset(0,\\infty)$</span>。则族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\pi^{w}_0\\}_{w\\ge 0}$</span> 的矩母函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_c(w)=\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_\\varnothing}[r_c^{w}]$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span> 上解析，且由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\pi^{w}_0\\}_{w\\in\\mathbb{N}}$</span> 可唯一确定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\varnothing$</span>-a.e. 的取值，从而唯一确定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_c$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　<span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c$</span> 紧支撑于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[a,b]$</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_c(w)$</span> 对全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span> 有限且解析（由 (A4) <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c\\in L^2$</span> 与紧支撑）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{w}_0$</span> 的密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c^{w}p_0/M_c(w)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{w}_0$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\varnothing$</span> 的 Radon–Nikodym 导数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c^{w}/M_c(w)$</span>。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\pi^{w}_0\\}_{w\\in\\mathbb{N}}$</span>，可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi^{w}_0}[\\log r_c]=M_c'(w)/M_c(w)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span>，从而得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_c$</span> 在对数导数层面的全部值。由解析性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_c$</span> 由其在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{N}$</span> 上的值唯一确定（恒等定理），进而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_c$</span> 的 Laplace 逆变换唯一确定（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c$</span> 紧支撑，Laplace 变换为单射）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 12.12 的接口含义是：<strong>在条件得分残差有界的情形下，CFG 的多权重采样足以反推联合分布的条件结构</strong>。这为联合生成提供了一个操作路径：若下游任务需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathrm{joint}}$</span> 的条件边缘，可对同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 在多个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 下采样，通过矩母函数的对数导数恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c$</span>，再乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\varnothing$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_c$</span>。该路径的代价是每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 需要多次采样，且要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c$</span> 有界（即条件分布不能在任何区域比无条件分布“重”无穷倍）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c$</span> 无界（例如条件分布支撑比无条件分布窄但尾部更重），则 Laplace 变换的单射性失效，接口不可逆，这与命题 12.11 的 KL 发散性一致。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>CFG 的插值公式在得分层面线性，在密度层面为几何插值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{w}_t\\propto p_t(x\\mid c)^{w}p_t(x)^{1-w}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 严格退化为条件采样（命题 12.1、推论 12.2）。</li>\n<li>与联合分布的接口在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时成立（命题 12.3），在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 且条件信息非平凡时失效（命题 12.4）；失效的定量上界由条件得分残差的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\pi_\\varnothing)$</span> 范数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w-1$</span> 的乘积控制（命题 12.5）。</li>\n<li>联合生成使用 CFG 时必须把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{w}_c$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_c$</span> 视为条件分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 是不可消除的扭曲参数；一维高斯例子给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{w}_0=\\mathcal{N}(w\\mu_c,1)$</span> 的精确验证。</li>\n<li>CFG 的接口间隙在 KL 意义下有精确恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}^{w}_c=\\log Z(w)-w\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi^{w}_0}[\\log r_c]$</span>（命题 12.6），在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 处取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi_c\\|\\pi_\\varnothing)$</span> 而非零；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的局部可辨识性由 Fisher 信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_{\\pi_c}(\\log r_c)$</span> 刻画（命题 12.8）。</li>\n<li>多条件注入时逐条件复合与联合引导一般不可交换（命题 12.9），交互项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j w_j\\log r_{c_j}-w\\log r_c$</span>；接口间隙沿反向时间被散度项累积放大（命题 12.10），在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小时最显著。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 时 CFG 退化为条件分布最可几子集上的均匀化，接口间隙发散（命题 12.11）；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c$</span> 有界时多权重采样可反推联合分布的条件结构（命题 12.12），<span class=\"math-inline\">$r_c$</span> 无界时接口不可逆。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df18--h-代码-CFG-采样\">代码：CFG 采样<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-代码-CFG-采样\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号。记数据维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb{N}$</span>，条件空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span> 为有限集或可测空间，空条件记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing\\in\\mathcal{C}$</span>。扩散过程在时间网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_N$</span> 上离散，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>。噪声预测网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathcal{C}\\times\\{t_n\\}\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(c,t_n)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>-Lipschitz 且一致有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|\\le B_\\varepsilon$</span>。引导权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span>。前序节已建立 CFG 插值公式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=(1-w)\\,\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\,\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c).$$</div>\n<p>以及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 退化为普通条件采样、<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 锐化条件分布、训练时以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 置空。本节只使用这些符号，不引入新的概率对象；唯一新增的是数值实现所需的机器精度常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>（取 <code>np.finfo(float).eps</code>）与用于稳定性截断的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{\\mathrm{clamp}}&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>输入输出契约。</strong> 算法输入为：初始噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_N}\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d}$</span>（形状 <code>(B, d)</code>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 为批大小）、条件批次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>（形状 <code>(B,)</code>，取值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span> 中整数标签或空标签 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing$</span> 的编码）、权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in\\mathbb{R}_{\\ge0}$</span>、时间表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_n\\}_{n=0}^N$</span>、以及网络可调用对象。输出为采样轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_0}\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d}$</span>（形状 <code>(B, d)</code>）。数值范围：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 按前序节的方差保持参数化被缩放到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 量级，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 被有界约束，故中间量不溢出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-1-离散反向更新的数学形式\">1. 离散反向更新的数学形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-1-离散反向更新的数学形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设前序节给出的反向离散更新为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_{n-1}}=\\mu_\\theta(x_{t_n},t_n,c)+\\sigma_n z_n,\\qquad z_n\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 线性表出。CFG 采样把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_{t_n},t_n,c)$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_{t_n},t_n,c)$</span>，其余结构不变。因此算法核心更新为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_{n-1}}=\\mu_{\\tilde\\theta}(x_{t_n},t_n,c)+\\sigma_n z_n,$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{\\tilde\\theta}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的差别仅在噪声预测项。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的线性性，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 仿射，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_{\\tilde\\theta}=\\mu_{\\theta,\\varnothing}+w\\left(\\mu_{\\theta,c}-\\mu_{\\theta,\\varnothing}\\right),$$</div>\n<p>即插值在漂移层面逐点成立。这一步不需要交换极限，只是有限维仿射组合。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.13.1（插值的逐点稳定性）</strong> 假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)$</span> 均 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>-Lipschitz 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|\\le B_\\varepsilon$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,c)-\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(y,c)\\|\\le (1+|w-1|)L\\|x-y\\|,$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,c)\\|\\le (1+|w-1|)B_\\varepsilon$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 写 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta=\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)+w(\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing))$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,c)-\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(y,c)\n=(1-w)\\big[\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,\\varnothing)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(y,\\varnothing)\\big]\n+w\\big[\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(y,c)\\big].$$</div>\n<p>取范数并用三角不等式与 Lipschitz 性得第一式；有界性同理。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 增大时 Lipschitz 常数线性增长，这是数值稳定性的来源之一，也是第 10 节模式崩溃反例的定量入口。本节代码用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in\\{0,1,2\\}$</span> 验证逐点等价与退化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-2-数值误差来源与量级\">2. 数值误差来源与量级<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-2-数值误差来源与量级\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>三类误差：(i) 浮点舍入，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\cdot\\|\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\le5$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\le2000$</span> 下可忽略；(ii) 插值公式的代数误差为零（有限维仿射组合无截断）；(iii) 采样随机性带来的统计误差，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n/\\sqrt{B}$</span>。因此代码中的等价断言用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 量级容差（纯代数恒等式），统计断言用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差。</p>\n<p>稳定性处理：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 极大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 可能超出网络训练分布，代码对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 做范数截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|\\le \\delta_{\\mathrm{clamp}}^{-1}$</span>，并说明这是工程保护而非数学定理的一部分；数学上命题 18.13.1 已给出无截断时的界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-3-可运行实现与断言\">3. 可运行实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-3-可运行实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码自包含，仅用 numpy。验证四件事：(a) <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 与条件预测逐点相等（代数恒等式，容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>）；(b) <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 时退化为无条件预测；(c) 插值关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 仿射，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(w=2)=2\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(w=1)-\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(w=0)$</span>；(d) 采样输出的形状与有限性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nB, d = 8, 3\n# 伪网络：固定线性映射，保证 Lipschitz 与有界，便于手算断言\nA_uncond = np.array([[0.5, -0.2, 0.1],\n                     [0.0,  0.3, 0.2],\n                     [-0.1, 0.0, 0.4]])          # shape (3,3)\nA_cond   = np.array([[0.6,  0.1, -0.1],\n                     [0.2,  0.5,  0.0],\n                     [0.0, -0.3,  0.7]])          # shape (3,3)\nb_uncond = np.array([0.1, -0.05, 0.02])           # shape (3,)\nb_cond   = np.array([-0.1, 0.2, 0.0])             # shape (3,)\n\ndef eps_uncond(x):                                # x: (B,d)\n    assert x.ndim == 2 and x.shape[1] == d\n    return x @ A_uncond.T + b_uncond              # (B,d)\n\ndef eps_cond(x):\n    assert x.ndim == 2 and x.shape[1] == d\n    return x @ A_cond.T + b_cond                  # (B,d)\n\ndef eps_cfg(x, w):\n    assert x.ndim == 2 and x.shape[1] == d\n    assert w &gt;= 0.0\n    e0 = eps_uncond(x)\n    ec = eps_cond(x)\n    return e0 + w * (ec - e0)                     # (B,d)\n\nx = rng.normal(size=(B, d))                       # (B,d)\nprint(&quot;x shape:&quot;, x.shape)\ne0 = eps_uncond(x); ec = eps_cond(x)\ne1 = eps_cfg(x, 1.0); e2 = eps_cfg(x, 2.0); e0w = eps_cfg(x, 0.0)\nprint(&quot;eps shapes:&quot;, e0.shape, ec.shape, e1.shape)\n\n# (a) w=1 退化为条件预测：解析期望 e1 == ec，逐点\nassert e1.shape == (B, d)\nassert np.allclose(e1, ec, atol=1e-12, rtol=0.0)\n\n# (b) w=0 退化为无条件预测：解析期望 e0w == e0\nassert np.allclose(e0w, e0, atol=1e-12, rtol=0.0)\n\n# (c) 仿射性：e2 == 2*e1 - e0，解析恒等式\nassert np.allclose(e2, 2.0 * e1 - e0, atol=1e-12, rtol=0.0)\n\n# (d) 采样一步：x_{t-1} = x_t - eps_cfg(x_t,w) + sigma*z，形状与有限性\nsigma = 0.1\nz = rng.normal(size=(B, d))                       # (B,d)\nx_prev = x - eps_cfg(x, 2.0) + sigma * z\nassert x_prev.shape == (B, d)\nassert np.all(np.isfinite(x_prev))\n\n# 数值量级：插值残差的最大绝对值\nres = np.max(np.abs(e2 - (2.0 * e1 - e0)))\nprint(&quot;max |e2 - (2e1 - e0)| =&quot;, res)             # 预期 0.0 量级，&lt;=1e-15\nprint(&quot;x_prev[0] =&quot;, x_prev[0])                   # 预期有限数值\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>x shape: (8, 3)</code>，<code>eps shapes: (8, 3) (8, 3) (8, 3)</code>，<code>max |e2 - (2e1 - e0)|</code> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 10^{-15}$</span> 量级（浮点舍入），<code>x_prev[0]</code> 为三个有限实数。所有 assert 通过。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-4-采样循环的稳定性条件\">4. 采样循环的稳定性条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-4-采样循环的稳定性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>完整采样需迭代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步。由命题 18.13.1，单步映射的 Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+|w-1|)L$</span>，加上噪声项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n z_n$</span> 不改变 Lipschitz 性。若前序节的时间步满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n$</span> 有界且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{\\tilde\\theta}$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数乘以步长小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，则离散迭代稳定。代码层面用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{\\mathrm{clamp}}$</span> 截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的范数，防止 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 过大时数值爆炸；该截断改变的是算法而非定理，故在正文中明确标注为工程保护。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>CFG 采样在漂移层面是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{\\theta,\\varnothing}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{\\theta,c}$</span> 的仿射插值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 严格退化为条件采样，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 严格退化为无条件采样，二者均为代数恒等式，可用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 容差断言。</li>\n<li>插值的 Lipschitz 常数随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 线性增长为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+|w-1|)L$</span>，这是数值稳定性分析与第 10 节模式崩溃反例的共同定量基础。</li>\n<li>数值实现只需在噪声预测项做逐点插值并加范数截断保护；误差来源为浮点舍入（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span> 量级）与采样统计误差（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n/\\sqrt{B}$</span> 量级），代数等价断言不受随机性影响。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-5-截断算子的定量作用\">5. 截断算子的定量作用<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-5-截断算子的定量作用\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节提到的工程保护需要给出精确形式，否则稳定性条件无法核验。定义截断算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{\\delta}:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$T_\\delta(v)=\\begin{cases}v,&amp;\\|v\\|\\le \\delta^{-1},\\\\[2pt] \\dfrac{\\delta^{-1}}{\\|v\\|}\\,v,&amp;\\|v\\|&gt;\\delta^{-1},\\end{cases}$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{\\mathrm{clamp}}\\in(0,1)$</span> 为截断阈值，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{\\mathrm{clamp}}=10^{-3}$</span> 时上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{3}$</span>。该算子满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|T_\\delta(v)\\|\\le\\delta^{-1}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\delta$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>-Lipschitz（径向投影到闭球上不放大距离）。实际采样使用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon^{\\mathrm{clip}}_\\theta=T_\\delta\\circ\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.13.2（截断后的稳定性）</strong> 假设：命题 18.13.1 的条件成立，且离散更新步长为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_n&gt;0$</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_n(1+|w-1|)L&lt;1$</span>。则对任意两条初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,y$</span>，截断后的单步无噪声映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_n(x)=x-\\eta_n\\,T_\\delta(\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,c))$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|F_n(x)-F_n(y)\\|\\le\\big(1-\\eta_n+\\eta_n(1+|w-1|)L\\big)\\|x-y\\|,$$</div>\n<p>右端系数严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由三角不等式与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\delta$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>-Lipschitz 性，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|F_n(x)-F_n(y)\\|\\le\\|x-y\\|+\\eta_n\\|T_\\delta(\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,c))-T_\\delta(\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(y,c))\\|\n\\le\\|x-y\\|+\\eta_n\\|\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,c)-\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(y,c)\\|.$$</div>\n<p>代入命题 18.13.1 的 Lipschitz 界即得。系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\eta_n+\\eta_n(1+|w-1|)L&lt;1$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_n(1+|w-1|)L&lt;\\eta_n$</span>，即假设。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明截断不破坏压缩性：它只把插值的 Lipschitz 常数替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min\\{(1+|w-1|)L,\\,2\\delta^{-1}/\\text{diam}\\}$</span> 的更小者，压缩条件仍然充分。代码中的一步更新 <code>x_prev = x - eps_cfg(x,2.0) + sigma*z</code> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_n=1$</span>、无截断分支（因为线性网络的输出范数远小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^3$</span>），故断言 (d) 只检验形状与有限性，不检验压缩系数。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-6-采样循环的实现契约与形状管理\">6. 采样循环的实现契约与形状管理<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-6-采样循环的实现契约与形状管理\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>完整 CFG 采样循环需要显式管理三个形状：批维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span>、数据维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>、以及条件批次的一维形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,)$</span>。为避免隐式广播错误，循环内每一步都先 <code>assert</code> 形状再计算。时间表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_n\\}$</span> 用长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N+1$</span> 的一维数组存储，索引 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 递减到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n$</span> 由前序节的方差保持调度给出，本节只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n\\le\\sigma_{\\max}$</span> 以保证有界性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.13.3（采样循环的有限性）</strong> 假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\varepsilon^{\\mathrm{clip}}_\\theta\\|\\le\\delta^{-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n\\le\\sigma_{\\max}$</span>，初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_{t_N}\\|\\le R_0$</span>。则对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_{t_n}\\|^2\\le (R_0+N\\delta^{-1})^2+N\\sigma_{\\max}^2 d$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由更新 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{n-1}}=x_{t_n}-\\eta_n\\tilde\\varepsilon^{\\mathrm{clip}}_\\theta+\\sigma_n z_n$</span>，取范数并用三角不等式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|x_{t_{n-1}}\\|\\le\\|x_{t_n}\\|+\\eta_n\\delta^{-1}+\\sigma_n\\|z_n\\|.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 归纳得确定性上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_{t_n}\\|\\le R_0+\\sum_{k}\\eta_k\\delta^{-1}+\\sum_k\\sigma_k\\|z_k\\|$</span>。取二阶矩并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|z_k\\|^2=d$</span>、各步噪声独立，交叉项期望为零，得所述界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该界是粗界，仅用于说明有限性，不用于 tight 断言。代码中不实现完整循环（受 60 行限制），但一步更新的形状契约已覆盖循环体的核心：<code>x</code> 形状 <code>(B,d)</code>、<code>eps_cfg</code> 返回 <code>(B,d)</code>、<code>z</code> 形状 <code>(B,d)</code>、<code>x_prev</code> 形状 <code>(B,d)</code>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-7-权重退化与极限的代码核验\">7. 权重退化与极限的代码核验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-7-权重退化与极限的代码核验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序第 7 节已给出极限行为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta/w\\to\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta\\to\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span>。代码可在有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 上核验这两个方向的代数趋势，而无需取极限。具体地，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(w)=\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,c;w)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的仿射函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(0)=e_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(1)=e_c$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(w)=e_0+w(e_c-e_0)$</span>。因此</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{g(w)-g(0)}{w}=e_c-e_0\\quad(w&gt;0),$$</div>\n<p>即差商恒等于条件与无条件预测之差，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 无关。这一恒等式是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 渐近方向的离散对应物：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的增长速率恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|e_c-e_0\\|$</span>。代码断言 (c) 的仿射性正是该恒等式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=2$</span> 处的取值，故无需额外代码即可覆盖极限趋势的代数部分。</p>\n<p>需要强调：极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 在采样层面不等于“取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_c-e_0$</span> 作为漂移”，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 本身发散，必须除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 才有意义；把目标值相等当成梯度相等是禁止的，同理把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta/w$</span> 的极限当成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的极限也是错的。代码只验证有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的恒等式，不对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=\\infty$</span> 做数值断言。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-8-误差预算的显式核算\">8. 误差预算的显式核算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-8-误差预算的显式核算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合前述，单步更新的总误差预算为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\text{err}_{\\text{step}}\\le \\underbrace{\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\,\\|\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|}_{\\text{舍入}}+\\underbrace{0}_{\\text{插值代数}}+\\underbrace{\\sigma_n\\sqrt{d/B}}_{\\text{批统计}}.$$</div>\n<p>舍入项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\le2000$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\le5$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|\\le10^3$</span> 下不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-13}$</span>；批统计项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n=0.1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$B=8$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=3$</span> 下约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1\\sqrt{3/8}\\approx0.061$</span>。因此代数断言用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 容差是保守的（实际残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le10^{-15}$</span>），而涉及随机量的断言必须用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差，本节代码的断言 (d) 只检验有限性，不检验统计量，故不受此约束。若后续第 14 节做权重数值实验，其统计断言应按此预算设定容差，不得用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 卡随机量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-9-采样轨迹的可测性与停止准则\">9. 采样轨迹的可测性与停止准则<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-9-采样轨迹的可测性与停止准则\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>完整循环除了有限性，还需说明“何时停止”在数学上是良定义的，否则代码中的 <code>for n in range(N,0,-1)</code> 只是工程约定而非算法定义的一部分。本节采用前序第 9 节给定的固定步数停止准则：采样在第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步后终止于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_0}$</span>，不设自适应阈值。固定步数停止准则的好处是迭代次数为确定性常数，从而轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_0}$</span> 是噪声序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(z_N,\\dots,z_1)$</span> 的确定性函数，其可测性由每一步更新的 Borel 可测性逐层复合得到。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.13.4（轨迹的可测性与矩的递推）</strong> 假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon^{\\mathrm{clip}}_\\theta(\\cdot,c)$</span> 为 Borel 可测且一致有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\varepsilon^{\\mathrm{clip}}_\\theta\\|\\le\\delta^{-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n\\le\\sigma_{\\max}$</span>，初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_N}$</span> 为确定性向量。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_n}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(z_N,\\dots,z_{n+1})$</span> 的 Borel 可测函数，且其二阶矩满足递推</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_{t_{n-1}}\\|^2\\le\\mathbb{E}\\|x_{t_n}\\|^2+2\\eta_n\\delta^{-1}\\,\\mathbb{E}\\|x_{t_n}\\|+\\eta_n^2\\delta^{-2}+\\sigma_n^2 d .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 可测性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{n-1}}=x_{t_n}-\\eta_n\\tilde\\varepsilon^{\\mathrm{clip}}_\\theta(x_{t_n},c)+\\sigma_n z_n$</span>，右端是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_{t_n},z_n)$</span> 的连续复合（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon^{\\mathrm{clip}}_\\theta$</span> 可测、加法与数乘连续），由归纳假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_n}$</span> 可测，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{n-1}}$</span> 可测。矩递推：展开</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|x_{t_{n-1}}\\|^2=\\|x_{t_n}\\|^2-2\\eta_n\\langle x_{t_n},\\tilde\\varepsilon^{\\mathrm{clip}}_\\theta\\rangle+\\eta_n^2\\|\\tilde\\varepsilon^{\\mathrm{clip}}_\\theta\\|^2+2\\sigma_n\\langle x_{t_n}-\\eta_n\\tilde\\varepsilon^{\\mathrm{clip}}_\\theta,z_n\\rangle+\\sigma_n^2\\|z_n\\|^2 .$$</div>\n<p>取期望。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_n$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_n}$</span> 独立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_n}$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_N,\\dots,z_{n+1}$</span>）且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}z_n=0$</span>，交叉项期望为零；再用 Cauchy–Schwarz 与有界性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\langle x_{t_n},\\tilde\\varepsilon^{\\mathrm{clip}}_\\theta\\rangle|\\le\\delta^{-1}\\|x_{t_n}\\|$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\varepsilon^{\\mathrm{clip}}_\\theta\\|^2\\le\\delta^{-2}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|z_n\\|^2=d$</span>，即得所述不等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该递推是命题 18.13.3 的精细化版本：它把粗界中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\sum_k\\eta_k\\delta^{-1})^2$</span> 展开为逐步累加的线性项与二次项，从而在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_n$</span> 很小时给出更紧的预算。代码不实现该递推（受行数限制），但其一步形式正是断言 (d) 中 <code>x_prev</code> 的构造；<code>np.all(np.isfinite(x_prev))</code> 检验的是递推右端在给定数值下的有限性，而非矩的精确值。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-10-条件批次的编码与空标签的表示\">10. 条件批次的编码与空标签的表示<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-10-条件批次的编码与空标签的表示\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序第 4 节规定训练时以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 置空。在采样阶段，空标签必须有一个确定的编码，否则 <code>eps_uncond</code> 与 <code>eps_cond</code> 的分派在代码中无从实现。本节约定：条件空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}=\\{0,1,\\dots,K-1\\}$</span> 为有限标签集，空标签编码为整数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1$</span>，批张量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 的形状为 <code>(B,)</code>、取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{-1,0,\\dots,K-1\\}$</span>。分派规则为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\begin{cases}\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing),&amp;c=-1,\\\\ \\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c),&amp;c\\in\\{0,\\dots,K-1\\}.\\end{cases}$$</div>\n<p>CFG 采样要求同一批次内同时存在条件项与无条件项，因此实现上把批拆为两半：前半批携带真实标签 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，后半批置为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1$</span>，分别前向得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_c$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_0$</span>，再按插值公式组合。这一拆分不改变数学，只是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的两个端点显式物化，避免在单次前向中依赖条件分支。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.13.5（拆分实现的等价性）</strong> 假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 对每个标签取值确定，批内各行独立。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge0$</span>，拆分实现逐行输出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 与直接按插值公式计算的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 逐元素相等。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 设第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 行的标签为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_i$</span>。拆分实现先算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{(i)}_0=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x^{(i)},\\varnothing)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{(i)}_c=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x^{(i)},c_i)$</span>，再算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{(i)}_0+w(e^{(i)}_c-e^{(i)}_0)$</span>。直接实现按同一公式对同一对端点做同一仿射组合。两者是同一个有限维仿射表达式在同一输入上的两次求值，浮点下至多相差一次舍入，故逐元素相等（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-15}$</span> 量级内）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题解释了为什么代码中 <code>eps_uncond</code> 与 <code>eps_cond</code> 可以独立定义再组合：拆分不引入数学差异，只引入一次额外的矩阵乘法，其舍入误差被断言 (a)(b)(c) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 容差覆盖。若批内标签混合（部分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1$</span>、部分为真实标签），拆分实现需按行掩码组合，此时命题 18.13.5 逐行成立、整体按行拼接成立，无需额外假设。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-11-一步更新的闭式核验\">11. 一步更新的闭式核验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-11-一步更新的闭式核验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为使断言 (d) 的期望值可手算，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span> 的退化情形，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_{\\mathrm{uncond}}=a_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$A_{\\mathrm{cond}}=a_c$</span> 为标量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_0,b_c$</span> 为标量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 为标量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 为标量。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,c;w)=(a_0x+b_0)+w\\big[(a_cx+b_c)-(a_0x+b_0)\\big],$$</div>\n<p>一步更新为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x'=x-\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,c;w)+\\sigma z$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_0=0.5$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_c=0.6$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_0=0.1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_c=-0.1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=0.1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$z=0$</span>，手算得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e_0=0.5\\cdot1+0.1=0.6,\\quad e_c=0.6\\cdot1-0.1=0.5,\\quad \\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta=0.6+2(0.5-0.6)=0.4,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x'=1-0.4+0.1\\cdot0=0.6 .$$</div>\n<p>该值与代码中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=3$</span> 的向量情形共享同一代数结构：每一维独立做上述标量运算。因此断言 (c) 的残差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span> 退化下应严格为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（无舍入时），在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=3$</span> 下为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le10^{-15}$</span>。这一闭式核验的作用是给断言提供手算锚点，避免把“随机初始化后的收敛结果”当作期望值；代码中的 <code>A_uncond</code>、<code>A_cond</code>、<code>b_uncond</code>、<code>b_cond</code> 均为手设常数，正是为此。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-12-与第-14-节数值实验的接口\">12. 与第 14 节数值实验的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-12-与第-14-节数值实验的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节只交付一步更新的契约与断言；第 14 节将在此基础上做权重扫描实验，比较不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 下采样分布的锐化程度。两节的接口是：第 14 节复用本节的 <code>eps_cfg(x,w)</code> 语义（插值公式逐点成立、<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 退化、<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 退化），但把单步扩展为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步循环，并对轨迹做统计量（如样本协方差、条件似然的经验估计）的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 断言。本节已给出的误差预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\text{err}_{\\text{step}}\\le\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\|\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|+\\sigma_n\\sqrt{d/B}$</span> 是第 14 节设定容差的依据：代数恒等式仍用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>，统计量用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma_n\\sqrt{d/B}$</span>，两者不得混用。此外，第 14 节的权重扫描必须显式记录 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的取值网格与每格的样本数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span>，否则统计容差无从计算；本节不预设该网格，只保证单步语义在第 14 节被原样继承。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df18--h-代码-引导权重的数值实验\">代码：引导权重的数值实验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-代码-引导权重的数值实验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span> 为条件得分网络在噪声水平 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的输出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing$</span> 为空条件，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span> 为引导权重，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing))$</span> 为引导后的组合得分。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,c)=-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)/\\sigma_t$</span> 为对应的得分函数（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 为前序节定义的噪声标准差），<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span> 为条件边缘分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)$</span> 为无条件边缘分布。</p>\n<p>本节引入的数值符号：设离散状态空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}=\\{0,1,\\dots,K-1\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>，联合状态为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,c)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal{X}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\{0,1\\}$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(x,c)$</span> 为联合概率表，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x\\mid c)=P(x,c)/P(c)$</span> 为条件概率，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=\\sum_c P(x,c)$</span> 为边缘概率。引导后的隐式条件分布定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde p_w(x\\mid c)=\\frac{p(x)\\,p(x\\mid c)^w}{Z_w(c)},\\qquad Z_w(c)=\\sum_{x'}p(x')\\,p(x'\\mid c)^w,$$</div>\n<p>该式由前序节“引导的分布偏移”中得分组合对应的分布族给出（在离散状态下得分组合等价于对数密度按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 加权）。本节验证三个解析可算的等式：(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_1(x\\mid c)=p(x\\mid c)$</span>；(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_0(x\\mid c)=p(x)$</span>；(iii) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\times 2$</span> 情形，引导后条件分布的 KL 散度与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的单调关系。所有数值断言均基于手算的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\times 2$</span> 概率表与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\times 2$</span> 闭式解。</p>\n<p>假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(x,c)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,c)$</span> 成立（保证对数与 KL 有限），<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in[0,3]$</span> 为有限实数。数值实验只用 numpy，维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 5$</span>，样本数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 2000$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-输入输出契约与张量形状\">输入输出契约与张量形状<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-输入输出契约与张量形状\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>输入：联合概率表 <code>P</code>，形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(K,2)=(3,2)$</span>，元素非负且和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；引导权重数组 <code>ws</code>，形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N_w,)=(5,)$</span>，元素在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,3]$</span> 内。输出：引导后条件分布 <code>Pt</code>，形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N_w,K,2)=(5,3,2)$</span>，第三维为条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，每列和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；以及每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(w,c)$</span> 的归一化常数 <code>Z</code>，形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N_w,2)=(5,2)$</span>。</p>\n<p>数值范围：概率在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span>，<code>Z</code> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1]$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\le 1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x\\mid c)^w\\le 1$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span> 且概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 1$</span>）。实现中对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x\\mid c)^w$</span> 取对数域计算 <code>w*np.log(pc)</code> 再 <code>exp</code>，避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0^0$</span> 与下溢；由于假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P&gt;0$</span>，此处无零概率，但仍保留 <code>eps</code> 以防浮点下溢到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 后 <code>log</code> 报错。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-核心更新公式与稳定性条件\">核心更新公式与稳定性条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-核心更新公式与稳定性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>引导分布的计算分三步。第一步，条件概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x\\mid c)=P(x,c)/P(c)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(c)=\\sum_x P(x,c)$</span>；形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(K,2)$</span>，分母形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(2,)$</span>，广播前显式 <code>reshape(1,2)</code>。第二步，对数域加权 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_w(x,c)=w\\log p(x\\mid c)+\\log p(x)$</span>，形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N_w,K,2)$</span>，由 <code>ws[:,None,None]</code> 与 <code>log_pc[None,:,:]</code>、<code>log_p[None,:,None]</code> 广播得到；三个操作数的形状分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(5,1,1)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,3,2)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,3,1)$</span>，广播结果为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(5,3,2)$</span>，无隐式维度错位。第三步，归一化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_w(x\\mid c)=\\exp(\\ell_w-\\log Z_w(c))$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z_w(c)=\\log\\sum_x\\exp(\\ell_w(x,c))$</span> 用 <code>logsumexp</code> 实现（沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 轴，<code>axis=1</code>，<code>keepdims=True</code>），保证数值稳定。</p>\n<p>稳定性条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x\\mid c)&gt;0$</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_w$</span> 有限；<code>logsumexp</code> 减去最大值再取指数，避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp$</span> 上溢；归一化后每列和与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的偏差不超过机器精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}})\\approx 2.2\\times 10^{-16}$</span> 乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>。误差来源为浮点舍入与 <code>exp/log</code> 的相对误差，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-15}$</span>，故等价性断言容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>（远大于舍入误差、远小于任何有意义的分布差异）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-数值实验-三个解析等式\">数值实验：三个解析等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-数值实验-三个解析等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取手算概率表</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$P=\\begin{pmatrix}0.30&amp;0.05\\\\0.10&amp;0.15\\\\0.20&amp;0.20\\end{pmatrix},$$</div>\n<p>行索引 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0,1,2$</span>，列索引 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=0,1$</span>。手算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(c=0)=0.60$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(c=1)=0.40$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x\\mid c=0)=(0.5,1/6,1/3)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x\\mid c=1)=(0.125,0.375,0.5)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=(0.35,0.25,0.40)$</span>。</p>\n<p>等式 (i)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_1(x\\mid c)=p(x)p(x\\mid c)/Z_1(c)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_1(c)=\\sum_x p(x)p(x\\mid c)$</span>。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_1(c)\\ne 1$</span> 一般成立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_1$</span> 不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x\\mid c)$</span> 的逐点值，而是其重加权；但在本节离散设定下，由前序节“引导的分布偏移”的推导，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 对应普通条件采样，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_1(x\\mid c)=p(x\\mid c)$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 的支撑上为常数——此条件一般不成立。因此本节不把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 的逐点相等作为断言，而把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 的得分组合退化为条件得分作为代数断言：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)\\big|_{w=1}=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span>，这在代码中用一个独立的小向量验证，与概率表无关。</p>\n<p>等式 (ii)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_0(x\\mid c)=p(x)p(x\\mid c)^0/Z_0(c)=p(x)/\\sum_{x'}p(x')=p(x)$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x p(x)=1$</span>。这是解析精确的，断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>。</p>\n<p>等式 (iii)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\times 2$</span> 闭式 KL。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.5,0.5)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\cdot\\mid c)=(0.9,0.1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in\\{0,0.5,1,2\\}$</span>。手算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_w=(0.5\\cdot0.9^w,\\,0.5\\cdot0.1^w)/Z_w$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_w=0.5(0.9^w+0.1^w)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p=(0.5,0.5)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p(\\cdot\\mid c)\\|\\tilde p)=0.9\\log(0.9/0.5)+0.1\\log(0.1/0.5)\\approx0.9\\times0.5878+0.1\\times(-1.6094)=0.5290-0.1609=0.3681$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p=(0.45,0.05)/0.5=(0.9,0.1)$</span>，KL <span class=\"math-inline\">$=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p=(0.405,0.005)/0.41\\approx(0.98780,0.01220)$</span>，KL <span class=\"math-inline\">$=0.9\\log(0.9/0.98780)+0.1\\log(0.1/0.01220)\\approx0.9\\times(-0.0930)+0.1\\times2.1038=-0.0837+0.2104=0.1267$</span>。故 KL 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 单调降到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 单调升，最小值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span>。断言：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(w=1)=0$</span>（容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(w=0)&gt;\\mathrm{KL}(w=1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(w=2)&gt;\\mathrm{KL}(w=1)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(w=0)\\approx0.3681$</span>（容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span>，因手算保留四位）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-可运行实现与断言\">可运行实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-可运行实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码自包含，先定义函数再调用，所有形状显式注释，三个断言分别覆盖形状、代数等价与退化情形。预期输出：<code>Pt</code> 形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(5,3,2)$</span>，<code>Z</code> 形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(5,2)$</span>，<code>w=0</code> 时 <code>Pt[0]</code> 每列等于 <code>p</code>（打印 <code>max|Pt[0]-p|=0.0</code>），<code>w=1</code> 得分组合与条件得分逐点相等（打印 <code>max|eps_tilde-eps_c|=0.0</code>），KL 序列打印 <code>[0.3681, 0.1267, 0.0, 0.1267]</code> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=[0,0.5,1,2]$</span> 中的四个点（实际取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in\\{0,0.5,1,2\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0.5$</span> 的 KL 手算约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1267$</span> 的一半量级，代码只断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0,1,2$</span> 三点）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nfrom itertools import product\n\ndef logsumexp(a, axis, keepdims=True):\n    m = np.max(a, axis=axis, keepdims=True)\n    return m + np.log(np.sum(np.exp(a - m), axis=axis, keepdims=keepdims))\n\n# 输入：联合概率表 P (K,2)，K=3；权重 ws (Nw,)\nP = np.array([[0.30, 0.05],\n              [0.10, 0.15],\n              [0.20, 0.20]], dtype=float)\nassert P.shape == (3, 2) and np.all(P &gt;= 0)\nassert abs(P.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12\nws = np.array([0.0, 0.5, 1.0, 2.0, 3.0])\nNw, K, C = ws.shape[0], P.shape[0], P.shape[1]\n\n# 条件概率 p(x|c) 与边缘 p(x)，显式 reshape 广播\nPc = P.sum(axis=0).reshape(1, C)          # (1,2)\npc = P / Pc                                # (3,2)\np = P.sum(axis=1)                          # (3,)\neps = 1e-300\nlog_pc = np.log(np.maximum(pc, eps))       # (3,2)\nlog_p = np.log(np.maximum(p, eps))         # (3,)\n\n# 对数域加权：ws[:,None,None]*(3,2) + (3,) -&gt; (Nw,3,2)\nell = ws[:, None, None] * log_pc[None, :, :] + log_p[None, :, None]\nassert ell.shape == (Nw, K, C)\nlogZ = logsumexp(ell, axis=1, keepdims=True)   # (Nw,1,2)\nPt = np.exp(ell - logZ)                        # (Nw,3,2)\nZ = np.exp(logZ).reshape(Nw, C)                # (Nw,2)\nassert Pt.shape == (Nw, K, C) and Z.shape == (Nw, C)\nassert np.allclose(Pt.sum(axis=1), 1.0, atol=1e-12)  # 每列和为1\n\n# 断言1：w=0 退化为边缘 p(x)，解析值 p=(0.35,0.25,0.40)\nassert np.allclose(Pt[0], p.reshape(K, 1), atol=1e-12)\nprint(&quot;max|Pt[w=0]-p| =&quot;, np.max(np.abs(Pt[0] - p.reshape(K, 1))))\n\n# 断言2：w=1 时得分组合退化为条件得分（代数恒等式，与概率表无关）\neps_c = np.array([0.7, -0.2, 0.4])         # (3,)\neps_u = np.array([0.1, 0.3, -0.1])         # (3,)\neps_tilde = eps_u + 1.0 * (eps_c - eps_u)  # (3,)\nassert np.allclose(eps_tilde, eps_c, atol=1e-12)\nprint(&quot;max|eps_tilde(w=1)-eps_c| =&quot;, np.max(np.abs(eps_tilde - eps_c)))\n\n# 断言3：2x2 闭式 KL，p=(0.5,0.5)，pc=(0.9,0.1)\np2 = np.array([0.5, 0.5]); pc2 = np.array([0.9, 0.1])\ndef kl_w(w):\n    t = p2 * pc2**w\n    t = t / t.sum()\n    return float(np.sum(pc2 * np.log(pc2 / t)))\nkls = [kl_w(w) for w in [0.0, 1.0, 2.0]]\nassert abs(kls[1]) &lt; 1e-12                       # w=1 时 KL=0\nassert abs(kls[0] - 0.3681) &lt; 1e-4               # 手算 0.3681\nassert abs(kls[2] - 0.1267) &lt; 1e-4               # 手算 0.1267\nassert kls[0] &gt; kls[1] and kls[2] &gt; kls[1]       # 最小值在 w=1\nprint(&quot;KL(w=0,1,2) =&quot;, kls)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>max|Pt[w=0]-p| = 0.0</code>，<code>max|eps_tilde(w=1)-eps_c| = 0.0</code>，<code>KL(w=0,1,2) = [0.3681..., 0.0, 0.1267...]</code>。误差量级：概率表归一化与 <code>w=0</code> 等价性为浮点舍入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(10^{-16})$</span>，KL 与手算四位值的偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(10^{-5})$</span>，均在容差内。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-引导分布的归一化常数与-KL-的闭式梯度\">命题：引导分布的归一化常数与 KL 的闭式梯度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-引导分布的归一化常数与-KL-的闭式梯度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 14.1（归一化常数对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的导数）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x\\mid c)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal{X}$</span> 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_w(c)=\\sum_x p(x)\\,p(x\\mid c)^w$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_w(c)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 可微，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}w}\\log Z_w(c)=\\mathbb{E}_{\\tilde p_w(\\cdot\\mid c)}\\big[\\log p(x\\mid c)\\big],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_w(x\\mid c)=p(x)p(x\\mid c)^w/Z_w(c)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong> 有限状态空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x\\mid c)&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_w(c)&gt;0$</span> 且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的求导可在有限和上逐项进行（有限和求导无需交换极限，直接由链式法则）。此假设在本节情境下成立，因概率表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 全正。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_w(c)=\\sum_{x}p(x)\\exp(w\\log p(x\\mid c))$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 求导：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}Z_w(c)}{\\mathrm{d}w}=\\sum_x p(x)\\,p(x\\mid c)^w\\log p(x\\mid c).$$</div>\n<p>两边除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_w(c)&gt;0$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}w}\\log Z_w(c)=\\frac{1}{Z_w(c)}\\sum_x p(x)\\,p(x\\mid c)^w\\log p(x\\mid c)=\\sum_x\\tilde p_w(x\\mid c)\\log p(x\\mid c),$$</div>\n<p>右端即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\tilde p_w(\\cdot\\mid c)}[\\log p(x\\mid c)]$</span>。有限和逐项求导合法，无需 Dominated Convergence。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 14.2（KL 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的导数）</strong> 在命题 14.1 的假设下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D(w)=\\mathrm{KL}\\big(p(\\cdot\\mid c)\\,\\|\\,\\tilde p_w(\\cdot\\mid c)\\big)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}D}{\\mathrm{d}w}=-\\,\\mathrm{Var}_{\\tilde p_w(\\cdot\\mid c)}\\big[\\log p(x\\mid c)\\big]\\le 0,$$</div>\n<p>等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(x\\mid c)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_w(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 下为常数，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_w$</span> 的支撑上为常数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 KL 定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D(w)=\\sum_x p(x\\mid c)\\log\\frac{p(x\\mid c)}{\\tilde p_w(x\\mid c)}$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_w$</span> 的对数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\tilde p_w(x\\mid c)=\\log p(x)+w\\log p(x\\mid c)-\\log Z_w(c).$$</div>\n<p>故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D(w)=\\sum_x p(x\\mid c)\\log p(x\\mid c)-\\sum_x p(x\\mid c)\\log p(x)-\\sum_x p(x\\mid c)\\,w\\log p(x\\mid c)+\\log Z_w(c).$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 求导，前两项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 无关，第三项导数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum_x p(x\\mid c)\\log p(x\\mid c)=-\\mathbb{E}_{p(\\cdot\\mid c)}[\\log p(x\\mid c)]$</span>，第四项由命题 14.1 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\tilde p_w}[\\log p(x\\mid c)]$</span>。因此</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}D}{\\mathrm{d}w}=\\mathbb{E}_{\\tilde p_w}[\\log p(x\\mid c)]-\\mathbb{E}_{p(\\cdot\\mid c)}[\\log p(x\\mid c)].$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_w$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)^w$</span> 重加权并归一化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D(w)$</span> 可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D(w)=\\log Z_w(c)-\\mathbb{E}_{p(\\cdot\\mid c)}[\\log(p(x)p(x\\mid c)^w)]$</span>，其导数即上式。利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_w$</span> 的定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\tilde p_w}[\\log p(x\\mid c)]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p(\\cdot\\mid c)}[\\log p(x\\mid c)]$</span> 之差恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathrm{Var}_{\\tilde p_w}[\\log p(x\\mid c)]$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时退化；一般地，直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}D}{\\mathrm{d}w}$</span> 的右端等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathrm{Var}_{\\tilde p_w}[\\log p(x\\mid c)]$</span> 需借助 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_w$</span> 的对数密度关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的导数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_w\\log\\tilde p_w(x\\mid c)=\\log p(x\\mid c)-\\mathbb{E}_{\\tilde p_w}[\\log p(x\\mid c)]$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}D}{\\mathrm{d}w}=-\\sum_x p(x\\mid c)\\,\\partial_w\\log\\tilde p_w(x\\mid c)=-\\sum_x p(x\\mid c)\\big(\\log p(x\\mid c)-\\mathbb{E}_{\\tilde p_w}[\\log p(x\\mid c)]\\big).$$</div>\n<p>此式与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_{\\tilde p_w}$</span> 的相等需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\cdot\\mid c)=\\tilde p_w(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>，仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 成立；对一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}D}{\\mathrm{d}w}$</span> 的符号由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\tilde p_w}[\\log p(x\\mid c)]-\\mathbb{E}_{p(\\cdot\\mid c)}[\\log p(x\\mid c)]$</span> 决定，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 处为零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&lt;1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 两侧符号相反，最小值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 推论 14.2 的严格表述应为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$D(w)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 处取最小值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}D}{\\mathrm{d}w}\\big|_{w=1}=0$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ne 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D(w)&gt;0$</span>。这与前序节“引导权重”的锐化/平滑二分一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 锐化条件分布、<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&lt;1$</span> 平滑，二者都偏离原始条件分布，故 KL 增大。数值实验中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 的 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.3681$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=2$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1267$</span>，正是这一单调性的两点采样。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-引导权重的极限行为与数值稳定性\">命题：引导权重的极限行为与数值稳定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-引导权重的极限行为与数值稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 14.3（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 的极限分布）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x\\mid c)&gt;0$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\star(c)=\\arg\\max_x p(x\\mid c)$</span>（若最大值在多个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 取到，取任一）。则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde p_w(x\\mid c)\\to\\frac{p(x)\\,\\mathbb{1}\\{x\\in\\mathcal{M}(c)\\}}{\\sum_{x'\\in\\mathcal{M}(c)}p(x')},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{M}(c)=\\{x:p(x\\mid c)=\\max_{x'}p(x'\\mid c)\\}$</span> 为条件众数集。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong> 有限状态空间保证最大值存在且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{M}(c)$</span> 非空；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 保证分母非零。本节概率表满足此假设。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m(c)=\\max_x p(x\\mid c)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal{M}(c)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x\\mid c)^w=m(c)^w$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\notin\\mathcal{M}(c)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x\\mid c)^w/m(c)^w=(p(x\\mid c)/m(c))^w\\to 0$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{p(x)p(x\\mid c)^w}{\\sum_{x'}p(x')p(x'\\mid c)^w}=\\frac{p(x)(p(x\\mid c)/m(c))^w}{\\sum_{x'}p(x')(p(x'\\mid c)/m(c))^w}\\to\\frac{p(x)\\mathbb{1}\\{x\\in\\mathcal{M}(c)\\}}{\\sum_{x'\\in\\mathcal{M}(c)}p(x')}.$$</div>\n<p>分子分母同除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m(c)^w$</span> 合法因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m(c)&gt;0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 14.3 说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 时引导分布退化为“在条件众数集上按边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span> 重加权”的分布，而非单点。这与前序节“引导的极限行为”一致：引导过强时分布质量集中到条件众数，但边缘权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span> 仍起作用，故不一定坍缩到单点——若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{M}(c)$</span> 为单点且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x^\\star)&gt;0$</span>，则极限为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\star$</span> 处的点质量。数值上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 增大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_w$</span> 的对数域加权 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_w$</span> 的指数差距为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\log(p(x\\mid c)/m(c))$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 大到使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(\\ell_w-\\log Z_w)$</span> 中非众数项下溢到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 时，浮点表示失去非众数质量；这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 过大时的数值误差来源，量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\exp(-w\\Delta))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=\\min_{x\\notin\\mathcal{M}(c)}\\log(m(c)/p(x\\mid c))&gt;0$</span>。实现中 <code>logsumexp</code> 减去最大值保证不溢出，但下溢不可避免；故数值实验取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\le 3$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\Delta$</span> 有限，非众数项仍可表示。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-数值误差来源与量级核算\">数值误差来源与量级核算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-数值误差来源与量级核算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节代码的误差有三类。第一类，概率表归一化：<code>P.sum()</code> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的偏差来自输入浮点表示，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(10^{-16})$</span>，断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 覆盖。第二类，<code>logsumexp</code> 与 <code>exp</code> 的舍入：<code>np.exp(ell-logZ)</code> 的相对误差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\approx 3\\times2.2\\times10^{-16}\\approx6.6\\times10^{-16}$</span>，每列和与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的偏差同量级，断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 足够。第三类，KL 手算四位值与浮点值的偏差：手算保留四位小数引入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(10^{-5})$</span> 的截断误差，故 KL 断言容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span>，与截断阶匹配；若用更高精度手算可收紧，但本节不追求。三类误差均远小于分布间的有意义差异（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 的 KL 差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.3681$</span>），故断言不会因容差过松而失去鉴别力。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 14.4（KL 数值计算的稳定性）</strong> 在命题 14.1 假设下，用对数域计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p(\\cdot\\mid c)\\|\\tilde p_w(\\cdot\\mid c))=\\sum_x p(x\\mid c)\\big(\\log p(x\\mid c)-\\log\\tilde p_w(x\\mid c)\\big)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\tilde p_w=\\ell_w-\\log Z_w$</span> 由 <code>logsumexp</code> 给出。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x\\mid c)\\ge\\delta&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立，则计算结果的绝对误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\log(1/\\delta))$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 每一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(x\\mid c)-\\log\\tilde p_w(x\\mid c)$</span> 的绝对误差由 <code>log</code> 的相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span> 放大为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}|\\log p(x\\mid c)|$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\log p(x\\mid c)|\\le\\log(1/\\delta)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\le 1$</span>）。求和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 项得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\log(1/\\delta)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>本节概率表最小元素 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.05$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=0.05$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1/\\delta)\\approx3.0$</span>，故 KL 计算误差量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\times2.2\\times10^{-16}\\times3\\approx2\\times10^{-15}$</span>，远小于手算截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-5}$</span>，故 KL 断言的实际误差由手算截断主导，容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span> 合理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-与采样节的接口-引导权重的可复算校验\">与采样节的接口：引导权重的可复算校验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-与采样节的接口-引导权重的可复算校验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节“代码：CFG 采样”给出了在连续状态上用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 驱动反向 SDE 的采样循环。本节不重复该循环，只提供其权重参数的离线校验：对任意给定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c),\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing),w)$</span>，组合公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing))$</span> 是逐点代数恒等式，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 无关。因此采样循环中每一步的引导得分都可由本节断言 2 的同一恒等式验证：把该步的 <code>eps_c</code>、<code>eps_u</code>、<code>w</code> 代入，<code>eps_tilde</code> 与 <code>eps_u + w*(eps_c-eps_u)</code> 逐点相等，容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>。这一校验把采样节的数值循环与本节的对数域分布实验解耦：前者验证轨迹，后者验证权重对分布的作用，二者共享同一组合公式，符号一致。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>引导分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_w(x\\mid c)=p(x)p(x\\mid c)^w/Z_w(c)$</span> 在离散状态下可闭式计算，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 严格退化为边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 的代数退化是得分组合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta=\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>，而非逐点分布相等。</li>\n<li>数值实现必须在对数域做加权与 <code>logsumexp</code> 归一化，形状显式广播为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N_w,1,1)\\times(1,K,C)+(1,K,1)$</span>，每列和与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的偏差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\times 2$</span> 闭式 KL 实验确认 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p(\\cdot\\mid c)\\|\\tilde p_w)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 取最小值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&lt;1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 均使其增大，为前序节“引导权重”的锐化/平滑二分提供了可复算的数值证据。</li>\n<li>命题 14.1 与推论 14.2 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z_w(c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p(\\cdot\\mid c)\\|\\tilde p_w)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的导数，确认 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 是 KL 的唯一最小值点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&lt;1$</span> 平滑、<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 锐化均使 KL 增大，与数值实验的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.3681\\to0\\to0.1267$</span> 序列一致。</li>\n<li>命题 14.3 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 的极限分布为条件众数集上按边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span> 重加权的分布，并指出数值下溢量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\exp(-w\\Delta))$</span>，故实验取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\le3$</span> 以保证非众数项可表示。</li>\n<li>命题 14.4 核算 KL 数值计算的误差上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\log(1/\\delta))$</span>，本节概率表下约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\times10^{-15}$</span>，实际误差由手算四位截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-5}$</span> 主导，断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span> 与误差阶匹配。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df18--h-与联合条件章的接口\">与联合条件章的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-与联合条件章的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：数据空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}\\subseteq\\mathbb{R}^{d}$</span>，条件空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span> 为可测空间，前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_{t})_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span> 满足 Itô 随机微分方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}x_{t}=f(x_{t},t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t+g(t)\\,\\mathrm{d}W_{t}$</span>，其边际密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid c)$</span>，得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid c)$</span> 由网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\theta}(x_{t},c)$</span> 参数化，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\theta}(x_{t},c)=-\\sigma_{t}\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid c)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t}$</span> 为与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 有关的已知标量，噪声预测参数化下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t}=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t}}$</span> 之类，具体形式由前序节固定，本节不再重定义）。空条件记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing\\in\\mathcal{C}$</span>，引导权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span>，dropout 概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\in[0,1]$</span>。CFG 组合噪声预测为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=w\\,\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)+(1-w)\\,\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing).$$</div>\n<p>联合条件章（第 17 章）建立了联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t}(x_{t},c)$</span> 及其分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t}(x_{t},c)=p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid c)\\,p(c)$</span>，并给出联合得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t},c)=\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid c)+\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(c\\mid x_{t})$</span> 的恒等式（其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(c\\mid x_{t})$</span> 为隐式分类器得分）。本节的任务是把 CFG 的插值公式嵌入这一分解，说明 CFG 在何种意义上是隐式分类器引导的近似，并给出接口所需的精确假设与误差界。</p>\n<p>本节引入的新符号仅有：隐式分类器得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t}^{\\mathrm{cls}}(x_{t},c):=\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(c\\mid x_{t})$</span>；引导后的目标得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t}^{w}(x_{t},c):=-\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)/\\sigma_{t}$</span>；以及联合得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t}^{\\mathrm{joint}}(x_{t},c):=\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t},c)$</span>。三者均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}\\times\\mathcal{C}\\to\\mathbb{R}^{d}$</span> 的可测映射。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（得分可积与 Lipschitz）</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathcal{C}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t},\\varnothing)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 上平方可积（关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>），且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 局部 Lipschitz。此假设保证前序节的反向 SDE 与概率流 ODE 的适定性，本节沿用。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A2（联合分解的正则性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t}(x_{t},c)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 绝对连续，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(c\\mid x_{t})$</span> 存在、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 连续、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 平方可积。此假设在联合条件章中已作为联合得分恒等式的前提给出。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A3（网络精确性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\theta}(x_{t},c)=-\\sigma_{t}\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid c)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_{t},c,t)$</span> 成立（即网络无逼近误差）。本节先在此理想化下建立恒等式，再在推论中讨论逼近误差的传播。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-接口恒等式-CFG-得分与联合得分的关系\">接口恒等式：CFG 得分与联合得分的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-接口恒等式-CFG-得分与联合得分的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（CFG 得分的分解）</strong>：在 A1–A3 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathcal{C}$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_{t}^{w}(x_{t},c)=\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid\\varnothing)+w\\,\\nabla_{x}\\log\\frac{p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid c)}{p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid\\varnothing)}.$$</div>\n<p>进一步，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid\\varnothing)&gt;0$</span>（关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 几乎处处），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_{t}^{w}(x_{t},c)=\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid\\varnothing)+w\\,s_{t}^{\\mathrm{cls}}(x_{t},c)+w\\,\\nabla_{x}\\log\\frac{p(c)}{p(\\varnothing)}\\Big|_{\\text{常数项}},$$</div>\n<p>其中最后一项关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的梯度为零，故在得分层面可略去。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 A3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\theta}(x_{t},c)=-\\sigma_{t}\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid c)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\theta}(x_{t},\\varnothing)=-\\sigma_{t}\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid\\varnothing)$</span>。代入 CFG 公式并除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_{t}$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_{t}^{w}(x_{t},c)=-\\frac{\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)}{\\sigma_{t}}=\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid\\varnothing)+w\\left(\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid c)-\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid\\varnothing)\\right).$$</div>\n<p>第一式得证。对第二式，由联合分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid c)=p_{t}(x_{t},c)/p(c)=p_{t}(c\\mid x_{t})\\,p_{t}(x_{t})/p(c)$</span>，取对数梯度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid c)=\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(c\\mid x_{t})+\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t})-\\nabla_{x}\\log p(c).$$</div>\n<p>同理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid\\varnothing)=\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(\\varnothing\\mid x_{t})+\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t})-\\nabla_{x}\\log p(\\varnothing)$</span>。两式相减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t})$</span> 抵消，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{x}\\log\\frac{p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid c)}{p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid\\varnothing)}=\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(c\\mid x_{t})-\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(\\varnothing\\mid x_{t})+\\nabla_{x}\\log\\frac{p(\\varnothing)}{p(c)}.$$</div>\n<p>最后一项关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的梯度为零。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t}^{\\mathrm{cls}}(x_{t},c):=\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(c\\mid x_{t})$</span>，并注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(\\varnothing\\mid x_{t})$</span> 是空条件对应的隐式分类器得分，则第二式成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>区别说明</strong>：命题 1 的第一式是纯粹的插值恒等式，不依赖联合分解；第二式才把 CFG 与联合条件章对接，其关键是把“条件与无条件的对数密度比”识别为“隐式分类器得分减去空条件隐式分类器得分”。这与前序节“引导与贝叶斯”中把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 解释为对条件似然的指数加权不同：那里讨论的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid c)^{w}$</span> 的归一化，本节讨论的是得分层面的精确分解，二者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时一致，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\neq1$</span> 时前者需要重新归一化而后者不需要（因为得分是局部量）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-主定理-CFG-是隐式分类器引导的一阶近似\">主定理：CFG 是隐式分类器引导的一阶近似<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-主定理-CFG-是隐式分类器引导的一阶近似\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 2（CFG 与隐式分类器引导的误差界）</strong>：在 A1–A3 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;0$</span>，并设隐式分类器得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t}^{\\mathrm{cls}}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t}(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 支撑上满足 Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t}$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left\\|s_{t}^{w}(x_{t},c)-\\left[\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid\\varnothing)+w\\,s_{t}^{\\mathrm{cls}}(x_{t},c)\\right]\\right\\|\\le w\\,L_{t}\\,\\left\\|\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(\\varnothing\\mid x_{t})\\right\\|.$$</div>\n<p>特别地，当空条件近似均匀（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t}(\\varnothing\\mid x_{t})$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 近乎常数）时，CFG 得分与“无条件得分 + <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 倍隐式分类器得分”的偏差趋于零。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 1 第二式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_{t}^{w}(x_{t},c)=\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid\\varnothing)+w\\,s_{t}^{\\mathrm{cls}}(x_{t},c)-w\\,\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(\\varnothing\\mid x_{t}).$$</div>\n<p>移项即得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_{t}^{w}(x_{t},c)-\\left[\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid\\varnothing)+w\\,s_{t}^{\\mathrm{cls}}(x_{t},c)\\right]=-w\\,\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(\\varnothing\\mid x_{t}).$$</div>\n<p>取范数，右边为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\|\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(\\varnothing\\mid x_{t})\\|$</span>。Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t}$</span> 在此处的作用是：若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t}^{\\mathrm{cls}}$</span> 替换为其在参考点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{0}$</span> 处的一阶展开，则误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t}\\|x_{t}-x_{0}\\|$</span> 控制；但本定理的误差项直接来自空条件分类器得分，不需要展开，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t}$</span> 仅用于说明当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t}^{\\mathrm{cls}}$</span> 被近似时的额外误差。严格地说，定理的等式部分不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t}$</span>，不等式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t}$</span> 项应理解为：若进一步用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t}^{\\mathrm{cls}}(x_{0},c)$</span> 代替 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t}^{\\mathrm{cls}}(x_{t},c)$</span>，则总误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le w\\|\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(\\varnothing\\mid x_{t})\\|+wL_{t}\\|x_{t}-x_{0}\\|$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>可检验推论 3（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 的退化）</strong>：在 A1–A3 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t}^{1}(x_{t},c)=\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid c)$</span>，即 CFG 退化为普通条件采样。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 代入命题 1 第一式，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid\\varnothing)+1\\cdot(\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid c)-\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid\\varnothing))=\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid c)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>具体例子（一维高斯）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}=\\mathbb{R}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t}(x\\mid c)=\\mathcal{N}(x;\\mu_{c},\\sigma_{t}^{2})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t}(x\\mid\\varnothing)=\\mathcal{N}(x;0,\\sigma_{t}^{2})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c)=p(\\varnothing)=1/2$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x\\mid c)=-(x-\\mu_{c})/\\sigma_{t}^{2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x\\mid\\varnothing)=-x/\\sigma_{t}^{2}$</span>。CFG 得分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_{t}^{w}(x,c)=-\\frac{x}{\\sigma_{t}^{2}}+w\\left(-\\frac{x-\\mu_{c}}{\\sigma_{t}^{2}}+\\frac{x}{\\sigma_{t}^{2}}\\right)=-\\frac{x}{\\sigma_{t}^{2}}+\\frac{w\\mu_{c}}{\\sigma_{t}^{2}}=-\\frac{x-w\\mu_{c}}{\\sigma_{t}^{2}}.$$</div>\n<p>这对应均值平移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\mu_{c}$</span> 的高斯得分，即引导后的边际为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(w\\mu_{c},\\sigma_{t}^{2})$</span>。而隐式分类器得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t}^{\\mathrm{cls}}(x,c)=\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(c\\mid x)$</span>：由贝叶斯公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t}(c\\mid x)\\propto p_{t}(x\\mid c)p(c)$</span>，两高斯等方差时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_{t}(c\\mid x)=\\log p(c)-\\frac{(x-\\mu_{c})^{2}}{2\\sigma_{t}^{2}}+\\text{常数}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t}^{\\mathrm{cls}}(x,c)=-(x-\\mu_{c})/\\sigma_{t}^{2}$</span>。于是“无条件得分 + <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 倍分类器得分”为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-x/\\sigma_{t}^{2}-w(x-\\mu_{c})/\\sigma_{t}^{2}=-(1+w)x/\\sigma_{t}^{2}+w\\mu_{c}/\\sigma_{t}^{2}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t}^{w}$</span> 相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-w x/\\sigma_{t}^{2}$</span> 项——这正是定理 2 中的空条件分类器得分项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(\\varnothing\\mid x_{t})=-wx/\\sigma_{t}^{2}$</span>。此例验证了误差项非零但结构明确：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\varnothing)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c)$</span> 不等或空条件非均匀时，CFG 并不精确等于“无条件 + <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 倍分类器”，而是多出一个空条件分类器修正。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-接口的适用边界-dropout-训练下的联合一致性\">接口的适用边界：dropout 训练下的联合一致性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-接口的适用边界-dropout-训练下的联合一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4（dropout 训练的得分一致性）</strong>：设训练时以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 置空，且网络在期望损失下收敛到最优。则在 A1–A2 下，最优空条件网络满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\theta}(x_{t},\\varnothing)=-\\sigma_{t}\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}&gt;0$</span> 且空条件样本的边缘分布与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 匹配。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong>：训练目标为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{c\\sim p(c)}\\mathbb{E}_{x_{t}\\sim p_{t}(\\cdot\\mid c)}[\\|\\varepsilon_{\\theta}(x_{t},\\tilde c)-\\varepsilon\\|^{2}]$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde c=c$</span> 以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde c=\\varnothing$</span> 以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\theta}(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 求变分，得最优解为在空条件被激活的样本上的条件期望。空条件被激活的样本分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}})\\,p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\,p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 的混合（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 边缘化后）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}&gt;0$</span> 时，混合分布中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 分量非零，最优空条件得分收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid\\varnothing)$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}=0$</span> 时，空条件从未被激活，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\theta}(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 无定义或无约束，CFG 公式失效。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把接口的另一端接到训练节：CFG 的数学有效性依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}&gt;0$</span>，否则命题 1 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 不可由网络读出。这与前序节“训练时的 dropout”一致，但本节强调的是：dropout 不仅是一个训练技巧，而是接口恒等式成立的结构性前提。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-接口的失败模式-w-gt-1-时的分布偏移与联合分解的不一致\">接口的失败模式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时的分布偏移与联合分解的不一致<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-接口的失败模式-w-gt-1-时的分布偏移与联合分解的不一致\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5（引导后的联合分解不再成立）</strong>：在 A1–A3 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\neq1$</span>，则一般不存在概率密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t}^{w}(x_{t},c)$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t}^{w}(x_{t},c)=\\nabla_{x}\\log q_{t}^{w}(x_{t},c)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t}^{w}(x_{t},c)$</span> 的边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t}^{w}(x_{t}\\mid c)$</span> 同时满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t}^{w}(x_{t}\\mid c)\\propto p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid c)^{w}p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid\\varnothing)^{1-w}$</span> 与联合分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t}^{w}(x_{t},c)=q_{t}^{w}(c\\mid x_{t})q_{t}^{w}(x_{t})$</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t}^{w}(c\\mid x_{t})$</span> 为隐式分类器的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 次幂归一化。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t}^{w}$</span> 是梯度场，故可积为某个对数密度的梯度当且仅当满足旋度自由条件（一维自动满足，高维需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{i}s_{j}=\\partial_{j}s_{i}$</span>）。命题 1 第一式给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t}^{w}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_{t}(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)+w\\log(p_{t}(\\cdot\\mid c)/p_{t}(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing))$</span> 的梯度，故存在密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t}^{w}(x_{t}\\mid c)\\propto p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid\\varnothing)^{1-w}p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid c)^{w}$</span>。但联合分解要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t}^{w}(x_{t},c)=q_{t}^{w}(c\\mid x_{t})q_{t}^{w}(x_{t})$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t}^{w}(x_{t}\\mid c)$</span> 由上式给出、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t}^{w}(x_{t})$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t}(x_{t})$</span> 给出时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t}^{w}(c\\mid x_{t})=q_{t}^{w}(x_{t}\\mid c)q_{t}^{w}(x_{t})/q_{t}^{w}(x_{t}\\mid c)$</span> 的归一化一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t}(c\\mid x_{t})^{w}$</span> 的归一化，除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid\\varnothing)=p_{t}(x_{t})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题是接口节的边界声明：CFG 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时给出的是一个合法的得分场（从而前序节的采样节可运行），但它对应的“联合分布”不再与联合条件章的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t}(x_{t},c)$</span> 分解兼容。因此，若下游任务需要联合条件章的精确联合得分（例如联合生成中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 耦合采样），则不能直接用 CFG 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t}^{w}$</span> 替代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t}^{\\mathrm{joint}}$</span>，而应使用命题 1 第二式中的显式分解，并单独处理空条件分类器项。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-代码验证-接口恒等式的数值检验\">代码验证：接口恒等式的数值检验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-代码验证-接口恒等式的数值检验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在一维高斯例子中验证命题 1 第一式、推论 3 与定理 2 的误差项，并打印形状与预期结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\n# 一维高斯参数\nmu_c, mu_empty, sigma_t = 1.5, 0.0, 0.8\nx = np.linspace(-3, 3, 7)\n\n# 得分函数\ndef score_cond(x, mu): return -(x - mu) / sigma_t**2\ndef score_empty(x): return -(x - mu_empty) / sigma_t**2\n\n# CFG 得分\ndef score_cfg(x, w): return score_empty(x) + w * (score_cond(x, mu_c) - score_empty(x))\n\n# 命题 1 第一式右边\ndef rhs_prop1(x, w):\n    ratio_log_grad = score_cond(x, mu_c) - score_empty(x)\n    return score_empty(x) + w * ratio_log_grad\n\nfor w in [0.0, 1.0, 2.5]:\n    lhs = score_cfg(x, w)\n    rhs = rhs_prop1(x, w)\n    assert np.allclose(lhs, rhs), f&quot;命题1第一式失败 w={w}&quot;\n    print(f&quot;w={w}: lhs shape={lhs.shape}, max|diff|={np.max(np.abs(lhs-rhs)):.2e}&quot;)\n\n# 推论 3: w=1 退化为条件得分\nassert np.allclose(score_cfg(x, 1.0), score_cond(x, mu_c)), &quot;推论3失败&quot;\nprint(&quot;w=1 退化验证通过, shape=&quot;, score_cond(x, mu_c).shape)\n\n# 定理 2 误差项: -w * grad log p_empty(x)\n# p_empty(x) ∝ exp(-(x-mu_empty)^2/(2 sigma^2)), grad log p_empty = score_empty\nerr_theorem = -w * score_empty(x)  # 注意定理2中误差为 -w * grad log p_empty\nfor w in [0.5, 2.0]:\n    lhs = score_cfg(x, w)\n    approx = score_empty(x) + w * score_cond(x, mu_c)  # 无条件 + w倍分类器（此例分类器=条件得分）\n    diff = lhs - approx\n    assert np.allclose(diff, -w * score_empty(x)), f&quot;定理2误差项失败 w={w}&quot;\n    print(f&quot;w={w}: 误差项 shape={diff.shape}, 与 -w*score_empty 最大偏差={np.max(np.abs(diff + w*score_empty(x))):.2e}&quot;)\n\n# 联合分解一致性: w=1 时 q(x|c)=p(x|c)\n# 此处仅数值检查 w=1 时 CFG 得分等于条件得分，已由推论3覆盖\nprint(&quot;接口恒等式数值验证完成&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：三组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 下命题 1 第一式的最大偏差为机器精度量级；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 退化验证通过；定理 2 误差项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-w\\,s_{t}^{\\mathrm{empty}}$</span> 一致。代码中的 <code>assert</code> 覆盖了命题 1、推论 3 与定理 2 的关键等式，形状均为 <code>(7,)</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>命题 1 把 CFG 得分精确分解为“无条件得分 + <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 倍条件与无条件的对数密度比梯度”，并进一步识别为“无条件得分 + <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 倍隐式分类器得分 − <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 倍空条件分类器得分”，从而给出与联合条件章的精确接口：CFG 不是联合得分的替代，而是联合得分中隐式分类器项的一个带修正的插值。</li>\n<li>定理 2 与推论 3 表明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 CFG 严格退化为条件采样；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\neq1$</span> 时 CFG 与“无条件 + <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 倍隐式分类器”的偏差由空条件分类器得分控制，空条件越接近均匀，CFG 越接近纯粹的隐式分类器引导。</li>\n<li>命题 4 与命题 5 划定了接口的适用边界：dropout 概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}&gt;0$</span> 是空条件得分可读出的结构性前提；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时引导后的得分场虽合法，但其对应的联合分布不再满足联合条件章的分解，故联合生成任务须使用显式分解而非直接套用 CFG 得分。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-接口的定量形式-联合得分分解的算子表述\">接口的定量形式：联合得分分解的算子表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-接口的定量形式-联合得分分解的算子表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前文命题 1 与定理 2 给出的是逐点恒等式与逐点误差界。在联合条件章的框架下，下游任务（联合采样、条件耦合、联合似然估计）需要的往往不是逐点等式，而是得分场作为算子的分解关系。本节把接口写成算子形式，并给出其成立所需的可积性条件，使联合条件章的联合得分恒等式与 CFG 的插值公式在同一函数空间中可比。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}_{t}:=L^{2}(\\mathcal{X},p_{t}(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing);\\mathbb{R}^{d})$</span> 为关于空条件边际平方可积的向量场空间，内积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle u,v\\rangle_{\\mathcal{H}_{t}}:=\\int_{\\mathcal{X}}u(x)\\cdot v(x)\\,p_{t}(x\\mid\\varnothing)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$</span>。定义三个算子：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\mathsf{S}_{\\mathrm{cond}}u)(x):=u(x)\\quad\\text{（条件得分嵌入）},\\qquad\n(\\mathsf{S}_{\\mathrm{cls}}u)(x):=s_{t}^{\\mathrm{cls}}(x,c)\\,u(x)\\quad\\text{（分类器得分乘子）},$$</div>\n<p>以及 CFG 算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf{C}_{w}:=\\mathsf{Id}+w(\\mathsf{S}_{\\mathrm{cond}}-\\mathsf{Id})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf{Id}$</span> 为恒等算子。此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf{S}_{\\mathrm{cls}}$</span> 的乘子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t}^{\\mathrm{cls}}(\\cdot,c)$</span> 由 A2 保证属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^{\\infty}(\\mathcal{X},p_{t}(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing))$</span>（因 A2 要求其连续且平方可积，连续函数在紧支撑下自动有界；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 非紧，则需补充假设 A2'：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t}^{\\mathrm{cls}}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t}(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 本质有界）。本节以下显式采用 A2'。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（CFG 算子的有界性与谱）</strong>：在 A1、A2'、A3 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf{C}_{w}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}_{t}$</span> 上的有界线性算子，其算子范数满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mathsf{C}_{w}\\|_{\\mathcal{H}_{t}}\\le 1+w(1+\\|s_{t}^{\\mathrm{cls}}\\|_{\\infty})$</span>。若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t}^{\\mathrm{cls}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}_{t}$</span> 中正交，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf{C}_{w}$</span> 的谱半径不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max(1,w\\|s_{t}^{\\mathrm{cls}}\\|_{\\infty})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in\\mathcal{H}_{t}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\mathsf{C}_{w}u\\|_{\\mathcal{H}_{t}}=\\|u+w(\\mathsf{S}_{\\mathrm{cond}}u-u)\\|_{\\mathcal{H}_{t}}\\le\\|u\\|_{\\mathcal{H}_{t}}+w\\|\\mathsf{S}_{\\mathrm{cond}}u-u\\|_{\\mathcal{H}_{t}}.$$</div>\n<p>由三角不等式与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mathsf{S}_{\\mathrm{cond}}u\\|_{\\mathcal{H}_{t}}\\le\\|u\\|_{\\mathcal{H}_{t}}(1+\\|s_{t}^{\\mathrm{cls}}\\|_{\\infty})$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf{S}_{\\mathrm{cond}}u=u\\cdot(1+s_{t}^{\\mathrm{cls}})$</span> 在命题 1 第二式的意义下），得第一式。谱半径部分：若正交，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf{C}_{w}$</span> 在正交直和分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}_{t}=\\mathrm{span}\\{\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)\\}\\oplus\\mathrm{span}\\{\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)\\}^{\\perp}$</span> 上分块对角，第一块特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，第二块特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\|s_{t}^{\\mathrm{cls}}\\|_{\\infty}$</span>，故谱半径不超过二者最大值。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的意义在于：它把“CFG 是否稳定”从前序节数值稳定性中的逐点 Lipschitz 讨论提升为算子层面的谱条件。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\|s_{t}^{\\mathrm{cls}}\\|_{\\infty}&gt;1$</span> 时，CFG 算子在高频方向放大扰动，这正是前序节“反例：引导过强导致模式崩溃”在接口层面的机制：放大方向恰是隐式分类器得分张成的方向，即条件与无条件密度比变化最剧烈的方向。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-接口的联合采样恒等式-从得分到联合转移核\">接口的联合采样恒等式：从得分到联合转移核<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-接口的联合采样恒等式-从得分到联合转移核\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>联合条件章的核心对象是联合转移核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_{t\\to s}^{\\mathrm{joint}}(x_{t},c;\\mathrm{d}x_{s})$</span>，它由联合得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t}^{\\mathrm{joint}}$</span> 驱动的反向 SDE 或概率流 ODE 生成。接口节需要回答：CFG 得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t}^{w}$</span> 驱动的转移核与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_{t\\to s}^{\\mathrm{joint}}$</span> 有何关系。下面的命题给出精确的 Radon–Nikodym 导数表述。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（CFG 转移核的联合密度比）</strong>：在 A1–A3 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;0$</span>，并设 CFG 得分驱动的概率流 ODE 存在全局解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{t\\to s}^{w}$</span>（由 A1 的局部 Lipschitz 与线性增长条件保证）。则对任意有界可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathcal{X}\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathcal{X}}f(x_{s})\\,K_{t\\to s}^{w}(\\mathrm{d}x_{s}\\mid x_{t},c)=\\int_{\\mathcal{X}}f(\\Phi_{t\\to s}^{w}(x_{t}))\\,\\frac{q_{t}^{w}(x_{t}\\mid c)}{p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid c)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x_{t},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t}^{w}(x_{t}\\mid c)\\propto p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid\\varnothing)^{1-w}p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid c)^{w}$</span> 为命题 5 中由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t}^{w}$</span> 积出的密度。特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时该密度比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，CFG 转移核与联合条件章的条件转移核在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t}$</span> 边缘上一致。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 1 第一式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t}^{w}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q_{t}^{w}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 的梯度，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{t\\to s}^{w}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t}^{w}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 的概率流 ODE 的解。概率流 ODE 保持密度沿流不变（前序节已证），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{s}^{w}(\\Phi_{t\\to s}^{w}(x_{t})\\mid c)=q_{t}^{w}(x_{t}\\mid c)$</span>。对测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 积分并换元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{s}=\\Phi_{t\\to s}^{w}(x_{t})$</span>，得左边 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\int f(\\Phi_{t\\to s}^{w}(x_{t}))q_{t}^{w}(x_{t}\\mid c)\\,\\mathrm{d}x_{t}$</span>。再乘以并除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid c)$</span> 即得所述 Radon–Nikodym 形式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t}^{1}=p_{t}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>，密度比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把接口从“得分层面”推进到“转移核层面”：CFG 采样得到的样本分布相对于真实条件分布的偏移，完全由初始时刻的密度比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t}^{w}/p_{t}$</span> 刻画。这为前序节“引导的分布偏移”提供了联合条件章视角下的精确表达——偏移不是发生在采样动力学内部，而是发生在初始条件的重加权上。因此，若下游联合任务需要从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t}(x_{t},c)$</span> 精确采样，则不能直接用 CFG 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{w}$</span>，而须在联合得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t}^{\\mathrm{joint}}$</span> 上做显式分解，并按命题 1 第二式保留空条件分类器修正项。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-接口的误差传播-网络逼近误差下的联合一致性\">接口的误差传播：网络逼近误差下的联合一致性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-接口的误差传播-网络逼近误差下的联合一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前文 A3 假设网络精确。实际工程中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\theta}$</span> 有逼近误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{\\theta}(x_{t},c):=\\varepsilon_{\\theta}(x_{t},c)+\\sigma_{t}\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid c)$</span>。接口节须说明该误差在 CFG 组合下如何传播到联合得分，否则联合条件章的恒等式在工程实现中不可检验。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（逼近误差的线性传播）</strong>：在 A1、A2' 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta_{\\theta}(\\cdot,c)\\|_{\\mathcal{H}_{t}}\\le\\eta_{c}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta_{\\theta}(\\cdot,\\varnothing)\\|_{\\mathcal{H}_{t}}\\le\\eta_{\\varnothing}$</span>。则 CFG 得分与命题 1 第一式右端的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}_{t}$</span> 误差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|s_{t}^{w}-\\big(\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)+w(\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(\\cdot\\mid c)-\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing))\\big)\\|_{\\mathcal{H}_{t}}\\le\\frac{1}{\\sigma_{t}}\\big(\\eta_{\\varnothing}+w(\\eta_{c}+\\eta_{\\varnothing})\\big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_{\\theta}(x_{t},c)=\\varepsilon_{\\theta}(x_{t},\\varnothing)+w(\\varepsilon_{\\theta}(x_{t},c)-\\varepsilon_{\\theta}(x_{t},\\varnothing))$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\theta}=-\\sigma_{t}\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}+\\delta_{\\theta}$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_{\\theta}=-\\sigma_{t}\\big[\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)+w(\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(\\cdot\\mid c)-\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing))\\big]+\\delta_{\\theta}(\\cdot,\\varnothing)+w(\\delta_{\\theta}(\\cdot,c)-\\delta_{\\theta}(\\cdot,\\varnothing)).$$</div>\n<p>除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_{t}$</span> 并取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}_{t}$</span> 范数，用三角不等式即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的关键结构是：误差项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{\\theta}(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-w$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时该系数为负且绝对值随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 增长，故空条件网络的误差在强引导下被放大。这与命题 6 的谱分析一致：强引导放大的是空条件方向的扰动。接口的工程含义是，联合任务若使用 CFG，必须同时控制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_{\\varnothing}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span>，否则联合得分分解中的空条件修正项不可靠。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-接口的充要条件-CFG-何时精确等于联合得分分解\">接口的充要条件：CFG 何时精确等于联合得分分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-接口的充要条件-CFG-何时精确等于联合得分分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出接口节的一个判别性结论：在什么条件下 CFG 得分恰好等于联合条件章中“无条件得分 + 隐式分类器得分”的某个显式组合，从而使联合采样无需额外修正。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（精确接口的充要条件）</strong>：在 A1–A3 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t}^{w}(x_{t},c)=\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(x_{t}\\mid\\varnothing)+w\\,s_{t}^{\\mathrm{cls}}(x_{t},c)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t}(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 几乎处处成立，当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(\\varnothing\\mid x_{t})=0$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t}(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)$</span> 几乎处处成立，即空条件后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t}(\\varnothing\\mid x_{t})$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t}$</span> 为常数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 1 第二式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t}^{w}-\\big(\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(\\cdot\\mid\\varnothing)+w\\,s_{t}^{\\mathrm{cls}}\\big)=-w\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(\\varnothing\\mid x_{t})$</span>。故等式成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(\\varnothing\\mid x_{t})=0$</span> 几乎处处。<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;0$</span> 时即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x}\\log p_{t}(\\varnothing\\mid x_{t})=0$</span> 几乎处处，等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t}(\\varnothing\\mid x_{t})$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t}$</span> 为常数（在连通支撑上）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题澄清了一个常见误解：CFG 并不“就是”隐式分类器引导，二者精确相等需要空条件后验均匀这一强条件。在一般条件下，CFG 是隐式分类器引导加上一个空条件分类器修正项；只有当空条件在所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t}$</span> 上等可能时，修正项才消失。这为联合条件章的接口提供了判别准则：若联合任务的条件空间设计中空条件被赋予非均匀先验，则 CFG 与联合得分分解之间存在不可忽略的结构性差异，必须显式处理。</p>\n<p><strong>接口节的算子链小结（非本节小结，仅为接口链的紧凑表述）</strong>：命题 6 给出 CFG 算子的谱条件，命题 7 给出转移核的密度比，命题 8 给出逼近误差的线性传播，命题 9 给出精确相等的充要条件。四者共同构成从得分恒等式（命题 1）到联合采样（命题 7）的完整接口链，其每一环的假设均已在 A1–A3 与 A2' 中显式列出，缺任一环则联合条件章的恒等式在 CFG 语境下不可直接调用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df18--h-本章推导链-CFG-隐式分类器\">本章推导链：CFG = 隐式分类器<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-本章推导链-CFG-隐式分类器\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号，不引入新记号。回顾如下：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为扩散过程在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的状态，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 为条件变量，取值于可测空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal{C},\\Sigma_{\\mathcal{C}})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing$</span> 为空条件（一个形式符号，视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span> 的附加点）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)$</span> 为噪声预测网络，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)$</span> 为无条件预测；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span> 为引导权重；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\in[0,1)$</span> 为训练时条件置空概率。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)$</span> 为无条件边缘密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span> 为条件密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c\\mid x_t)$</span> 为后验。记得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x_t,c)=\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x_t,\\varnothing)=\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t(x_t)$</span>。噪声预测与得分的关系为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=-\\sigma_t\\, s_t(x_t,c)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 为前向噪声标准差，前序节已定义），故线性关系在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 之间保持。</p>\n<p>本节所需正则性假设，逐条显式列出并在证明中引用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(A1) 可测性与可积性</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,c)\\mapsto p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\otimes\\Sigma_{\\mathcal{C}}$</span> 可测，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid c)&gt;0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)&gt;0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 成立。</li>\n<li><strong>(A2) 得分的存在性与局部 Lipschitz</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot,c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上局部 Lipschitz 且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 连续可微，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 同样局部 Lipschitz。</li>\n<li><strong>(A3) 后验的可微性</strong>：贝叶斯恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid c)=p_t(x_t)\\,p(c\\mid x_t)/p(c)$</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c\\mid x_t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 连续可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c)&gt;0$</span>，使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p(c\\mid x_t)$</span> 存在且连续。</li>\n<li><strong>(A4) 训练分布的一致性</strong>：训练时以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 置空，等价于网络在期望意义上拟合的联合目标为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}})$</span> 权重下的条件得分与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 权重下的无条件得分的凸组合（第 4 节已证），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)$</span> 得分的相合估计。</li>\n<li><strong>(A5) 引导权重的有界性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in[0,W_{\\max}]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_{\\max}&lt;\\infty$</span>，以保证本节所有极限与积分交换在有限参数下成立。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节核心定义（与相邻概念的区别）：<strong>隐式分类器</strong>指由 CFG 组合式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\left(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\right)$$</div>\n<p>所诱导的得分场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t(x_t,c)=-\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)/\\sigma_t$</span>。它与显式分类器引导（在得分上直接加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p(c\\mid x_t)$</span> 的梯度项）的区别在于：隐式分类器不显式构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c\\mid x_t)$</span>，而是用条件与无条件得分之差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)$</span> 作为后验得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p(c\\mid x_t)$</span> 的代理。它与普通条件采样（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span>）的区别在于权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 对差值项的缩放；它与无条件采样（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span>）的区别在于是否保留条件项。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-18-16-1-CFG-得分恒等式\">命题 18.16.1（CFG 得分恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-18-16-1-CFG-得分恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_t(x_t,c)-s_t(x_t,\\varnothing)=\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p(c\\mid x_t).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由贝叶斯恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid c)=p_t(x_t)\\,p(c\\mid x_t)/p(c)$</span>，两边取对数得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)=\\log p_t(x_t)+\\log p(c\\mid x_t)-\\log p(c)$</span>。由 (A3)，右端三项关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 连续可微，故可逐项求梯度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t(x_t\\mid c)=\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t(x_t)+\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p(c\\mid x_t)$</span>。移项即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x_t,c)-s_t(x_t,\\varnothing)=\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p(c\\mid x_t)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式是本节推导链的起点：它说明条件与无条件得分之差<strong>恰好</strong>是后验对数密度的梯度，无需任何近似。CFG 的全部近似性来自下一步——用网络预测替代真实得分。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-18-16-2-CFG-作为隐式分类器引导的主定理\">命题 18.16.2（CFG 作为隐式分类器引导的主定理）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-18-16-2-CFG-作为隐式分类器引导的主定理\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1)–(A5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))$</span> 意义下相合，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{x_t\\sim p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)}\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,c)\\|^2\\to 0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{x_t\\sim p_t}\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)-\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,\\varnothing)\\|^2\\to 0$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star$</span> 为真实噪声预测。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in[0,W_{\\max}]$</span>，CFG 组合式诱导的得分场满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde s_t(x_t,c)=s_t(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\,\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p(c\\mid x_t)+o_{L^2}(1),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$o_{L^2}(1)$</span> 表示在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))$</span> 意义下趋于零的误差项。特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta=\\varepsilon^\\star$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t(x_t,c)=s_t(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\,\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p(c\\mid x_t)$</span> 精确成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的定义与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t=-\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta/\\sigma_t$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde s_t(x_t,c)=-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t}\\left[\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\left(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)\\right)\\right].$$</div>\n<p>将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,c)=\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,c)+e_c(x_t)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)=\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,\\varnothing)+e_\\varnothing(x_t)$</span> 代入，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_c,e_\\varnothing$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 误差，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde s_t(x_t,c)=-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t}\\left[\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\left(\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,c)-\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,\\varnothing)\\right)\\right]-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t}\\left[e_\\varnothing(x_t)+w\\left(e_c(x_t)-e_\\varnothing(x_t)\\right)\\right].$$</div>\n<p>第一项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star=-\\sigma_t s_t$</span> 化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\left(s_t(x_t,c)-s_t(x_t,\\varnothing)\\right)$</span>；再由命题 18.16.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x_t,c)-s_t(x_t,\\varnothing)=\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p(c\\mid x_t)$</span>，故第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=s_t(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\,\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p(c\\mid x_t)$</span>。第二项为误差项，其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))$</span> 范数由三角不等式与 (A5) 有界：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left\\|\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t}\\left[e_\\varnothing+w(e_c-e_\\varnothing)\\right]\\right\\|_{L^2}\\le\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t}\\left(\\|e_\\varnothing\\|_{L^2}+W_{\\max}(\\|e_c\\|_{L^2}+\\|e_\\varnothing\\|_{L^2})\\right)\\to 0.$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t=s_t(\\cdot,\\varnothing)+w\\,\\nabla\\log p(c\\mid\\cdot)+o_{L^2}(1)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此定理给出本节的核心结论：<strong>CFG 是隐式分类器引导的近似</strong>——它用网络得分差替代后验得分，近似误差由网络在条件与无条件两个分布上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 相合性控制，且误差被权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 线性放大（因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+W_{\\max}$</span>）。这解释了第 8 节数值稳定性中“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 过大时误差放大”的现象，也解释了第 5 节分布偏移的来源：偏移量正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\,\\nabla\\log p(c\\mid x_t)$</span> 与真实后验得分之差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-推论-18-16-3-引导权重的极限行为与分布锐化\">推论 18.16.3（引导权重的极限行为与分布锐化）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-推论-18-16-3-引导权重的极限行为与分布锐化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在命题 18.16.2 的假设下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，考虑由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t$</span> 诱导的近似条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(w)}(x_t\\mid c)\\propto p_t(x_t)\\exp\\left(w\\log p(c\\mid x_t)\\right)$</span>（即隐式分类器引导的目标分布）。则：</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(1)}(x_t\\mid c)=p_t(x_t\\mid c)$</span>，退化为普通条件采样；</p>\n<p>(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 相对于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c\\mid x_t)$</span> 大的区域被锐化，即对任意可测集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\tilde p_t^{(w)}(A\\mid c)}{p_t(A\\mid c)}=\\frac{\\mathbb{E}_{p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)}\\left[\\mathbf{1}_A(x_t)\\,p(c\\mid x_t)^{w-1}\\right]}{\\mathbb{E}_{p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)}\\left[p(c\\mid x_t)^{w-1}\\right]},$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 弱收敛于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 在集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max_{x_t}p(c\\mid x_t)$</span> 上的条件化（在最大值点唯一且非退化的假设下）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　(i) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(w)}\\propto p_t(x_t)\\exp(w\\log p(c\\mid x_t))=p_t(x_t)p(c\\mid x_t)^w$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(1)}\\propto p_t(x_t)p(c\\mid x_t)=p_t(x_t\\mid c)p(c)$</span>，归一化即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>。(ii) 对可测集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(w)}(A\\mid c)=\\int_A p_t(x_t)p(c\\mid x_t)^w\\,dx_t/Z_w$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_w=\\int p_t(x_t)p(c\\mid x_t)^w\\,dx_t$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)=p_t(x_t\\mid c)p(c)/p(c\\mid x_t)$</span> 代入（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c\\mid x_t)&gt;0$</span> 处），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(w)}(A\\mid c)=\\int_A p_t(x_t\\mid c)p(c\\mid x_t)^{w-1}\\,dx_t/\\int p_t(x_t\\mid c)p(c\\mid x_t)^{w-1}\\,dx_t$</span>，即所证比值式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 的弱收敛由 Laplace 方法：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c\\mid x_t)^{w-1}$</span> 的质量集中在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max p(c\\mid x_t)$</span> 附近，在最大值点唯一且 Hessian 非退化的假设下，归一化后的测度弱收敛于该点集上的条件化。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论把第 3 节“引导权重”与第 7 节“极限行为”的结论统一到隐式分类器框架下：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 是恒等，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 是按后验锐化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 是硬条件化（对应第 10 节模式崩溃的极端情形）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-具体例子-一维高斯-验证公式\">具体例子（一维高斯，验证公式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-具体例子-一维高斯-验证公式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c\\mid x_t)=\\sigma(\\alpha x_t)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 为 logistic 函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c)=1/2$</span>（对称）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid c)=2\\,\\mathcal{N}(0,1)\\,\\sigma(\\alpha x_t)$</span>。计算后验得分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p(c\\mid x_t)=\\frac{\\alpha\\,e^{\\alpha x_t}}{1+e^{\\alpha x_t}}=\\alpha\\,\\sigma(-\\alpha x_t).$$</div>\n<p>无条件得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x_t,\\varnothing)=-x_t$</span>。由命题 18.16.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x_t,c)=-x_t+\\alpha\\sigma(-\\alpha x_t)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=0$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(0,\\varnothing)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(0,c)=0+1\\cdot\\sigma(0)=0.5$</span>，差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.5=\\nabla\\log p(c\\mid 0)=\\sigma(0)=0.5$</span>，恒等式成立。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t(0,c)=0+2\\cdot0.5=1.0$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(2)}\\propto\\mathcal{N}(0,1)\\sigma(x_t)^2$</span> 的对数梯度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=0$</span> 处一致（直接计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log[\\mathcal{N}(0,1)\\sigma(x_t)^2]|_{0}=0+2\\sigma(0)=1.0$</span>）。数值验证见下方代码。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-推导链的闭合-从-dropout-到隐式分类器\">推导链的闭合：从 dropout 到隐式分类器<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-推导链的闭合-从-dropout-到隐式分类器\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节推导链可概括为四步，每步对应前序一节：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>训练 dropout（第 4 节）</strong> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,\\varnothing)$</span> 成为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)$</span> 得分的相合估计（假设 A4）。</li>\n<li><strong>贝叶斯恒等式（第 6 节）</strong> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x_t,c)-s_t(x_t,\\varnothing)=\\nabla\\log p(c\\mid x_t)$</span>（命题 18.16.1），这是精确的、无近似的。</li>\n<li><strong>CFG 组合式（第 1 节）</strong> 用网络预测替代真实得分，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t=s_t(\\cdot,\\varnothing)+w\\nabla\\log p(c\\mid\\cdot)+o_{L^2}(1)$</span>（命题 18.16.2），近似误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 线性放大。</li>\n<li><strong>权重极限（第 3、7 节）</strong> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 恒等、<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 锐化、<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 硬条件化（推论 18.16.3），并解释第 5 节分布偏移与第 10 节模式崩溃的数学来源。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这四步闭合了“CFG = 隐式分类器”的推导链：CFG 不是显式构造分类器，而是用得分差作为后验得分的代理，其全部性质由贝叶斯恒等式与网络相合性决定。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\n# 一维高斯例子：验证命题 18.16.1 与推论 18.16.3 的恒等式\nalpha = 1.0\nx = 0.0\n\ndef sigmoid(z):\n    return 1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-z))\n\n# 无条件得分 s(x, empty) = -x\ns_uncond = -x\n# 条件得分 s(x, c) = -x + alpha * sigmoid(-alpha * x)\ns_cond = -x + alpha * sigmoid(-alpha * x)\n# 后验得分 grad log p(c|x) = alpha * sigmoid(-alpha * x)\ngrad_post = alpha * sigmoid(-alpha * x)\n\ndiff = s_cond - s_uncond\nassert np.isclose(diff, grad_post), (diff, grad_post)\nprint(&quot;命题18.16.1: s_cond - s_uncond =&quot;, diff, &quot; grad_post =&quot;, grad_post)\n\n# 验证 CFG 组合式在 w=2 时与 tilde_p 的对数梯度一致\nw = 2.0\ns_tilde = s_uncond + w * diff\n# tilde_p ∝ N(0,1) * sigmoid(x)^2，其对数梯度在 x=0 处为 0 + 2*sigmoid(0)\ngrad_tilde_p = -x + w * grad_post\nassert np.isclose(s_tilde, grad_tilde_p), (s_tilde, grad_tilde_p)\nprint(&quot;命题18.16.2 (w=2): s_tilde =&quot;, s_tilde, &quot; grad_tilde_p =&quot;, grad_tilde_p)\n\n# 验证 w=1 退化为条件采样\nw1 = 1.0\ns_w1 = s_uncond + w1 * diff\nassert np.isclose(s_w1, s_cond), (s_w1, s_cond)\nprint(&quot;推论18.16.3(i): w=1 时 s_tilde =&quot;, s_w1, &quot; = s_cond =&quot;, s_cond)\n\n# 验证 w&gt;1 锐化：在 x=0 处 tilde_p 的对数梯度绝对值大于 p(x|c) 的\nassert abs(s_tilde) &gt; abs(s_cond)\nprint(&quot;推论18.16.3(ii): |s_tilde(w=2)| =&quot;, abs(s_tilde), &quot;&gt; |s_cond| =&quot;, abs(s_cond))\nprint(&quot;形状检查: 所有量为标量，d=1，无数组形状&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：四行断言全部通过，打印 <code>命题18.16.1: s_cond - s_uncond = 0.5  grad_post = 0.5</code>，<code>命题18.16.2 (w=2): s_tilde = 1.0  grad_tilde_p = 1.0</code>，<code>推论18.16.3(i): w=1 时 s_tilde = 0.5 = s_cond = 0.5</code>，<code>推论18.16.3(ii): |s_tilde(w=2)| = 1.0 &gt; |s_cond| = 0.5</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>命题 18.16.1 证明条件与无条件得分之差精确等于后验对数密度的梯度，这是 CFG 作为隐式分类器的无近似基础；CFG 的全部近似性仅来自网络预测对真实得分的替代。</li>\n<li>命题 18.16.2 给出主定理：CFG 组合式诱导的得分场等于无条件得分加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 倍后验得分，误差项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 意义下趋于零且被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 线性放大，从而定量解释了引导权重的数值稳定性边界。</li>\n<li>推论 18.16.3 统一了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 退化、<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 锐化与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 硬条件化的极限行为，并把第 5 节分布偏移与第 10 节模式崩溃归因于隐式分类器目标分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(w)}\\propto p_t\\,p(c\\mid x_t)^w$</span> 的集中效应。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-18-16-4-隐式分类器与显式分类器引导的等价性判据\">命题 18.16.4（隐式分类器与显式分类器引导的等价性判据）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-18-16-4-隐式分类器与显式分类器引导的等价性判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1)–(A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span>，记显式分类器引导的得分场为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^{\\mathrm{exp}}(x_t,c)=s_t(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\,\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p(c\\mid x_t)$</span>，隐式分类器引导的得分场为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t(x_t,c)=s_t(x_t,\\varnothing)+w\\left(s_t(x_t,c)-s_t(x_t,\\varnothing)\\right)$</span>。则二者恒等，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t=s_t^{\\mathrm{exp}}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 成立，当且仅当命题 18.16.1 的贝叶斯恒等式成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　充分性：若贝叶斯恒等式成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x_t,c)-s_t(x_t,\\varnothing)=\\nabla\\log p(c\\mid x_t)$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t$</span> 的定义即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t=s_t(\\cdot,\\varnothing)+w\\nabla\\log p(c\\mid\\cdot)=s_t^{\\mathrm{exp}}$</span>。必要性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t=s_t^{\\mathrm{exp}}$</span>，则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;0$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(s_t(x_t,c)-s_t(x_t,\\varnothing))=w\\nabla\\log p(c\\mid x_t)$</span>，两边除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 即得贝叶斯恒等式；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span> 时二者均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span>，此时等价性不携带后验信息，但贝叶斯恒等式仍由 (A3) 独立成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题澄清了一个常见混淆：在<strong>真实得分</strong>层面，隐式与显式分类器引导是同一个对象，二者无差别；差别只出现在<strong>网络预测</strong>层面——显式引导需要额外训练一个分类器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\phi(c\\mid x_t)$</span> 并对其求梯度，隐式引导则复用条件与无条件两个噪声预测网络，用其差作为后验得分的代理。因此命题 18.16.2 的近似误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$o_{L^2}(1)$</span> 是隐式方案相对显式方案的全部代价，而这一代价由两个网络的相合性控制，不需要分类器的额外假设。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-18-16-5-引导误差的方差分解\">命题 18.16.5（引导误差的方差分解）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-18-16-5-引导误差的方差分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在命题 18.16.2 的假设下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_c=\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,c)-\\varepsilon^\\star(\\cdot,c)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_\\varnothing=\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)-\\varepsilon^\\star(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 为两个网络的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 误差。则 CFG 得分场的均方误差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)}\\|\\tilde s_t-\\tilde s_t^\\star\\|^2=\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}\\mathbb{E}\\left\\|(1-w)\\,e_\\varnothing+w\\,e_c\\right\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t^\\star$</span> 为真实得分诱导的隐式分类器引导场。右端可分解为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}\\left[(1-w)^2\\|e_\\varnothing\\|^2+w^2\\|e_c\\|^2+2w(1-w)\\langle e_\\varnothing,e_c\\rangle\\right],$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t(\\cdot\\mid c))$</span> 内积。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_t-\\tilde s_t^\\star=-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t}\\left[(1-w)e_\\varnothing+w e_c\\right]$</span>（直接由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的线性组合与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varepsilon^\\star$</span> 的线性组合相减得到），取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数平方即得第一式。展开平方并用内积双线性得第二式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此分解给出三个可检验的推论。其一，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时误差退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|e_c\\|^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，即普通条件采样的误差，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_\\varnothing$</span> 无关——这解释了为何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时无条件网络的误差不影响条件采样质量。其二，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_c$</span> 的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_\\varnothing$</span> 的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|1-w|=w-1$</span> 同时增大，故误差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 超线性增长（交叉项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_c,e_\\varnothing$</span> 同向时为正），这与第 8 节数值稳定性中“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 增大导致采样发散”的观察一致。其三，若两误差独立且均值为零，交叉项期望为零，则误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-w)^2\\|e_\\varnothing\\|^2+w^2\\|e_c\\|^2$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w^\\star=\\|e_\\varnothing\\|^2/(\\|e_\\varnothing\\|^2+\\|e_c\\|^2)$</span> 处取极小——这给出一个<strong>最优引导权重</strong>的解析表达式，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 并非越大越好，其最优值由两个网络的相对精度决定。这一结论不依赖任何实验，仅由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 分解得到。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-命题-18-16-6-dropout-概率对隐式分类器相合性的影响\">命题 18.16.6（dropout 概率对隐式分类器相合性的影响）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-命题-18-16-6-dropout-概率对隐式分类器相合性的影响\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A4) 下，设训练时以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 置空条件，则无条件网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 意义下相合于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的得分，其相合速率与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 的关系为：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\to 1$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 的训练样本全部来自无条件分支，相合性最好；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\to 0$</span> 时，无条件分支几乎不被训练，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|e_\\varnothing\\|$</span> 不趋于零，命题 18.16.2 的误差项不再消失。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong>　(A4) 已证训练目标为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-p_{\\mathrm{drop}})$</span> 权重的条件得分与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 权重的无条件得分的凸组合。设网络容量充分，则在该凸组合目标下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 的有效训练信号强度正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\to 0$</span> 时，无条件分支的梯度信号趋于零，网络在该分支上的输出趋于初始化值而非真实得分，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|e_\\varnothing\\|$</span> 有正下界。反之 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}\\to 1$</span> 时条件分支信号趋于零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|e_c\\|$</span> 有正下界，命题 18.16.2 的误差项同样不消失。因此存在一个由两分支精度平衡决定的中间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|e_\\varnothing\\|$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|e_c\\|$</span> 同时较小；这与命题 18.16.5 的最优权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w^\\star$</span> 通过同一组误差量耦合。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把第 4 节的 dropout 训练与本节的主定理连接起来：dropout 概率不是独立超参数，它通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|e_\\varnothing\\|$</span> 进入命题 18.16.2 的误差项，进而决定 CFG 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 下的实际分布偏移量。这也解释了为何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 的经验取值通常不大（约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1$</span>）：它需要在保留条件分支信号与维持无条件分支相合性之间取平衡。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-推论-18-16-7-分布偏移的-KL-恒等式\">推论 18.16.7（分布偏移的 KL 恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-推论-18-16-7-分布偏移的-KL-恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在推论 18.16.3 的设定下，隐式分类器目标分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 与真实条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 之间的 KL 散度满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\left(\\tilde p_t^{(w)}\\,\\|\\,p_t(\\cdot\\mid c)\\right)=(w-1)\\,\\mathbb{E}_{\\tilde p_t^{(w)}}\\left[\\log p(c\\mid x_t)\\right]-\\log Z_w+\\log p(c),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_w=\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}\\left[p(c\\mid x_t)^w\\right]$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(w)}(x_t\\mid c)=p_t(x_t)p(c\\mid x_t)^w/Z_w$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid c)=p_t(x_t)p(c\\mid x_t)/p(c)$</span>，取对数比：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\frac{\\tilde p_t^{(w)}(x_t\\mid c)}{p_t(x_t\\mid c)}=w\\log p(c\\mid x_t)-\\log Z_w-\\log p(c\\mid x_t)+\\log p(c)=(w-1)\\log p(c\\mid x_t)-\\log Z_w+\\log p(c).$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(w)}(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 取期望即得所证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式把第 5 节的“分布偏移”量化为一个可计算的 KL 表达式：偏移由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(w-1)$</span> 乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(w)}$</span> 下的平均对数后验，减去归一化常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z_w$</span> 与先验项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(c)$</span> 构成。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(w-1)=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_1=p(c)$</span>，KL 为零，与推论 18.16.3(i) 一致。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 时，第一项为正（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(w)}$</span> 集中在对数后验大的区域），故 KL 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 增大而增大，定量刻画了“引导越强、偏移越大”的单调性。这一恒等式不依赖任何采样，仅由两个密度的解析形式得到，可作为第 14 节数值实验中 KL 估计的解析基准。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df18--h-推导链的闭合-补足\">推导链的闭合（补足）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df18--h-推导链的闭合-补足\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>至此本节推导链的五个环节全部闭合，逐环对应前序节：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>dropout 训练（第 4 节）</strong> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\varnothing)$</span> 的相合性及其对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{drop}}$</span> 的依赖（命题 18.16.6），这是隐式分类器方案中无条件分支的合法性来源。</li>\n<li><strong>贝叶斯恒等式（第 6 节）</strong> 给出条件与无条件得分之差精确等于后验得分（命题 18.16.1），这是无近似的代数基础。</li>\n<li><strong>CFG 组合式（第 1 节）</strong> 在网络预测层面用得分差替代后验得分，得到主定理（命题 18.16.2），近似误差由两网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 误差控制并被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 放大。</li>\n<li><strong>误差结构（本节新增）</strong> 命题 18.16.5 把误差分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_c$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_\\varnothing$</span> 的加权和，给出最优权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w^\\star$</span> 的解析式，把第 8 节数值稳定性从定性观察提升为定量判据。</li>\n<li><strong>权重极限与偏移（第 3、5、7 节）</strong> 推论 18.16.3 与 18.16.7 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=1$</span> 恒等、<span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;1$</span> 锐化、<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span> 硬条件化，以及 KL 偏移的解析表达式，把第 10 节模式崩溃归因于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t^{(w)}$</span> 的集中效应。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>五个环节的共同结论是：CFG 在真实得分层面与显式分类器引导完全等价（命题 18.16.4），其全部近似性来自网络预测对真实得分的替代，而这一替代的误差由 dropout 训练保证的无条件分支相合性与条件分支相合性共同控制。因此“CFG = 隐式分类器”不是类比，而是一个可逐项验证的恒等式链：贝叶斯恒等式提供精确的代数骨架，网络相合性提供近似的误差界，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 提供从恒等到硬条件化的连续插值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\n# 验证命题 18.16.5 的方差分解与最优权重 w_star\n# 取一维高斯例子，构造两个具有已知 L2 误差的网络\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nN = 200000\nx = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=N)  # 采样自 p_t = N(0,1)\nalpha = 1.0\n\n# 真实得分\ns_uncond_true = -x\ns_cond_true = -x + alpha / (1.0 + np.exp(alpha * x))  # alpha * sigmoid(-alpha x)\n\n# 构造带误差的网络预测：e_c 与 e_empty 为独立零均值噪声\nsigma_c, sigma_e = 0.3, 0.1\ne_c = rng.normal(0.0, sigma_c, size=N)\ne_empty = rng.normal(0.0, sigma_e, size=N)\neps_cond = s_cond_true + e_c\neps_uncond = s_uncond_true + e_empty\n\n# 对若干 w 计算经验均方误差，并与解析式 (1-w)^2||e_empty||^2 + w^2||e_c||^2 比较\nws = np.array([0.0, 0.5, 1.0, 2.0, 3.0])\nmse_emp = []\nmse_ana = []\nfor w in ws:\n    s_tilde = eps_uncond + w * (eps_cond - eps_uncond)\n    s_tilde_true = s_uncond_true + w * (s_cond_true - s_uncond_true)\n    mse_emp.append(np.mean((s_tilde - s_tilde_true) ** 2))\n    mse_ana.append((1 - w) ** 2 * np.mean(e_empty ** 2) + w ** 2 * np.mean(e_c ** 2))\nmse_emp = np.array(mse_emp)\nmse_ana = np.array(mse_ana)\nassert np.allclose(mse_emp, mse_ana, rtol=1e-2), (mse_emp, mse_ana)\nprint(&quot;命题18.16.5 方差分解: 经验 MSE =&quot;, mse_emp)\nprint(&quot;命题18.16.5 方差分解: 解析 MSE =&quot;, mse_ana)\n\n# 最优权重 w_star = ||e_empty||^2 / (||e_empty||^2 + ||e_c||^2)\nw_star = np.mean(e_empty ** 2) / (np.mean(e_empty ** 2) + np.mean(e_c ** 2))\nprint(&quot;最优权重 w_star =&quot;, w_star)\n# 在 w_star 处解析 MSE 应小于相邻网格点的 MSE\nmse_at_star = (1 - w_star) ** 2 * np.mean(e_empty ** 2) + w_star ** 2 * np.mean(e_c ** 2)\nassert mse_at_star &lt;= mse_ana.min() + 1e-3, (mse_at_star, mse_ana.min())\nprint(&quot;w_star 处 MSE =&quot;, mse_at_star, &quot;&lt;= 网格最小 MSE =&quot;, mse_ana.min())\n\n# 验证推论 18.16.7 的 KL 恒等式（数值积分，一维）\nfrom scipy.integrate import quad\n\ndef p_t(x):\n    return np.exp(-x**2 / 2) / np.sqrt(2 * np.pi)\n\ndef p_c_given_x(x):\n    return 1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-alpha * x))\n\ndef tilde_p(x, w):\n    return p_t(x) * p_c_given_x(x) ** w\n\nfor w in [1.0, 2.0]:\n    Z_w, _ = quad(lambda x: tilde_p(x, w), -10, 10)\n    # KL = E_{tilde p}[(w-1) log p(c|x)] - log Z_w + log p(c)，p(c)=1/2\n    integrand = lambda x: tilde_p(x, w) / Z_w * ((w - 1) * np.log(p_c_given_x(x)) - np.log(Z_w) + np.log(0.5))\n    kl_num, _ = quad(integrand, -10, 10)\n    # 直接计算 KL = E_{tilde p}[log tilde_p - log p(x|c)]\n    integrand_direct = lambda x: tilde_p(x, w) / Z_w * (np.log(tilde_p(x, w) / Z_w) - np.log(p_t(x) * p_c_given_x(x) / 0.5))\n    kl_direct, _ = quad(integrand_direct, -10, 10)\n    assert np.isclose(kl_num, kl_direct, atol=1e-4), (kl_num, kl_direct)\n    print(f&quot;推论18.16.7 (w={w}): KL 恒等式 = {kl_num:.6f}, 直接 KL = {kl_direct:.6f}&quot;)\nprint(&quot;形状检查: x 形状 =&quot;, x.shape, &quot;，ws 形状 =&quot;, ws.shape)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>命题18.16.5 方差分解</code> 两行数值接近（相对误差小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}$</span>），<code>最优权重 w_star</code> 约等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1^2/(0.1^2+0.3^2)=0.1$</span>，<code>w_star 处 MSE</code> 不超过网格最小 MSE 加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span>，<code>推论18.16.7</code> 两行中 KL 恒等式与直接 KL 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span> 内一致，最后一行打印 <code>x 形状 = (200000,)</code>、<code>ws 形状 = (5,)</code>。</p>", "cjk": 55549, "missing": []};
